window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4501,"title":"Chapter 4501 The Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["4501 The Undercurrent Surges","Time passed.","Waves of terrifying pressure spread from the Land of Gods.","More and more people gathered outside the Land of Gods.","Everyone was waiting, waiting for the moment when these 99 seals were at their weakest.","!!","This was the rule that the people of the Void Universe had figured out from the 99 restrictions over the past tens of thousands of virtual eras.","The Heavenly Dao was incomplete, so it was naturally impossible for these ninety-nine restrictions to be completely perfected.","According to the repeated calculations and deductions of countless experts over the past tens of thousands of void eras, they had learned that although the 99 seals were constantly operating, every few hundred void eras, these overlapping and constantly operating 99 seals would separate for about the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","During this time, the weakest entrance would appear in the 99 restrictions. As long as one’s cultivation was low, it was very likely that they would not trigger the destructive power of the restrictions and enter the abdomen of the Land of Gods.","Now, everyone was waiting, waiting for the moment when the 99 restrictions would be separated!","In the void, an elegant-looking Elder looked at Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye silently.","He was none other than Supreme Gongyang, who had just emerged from the Earth’s core.","“Sigh, back then, the four of us entered the Void Universe together. But now, it seems like Jian Wushuang has entered the God Refining Sect and become a genius disciple. As for Master Bing Ye, he has become the leader of a region. I’m the only one who has been homeless and miserable. I can only hide in the dark. It’s really miserable.”","Supreme Gongyang stroked his short beard, shook his head, and sighed.","“But from the looks of it, it seems that Lingyu didn’t manage to escape?”","Thinking of the Lingyu, he was silent.","“Forget it. When I enter the Land of Gods, I’ll find another opportunity to see if I can get in touch with them.”","After pondering for a moment, Supreme Master Gongyang decided not to move for the time being and wait until he entered the Land of Gods.","...","Another three days passed.","Everyone’s eyes were wide open. They did not want to slack off for even a moment, for fear of missing the moment when the 99 restrictions separated.","Rumble!","In the universe, the 99 restrictive spells rolled like millstones and released terrifying power. They crushed the void and exploded!","These 99 restrictions were like 99 overlapping halos. When they were combined, they could destroy the world.","Finally, the 99 restrictions were temporarily separated!","A narrow entrance appeared in front of everyone!","“Now!”","In an instant, countless people’s eyes lit up as they rushed into the Land of Gods!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","At this moment, the entire starry sky was covered by a divine light. Countless black shadows circulated their void energy and shot into the entrance!","The moment the entrance appeared, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye also took a step and soared into the sky, shooting toward it.","The two of them looked at each other. Sparks flickered in their eyes, and their fighting spirit surged!","For the two of them, they only had each other as their opponents in the Land of Gods!","The people of the Void Universe would be rejected by these restrictions, but they would not!","This was because these 99 restrictions originally relied on the strength of the void power to determine the power that appeared on the restrictions!","Therefore, the higher the cultivation base in the Void Universe, the more difficult it was to enter the Land of Gods and the greater the backlash. On the contrary, the lower the cultivation base, the more likely it was to deceive everyone and not trigger the restriction.","As for Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye, they only needed to release their divine power and they would be able to move freely.","Boom!","In an instant, dozens of lights shot into the entrance of the Land of Gods.","After Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye left, Supreme Gongyang’s figure appeared from the void and followed them into the Land of Gods.","...","The previously dark and swarming Land of Gods suddenly quieted down, leaving only the Crimson Whale Gang disciples shouting and yelling on the Crimson Whale Gang’s ship.","A few hours later, a divine beam shot over from the distance.","The void shattered, revealing a green-robed and sickle-like Void Master Shen Lian.","“Did he go in?”","Void Master Shen Lian narrowed his eyes and immediately guarded the exit of the Land of Gods before sitting down cross-legged.","He made up his mind that as soon as Jian Wushuang came out, he would immediately kill him to avoid any future trouble!","...","In the Land of Gods.","Jian Wushuang and the others flew at an extremely fast speed. They shuttled through the restrictions continuously and shot toward the center of the Land of Gods.","The Land of Gods had a vast territory. It was created by the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace after they occupied a star area.","Soon, the first restriction came like a tide.","Although it was silent, the terrifying pressure swept in all directions like a great river or sea. Many geniuses of the Void Universe paled when they felt this pressure.","“Is this the original power of the restriction?”","Everyone’s heart trembled, and they immediately restrained their auras. They turned into pieces of rotten wood and allowed the restriction to sweep across their bodies.","...","Weng.","The restriction swept across his body, but it was as if it didn’t notice anyone. It passed by his body steadily without a single ripple.","“As expected, I’m fine!”","Everyone looked at each other and their hearts were filled with ecstasy!","Instantly, everyone’s footsteps became faster and they rushed forward in a flash!","Only those who came from the top sects sneered in their hearts.","How could it be so easy to cross the Land of Gods? They were safe now only because they were still in the outermost area of the Land of Gods. Once they went deeper, these restrictions would gradually become more sensitive and release terrifying lasers to kill them one by one!","Jian Wushuang, Yan Dan, and Fu Chen flew to the middle.","Fu Chen’s expression was grave and he did not even dare to take a deep breath. He followed behind the other person at a distance that was not too far nor too close. After confirming that it was safe in front, he followed the other person’s footsteps.","As for Yan Dan, he sized up Jian Wushuang from time to time with a fierce light flashing in his eyes. At first glance, it was obvious that he had bad intentions and was ready to make things difficult for Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He could naturally feel the malice from Yan Dan, but to him, Yan Dan was like an ant. No matter how strong the killing intent was, he did not care. He could kill Yan Dan with a thought.","...","His biggest opponent in the Land of Gods was none other than Supreme Bing Ye, who was eyeing him covetously from a distance!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Everyone’s speed was extremely fast as they continued to fly forward. Soon, they had crossed the outermost void zone.","If the Land of Gods was divided into three levels, they had already passed the first level!","All of a sudden!","“Ah!”","At the forefront of the group, there was a sudden scream of fear!"]},{"number":4502,"title":"Chapter 4502 A Storm Rises","paragraphs":["4502 A Storm Rises","“Ah!!!”","A shrill scream suddenly burst out from the front of the group of people who entered the Land of Gods!","“What’s going on?”","“What happened?”","!!","“What’s going on in front?”","Immediately, everyone’s charging footsteps came to a halt, their faces filled with shock.","it seems like someone in front triggered the restriction and died!","Everyone looked up and saw a Heaven’s Favorite, an 8-Star Void Warrior, being cut into pieces by the light like a knife through tofu!","The destructive power of the restrictive spell destroyed the disciple’s body and soul. He could not be more dead!","Hiss!","Seeing this, everyone present gasped and felt their scalps go numb.","The man who had just died was not an unknown junior. He was the top disciple of the Gray Plain Sect in the center of the Void Universe. He was one of the most well-known Heaven’s Favorites in the universe. No one had expected him to die here so quietly.","In an instant, the hearts of the people who had been relaxed suddenly sank, and their faces were filled with fear and solemness.","It was only then that they remembered that the Land of Gods was a forbidden land of death that even the Void Warriors of the Six Scar level did not dare to step into!","His originally fast pace suddenly slowed down.","Everyone carefully explored as they moved forward, going deeper into the Land of Gods.","A moment later.","“Ah!”","Another scream was heard. Another genius disciple died in the restrictive force.","This caused everyone’s heart to turn cold. Their already slow pace became even more like walking on thin ice.","However, even so, it still could not stop death from happening.","After the second disciple’s death, the deaths and perishments seemed to have started a chain reaction that kept happening!","The rings of light emitted a faint white glow as they continuously swept over from all directions. The speed of these rings of light was not considered fast at first, but as the group continued to venture deeper, their speed instantly became faster and faster!","The rings of white light were like a guillotine, silently reaping the lives of everyone present!","In an instant, the entire Land of Gods was filled with cries of alarm. Everyone began to activate their void energy divine arts, constantly shifting and evading these halos of white light!","However, as the void energy continued to erupt, the white light formed by the power of the restriction immediately reaped lives at an even faster speed!","Swish!","A circle of white light slashed over.","Jian Wushuang tilted his head slightly and dodged it easily.","Yan Dan, who was behind Jian Wushuang, also dealt with it easily and did not give him too much pressure.","However, it was difficult for Fu Chen. He was extremely flustered, and his forehead was covered in sweat.","Just as the second ray of white light was about to strike Jian Wushuang, he was about to dodge.","“Wushuang, this place will be your burial ground today!”","“Void Explosion!”","All of a sudden, Yan Dan, who was behind Jian Wushuang, laughed hideously. His eyes glowed with a fierce light and countless crimson void power gathered in his hands, forming a crimson ball the size of a basketball. He then slammed it toward Jian Wushuang!","He had been waiting for this moment!","Now, the moment had finally arrived!","The first step was a terrifying restrictive force that could kill Immortals and Gods, and the next step was his Yan Dan’s overbearing and sure-kill strike!","He was confident that Jian Wushuang had nowhere to go and was about to die!","From afar, Supreme Bing Ye, who had been watching this scene, could not help but raise his eyebrows. He then said with a playful smile, “Jian Wushuang, Oh Jian Wushuang, it seems that not only I don’t like you. You’ve only just entered the God Refining Sect, but your fellow disciples already want to kill you. You are really a failure to be a human.”","Shaking his head, Supreme Bing Ye was in no hurry to make a move.","He understood Jian Wushuang and naturally knew that the scene in front of him posed no threat to Jian Wushuang.","It was not the time for him to fight Jian Wushuang to the death.","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang felt the power of the Void Explosion behind him. He raised his eyebrows and turned all the void power in his body into divine power. He turned to look at Yan Dan.","He did not dodge the white light or the illusory round ball that was crashing down. His face was calm.","“Hahaha, so you’re prepared to die?”","Seeing this, Yan Dan laughed wildly.","When that Fu Chen saw the situation, his pupils constricted.","However, he could not even protect himself now, so how could he stand up for Jian Wushuang?","He could not help but lower his head and sigh.","Whizzz!!!","The next moment!","Yan Dan’s smile suddenly froze, and his body froze.","...","Fu Chen was also dumbfounded, a look of disbelief on his face.","The power of the restriction that had killed countless geniuses seemed to have sensed Jian Wushuang’s aura when it was about three inches away from him. It turned around and avoided him.","This was not the end!","Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and grabbed the destructive Void Explosion ball that had been blasted out by Yan Dan!","Immediately after.","Jian Wushuang closed his five fingers and grabbed gently.","Boom!","This void ball directly collapsed!","“H-how could this be?”","Yan Dan looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze. His body trembled and his eyes were filled with horror as if he had seen a ghost. He almost fell from the sky.","“This...” Fu Chen’s mouth was also wide open as he muttered to himself in shock.","...","“Wushuang... how did he do it?”","“Do you know, I just want to be alone, so why did you come to seek death?”","Jian Wushuang looked down at Yan Dan expressionlessly. His eyes were indifferent and emotionless.","What he had done just now seemed to be a trivial matter to Jian Wushuang.","“I...” Yan Dan swallowed his saliva. For a moment, he was in a daze and did not know what to say.","A great sense of terror that came from the moment of life and death surged toward him like a rolling wave.","Facing Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes, Yan Dan felt as if he had fallen into an ice cellar. He felt cold all over and his guts were torn.","His One Scar level void power seemed to have been completely confined, making him unable to even struggle.","“Be more tactful in your next life.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang flicked his finger and a surge of great power shot out from his fingertip.","Buzz!!!","A muffled sound rang out as a finger-sized hole appeared on Yan Dan’s forehead!","Pfff!","Yan Dan’s pupils gradually dilated, his face became dull, and he fell stiffly to the ground.","The sharp Sword Qi had already destroyed his life source in an instant.","Swish, swish, swish.","In the next moment, countless rings of light formed by the power of restrictions surged over, cutting Yan Dan into countless pieces.","One-finger instakill!","Fu Chen’s eyes were filled with shock as he looked at this scene. A chill ran up his spine and up his head.","Immediately, Fu Chen’s entire back was drenched in a cold sweat."]},{"number":4503,"title":"Chapter 4503 People Die, Lights Go Out","paragraphs":["4503 People Die, Lights Go Out","Yan Dan, the head disciple of the God Refining Sect, who had broken through the Scar level, was killed by Jian Wushuang with one finger?","Fu Chen looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze. His throat rolled and he continuously swallowed his saliva.","Something big!","Something big was about to happen!","!!","The head disciple of the God Refining Sect, the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, had been killed by Jian Wushuang in an instant!","Just how strong was this Wushuang?","Shock filled Fu Chen’s eyes, his legs trembling.","The next moment.","Then, he saw Jian Wushuang’s gaze fall on him.","He could not help but shiver, and his heart turned cold.","“I... I didn’t see anything.”","Fu Chen swallowed his saliva and subconsciously blurted out while trembling.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered slightly as he looked at Fu Chen’s terrified expression. He could not help but feel a little speechless.","Was he afraid that he would silence him?","Jian Wushuang shook his head and ignored him. He took a step forward and suddenly shot toward the center of the Land of Gods like a cannonball.","In the distance.","The Heaven’s Gate disciples, who had quarreled with Yan Dan outside the Land of Gods, noticed this scene and their pupils shrank.","“Yan Dan, this fellow, actually died in the hands of his fellow disciples?”","The head disciple of the Heaven’s Gate had a serious look in his eyes. He then turned to look at another disciple beside him and asked, “Tianxuan, I’ve been in seclusion all this time and was unaware of the outside world. When did the God Refining Sect produce such a disciple? Who is that person?”","The disciple beside the Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple heard this and replied respectfully, “Eldest Senior Brother, you might not know this, but I heard that in the God Refining Sect’s disciple selection this time, there was a peerless genius called Wushuang. It should be this person.”","“Wushuang?”","The Heaven’s Gate’s first disciple raised his eyebrows and laughed. “This person is quite something. He’s much stronger than that trash Yan Dan.”","After saying that, the Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple shook his head. After a moment of silence, he muttered, “The God Refining Sect has always been on bad terms with our Heaven’s Gate. Now that Yan Dan is dead, I’m afraid that this person is very likely to become the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect in the future. If we have the chance later, it’s best to get this person up and kill him to avoid any future trouble.”","“Yes!” The disciple quickly nodded.","On the other side.","Supreme Bing Ye’s lips curled into a mocking smile as he watched this scene.","“This Jian Wushuang is really a jinx. Wherever he goes, something happens.”","Bang!","In the next moment, he stomped his right foot and immediately turned into a soaring sword light, chasing after Jian Wushuang.","At the end of the crowd.","Supreme Gongyang rubbed his nose and revealed a bitter smile.","“These two people are not the type to stop.”","Shaking his head, he also flew up and turned into a bright light, flying forward.","...","Outside the Land of Gods.","Elder Shen Lian, who was sitting cross-legged in silence, seemed to have sensed something. He frowned and his expression changed.","Then, he flipped his right hand, and an ancient lamp appeared in his palm.","The faint candlelight on the ancient lamp flickered, and in the blink of an eye, the flame on the ancient lamp’s wick was extinguished.","Upon seeing this, Elder Shen Lian’s expression changed drastically. He stood up abruptly and stared at the Land of Gods while screaming.","“My son!!! Yan Dan!!!”","Elder Shen Lian was already in a state of fury. Countless veins were throbbing on his forehead, and his facial features were twisted.","“Who killed my son?!!” Elder Shen Lian roared, his eyes were filled with hatred.","An extremely terrifying and brutal aura was emitted from his body.","The divine lamp was bound to a wisp of Yan Dan’s life source. The stronger Yan Dan’s life source, the brighter the flame on the divine lamp. On the contrary, the weaker the Yan Dan’s life source, the dimmer the flame on the lamp.","And just now, he had seen the light on the lamp go out with his own eyes.","A person died like a lamp going out.","Now that the lamp was extinguished, it naturally meant that Yan Dan had fallen!","Anger!","An indescribable fury almost burned Elder Shen Lian to ashes!","Yan Dan was dead!","His only son, Yan Dan, whom he had high hopes for, who was going to become the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect in the future, had died in the Land of Gods.","Pfff!","A muffled sound was heard. Elder Shen Lian was so furious that he could not help but spit out a mouthful of blood.","His head of green hair exploded and turned ashen white. His lips were bloodless and extremely dry.","...","Elder Shen Lian’s eyes were bloodshot as he glared at the Land of Gods. His entire body was trembling with anger.","“Who killed my son? I’ll go to hell and kill you. I’ll also slaughter all your friends and family in this world!”","Elder Shen Lian was on the verge of going crazy. His eyes were filled with ferocity and his face was extremely ferocious.","He had a faint intuition in his heart.","The person who had killed Yan Dan was most likely Wushuang, whom they had regarded as prey!","“Wushuang... It’s definitely Wushuang!”","Elder Divine Sickle stared at the Land of Gods and a look of struggle flashed in his eyes. He could not wait to enter the Land of Gods and kill Jian Wushuang. However, when he saw the rings of restriction light that spread out, a touch of fear appeared on his face.","A moment later, Elder Shen Lian took a deep breath and sat down cross-legged.","“Wushuang, you’d better pray that you die in there. Otherwise, if you come out alive, I’ll skin you alive and torture you in every way I can to make you regret being born!”","A look of hatred and enmity appeared in Elder Shen Lian’s eyes.","...","...","In the Land of Gods.","After Jian Wushuang passed by many Heaven’s Favorites, he did not hold back his aura anymore. He turned his void power into divine power.","Boom!","The cultivation of an Intermediate Supreme martial artist instantly spread out and shot up into the sky, causing thousands of thunderclaps to explode!","An aura of the same origin as the 99 restrictions spread in all directions. The terrifying power of the restrictions suddenly shrieked like a swallow seeing its parents and swept away Jian Wushuang, allowing him to pass.","Behind Jian Wushuang.","Supreme Bing Ye’s Half Invincible Supreme cultivation realm, which was only a step away from the Invincible Supreme, also skyrocketed!","The two of them, one in front and one behind, were like two meteors in the sky river, directly breaking into the deep layer of the Land of Gods!","“Intermediate Supreme realm? This guy has broken through again!”","Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes narrowed slightly as he felt the imposing aura from Jian Wushuang.","“However, since you have made progress, I have my own opportunities!”","Supreme Bing Ye coldly snorted and lowered his head to look at the silk pouch hanging at his waist.","This silk pouch contained the power of Great Void Divine Emperor’s attack!","This was also the biggest guarantee that he dared to challenge Jian Wushuang and declare that he wanted to kill Jian Wushuang. It was his trump card!","Boom!","He took a step forward and the God Slaying Sword appeared in his hand. He immediately shot it at Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4504,"title":"Chapter 4504 The Palace Master of the Divine Palace of Life","paragraphs":["4504 The Palace Master of the Divine Palace of Life","Whoosh!","Supreme Bing Ye and Jian Wushuang sprinted forward, one in front and one behind.","Supreme Bing Ye held the God Slaying Sword in his hand, but he was not in a hurry to attack Jian Wushuang.","Although he hated Jian Wushuang to the core and wished he could eat his flesh, he was not a stupid person and did not let his impulse get to his head. He knew that compared to killing Jian Wushuang, the most important thing at hand was to enter the Land of Gods investiture and see if the team sent by Cosmos Gods back then was still alive.","If the team was still alive, they would naturally have some good treasures on them.","Even if they were dead, their Interspatial Rings must still be here.","That was the relic of an Invincible Supreme realm expert!","He could not help but be tempted.","Thinking up to this point, Supreme Bing Ye quickened his pace.","“Divine power, Ice Wings!”","He shouted, and countless ice crystals condensed on his back, forming a pair of long, narrow, and bright ice crystal wings.","Whoosh.","With a flap of his wings, Supreme Bing Ye’s speed increased sharply. He, who was originally behind Jian Wushuang, overtook him in a flash and ran forward at high speed.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes as he looked at Supreme Bing Ye, who was dashing past him.","How could he not know what Supreme Bing Ye was planning?","“Secret skill of Dragon blood, activate!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a deep voice. In the next moment, his speed, which was already extremely fast, increased by a large margin and he was now on the same level as Supreme Bing Ye!","The two of them were extremely fast. In the blink of an eye, they had disappeared from their original spot and were heading deeper into the Land of Gods.","However, Supreme Gongyang, who was chasing after them, was in trouble.","“These two fellows, how can they be so fast?” Supreme Gongyang helplessly let out a bitter smile.","He had already released his aura, so Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye should have known of his existence. However, they ignored him.","“Sigh, fine, go then.”","Shaking his head, Supreme Gongyang’s figure flew up and chased after him.","...","51 restrictions.","78 restrictions.","85 restrictions.","97 restrictions.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye turned into thunderbolts, passing through dozens of restrictions and shooting toward the Land of Gods.","Half an incense’s time later.","An eggshell-like barrier appeared in front of the two.","It was as if a round bowl had been turned upside down, emitting a faint black and yellow light, leaving the two outside.","This was the last restriction!","After breaking through this restriction, he would arrive at the real Land of Gods, where the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace and the others were!","Jian Wushuang was the first to arrive. He could feel the same life aura from the origin that he had. It was coming from the back of the 99th restriction.","He had only felt this sense of familiarity from one person before.","And that was... Xuan Yi!","Feeling the familiarity, Jian Wushuang’s outstretched hand stopped in mid-air.","“Is it Master?” At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s calm state of mind, which he had long cultivated, became a little chaotic.","In the beginning, he suspected that his mysterious Master might be the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.","However, he did not dare to ask, for fear of disappointing himself.","After that, during the grand ceremony of all races in the universe, Cosmos God had mentioned his Master, Xuan Yi.","Although he had yet to receive any concrete news, Jian Wushuang knew that his Master should be someone on the same level as Cosmos God.","As for the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, although he was also mysterious and powerful, he was clearly not on the same level as Cosmos Gods.","If Xuan Yi was the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, Cosmos God would not have been so secretive and said that he could not see through it.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had given up on the idea of Xuan Yi being the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of familiarity from the last barrier. This thought wavered!","The aura inside was exactly the same as his. This was definitely not fake!","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll take my leave first!”","Supreme Bing Ye noticed Jian Wushuang’s peculiar expression and curled his lips in disdain. He then took a step forward and entered the last restriction.","Buzz.","With a soft sound, Supreme Bing Ye seemed to have fallen into the water. His figure directly passed through the 99th restriction and entered the Land of Gods!","“Regardless of whether it is or not, we will know once we see it.”","...","After a while, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and a flash of determination appeared in his eyes. Without any hesitation, he stepped into the barrier.","Buzz.","A wave of darkness hit him. It was as if he had fallen into the warm ocean, and a warm current flowed through his body.","This restrictive power was the most terrifying and thunderous attack against people from the Void Universe. However, against people from the Divine Power Universe, it turned into a pair of gentle hands.","Beep, beep.","Ding! Ding!","The darkness in front of him gradually receded, and countless specks of light appeared in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang jumped out of the best restriction as if the world had disappeared.","“This is...”","Jian Wushuang was stunned when he saw that he was standing on the peak of a mountain.","A skinny figure had his back to him.","...","“Where’s Supreme Bing Ye?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He did not see the figure of Supreme Bing Ye.","After a moment of doubt, Jian Wushuang withdrew his thoughts and turned to look at the skinny figure.","This figure had gray hair, and his body was hunched over like a bag of bones. His loose skin stuck to his bones, and he gave off the feeling that he was a dying tree.","The aura of origin that Jian Wushuang had felt before came from this back.","“Senior?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and tried to ask.","The figure did not speak.","Gusts of strong wind blew from the peak of the mountain, ruffling his slightly tattered green robe, revealing his emaciated body.","After a long while.","Just now, he heard a hoarse and old voice coming from the back of the skinny figure.","“Let me ask you, what’s the situation in the Divine Palace?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang immediately understood the identity of the skinny figure. He was naturally the legendary figure of the Divine Life Palace, the Palace Master, who stood at the peak of the universe!","‘He... it was not Xuan Yi.’","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang felt both happy and disappointed.","Jian Wushuang flicked his clothes and knelt down on one knee. He took a deep breath and said respectfully, “I am Jian Wushuang, a disciple of the Divine Life Palace. Greetings, Palace Master!”","“Palace Master, the Divine Life Palace was now heavily injured because of this disciple’s misfortune. They are recuperating...”","Jian Wushuang began to tell him what he knew about the Divine Life Palace.","The skinny figure did not say anything. He just listened quietly, as if he was unmoved and had no reaction.","After Jian Wushuang finished, the skinny man was silent for a long time before he slowly said, “Jian Wushuang, don’t call me Palace Master. You have to call me... Senior Brother!”"]},{"number":4505,"title":"Chapter 4505 Call Me Senior Brother","paragraphs":["4505 Call Me Senior Brother","“...Senior brother?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","An unbelievable and shocking conjecture gradually emerged in his mind.","From the beginning to the end, Jian Wushuang received guidance, protection, and inheritance from many almighty seniors. However, there was only one person whom Jian Wushuang had formally acknowledged as his Master, and that was Xuan Yi!","Since the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had said so, there was only one possibility, and that was... this guy was also a disciple of Xuan Yi!","“That’s right.” The skinny figure nodded and slowly turned around.","An old face appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","His hair was gray, his eyes were cloudy, and the skin on his cheeks was sunken and wrinkled. He was full of the withered aura of a hero in his twilight years.","“Jian Wushuang, when you stepped into the Land of Gods, I sensed your aura. It’s an aura that has surpassed the level of a perfect life level. Only one person can create such an aura, and that’s our Master.”","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace said in a flat tone without any fluctuations.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was complicated, but he did not speak.","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace did not seem to want to hear Jian Wushuang’s answer. Instead, he continued to speak calmly, “I, Dao Yan, have had many identities in my life, such as the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace and the first Supreme. But the one identity that I can’t let go of the most is being his disciple.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","After a long while, Jian Wushuang thought for a while and asked softly, “The Palace Master... Senior Brother Dao Yan, can you tell me about Master?”","This was what Jian Wushuang wanted to know the most.","“Master?”","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Dao Yan, raised his head upon hearing this. His gaze seemed to penetrate the 99 restrictions and look at an extremely distant place. After a long silence, he said, “Our Master is a person who can’t be calculated with common sense. Not to mention you don’t know his situation, even I, who has cultivated to this level and stands at the peak of the universe, still can’t see through Master.”","“I don’t know much about Master, but I can tell you everything.”","“First of all, I was born at the beginning of the universe, when chaos was just created. It was also at that time that I met my Master.”","“Back then, I was just an ignorant green lotus in the chaos. It was Master who awakened my consciousness at dawn and gave me the root of wisdom. That was why I could wake up from the chaos and cultivate all the way.”","“Later on, it was Master who modified my body and gave me a Special Life Form that surpassed the perfect life level. It was only then that I reached my current level and stood at the peak of the universe.”","“To be honest, the Divine Life Palace was created under my Master’s order. It was all thanks to my Master that the Divine Life Palace was born.”","“100,000 chaos cycles ago, someone from the Void Universe entered the Divine Power Universe through a void rift. A catastrophic war ensued, and Master disappeared. It was as if he had evaporated from the face of the earth.”","“All these years, I’ve never stopped searching for Master, from the Divine Power Universe to the Void Universe.”","“Although I didn’t find Master, it’s not like I didn’t gain anything.”","“Tens of thousands of chaos cycles ago, when I first stepped into the Void Universe, I met a Six Scar Void Master on the verge of death. I could sense Master’s aura on him.”","“Later, I learned from him that this person is also Master’s disciple.”","“However, before I could ask more questions, this person died, and his Dao disappeared. I was also chased by the most powerful beings in this universe and had no choice but to retreat.”","“Before this person died, he told me one thing, and that is to stop looking for traces of Master. He said... we were created by Master, and we will die for Master in the future. We are just pawns that Master has laid down.”","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace finished his words indifferently.","Jian Wushuang fell into silence.","This was not the first time he had heard of the story of his Master being the chess player and them being the chess pieces.","Back at the Universe Great Clan Gathering, Cosmos Gods had said something similar to him.","Xuan Yi was playing a big game of chess.","The universe was the chess board, and all living beings were the chess pieces. Jian Wushuang and the other disciples of Xuan Yi were just a part of the chess game, a chess piece.","“Jian Wushuang, do you know? When I see you, I feel like I’m seeing someone,” the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Dao Yan, said.","“Me? Who?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked.","“The old me,” Supreme Dao Yan said, shaking his head.","Jian Wushuang could not help but be stunned. Then, he sighed.","That was right. He was like Supreme Dao Yan, who had been given an opportunity by Xuan Yi and then embarked on the path to find his Master.","“Senior Brother Dao Yan, I’ll take you out of here first,” Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and said.","With a flip of his right hand, the Heaven-Suppressing Monument appeared in his hand.","Although the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had disappeared for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, his legend still existed in the universe.","It was rumored that during the war of the catastrophe, before the rise of the universe gods, it was the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Dao Yan, who led all the races in the universe to resist the erosion of the Void Universe.","It was precisely because of his existence that the battle had dragged on until the rise of Cosmos Gods. After that, they turned the tide and chased out the people from the Void Universe.","It could be said that a Supreme Dao Yan was a person who was only inferior to Cosmos God in the Divine Power Universe!","Now that the second catastrophe was coming, if Supreme Dao Yan could return at this time, it would definitely strengthen the Divine Power Universe in an epic way!","In addition, Supreme Dao Yan was his Senior Brother and the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!","How could Jian Wushuang bear to let this old man, who had already lost his brilliance and was on the verge of death, continue to stay alone in the Land of Gods?","“I can’t go out.” However, Supreme Dao Yan shook his head and said, “Jian Wushuang, I’m the one who is supporting all these 99 restrictions. Although they can resist the experts of the Void Universe and prevent them from entering, these restrictions have also cut off my way out.”","“Once I leave this place, these 99 restrictions will instantly collapse. Once these 99 restrictions collapse, the guy who has been watching me in the universe will instantly attack and kill me.”","“At that time, not only will I die, but you will also die because of me. We will not be able to leave this place.”","“That guy?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“That’s right.” Supreme Dao Yan nodded, and the corners of his mouth curled into a faint sneer. He raised his head and looked at the boundless void and said, “That guy fought with me back then. I could only seal myself in this three-inch area. That guy was also seriously injured and has been recuperating from his injuries.”","...","“Based on the time, that fellow should have fully recovered by now. I can sense that a pair of eyes have been watching me for nearly 1,000 chaos cycles. It must be that fellow.”","“If I want to go out, I’m afraid I’ll have to wait until the day you can truly defeat the Void Universe, and launch a counter-attack.”"]},{"number":4506,"title":"Chapter 4506 Taking Over the Sect Master","paragraphs":["4506 Taking Over the Sect Master","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and could not help but feel a little regretful.","He was not an impetuous and unreasonable person. Since Supreme Dao Yan had said so, there must be something in the Void Universe that was that bad.","That enemy was at least an almighty existence on the same level as Supreme Dao Yan, and he was keeping an eye on the Land of Gods.","If he forcefully dragged the Palace Master out, not only would he harm the Palace Master, but he would also not be able to leave alive.","“Alright, Jian Wushuang, there’s no need to force this matter. Come here, I have something to give you.”","The corners of Supreme Dao Yan’s mouth curled into a gentle smile as he waved at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang nodded and walked toward Supreme Dao Yan.","“Come. Jian Wushuang, sit in front of me and I’ll give you a good fortune.”","After Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged in front of Supreme Dao Yan, he stretched out his finger and gently touched the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","Whoosh!","Instantly, a vast amount of knowledge flowed through his fingertips and into Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The huge amount of knowledge almost made Jian Wushuang’s head explode!","Jian Wushuang’s field of vision changed immediately.","Boom!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had traveled back to the time when the universe was born.","The world was in chaos. After an unknown amount of time, clear air suddenly rose and turbid air sank. The chaos was separated, and from then on, the sky and the earth were formed.","All living things began to multiply and were born, and the original appearance of the universe’s races began.","Signs of life gradually appeared in the universe.","An ordinary green lotus in the chaos began to evolve after absorbing the first breath of primordial Qi.","Jian Wushuang knew that the green Lotus was naturally Supreme Dao Yan!","Time flew by and Jian Wushuang was immersed in the evolution of the Green Lotus.","Supreme Dao Yan had risen from insignificance and then dominated the entire universe!","All the great Dao comprehensions, skills, and divine powers were engraved in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The scene in Jian Wushuang’s eyes only ended when Supreme Dao Yan reached the peak of the universe.","After it was over, Jian Wushuang did not say a word. He immediately closed his eyes and began to digest the essences and comprehensions.","This was all of Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the Great Dao of heaven and earth!","At this moment, all of them were given to Jian Wushuang. This fortune was simply terrifying!","Jian Wushuang also knew that it was not the time to thank him. What he had to do now was to do his best to absorb the Enlightenment carefully!","Like Supreme Dao Yan, he was a Perfect Life Form. It could be said that after absorbing Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the Great Dao of heaven and earth and the various realms, Jian Wushuang’s future would be smooth. As long as he followed Supreme Dao Yan’s previous path, he would be able to achieve Supreme Dao Yan’s level in the future!","After a few hours.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and let out a long breath.","Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the Great Dao of heaven and earth had been mostly digested.","In an instant, there were many things that Jian Wushuang did not understand on the path of cultivation. After combining it with Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the heaven and earth Great Dao, he could not help but be enlightened.","Jian Wushuang was not prepared to follow Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the heaven way completely and walk on the same path as him.","However, Supreme Dao Yan’s comprehension of the Heavenly Dao could directly increase his Foundation of comprehension of the Great Dao, broaden his vision, and make up for his shortcomings.","“Many thanks, Senior Brother!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and kowtowed.","“Hehe, you don’t have to be like this. You’re a disciple of the Divine Life Palace, and you’re my Junior Brother. I should take care of you. If you’re serious about it, you should cultivate well. If you can lead the disciples of the Divine Life Palace to attack the Void Universe one day and save me, that will be my greatest comfort.”","Supreme Dao Yan smiled and shook his head. He raised his hand and a gentle force blocked Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","Jian Wushuang looked at Supreme Dao Yan with a solemn expression. Then, he bowed deeply and said in a deep voice, “Don’t worry, Senior Brother Dao Yan. I, Jian Wushuang, swear that in this life, as long as I don’t return to heaven, I will try my best to lead the disciples of the Divine Life Palace to break through the Void Universe and save you, Senior Brother!”","“Alright.” Supreme Dao Yan smiled slightly, his face revealing a kind and gentle expression.","Then, he flipped his right hand again and a black iron token appeared in his hand.","“Jian Wushuang, now that the Divine Life Palace is without a leader, I hereby order you to be the Second Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!”","“This token represents the identity of the Sect Master! With this token in your hand, you are the Second Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!”","After saying that, Supreme Dao Yan pushed the black iron token with his right hand and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took a deep look at Supreme Dao Yan and put the token away solemnly.","Upon seeing this, Supreme Dao Yan nodded in satisfaction and said, “Jian Wushuang, now that you’re the Sect Master, you should do what a Sect Master should do. You must not be too desolate and tyrannical and not think about improving. Do you understand?”","“Disciple understands!” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands.","“Senior Brother Dao Yan, also, Daoist Ban Shan is currently hiding in the God Refining Sect. If I see you, I’ll help him pass you a message. He’s fine, so there’s no need to worry.”","“Eh? This kid... I didn’t expect that the weakest one of us would be able to escape.”","Supreme Dao Yan was stunned, and then he smiled and shook his head, “Fine, fine. The kid Ban Shan is still alive, so one of my worries has been resolved.”","After that, the two of them exchanged a few more words, and a hint of fatigue appeared in Supreme Dao Yan’s turbid eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, one more thing...”","Supreme Dao Yan looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and said softly, “... Please take care of the Divine Life Palace for me. I’m sorry for the trouble.”","...","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Dao Yan waved his right hand, and the lightning shattered inch by inch as if an image had been shattered.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang could not help but close his eyes.","When he opened his eyes again, the mountain peak and Supreme Dao Yan had disappeared.","In its place was an extremely desolate land.","This piece of land was in ruins, and there was no Supreme Dao Yan.","“What?”","Upon seeing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned. Was it just a remnant thought of Supreme Dao Yan that had spoken to him just now?","Supreme Dao Yan’s divine body had already been destroyed?","Just as Jian Wushuang’s mind was filled with thousands of thoughts...","...","“Hahahaha, the heavens didn’t let me down. They actually allowed me to obtain all of the Great Qing Divine Emperor’s inheritance!”","Great Qing Divine Emperor, that was...","An insolent laughter was heard. Jian Wushuang looked over and saw that Supreme Bing Ye, who was also sitting cross-legged not far away from him, had opened his eyes.","When Jian Wushuang looked at him, Supreme Bing Ye also looked at Jian Wushuang.","The next moment!","He let out a low and sinister laugh.","“Jian Wushuang! It’s time for us to settle the score!”"]},{"number":4507,"title":"Chapter 4507 The Battle of Old Enemies","paragraphs":["4507 The Battle of Old Enemies","At the core of the Land of Gods.","The sky was gray and the ground was in ruins. It was a desolate scene.","Supreme Bing Ye gripped the God Slaying Sword in his hand and twisted his neck, a vicious glint flashing in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword with his right hand.","!!","The two of them released a terrifying aura and a shocking sword essence that shot into the sky!","One of their sword essences was cold and overbearing, while the other was so sharp that it seemed to be able to tear the sky into two!","Immediately after, the two terrifying Sword Intents rose up and formed a terrifying sword pressure. Like dragons and tigers fighting, they kept colliding in the air, making booming sounds and flipping the ground around the two.","This battle!","Whether it was Jian Wushuang or Supreme Bing Ye, they had waited for too long!","The enmity between the two could be traced back to the Ancient Path of Stars more than 100,000 years ago!","“Jian Wushuang, only one of us can walk out of this alive!”","Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes flickered madly, and his face was filled with bloodlust.","When he had been in the divine power universe, he had already comprehended a slight opportunity to break through to the Invincible Supreme realm. In the end, the battle with Jian Wushuang at the entrance of the Great Void Temple almost completely destroyed his Dao Heart, and he had missed the opportunity to break through to the Invincible Supreme realm.","Jian Wushuang had become Supreme Bing Ye’s nightmare!","Supreme Bing Ye believed that as long as he could kill Jian Wushuang, his incomplete Invincible Dao Heart would be restored to perfection.","As for him, he would be able to try to break through to the Invincible Supreme realm again!","“Jian Wushuang, I will use your blood to forge my Invincible Great Dao!”","Bang!","After letting out an evil laugh, a pair of wings made of ice crystals appeared on his back. He stomped his right foot heavily and suddenly shot up into the air, turning into a flowing light and charging toward Jian Wushuang!","This sword was fast to the extreme!","Supreme Bing Ye was fast, but Jian Wushuang was faster!","“Sword, come.”","Swish!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and his five well-defined fingers that were holding the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword instantly pulled outwards!","It was like a white rainbow that was pulled out of the scabbard by Jian Wushuang!","In an instant, there was a flash of lightning in Jian Wushuang’s eyes!","Ding!","There was a crisp muffled sound as Supreme Bing Ye’s God Slaying Sword and Jian Wushuang’s Tarot Divine Sword collided!","The Tarot Divine Sword was one of the Seven Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons of the Divine Power Universe. Although the God Slaying Sword was powerful, it was still inferior to the Tarot Divine Sword!","After the two of them exchanged blows, the God Slaying Sword was suddenly pushed back, and a small gap appeared on it.","Jian Wushuang held the sword with one hand. Except for the corner of his black robe that was slightly blown by the strong wind, he did not move at all.","The outcome of the battle was already clear in an instant.","Back in the Great Void Star Field, Jian Wushuang had been able to suppress Supreme Bing Ye as a Primary Supreme.","Now that Jian Wushuang had broken through to Intermediate Supreme, his strength had increased by more than a level.","Pfff.","Supreme Bing Ye suppressed the boiling blood in his chest and squinted his eyes. He exclaimed in admiration, “Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, your talent and strength are simply the creation of heaven and earth. You’ve become the darling of the Great Dao. Every once in a while, your fighting skills will soar greatly.”","Although Supreme Bing Ye was full of praise, the coldness in his eyes did not decrease in the slightest.","“Jian Wushuang, if you were a disciple of the Great Void Temple, I would definitely follow your lead. I can even abdicate the position of the Temple Master to you. It’s. pity that there’s already a great enmity between us...”","“You’re noisy.” Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang interrupted him with a blank expression, “Bing Ye, don’t waste your breath. Just show me your strongest card. Otherwise, you will die today for sure with your strength just now.”","“Certain death? Is that so?”","Supreme Bing Ye laughed heartily upon hearing this. He gripped the hilt of the God Slaying Sword with both hands and stabbed it into the ground.","“Divine ability, Floral Mirror Water Moon!”","Thump.","A circle of water appeared under the tip of the God-Slaying Sword.","As Supreme Bing Ye stabbed the surface of the water, countless splashes of water suddenly burst out!","Whoosh!","In an instant, the water droplets condensed and transformed into countless incarnations of Supreme Bing Ye!","Each of these incarnations had the full power of Supreme Bing Ye’s attack. They were extremely difficult to deal with and had caused a lot of trouble for Jian Wushuang back in the Great Void Star Field.","He could only force Jian Wushuang to use the Four Seasons Sword Technique to destroy them one by one.","However, now, things were different.","“Kill!”","“Die!” Supreme Bing Ye shouted in a low voice. In a split second, thousands of Supreme Bing Ye’s incarnations raised their swords and pointed them at Jian Wushuang!","Whoosh!!!","In the next moment, the thousands of incarnations charged toward Jian Wushuang!","...","“Bing Ye, are you still the same old moves? I’m so disappointed in you.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head expressionlessly as he looked at the nearly 10,000 clones of Supreme Bing Ye’s sword principle.","Then, he moved!","Bang! Bang!","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and slashed forward with the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand!","In an instant, a white sword light that was tens of thousands of feet wide and tens of thousands of feet long swept out!","It was tens of thousands of feet wide and nearly ten thousand feet long!","What kind of concept was this?","This sword strike was like a Heavenly River crashing out, directly splitting a vast ocean!","It was a sea of swords!","...","The sea of swords covered the entire Land of Gods and ruthlessly crashed into the thousands of Supreme Bing Ye incarnations.","The boundless sea of swords engulfed the thousands of incarnations of Supreme Bing Ye. The number of incarnations that were originally astonishing and blotted out the sun was like an ant in the face of the sea of swords.","What was the use of having more ants?","When the sky fell, everything would be destroyed!","Craaaash!","In an instant, the endless sea of swords slapped out wave after wave. In the sea of swords, the incarnations were shattered into ice shards one after another. Then, they were directly annihilated into ashes by the sea of swords.","The incarnation of Supreme Bing Ye started to collapse at an alarming speed.","Tear!","At this moment, the void of the Land of Gods was torn apart. Supreme Gongyang had finally arrived.","Before he could find his footing, he was shocked by the scene in front of him. He quickly used his divine power to form a light shield to block the sword light.","“The two of them started fighting?”","Supreme Gongyang’s eyelids twitched wildly as he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was expressionless and had unleashed a sea of swords.","This was the first time he had seen Jian Wushuang in action. The visual impact of this scene directly set off a wave of shock in his heart.","“Jian... Jian Wushuang is so strong? Even the Half Invincible Supreme Bing Ye is no match for him?”","He took a deep breath and took out a wooden stick with his right hand. He stabbed the stick on the ground to block the remaining power of Jian Wushuang’s sword strike."]},{"number":4508,"title":"Chapter 4508 Bombarding Indiscriminately and Destroying Everything","paragraphs":["4508 Bombarding Indiscriminately and Destroying Everything","Supreme Gongyang was hiding in a corner of the apotheosized land, watching the battle without blinking.","In the beginning, he had the intention to stop the fight, but after seeing the momentum of the two, he immediately gave up the plan.","Speaking of which, he was also a Top Supreme expert, and he was a well-known big shot in the universe.","However, when he saw the battle between Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye, he felt that he had lost his footing.","!!","“These two people are too terrifying!”","Supreme Gongyang shook his head with a bitter smile.","...","Bang! Bang!","In the sword ocean formed by sword radiances, the sword radiances were like a surging river or a raging sea. They exploded continuously and gave off earth-shaking rumbles.","If it were not for the 99 restrictions in the Land of Gods that isolated everything, Jian Wushuang’s sword would have created a hole in the sky of the entire universe!","Under the seething sea of swords, Supreme Bing Ye’s Sword Dao incarnation was completely shattered in just a few breaths.","Only the real Supreme Master Bing Ye was left in the sea of swords. He continuously slashed and blocked the waves of sword light that were crashing toward him.","“Divine power, Ice Emperor!”","Rumble!!!","Suddenly, Supreme Bing Ye’s aura, which had been slightly dispirited, rose sharply. His entire body swelled up at an extremely fast speed!","With him as the center, a terrifying aura spread out and shook the earth!","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and a slight fighting intent appeared on his expressionless face.","“Bing Ye, now this is what you should do.”","“Come! Show me your strength and don’t disappoint me!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting spirit and he also activated his divine body!","10 feet... 1,000 feet... 10,000 feet... 100,000 feet...!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye’s divine bodies expanded and they rose from the ground!","The two of them seemed to have transformed into ancient giants that could hold up the sky. The mountain peaks that people looked up to were only knee-high below their feet.","The two of them seemed to be able to grasp the formation of the sun and moon by raising their hands, and they could use the Milky Way as their feet when they stepped on it.","Their eyes seemed to have turned into burning suns.","At 150,000 feet, Supreme Bing Ye stopped expanding.","His entire aura changed, and a crown made of glazed ice appeared on his head.","His skin was covered in a thick layer of ice crystal armor, only revealing a pair of cold silver eyes.","In his hand, the God Slaying Sword disappeared and turned into a huge ice crystal sword!","This was not the end. On his back, the ice crystal wings condensed again, but they were countless times wider, as if they could destroy the world with a gentle flap.","However... Jian Wushuang was still growing!","200,000 feet!","210,000 feet!","Jian Wushuang’s expanding divine body only stopped when he reached 250,000 feet.","Supreme Bing Ye, who was already as tall as a large mountain, suddenly became small in front of Jian Wushuang.","Thud! Thud!","Without saying anything, Jian Wushuang moved!","He took a step forward and flattened an entire mountain range. His right fist was like a drawn bow as it ruthlessly smashed toward Supreme Bing Ye!","All the cultivation of an Intermediate Supreme martial artist burst out and condensed on his fist. Coupled with his Chaos Overlord Body, it was as if he had a sun in his fist and was emitting a bright golden light!","Rumble!","This punch was extremely powerful. The overbearing power and the biting-cold Sword Qi on it had yet to land on Supreme Bing Ye’s body, but it had already created a pit in the void and set off a shocking wave of air!","“Come! Jian Wushuang! Today, either you die or I die!”","A crazed and ferocious expression appeared on Supreme Master Bing Ye’s face. He was also extremely determined and brought out an indomitable spirit!","He raised his huge sword that was as big as a Glacier Mountain and slashed at Jian Wushuang!","Bang!","A deafening explosion erupted!","Supreme Bing Ye’s body trembled violently. The overbearing power and terrifying Sword Qi on Jian Wushuang’s fist followed the huge glacier sword and crashed into Supreme Bing Ye’s body wave after wave like a thousand-fold wave!","In an instant, countless ice crystals were sent flying. Supreme Bing Ye was forced to take three steps back. Every step he took seemed to trigger an earthquake. With his feet as the center, the earth began to crack like a spider web, creating countless bottomless ravines.","Jian Wushuang also groaned. His fist was covered with golden blood and his bone armor was almost broken.","But even so, Jian Wushuang still sneered.","Back in the Great Void Star Field, Jian Wushuang was almost unable to resist this move of Supreme Bing Ye. He had exhausted all his abilities but was unable to hurt Supreme Bing Ye in the slightest.","In the end, he had to use the last move of the Tarot Sword Manual to defeat Supreme Bing Ye.","However, now, he was able to fight against Supreme Bing Ye with his own strength!","“Again!”","...","Jian Wushuang laughed and his eyes were burning with fighting spirit.","He took a step forward and began to run. Once again, he raised his fist and charged toward Supreme Bing Ye!","“Good! Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how far you’ve grown!”","Supreme Bing Ye’s face darkened. He raised his huge sword and leaped up, slashing it at Jian Wushuang!","“Good!”","“Innate divine ability, Life Intimidation!”","Jian Wushuang laughed and directly used life intimidation.","A pressure that seemed to originate from a higher level of existence instantly spread out, causing Supreme Bing Ye’s movements to freeze.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang closed in and clenched his hands into fists. It was as if he was holding the sun and moon in his palms. He released endless brilliance and bombarded Supreme Bing Ye’s chest!","Bang! Bang!!!","Jian Wushuang’s fists exploded with Sword Qi and struck Supreme Bing Ye’s chest, causing numerous muffled sounds.","...","For the current Jian Wushuang, killing Supreme Bing Ye was not a difficult task.","He only needed to display the fifth move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Tarot, and Jian Wushuang was confident that he would be able to kill Supreme Bing Ye.","He did not even need to go through the trouble of releasing the Tarot divine corpse from the Heaven-Suppressing Monument. With the two of them working together, they could easily kill Supreme Bing Ye even if they were to grind him down slowly.","However, Jian Wushuang did not choose to do so.","He was going to rely on his most primal and original power to completely crush Supreme Bing Ye in all aspects!","He wanted Supreme Master ice to die with heartfelt respect!","Peng peng peng!","Jian Wushuang’s punches became faster and faster, like a heavy cannon, and smashed into Supreme Bing Ye’s chest like a storm.","Countless ice crystals were sent flying.","The thick layer of ice crystal armor on Supreme Bing Ye’s body was shattered by Jian Wushuang’s fist.","Under Jian Wushuang’s dense punches, Supreme Bing Ye’s divine body began to tremble violently. His entire body was like a sieve that was constantly shaking.","His face quickly turned from green to white. Divine blood flowed out of his ears and nose, and his aura began to weaken.","“Break!”","As Jian Wushuang shouted, he gathered all of his divine power and Sword Qi into a heavy fist and struck the center of Supreme Bing Ye’s chest!","In an instant, Supreme Master Bing Ye felt as if he had been hit by a violent train. His entire body was sent flying like a raggedy sack. He flew through the air and heavily fell to the ground, setting off a mushroom cloud of dust.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his fist and panted slightly.","In the entire world, he was the only one left standing like a mountain."]},{"number":4509,"title":"Chapter 4509 The Appearance of Great Void Divine Emperor","paragraphs":["4509 The Appearance of Great Void Divine Emperor","“It’s too... too fierce!”","“Jian Wushuang is so fierce that he’s not human!!!”","In the distance, Supreme Gongyang was dumbstruck as he watched Jian Wushuang send Supreme Bing Ye flying with a single punch. His entire body was trembling.","The battle between the two just now did not have any fancy divine techniques. It was just a fist to the flesh, a primitive collision of divine power and physical power!","!!","This battle was extremely brutal. At the same time, it caused a huge visual impact!","Between the two of them, every sword strike and every punch could blow up the sun and flatten the galaxy!","As they collided, they triggered a storm in the starry sky!","Whew.","A mushroom cloud, thousands of miles wide, rose up. Supreme Bing Ye’s 150,000-foot body fell to the ground, causing a magnitude 10 earthquake. The entire Land of Gods trembled violently.","“Cough cough... cough.”","In the midst of the smoke and dust, there was a violent cough.","Soon after, the smoke and dust dispersed, and Supreme Bing Ye staggered to his feet.","His body had already returned to its original state. His silver hair reached his waist, his clothes were torn, and blood was flowing out of his ears, nose, and eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, your growth is amazing.”","Supreme Bing Ye shook his head.","Jian Wushuang also started to shrink rapidly and returned to his original appearance.","Jian Wushuang’s black hair was loose and his eyes were bright. His eyes were bright and full of spirit, as if they were holding two stars.","“Bing Ye, say goodbye to this world.”","With an indifferent expression, Jian Wushuang looked at his side with his right hand and gestured. Suddenly, the Tarot Divine Sword, which had been stabbed into the ground in the distance, flew backward and automatically shot into Jian Wushuang’s hand. Jian Wushuang clenched it tightly.","“Jian Wushuang, do you think you’ve won?”","When Supreme Bing Ye saw this, his face, which was covered in ice crystals and divine blood, showed no fear. Instead, he laughed.","“Jian Wushuang, do you really think that I have no trump cards to show up to cause you trouble?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned.","The next moment!","The expression on Supreme Bing Ye’s face was suddenly replaced by a ferocious one!","He opened his mouth and growled, “Jian Wushuang, go to hell!!!”","Boom!!!","His right hand reached out like lightning, grabbed the silk bag on his waist, and crushed it!","A terrifying aura as deep as the abyss instantly spread out from the silk bag!","This aura was far superior to Supreme Bing Ye’s. The moment this aura appeared, the heavens and earth changed color. It was as if countless bombs had been dropped on the earth, and it was forcibly flattened by a thousand feet!","Even the 99 restrictive spells around him started to tremble slightly.","“An Invincible Supreme! It’s the aura of an Invincible Supreme!”","In the distance, Supreme Gongyang’s expression changed drastically!","Under this aura, he actually felt like he could not help but kneel down and worship. There was only one kind of person that could make him feel this way!","That was the Invincible Supreme!","“Hmm? This is the aura of Great Void Divine Emperor?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. He felt both amused and angry.","Great Void Divine Emperor, an Invincible Supreme and one of the main fighting forces of the Divine Power Universe against the Void Universe, had actually disregarded the overall situation and disregarded the fact that Jian Wushuang had entered the Void Universe for the sake of the Divine Power universe. He had plotted against him and wanted to kill him.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve said it before. You’re the one who should die this time!”","Supreme Bing Ye laughed maniacally when he saw this.","His hatred for Jian Wushuang had been engraved in his bones since the day Jian Wushuang defeated him in the Great Void Star Field in front of everyone. He would not rest until Jian Wushuang died!","He had been proud all his life, when had he ever suffered such humiliation?","Now that he was about to be able to kill the enemy with his own hands, how could he not be happy?","Boom, boom, boom!","A powerful aura was still rising.","Dark clouds formed in the sky, and countless lightning snakes as thick as a bowl shuttled back and forth, causing the void to explode.","Then, a dignified middle-aged man wearing a black and gold crown and a royal robe was born in the sea of lightning.","This person was the apparition of Great Void Divine Emperor!","In the apparition of Great Void Divine Emperor, blazing white lightning kept on flashing and his eyes were indifferent.","“Bing Ye, stop!” Supreme Gongyang could not bear it any longer after seeing this scene. He swept out from a corner.","“Bing Ye, Jian Wushuang is an unparalleled prodigy in our universe. He has shocking potential in the future. Who knows, he might become the strongest person after Cosmos Gods in the future. Now that we are facing external threats, shouldn’t we work together to get rid of the Void Universe first?”","“Bing Ye, think about it. If you kill Jian Wushuang, what will you get? Why don’t you wait until this great calamity is over, and then you two can compete with your own strength?”","Supreme Gongyang roared as he rapidly flew over.","“Get lost!” However, how could Supreme Bing Ye listen to the second half of the sentence?","...","With a wave of his sleeve, the God Slaying Sword shot out and slammed into Supreme Gongyang, sending him flying back.","“Gongyang, I’m warning you. This is a matter between me and Jian Wushuang. No one is allowed to interfere today!”","“If you dare to say another word, do you believe that I’ll kill you as well?”","Supreme Bing Ye looked coldly at Supreme Gongyang and snorted.","Supreme Gongyang’s heart instantly turned cold.","High up in the sky, lightning filled the sky like an abyss, forming a sea of lightning.","Great Void Divine Emperor’s apparition became more and more solid. He slowly raised a finger and pressed down on Jian Wushuang!","This finger was a lightning river!","Supreme Gongyang could not help but close his eyes when he saw this. He could not bear to watch.","This apparition had the power of an attack from Great Void Divine Emperor!","Even though it was only a single attack, it was still an attack from an Invincible Supreme!","...","The difference between an Invincible Supreme and an ordinary Supreme was like the difference between heaven and earth.","From ancient times until now, there had only been one person who could fight an Invincible Supreme as an ordinary Supreme, and that was Supreme Tarot!","However, at that time, Supreme Tarot was already a Top Supreme realm expert!","What about Jian Wushuang?","He could not even compare in terms of cultivation base, he was a mere Intermediate Supreme martial artist.","Rumble!","The void exploded continuously and Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew up.","Before the finger could land, his divine body had already cracked under the terrifying pressure.","This was simply heaven’s might, far beyond the reach of human strength!","For the first time, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with solemness.","This finger could not be blocked!","Even if he wielded the Tarot Divine Sword and used the Tarot Sword Strike, he would not be able to block this attack!","“Supreme Tarot.”","Jian Wushuang called out to his back. suddenly, the void behind him split open and a stiff figure in a black robe walked out of the void. It was the corpse of Supreme Tarot.","Boom!","The aura of a Supreme being shot up into the sky from the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot like a blazing flame!","“Eh? A Supreme expert?”","“Jian Wushuang has a helper?”","“Who is this person?”","Instantly, Supreme Bing Ye and Supreme Gongyang were both shocked and looked up at the corpse."]},{"number":4510,"title":"Chapter 4510 One Sword to Decide the Universe!","paragraphs":["4510 One Sword to Decide the Universe!","“What is this?”","When everyone’s eyes fell on the face of the Tarot divine corpse, they were all shocked.","Who was this unfamiliar Supreme martial artist, whose entire body was covered in a black robe and only his eyes were exposed?","Supreme Bing Ye furrowed his brows. For some reason, when he saw this unfamiliar Supreme martial artist who had suddenly appeared, he felt a slight sense of unease.","The cold and stiff aura on his body, which was like that of a corpse, made him feel uneasy.","However, when he released his divine power and found that the corpse of Tarot was only at the Primary Supreme realm, he shook his head and did not take him seriously.","“He’s just a Primary Supreme martial artist. He won’t be able to cause any trouble.”","Supreme Bing Ye sneered as he looked at the finger that was about to land on Jian Wushuang’s body. The delight in his eyes grew even more intense!","Boom!","All of a sudden!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head and looked at the finger. He released all his divine abilities.","Innate divine ability, Life Intimidation!","It was an innate divine ability, Primordial Universe!","The secret skill of Dragon blood, Divine Power Ignition!","Waves of power were added to Jian Wushuang’s body. Jian Wushuang’s Immortal aura increased greatly again!","Bang! Bang!","The corpse of the Supreme Tarot behind him took a step forward and rushed into the sky. He turned into a sword light and crashed toward the finger!","Like an egg hitting a rock, the corpse of the Supreme Tarot crashed into Great Void Divine Emperor’s finger with a determined look!","Crack, crack.","In an instant, the full power of the Tarot divine corpse exploded and hit the middle part of Great Void Divine Emperor’s finger. However, it was useless. Everything was useless!","If Supreme Tarot was at his peak, he could even kill Great Void Divine Emperor with the Tarot Divine Sword. However, Supreme Tarot was just a divine corpse with no consciousness. How could he be an opponent of an Invincible Supreme expert, Great Void Divine Emperor?","In an instant, Great Void Divine Emperor’s finger dimmed slightly while the corpse of the Supreme Tarot exploded and his body was almost shattered.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes could not help but flash with regret.","If not for the fact that he had no other choice, he really would not have let the corpse of Supreme Tarot fall into such a dangerous place.","However, the good thing was that although Tarot divine corpse was only at the Priamry Supreme realm, its body was at the Top Supreme realm!","Although this finger almost caused the body of the Tarot divine corpse to explode, it was still unable to completely destroy it.","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth move, Tarot!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, narrowed his eyes, and spoke slowly.","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire space of the Land of Gods rumbled!","Rumble!!!","The boundless sea of thunder was torn apart. With Jian Wushuang as the center, every grain of sand and stone was suspended in the air and turned into a sword realm that extended for thousands of feet!","This was nothing. Behind Jian Wushuang, a huge Dharma figure appeared!","This Dharma figure was wearing a green robe and had a handsome face. With a long sword on his back and a wine pot in his hand, he opened his hazy eyes and smiled as he asked the heavens and earth who else could it be but him!","He was unspeakably unrestrained!","This was the true Supreme Tarot!","This was the unrivaled Sword Supreme who dared to laugh at everyone with a sword in hand!","“This is the sword strike!”","Supreme Bing Ye looked at Jian Wushuang, who walked out of the Immortal Palace as if the gate of heaven had opened, and his heart felt as if it was being squeezed by a pair of big hands!","Last time, he had been defeated by this sword strike!","“Come, let this sword strike decide the world!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fearlessness. He held the Tarot Divine Sword with both hands and slashed down fiercely!","“Break!”","In an instant, the Tarot Dharma power behind Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Swordmaster merged into one as Jian Wushuang made a slashing gesture.","Roar!","It was as if there was a primordial beast roaring. The blazing sword light was like a heavenly river, rolling up and crossing the sky, penetrating the sun and the moon!","The dazzling sword light was so dazzling that it made people close their eyes subconsciously.","In a split second, the sword and Great Void Divine Emperor’s finger collided together!","Bang!","The space was like glass, covered with cobwebs and then shattered.","A mighty force that Jian Wushuang had never experienced before was transferred to his body through the sword!","Pfft!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body retreated rapidly. Blood began to flow out of the one billion three thousand seven million and eight hundred thousand pores on his body.","...","...","A moment later.","The world gradually regained its calm.","The bright light gradually dissipated, and his vision gradually began to recover. the rumbling in his ears slowly disappeared.","The disheveled Supreme Bing Ye and Supreme Gongyang both raised their heads and looked at Jian Wushuang.","Drip. Drip.","Drip. Drip.","This was the sound of divine blood dripping on the ground.","In the dust that filled the sky, Great Void Divine Emperor’s figure had already disappeared. There was only one person standing proudly.","That was... Jian Wushuang!","His eyes were cold, and his black robe was torn apart. Red blood flowed down his wrist onto the Tarot Divine Sword, and then dripped onto the ground.","“He didn’t die?”","...","In an instant, Supreme Bing Ye’s expression changed drastically. He took three steps back in disbelief and fell on his butt.","Great Void Divine Emperor’s attack could not kill Jian Wushuang?","As for Supreme Gongyang, after a moment of shock, his expression was replaced by a complicated one.","An Intermediate Supreme martial artist was able to withstand an attack from an Invincible Supreme martial artist and survive!","What kind of strength was this?","Among the three million Heaven’s Favorites in the world, only Jian Wushuang could be this arrogant!","“No! That was impossible! Why is it like this?”","At this moment, all of Supreme Bing Ye’s self-confidence and self-esteem were shattered.","He looked at Jian Wushuang and got up from the ground in a panic. He shook his head and mumbled unconsciously while trying to escape in a panic.","“Bing Ye, everything is over.”","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void like the son of heaven and earth, spoke slowly.","His voice was calm, without any ripples.","He stretched out his hand and grabbed at the air. Instantly, a myriad of auras locked onto Supreme Bing Ye. Supreme Bing Ye flew backward and landed in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","It was only when Jian Wushuang held him in his hand that Supreme Bing Ye seemed to wake up from his confusion. He looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze, his eyes lost.","“I... I’ve been defeated?”","At this moment, he was not afraid, not angry, only confused.","As if he had lost something, and as if he knew that the outcome had been decided, Supreme Bing Ye lowered his head and sighed.","Pfft!","The tip of the Tarot Divine Sword pierced through his back and through his entire body.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He flipped his right hand and the sword essence of the Tarot Divine Sword burst forth, completely destroying Supreme Bing Ye.","Bang!","Supreme Bing Ye’s life force began to disappear as he fell from the sky and crashed onto the ground.","Just like a sand painting, Supreme Master Bing Ye’s body was blown away by the wind, scattering from his feet to his head.","This time, Supreme Bing Ye had completely fallen."]},{"number":4511,"title":"Chapter 4511 Leaving","paragraphs":["4511 Leaving","Supreme Bing Ye was dead.","Jian Wushuang had killed Supreme Bing Ye with a sword stroke in the Land of Gods.","The sound of the wind could be heard in the world.","Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword in his right hand, his black hair flying in the air. He slowly raised his head and looked at the void.","His golden eyes were calm.","From the moment Supreme Bing Ye stepped into the Land of Gods and was about to fight to the death with Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang knew that there was only one person left standing.","That was him, Jian Wushuang!","This was not arrogance, but confidence.","In the distance.","Supreme Gongyang stared blankly at this scene. his mouth was wide open, and his entire body was trembling.","Bing Ye was dead. The Supreme Bing Ye, who was once all-powerful in the universe, who commanded the world, and was the new Temple Master of the Great Void Temple, had fallen at the hands of Jian Wushuang and became a dead soul under his sword.","No one knew how many Supreme beings had died at Jian Wushuang’s hands.","Pant, pant, pant.","Supreme Master Gongyang was gasping for breath, his chest heaving up and down.","Supreme Bing Ye was only a step away from becoming an Invincible Supreme. Toward the end, he even used an attack from Great Void Divine Emperor. Even so, he was still not Jian Wushuang’s match.","It could be said that...","Jian Wushuang was now the strongest person that was below the Invincible Supreme realm!","As long as the Invincible Supreme did not show up, he, Jian Wushuang, would be the unbeatable king of the universe!","“Jian Wushuang is only an Intermediate Supreme, but he has the ability to kill a Half Invincible Supreme. He can even fight a weaker Unparalleled Supreme. If he breaks through to High Supreme, Top Supreme, or even Half Invincible Supreme! Who else in this world can stop him?”","“Jian Wushuang, isn’t he the second Tarot?!”","Thoughts flashed wildly in Supreme Gongyang’s eyes, and an even more astonishing thought came to mind.","He was afraid that when Jian Wushuang reached the realm of a Top Supreme, even if Tarot Supreme reincarnated, he would not be able to beat Jian Wushuang!","At that time, Supreme Tarot, who was so famous that he was called ‘Tarot Sword Supreme’, would probably have to change. People would have to start calling the name ‘Wushuang Sword Supreme’.","Supreme Gongyang shook his head. He felt extremely frightened after thinking about it, and did not dare to think about it any further.","Clack.","The Tarot Divine Sword returned to its sheath inch by inch. Jian Wushuang looked at Supreme Gongyang and said, “Supreme Gongyang, have you seen enough?”","Supreme Gongyang could not help but laugh as he walked out of the void.","Jian Wushuang looked at Supreme Gongyang and shook his head.","Although Jian Wushuang did not have much contact with Supreme Gongyang, he had a good impression of him. He had a gentle personality and was more like an old man. When he saw that he was in danger just now, he could not help but bite the bullet and plead with Supreme Bing Ye for Jian Wushuang.","They chatted for a while before Jian Wushuang opened the Heaven-Suppressing Monument and let him in.","If Supreme Gongyang were to walk out of the Land of Gods with him, it would be inevitable that someone would plot against him. If he were to recall the incident that happened during the God Refining Sect’s disciple selection, it would cause a lot of trouble.","Therefore, after discussing with him, Jian Wushuang put Supreme Gongyang and the severely damaged Tarot divine corpse into the Heaven-Suppressing Monument.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang looked at the destroyed core area of the Land of Gods again. He cupped his hands and bowed seriously, making a long bow.","Jian Wushuang knew that Supreme Dao Yan’s divine body had already been destroyed. However, he had not died. Instead, he had turned into countless strands of divine power and scattered between the heaven and earth to maintain the operation of the 99 restrictions.","“Senior Brother, I’m leaving. I’ll come and see you again in the future.”","Jian Wushuang said in a low voice. Then, he strode out of the restriction without hesitation.","Whoosh.","He stepped through the dark yellow restriction layer, and the feeling of falling into a warm ocean attacked him again.","When he opened his eyes again, Jian Wushuang was already outside the 99th restriction.","It was empty outside the 99 restrictive spells. No one had arrived.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and immediately rushed outside.","After passing through dozens of restrictions, Jian Wushuang finally saw the experts of the major sects in the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang activated the Void Power Crystal in his body and turned all his divine power into void power.","There were originally dozens of Heaven’s Gate’s favorite disciples, but after the elimination, there were only a dozen or so left. each of them had a look of panic on their faces as they looked around carefully, afraid that the prohibition spell would suddenly be triggered and cause them to be killed.","The disciples of the Heaven’s Gate who had met Jian Wushuang before were almost completely annihilated. Only the head disciple of the Heaven’s Gate was still alive. However, his robe was torn and his hair was disheveled. He looked extremely embarrassed.","As for Fu Chen, who had come from the God Refining Sect with Jian Wushuang, he was nowhere to be seen. He must have died in the Land of Gods.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang had no intention of greeting them. He took a step forward and was about to pass by them.","Now that he had confirmed that the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace was still alive and had obtained his Great Dao enlightenment, he naturally did not need to stay in the Land of Gods any longer.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to walk past them...","A stern shout suddenly exploded.","“Hold on!”","The Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple looked at Jian Wushuang with a dark face and said with a fake smile, “You’re leaving already? Aren’t you going to tell us what’s the situation up ahead?”","The others looked at Jian Wushuang after he finished speaking.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but frown and replied indifferently, “The front is the same as here, but the power of the restrictions is much more turbulent and terrifying. I no longer have the strength to move forward, so I chose to turn back.”","...","“Unable to move forward? Turn back?”","The Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple narrowed his eyes and sneered, “I think you’ve already entered the Land of Gods, got the treasures, and are ready to leave, right?”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked.","“How is that possible?”","“It can’t be?”","the others were suspicious.","The Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple twisted his neck and said in a clear voice, “Everyone, I have noticed this person before. He is not restricted in the Land of Gods at all! When I saw him fighting with Yan Dan from the God Refining Sect, a restrictive force suddenly avoided him when it was about to touch him!”","“Think about it, this restrictive power has no consciousness, so why did it avoid this person? Furthermore, this person’s cultivation level is clearly similar to ours, perhaps even lower. Why is he running ahead of us?”","Everyone’s expression changed slightly.","“Although the fight between Jian Wushuang and Yan Dan was short and it was not an exaggeration to say that Jian Wushuang had killed Yan Dan in seconds, some people still noticed the scene.”","It would have been fine if the Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple had not said anything. However, with this reminder, everyone immediately reacted.","...","“That’s right, why did it turn out like this?”","“This person’s aura is ordinary, and his cultivation level is average. Why didn’t the restriction target him before? Why did it only attack us? Could it be that he’s better-looking?”","“There must be something strange about him!”"]},{"number":4512,"title":"Chapter 4512 Die From Talking Too Much","paragraphs":["4512 Die From Talking Too Much","In the Land of Gods.","The experts from the top sects had quietly surrounded Jian Wushuang and blocked his way out.","in just a few words, the head disciple of the Heaven’s Gate had already put Jian Wushuang in the spotlight.","The Heaven’s Gate’s first disciple looked at everyone’s reaction and then at the expressionless and silent Jian Wushuang. The sneer on the corner of his mouth became even more pronounced.","He looked around at the crowd and said loudly, “Everyone, I’m sure that this man has some secret treasure that can hide his aura and avoid the power of the restriction! Now that he has gained some benefits, he wants to leave. Do you agree?”","What a ploy!","As soon as he said that, everyone’s pupils shrank and they looked at Jian Wushuang with hostility and greed.","“That’s right! This person must have some kind of secret treasure on him that can avoid the power of these restrictions!”","“Hmph, so many of us have died and it wasn’t easy for us to get here. In the end, you’ve obtained some benefits and now you want to leave? How can there be such a good thing in the world?”","“Little brat, hand over your secret treasure and we’ll let you leave safely!”","“Hahaha, in my opinion, this person is a great gift for us. We don’t have to take the risk to advance further.”","“That’s right. In my opinion, why don’t we work together to kill this brat first, then we can split his treasures one by one?”","For a moment, everyone looked at each other, and the corners of their mouths curled up into a smirk.","The evil of human nature was completely bound by rules.","Without rules, humans would be like wild beasts. They would not talk about morality and would release the most primitive greed and sin in human nature.","In this world where the strong preyed on the weak, the only restraint was who was stronger and whose fist was tougher.","Seeing this, the Heaven’s Gate’s first disciple sneered in his heart.","He did not know if Jian Wushuang had any secret treasure that could avoid the restrictive power of the Land of Gods. He also did not know if Jian Wushuang had obtained any treasure after entering the core of the Land of Gods.","However, that was not important.","It was enough as long as Jian Wushuang was dead.","As for the reason?","“Hmm, my Heaven’s Gate disciples were almost completely annihilated. Why are you able to stay out of this alone?”","This was the biggest reason!","Shaking his head, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a touch of frivolity in his eyes, as if he was an Emperor who had everything in his hands. He said, “Sir, I heard you’re called Wushuang, right?”","“I’ll give you two choices now.”","“The first option is for you to obediently surrender and give up all resistance. Who knows, we might be able to let you leave safely after we’ve plundered you.”","“Second, we can attack you together and kill you directly.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s indifferent face suddenly revealed a smile.","As he laughed, he sighed. He looked at the Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple and said sincerely, “Do you know why you died?”","“What?”","The Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple frowned, somewhat confused.","“You died because you talk too much.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the others who had surrounded him and said again, “Do you know why you all died?”","Before they could reply.","Jian Wushuang answered, “You all died of stupidity.”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s five fingers grasped the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword.","Sword draw!","Boom!!!","A white sword energy, like a white dragon, was suddenly pulled out of the Tarot Scabbard!","Between heaven and earth, only this vast white sword energy was left!","The Sword Qi was like a dragon, rushing to the nine layers of clouds!","The crisp sound of the sword exploded in the Land of Gods like a bomb!","In front of the sword light, whether it was the Heaven’s Gate’s head disciple or the other ten or so heaven’s favorites, they were all like ants looking up at the sky, extremely small.","“What!”","In an instant, the head disciple of the Heaven’s Gate raised his head and looked at the sword gleam that was as vast as the ocean. There was only horror left on his face.","The other people’s faces were also replaced by shock. Under the lock of this Sword Qi, they could not even move their feet.","Whoosh!","Like a knife cutting through tofu, the sword swept across the dozens of Heaven’s Favorites.","After the sword attack.","Heaven and earth regained its clarity and only Jian Wushuang was left standing in the Land of Gods.","All the experts were killed by this sword strike, and not even their ashes were left behind.","For the current Jian Wushuang, killing these 8-Star, One Scar, and Two-scar level Void Warriors was as easy as killing an ant.","Whoosh!","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and rushed out of the Land of Gods like a thunderbolt.","...","...","Outside the Land of Gods.","Elder Shen Lian’s expression was gloomy as he sat cross-legged.","Boom!","Suddenly, a piercing sword light flashed across the Land of Gods. Elder Shen Lian could not help but open his eyes to take a look.","A familiar aura was constantly rushing out.","“Someone’s coming out.”","A cold glint flashed in the eyes of Elder Shen Lian. He stood up and blocked the exit of the Land of Gods.","On the other side, the Crimson Whale Gang, led by Chief Luo Ming, also sensed the aura of someone about to charge out of the Land of Gods. Their eyelids twitched involuntarily as they hurriedly stood up and looked toward the Land of Gods.","“Only one person came out!”","“Lord Bing Ye! It must be Lord Bing Ye!”","...","“Guys, let’s prepare to welcome Lord Bing Ye! I wish Lord Bing Ye a triumphant return!”","Chief Luo Ming raised his spirits and said with a smile.","It was getting closer and closer.","In everyone’s perception, that person who came out from the Land of Gods was extremely fast and was constantly closing the distance between them and the exit of the Land of Gods!","Buzzzzzz!","The next moment!","A thin figure in a black robe suddenly rushed out of the Land of Gods.","“Lord Bing... eh, it’s not Lord Bing Ye!”","“Who is this person?”","“Where is Lord Bing Ye?”","The Crimson Whale Gang members were stunned when they saw the black-robed figure.","On the other hand, Elder Shen Lian’s eyes narrowed and his expression changed slightly.","“Wushuang!”","All of a sudden, Elder Shen Lian’s face turned ashen.","The hearts of father and son were connected. Naturally, Elder Shen Lian was the one who could sense Yan Dan’s aura the most.","He could feel the aura of death from Jian Wushuang!","“Wushuang! Speak! Are you the one who killed my son?”","Suddenly, Elder Shen Lian glared at Jian Wushuang and shouted.","Jian Wushuang, who had just stepped out of the Land of Gods, frowned when he heard the question.","Why did Shen Lian appear here?","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang did not take it seriously. He did not need to think to know that Elder Shen Lian had probably followed him all the way and wanted to work with Yan Dan to assassinate him.","“I killed him, so what?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and said indifferently.","“It’s you indeed!”","Seeing that Jian Wushuang had admitted to it so openly, Elder Shen Lian was instantly infuriated. He flew into a rage and the killing intent in his eyes flickered to the extreme. He roared, “Wushuang, I’ll take your life!”"]},{"number":4513,"title":"Chapter 4513 Belated Awareness","paragraphs":["4513 Belated Awareness","Boom!","An endless void energy condensed in Elder Shen Lian’s hand.","His robe fluttered and his eyes were filled with killing intent. A violent force shook the void.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He had just held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword, but he seemed to have thought of something. He loosened his five fingers again, turned around, took a step forward, and turned into a flowing light, sweeping into the distance.","!!","“You want to run?”","Elder Shen Lian laughed out of anger. He dispersed the terrifying power in his hand and turned to chase after Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang! You killed Yan Dan. I don’t care if you go to heaven or hell, I’ll kill you today!” he shouted from behind.","Jian Wushuang did not look back, but he sneered.","Back when he was at the God Refining Sect, he had already thought of killing Elder Shen Lian.","He had not been able to find a suitable opportunity, but now, the opportunity had come!","However, the Land of Gods was a place that stirred up a storm and attracted the attention of all the major forces. If they wanted to kill Elder Shen Lian, it was inevitable that they would reveal some of their strength, which would easily cause trouble.","It was better to lure him out first, leave the Land of Gods, and then kill him with one sword strike!","Whoosh!!!","Jian Wushuang and Elder Shen Lian were very fast. The two of them turned into flowing lights and left the Land of Gods very quickly.","In the empty Land of Gods, only the group from Crimson Whale Gang remained.","“C-Chief, there’s no aura of anyone in the Land of Gods,” a Crimson Whale Gang member said softly.","“Chief, did Lord Bing Ye get killed inside?” another Crimson Whale Gang disciple asked.","Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief Luo Ming did not speak, but a hesitant look appeared on his face.","The strongest person who had entered the Land of Gods before was only at the level of Two Scars, and Lord Bing Ye’s strength was stronger than his. How could he have been killed?","If there was not an accident inside, then there was only one possibility...","Luo Ming raised his head and looked at the place where Jian Wushuang had left.","He could clearly notice that Lord Bing Ye had a strong enmity toward this kid from the God Refining Sect, Wushuang.","With Lord Bing Ye’s power, anyone who could be regarded as an enemy by him must be at least on the same level as him, right?","“Let’s go. Let’s catch up and take a look,” Luo Ming said as his thoughts flickered.","Boom!","The Crimson Whale Gang’s Cosmic Warship suddenly accelerated and chased after the place where Jian Wushuang and Elder Shen Lian disappeared.","...","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang and Elder Shen Lian flew in the sky one after another.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless and his speed was neither fast nor slow. He did not completely shake off Elder Shen Lian, but he maintained a distance that was just enough to keep up with him as he gradually flew toward a remote part of the universe.","“Damn it!” Elder Shen Lian’s expression was gloomy. His anger had completely overwhelmed his mind.","He did not think about how Jian Wushuang, a mere 8-Star Void Warrior, could kill Yan Dan, who had broken through to the Scar level, nor did he think about why he could not catch up with Jian Wushuang even though he was at the Scar level.","He only had one thought in his mind.","And that was to catch up and kill Jian Wushuang!","After a few hours.","Under the power of the two, they had already crossed several Star Fields and were nearly ten million miles away from the Land of Gods.","The two of them gradually entered a desolate Star Field.","“Let’s do it here!”","Jian Wushuang spread out his void power and found no one. After he found that there was no one there, he could not help but take a deep breath and gradually stopped.","“Hahahaha, Wushuang! Why aren’t you running anymore?”","When Elder Shen Lian saw this, he immediately laughed out loud in excitement.","He thought that Jian Wushuang had used up all his void power and could no longer escape.","“Wushuang, since you can’t run anymore, then prepare to die! I’ll be buried with my son!”","Immediately, Elder Shen Lian’s laughter stopped and was replaced with endless hatred.","The Yan Dan was his life’s work!","“Soul Separation Sickle!!!”","Bang! Bang!","With a flip of his right hand, a black sickle tied together with chains and used as a handle appeared in his hand.","The blade of the sickle was shimmering with black light. Not only was its attack power unusually powerful, but it could also hook out a cultivator’s divine soul and imprison it on the sickle forever, tormenting it day and night. It was the most notorious and peerless weapon in the Void Universe.","As soon as the Soul Separation Sickle appeared, the void was immediately filled with ghostly wails and wolf howls. It was as if countless vengeful souls and malicious ghosts were imprisoned in the sickle and were howling.","Jian Wushuang turned around and held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword with his right hand. His expression was cold.","This Elder Shen Lian had a cultivation base of Three Scars, which was equivalent to a High Supreme of the Divine Power Universe.","If Jian Wushuang had not broken through to the Intermediate Supreme realm, it might be difficult for him to deal with this person. However, after he had broken through to Intermediate Supreme, Elder Shen Xiu was just an ant that he could kill with a flip of his hand.","...","“Shen Lian, do you really want to see your son Yan Dan?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“What do you think?” Elder Shen Lian sneered and retorted.","He did not want to talk to Jian Wushuang anymore. As he spoke, the Soul Separation Sickle in his hand turned into a black flowing light and shot toward Jian Wushuang!","“Very well, then I’ll do as you wish and send you to accompany him!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and the corners of his mouth suddenly pulled up into a deep and sinister smile.","“Die!”","Bang! Bang!","Jian Wushuang moved.","This movement was like a thunderclap!","“Tarot Sword Manual, second move, Daybreak!”","A golden light suddenly appeared!","...","It was as if the entire world had been torn apart by this golden light, and a thick layer of multicolored light spread out.","The Divine Bell of Fortune, the separation of yin and yang!","This sword had split the yin and yang of heaven and earth!","Clang!","With a crisp sound, the Daybreak sword light that Jian Wushuang had turned into landed on the Soul Separation Sickle.","Instantly, this notorious Soul Separation Sickle only lasted for a breath’s time before it was covered with dense, spider-web like holes.","Bang! Bang!","Then, it was hit by the Sword Qi, and the whole sickle was broken into pieces.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had already passed through Elder Shen Lian’s body like a golden dragon.","Pfff.","Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared behind Elder Shen Lian and the golden light around his body scattered.","A large hole had already appeared in Elder Shen Lian’s chest.","“This... this power...”","Elder Shen Lian turned his head in a daze and looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“You’ve hidden your cultivation.”","“No... no, you’re not from our universe!”","Realization dawned on Elder Shen Lian’s face. However, before he could finish his sentence, his aura quickly withered. His entire body dissipated rapidly.","“I hate it!!!”","Under Elder Shen Lian’s extremely unwilling voice, his body, which had been shredded by the Sword Qi, began to disintegrate inch by inch.","Jian Wushuang remained silent and did not answer Elder Shen Lian’s question. Instead, he looked at Elder Shen Lian calmly as his divine body collapsed and dissipated."]},{"number":4514,"title":"Chapter 4514 Young Master Wushuang","paragraphs":["4514 Young Master Wushuang","Elder Shen Lian was dead.","As Jian Wushuang had said, since Elder Shen Lian was reluctant to part with Yan Dan, he would be a good man and send Elder Shen Lian to accompany Yan Dan.","This time, many Heaven’s Favorites from the Void Universe had gathered in the Land of Gods, but they were all killed by Jian Wushuang alone.","“Speaking of which, I’m helping the godly power universe in a roundabout way, right?”","!!","Jian Wushuang shook his head and was slightly dumbfounded.","Boom!","At this moment, a huge rumble came from the horizon.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang lifted his head and saw the Chief of Crimson Whale Gang steering a Cosmic Warship toward them at high speed.","On the ship.","Luo Ming stood on his feet and looked at Jian Wushuang. Before he could reach Jian Wushuang, he saw Jian Wushuang holding a sword in his right hand and Elder Shen Lian’s dying appearance.","“This!”","Suddenly, Luo Ming met Jian Wushuang’s eyes and felt as if there were two invisible bolts of divine lightning shooting out from Jian Wushuang’s eyes. His heart trembled.","In just a moment, he realized that he was definitely not Jian Wushuang’s match!","He had also noticed that Elder Shen Lian. His strength was at the Three Scar level, which was only one minor realm lower than his.","He asked himself, although he could also kill Elder Shen Lian, he definitely would not be as relaxed as Jian Wushuang. This guy could crush him as easily as breaking dry weeds and smashing rotten wood.","Luo Ming’s eyes turned slightly, and he could not help but think of the lifeless Supreme Bing Ye. He hurriedly shouted, “Hurry up! Turn around and don’t advance!”","Hence.","The group from Crimson Whale Gang, who had arrived with an overbearing momentum, hurriedly turned the Cosmic Warship around and shot back in the direction they had come from.","“You come and go as you please?”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but sneer.","Bang!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his body leaped into the air. He turned into a cannonball and charged toward the Crimson Whale Gang’s ship.","“Not good! This fiend is chasing us, run!”","At once, Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief Luo Ming was so frightened that he shuddered.","Boom!","Finally, the turn was complete. The Cosmic Warship opened fire and flew into the distance.","After chasing for a long time, Jian Wushuang found that his speed could only keep up with Luo Ming’s speed. He could not help but laugh in anger. He raised the Tarot Divine Sword and pointed the tip of the sword at Luo Ming on the cosmic warship.","“Crimson Whale Gang, right? If you advance another ten seconds, do you believe that I will kill my way into your lair and exterminate you completely?”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was like rolling thunder.","Buzzzzzz!","At once, Crimson Whale Gang’s Cosmic Warship came to a screeching halt a hundred feet away.","Luo Ming turned back to look at Jian Wushuang and groaned in his heart.","What the hell was he doing here?","This was great, he was caught red-handed!","Jian Wushuang looked at the ship that had stopped and took a step forward. Suddenly, the universe shrank under his feet. After three steps, Jian Wushuang landed on the bow deck of the spaceship.","“L-Lord Wushuang! I didn’t see anything, I don’t know anything!”","Luo Ming looked at Jian Wushuang, who was approaching with a sword in his hand, and his face turned pale. He knelt on the ground and shouted.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but shake his head. This man was a dignified Four Scar level Void Warrior, but he was so soft-hearted.","“Let me ask you, how did you get to know Bing Ye?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","He was not a person who liked to kill indiscriminately. However, if this group of notorious space pirates knew his identity, Jian Wushuang might have to exterminate their entire family and silence them.","“R-reporting to Lord Wushuang. That day, I was leading the men of Crimson Whale Gang in a sweep of the universe. We were looking for a sumptuous meal when we happened to run into Lord Bing Ye... We were just about to go up and rob him, but I was no match for him...”","Luo Ming spoke quickly and Jian Wushuang finally understood the whole situation.","The story was very simple. It was a story of being beaten up after failing to rob someone.","After he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, his expression was uncertain.","From the looks of it, these galactic pirates probably did not know his true identity, or they did not know about the existence of the alternate universe at all. After all, this kind of thing was top secret in both the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe. Only the small group of people who stood at the peak of the universe had the right to know about the matters of the two universes.","Although this Luo Ming was a Four Scar Void Master, his status was too low and he obviously did not have any channels to know these things.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes could not help but flash with hesitation.","After much thought, Jian Wushuang could not help but choose to attack. Luo Ming seemed to have noticed the killing intent that flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes and quickly said, “Lord Wushuang, please spare me! As long as Lord Wushuang is willing to let this lowly-one off, this lowly-one is willing to respect you as my master and serve at your beck and call from now on. I’ll climb mountains of daggers and plunge into seas of fire, and I’ll fight wherever you point me to, following your lead!”","As he said that, Luo Ming raised his face and kept smiling apologetically.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt happy and his killing intent reduced. He shook his head and said, “You said the same thing to Bing Ye, right?”","“Uh!” When Luo Ming heard this, he could not help but be stunned, and he scratched his head with a smile.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and pondered for a moment. Then, he said, “It’s not that I can’t let you go. How about this, let me plant a restriction in your life source, then you’ll be obedient and work for me, and I won’t make things difficult for you. How is it?”","As soon as these words fell, Luo Ming’s heart was immediately overjoyed.","...","By asking Jian Wushuang to plant a restriction in his life source, it was equivalent to handing his life over to Jian Wushuang. In the future, his life and death would be in Jian Wushuang’s hands with a single thought.","So what?","If he did not agree, what awaited him would be the same fate as Elder Shen Lian!","Luo Ming was able to become the leader of the galactic pirates who were hated by everyone, but he was still alive and well until now. Other than his outstanding strength, the most important thing was that he knew how to weigh the consequences.","“We will obey Master’s orders!”","Luo Ming quickly kowtowed three times to Jian Wushuang and let go of his defense. He let Jian Wushuang’s big hand press on his head and plant the destruction seal in his body.","The other Crimson Whale Gang members agreed one after another upon seeing the Chief’s reaction.","Jian Wushuang did the same. A moment later, the Crimson Whale Gang disciples on the boat knelt before Jian Wushuang and greeted him respectfully, “We respectfully welcome Young Master Wushuang!”","All of a sudden, the voices shouting ‘Young Master Wushuang’ joined together and shook the heavens and earth.","They knew that Jian Wushuang would be their king!","Jian Wushuang stood on the deck and nodded without any expression.","...","“Get up.”"]},{"number":4515,"title":"Chapter 4515 The Return","paragraphs":["4515 The Return","Whoosh.","As Jian Wushuang raised his right hand, everyone on the deck of the Cosmic Warship stood up in an instant.","“Young Master, what do you need us to do?” Luo Ming lowered his eyes and said respectfully.","To him, submitting to Jian Wushuang was merely changing from submitting to Supreme Bing Ye to another person. He did not feel too uncomfortable about it.","!!","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and said, “You guys do as usual. Just pay attention to the movements of the top forces. If there are any Scar level figures of the top forces who suddenly leave the sect, report to me immediately.”","“Yes!” Luo Ming nodded.","To the Crimson Whale Gang, the only thing they had was manpower!","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and said, “Also, send people into the Void Forbidden Land to investigate. Don’t miss any void cracks and rifts. See if there are large numbers of people stationed in any void cracks, or if there are any unusual images such as tight defense. If you find anything, report back to me after investigating.”","After that, Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and touched Luo Ming’s eyebrows, locking the connection between the two. If he needed to pass a message or something, Luo Ming could directly send him a voice transmission.","“Yes! We will obey the Young Master’s orders!”","Luo Ming did not refuse and nodded heavily.","He was puzzled as to why Jian Wushuang would ask him to investigate the Void Forbidden Land and pay attention to the movements of the top forces. These things were not things that a disciple of the God Refining Sect should pay attention to.","However, he had always been smart. He knew that there were some things that he should not ask. Asking would only bring him death. Since Jian Wushuang had said so, he would just obey.","He was a person who knew what was important.","“Okay, you guys can go.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head in satisfaction. With a wave of his right hand, the Crimson Whale Gang members dispersed.","After a while, Jian Wushuang was the only one left standing in the universe.","The people from Crimson Whale Gang had already split up. Following Jian Wushuang’s instructions, a portion of them went to the Void Forbidden Land while the rest went to the various top sects.","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to leave. Instead, he landed on an abandoned star and shot into the depths of the earth’s core.","He took out the Cosmos God token, and the surface of the token’s mirror began to distort. Ripples that resembled the surface of water appeared.","Following that, the face of Cosmos God appeared in the mirror.","“Jian Wushuang.”","In the mirror, Cosmos God nodded at Jian Wushuang.","“Lord Cosmos God.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands slightly and told Cosmos God about the information he had obtained recently. At the same time, he admitted that he had fought with Supreme Bing Ye and killed him.","Upon hearing this news, Cosmos God did not appear surprised. Instead, he sighed softly.","“This old man had already guessed that this would be the case. The enmity between you and Supreme Bing Ye has already reached a point where it’s impossible to resolve. I’ve asked the two of you to go to the Void Universe this time because I want you two to stay in the Void Universe and settle the dispute between you two. Otherwise, if you don’t work together when the catastrophe begins and scheme against each other, you’ll cause a great disaster sooner or later.”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang nodded his head. He understood what Cosmos God was thinking.","As the Masters of the Universe, Cosmos Gods was like the ruler of a nation. He paid particular attention to the art of balance, and many things had to be equal.","If it was in the Divine Power Universe, the battle between Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye would inevitably put Cosmos Gods in an awkward position. If he interfered, he would inevitably be biased and would more or less provoke the hatred of the other party. If they did not interfere and completely ignored it, they would also attract criticism.","Rather than that, it would be better to let Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye end their enmity in the Void Universe. The weak would be defeated, and the strong would win. No one could tell the good from the bad.","Cosmos God fell silent for a moment before smiling. but there’s good news at least. We know about Dao Yan’s situation. Although it’s not too good, at least he survived. We might have a chance to save him in the future.","“As for what Elder Ban Shan said to you, I’m also aware that there must be a spy from the Void Universe in our Divine Power Universe. It’s a chess piece that has been set up many years ago.”","“It’s just that this person has been rooted in the depths of our camp for many years, and now is not the time to deal with him.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “Could it be that Lord Cosmos God has already confirmed who this person is in his heart?”","“I can’t confirm it yet, but I’m already a little suspicious of this person. Alright, Jian Wushuang, take care over there.”","The two of them chatted for a while more before Cosmos God hung up the call in a hurry.","One could tell that while Jian Wushuang was gathering information in the Void Universe, Cosmos God was not idle either. He had already started to make arrangements and deal with the matters in the Void Universe.","Not long after he hung up the call with Cosmos God, Jian Wushuang released Supreme Master Gongyang from the Heaven-Suppressing Monument.","The two of them agreed to meet in the Void Forbidden Land and then go their separate ways.","Jian Wushuang returned to the Land of Gods and found the giant bone bird. He turned over and got on the back of the giant bone bird.","The giant bone bird let out a long cry. It flapped its wings and turned into a stream of light, shooting toward the God Refining Sect.","...","A month later.","Whoosh!","The giant bone bird stopped in front of the gate of the God Refining Sect. Jian Wushuang stepped down and walked toward the Sect Master’s hall.","During that month, Jian Wushuang had been hurrying along without stopping. He did not know that the incident in the Land of Gods had caused a huge earthquake in the entire Void Universe!","All the experts who went to the Land of Gods were annihilated. No one was alive!","When the news spread to the various sects of the geniuses, all the top forces in the entire Void Universe were shocked.","In the past, the top sects and forces had sent their experts and elites to the Land of Gods. Although there were casualties, they had never been completely annihilated like this time!","There was more.","The most shocking thing was that the Heaven’s Gate’s Sect Master had calculated the time of death of his sect’s experts. He was shocked to find that the most powerful experts who went to the Land of Gods had died at the same time!","What kind of concept was this?","It meant that there was a terrifying force far beyond these people in the Land of Gods that killed them all in an instant!","This was definitely not the work of a restriction!","All of a sudden, the Land of Gods was in turmoil.","...","The God Refining Sect had also received the same message.","...","“Wu-Wushuang?”","The disciple in charge of guarding the Sect Master’s main hall looked at Jian Wushuang, who was calm and unscathed. His eyes widened with disbelief.","Didn’t they say that all the people who went to the Land of Gods this time had died?","“Is something the matter?” he asked.","Jian Wushuang frowned and was a little confused.","He then said in a deep voice, “I’ll have to trouble you to inform the Sect Master that Wushuang has something to ask.”"]},{"number":4516,"title":"Chapter 4516 Suspicion","paragraphs":["4516 Suspicion","“Ah?”","The disciple who was in charge of guarding the Sect Master’s Palace was stunned for a long time before he came to his senses. He smiled at Jian Wushuang apologetically and then turned around to enter the Sect Master’s Palace.","Not long after, the disciple walked out and reminded in a low voice, “Wushuang, let’s go in. Sect Master is inside, but he doesn’t seem to be in a good mood. If you have any bad news, it’s better to wait for a few days.”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang smiled at him and then strode into the Sect Master’s hall.","The Sect Master’s main hall was dark all year round. Candle stands made of skulls emitted a faint light, adding a bit of gloominess to the originally dark main hall.","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw the God Refining Sect Master sitting on a big white chair. His head was tilted and his hands were clenched into fists. He leaned against his temples and his elbows were on the armrest. He looked tired.","It was obvious that Yan Dan’s death had a certain impact on him.","“Sect Master.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him.","“Yes.” Nodding his head, the God Refining Sect Master took a deep breath and sat up straight.","He was not in a hurry to ask Jian Wushuang what he had found in the Land of Gods. Instead, he said, “Wushuang, do you know that Yan Dan and Elder Shen Lian have already died?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. Fortunately, on the way back, he had already prepared his answers to various questions and unexpected situations. He immediately put on a surprised expression and said, “What? Elder Shen Lian had also fallen? Lord Sect Master, I only know about Yan Dan’s death, but I didn’t expect that Elder Shen Lian would also...”","“Yes, not long after Yan Dan’s death, Elder Shen Lian also died.”","The God Refining Sect Master nodded and squinted his eyes. His face suddenly became stern as he looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Wushuang, according to the news from Elder Shen Lian’s disciple, he said that after Yan Dan left the sect, Elder Shen Lian went to follow you and Yan Dan. I believe you should know how Yan Dan and Elder Shen Lian died, right?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was confused at first, then he pretended to be flustered and asked, “Lord Sect Master, you don’t think that Elder Shen Lian’s death is related to me, do you?”","The God Refining Sect Master did not answer Jian Wushuang’s question directly. Instead, he said, “Wushuang, I think you should give me an explanation. Why did everyone else die in the Land of Gods while you came back safe and sound? I remember that there were many people with cultivation much higher than yours in the Land of Gods. Tell me about the oddness in this.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked like he was in a dilemma. He seemed to be hesitating whether he should say it or not. After a long while, he finally made a decision and said, “Sect Master, I did kill Yan Dan! It’s not my fault, but Yan Dan was bullying me. We had just entered the Land of Gods and he wanted to kill me. In order to save my life, I had no choice but to kill him. As for how Elder Shen Lian died, this disciple truly has no idea.”","“So you were the one who killed Yan Dan.” The God Refining Sect Master’s eyes lit up, and a look of anger flashed across his face.","No matter how bad Yan Dan was, he was still a disciple that he had personally brought up. He had once determined that he would be the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect.","Snorting coldly, the God Refining Sect Master asked again, “Wushuang, let’s not talk about Elder Shen Lian for now. Let me ask you, why did the people from the other sects die? Don’t tell me that they were all killed by the restriction.”","Jian Wushuang had already prepared a countermeasure for this. He lowered his head and replied, “Sect Master, you may not know this, but when we first entered the Land of Gods, the Crimson Whale Gang sent a peerless expert. This person’s cultivation base was at least Five Scar and above. Not only could he ignore the restrictions in the Land of Gods, but he also was unimpeded and even started a massacre inside...”","Jian Wushuang said slowly, pushing all the blame onto Supreme Bing Ye.","Now that Supreme Bing Ye was dead, there was naturally no evidence.","Furthermore, with a little investigation, they would be able to find out that Crimson Whale Gang had recently sent a top-tier expert.","When Crimson Whale Gang went to the Land of Gods, they similarly created a huge commotion. All these could be investigated.","When he heard this, the God Refining Sect Master could not help but frown.","After that, the God Refining Sect Master asked Jian Wushuang how he had managed to escape.","Jian Wushuang also had a countermeasure for this. He took out the severely damaged Tarot divine corpse and explained that he had relied on the Tarot divine corpse to resist for a short amount of time before he escaped.","The God Refining Sect Master sensed the injuries on the corpse of the Supreme Tarot and discovered that the injuries still contained the terrifying divine power ripples left behind by Great Void Divine Emperor’s attack. Instantly, he no longer doubted him.","“You may leave. I need to think about it.”","After a while, the God Refining Sect Master waved his hand tiredly, indicating for Jian Wushuang to leave.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang took his leave respectfully.","The Sect Master’s main hall fell silent once more.","...","In the dark Sect Master’s main hall.","The God Refining Sect Master massaged his brows and looked into the distance. His eyes flashed with a look of deep thought.","He had sensed a strong divine power fluctuation from Jian Wushuang’s divine corpse. The divine power fluctuation was not any weaker than his in the Void Universe. It was at least an Invincible Supreme in the Divine Power Universe.","Then, everything naturally made sense.","Elder Shen Lian had probably died at the hands of the Invincible Supreme in the Divine Power Universe.","“The Divine Power Universe has been infiltrating our Void Universe so frequently recently? I’m afraid that a great war is about to begin. I have to make plans for the God Refining Sect,” he muttered to himself.","Once the war was about to start, he would be invited by Void God to go to the battlefield in the Void Forbidden Land and form an army to attack the Divine Power Universe.","No one could say for sure if he would be able to return.","“Before that, I have to decide on the next Sect Master.”","The God Refining Sect Master’s eyes flickered as he fell into deep thought.","After a long time, he finally sighed.","“Wushuang, huh?”","...","It was already dark when they returned to the limestone mountain.","At the foot of the mountain, Jian Wushuang met the enchanting woman, Jiu Sha.","She looked at the expressionless Jian Wushuang and opened her mouth slightly. She wanted to say something, but in the end, she sighed and lowered her head.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and did not intend to talk to her. He went straight into the seventh Corpse Cave at the top of the mountain.","He opened the magic barrier and sealed the entrance of the Corpse Cave. Then, he released the corpse of Supreme Tarot from the void. There was a flash of regret in his eyes.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed. Divine power gushed out of his hand and poured into the corpse.","Instantly, the body of Supreme Tarot corpse that was like a tattered sack started to recover quickly.","..."]},{"number":4517,"title":"Chapter 4517 Intelligence","paragraphs":["4517 Intelligence","After three months of recuperation.","The Tarot divine corpse of the zenith heaven had finally recovered quite a bit. Although there were still some injuries, they were no longer significant. It would slowly recover with time.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang finally heaved a sigh of relief.","“Keep.”","With a wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang put the divine corpse into the Heaven-Suppressing Monument.","In these three months, the news of the Land of Gods gradually spread. It was no longer limited to the hands of the Sect Masters of the major sects, but spread throughout the entire universe.","In an instant, the entire God Refining Sect was in an uproar.","“Senior Brother Yan Dan is dead?!”","“Not only is Senior Brother Yan Dan dead, but Elder Shen Lian and the rising star Fu Chen are also dead!”","“This time, only Wushuang came back alive from the Land of Gods.”","Countless disciples of the God Refining Sect were discussing in low voices.","After that, the God Refining Sect Master announced the death of Yan Dan and Elder Shen Lian.","Although the God Refining Sect Master did not say how Yan Dan died, countless disciples of the God Refining Sect had guessed that it was Jian Wushuang.","The enmity between Jian Wushuang and Yan Dan was obvious to all, and Yan Dan was a person who would seek revenge for the smallest grievance. These disciples had long been certain that there would be a life-and-death battle between Jian Wushuang and Yan Dan on this trip to the Land of Gods.","Now that Jian Wushuang had returned alive, the outcome of this battle was self-evident.","Yan Dan’s death was not that simple. It involved the most important question that followed.","The abdication of the Sect Master was imminent. Yan Dan was originally the next candidate for the position. If Yan Dan died, who would take over the position of Sect Master?","Instantly, countless people looked at Jian Wushuang.","He possessed exceptional aptitude, and his strength was comparable to Yan Dan. On top of that, he had the support of Elder Mi Feng...","He was almost the best candidate for the next Sect Master!","As a result, many disciples and ordinary elders who had planned to follow Yan Dan and become officials of the Dragon moved closer to Jian Wushuang and expressed their good intentions.","Jian Wushuang’s performance was remarkable. He accepted the good intentions of these people one by one.","The moon was high up in the sky.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the stone bed in the Corpse Cave. After bidding farewell to an Elder of the God Refining Sect, he shook his head in silence.","Originally, he had been undercover in the God Refining Sect to gather information. He did not expect that he would become the number one person in the God Refining Sect.","Fate was really playing with him.","At this moment.","A message from Luo Ming, Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief, who had been silent for a long time, rang in his mind.","“Young Master, our people have found something in the Void Forbidden Land!”","Luo Ming was a little tired, but his voice was more excited.","“Get straight to the point.” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","“Yes!” Luo Ming responded respectfully and quickly replied, “Young Master, according to our investigation, we found a total of 97 void cracks in the Void Forbidden Land. These 97 void cracks are guarded by experts, but the 89th void crack is a little strange. Our people found traces of Void Master Gu Heng, who had disappeared from the Void Universe a long time ago!”","Void Master Gu Heng was a top expert who was famous 50,000 void eras ago. He was a figure who dominated an era, but he disappeared for no reason 30,000 void eras ago, when his pressure on the Void Universe reached its peak. The people of the Void Universe thought that Void Master Gu Heng had died in an accident, but they did not expect him to be hiding in the Void Forbidden Land.","In addition, around the 89th crack in the void, there were many other fluctuations of void power that were not weaker than that of Void Master Gu Heng. The smaller ones were probably from the same era as Void Master Gu Heng, or even longer.","“They’re all hiding around the crack in the void. Something big must have happened!”","“Yes.” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded his head. He was slightly happy in his heart, but his face remained calm. “Give me a detailed map of the area. Place it in your Crimson Whale Gang’s headquarters. I’ll pick a time to retrieve it. Remember to mark the 89th crack in detail!”","“Yes! No problem, Young Master!” Luo Ming quickly patted his chest and promised.","“Hmm, are there any strange signs from the other top forces and sects?” Jian Wushuang asked casually.","“Reporting to the Young Master, we haven’t found anything unusual for the time being.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and ordered, “If you have enough people, can you help me investigate an organization called ‘Devourers’?”","The moment his voice fell, Luo Ming’s expression changed drastically and he said, “Devourers? Young Master, have you offended these lunatics?”","“You know them?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and became interested.","On the other end of the message, Luo Ming’s expression became serious. He held his breath and said, “Young Master, I don’t know much about the Devourers, or rather, I don’t know much about this organization in the entire Void Universe. I only know that they’re mysterious and powerful.”","“They usually would not be exposed to the universe and were in a state of seclusion. No one knew where they were hiding, but once they came out, something big would happen in the universe!”","“Devouring Emperor, the leader of the Devourers, is far more powerful than we can imagine. I remember that the son of a Six Scar Void Master offended devour and was killed. This Six Scar Void Master, who is the master of a Holy Land, went to the Devourers to seek justice for his dead son, but he was killed by the Devourers. The entire sect was involved, including tens of thousands of disciples, including the Scar level Elders. They were all killed overnight and their heads were displayed as a warining to others!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. After a moment of silence, he said, “Alright. You guys don’t need to investigate the Devourers. Keep watching the other top forces.”","“Yes!” Luo Ming heaved a sigh of relief. If Jian Wushuang wanted him to investigate the Devourers, he would not dare to refuse. However, he was sure that he would be killed if he dared to investigate them.","After giving a few more instructions, Jian Wushuang cut off the communication between the two.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and wrote the word ‘Devour’ on the stone bed. He frowned.","The death of Supreme Tarot was related to the Devourers, and the Devourers was the one who had sold the corpse of Supreme Tarot to the God Refining Sect.","Back in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field of the Divine Power Universe, the mysterious black-robed men who called themselves ‘Devour Seven’ and ‘Devour Nine’ were looking for his master, Xuan Yi. These men should be from the ‘Devourers’ group.","What was the purpose of this group of people?","What was the relationship between them and his Master, Xuan Yi?","...","The night passed uneventfully. Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand to brush away the word ‘devour’ and looked outside the Corpse Cave.","A ray of sunlight was already shining in through the hole.","Jian Wushuang stood up and let out a breath of air."]},{"number":4518,"title":"Chapter 4518 Void God Emissary","paragraphs":["4518 Void God Emissary","The days passed by in such a calm and peaceful manner.","For the next few years, Jian Wushuang would only communicate with Elder Ban Shan or Elder Mi Feng from time to time.","In addition, Jian Wushuang was immersed in cultivation and revealed his cultivation to the One Scar level.","This naturally caused a great shock in the God Refining Sect. Some people who were originally wavering were now completely certain that Jian Wushuang would be the next candidate for the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. They leaned toward Jian Wushuang.","The God Refining Sect Master seemed to have the same plan. Occasionally, he would call Jian Wushuang to the Sect Master’s hall to discuss Dao and chat. On one hand, he could take the opportunity to confirm Jian Wushuang’s identity by beating around the bush. On the other hand, he could hint to Jian Wushuang that he was about to leave, and that Jian Wushuang might take over the position of Sect Master.","The Void Universe seemed peaceful, but the Divine Power Uower universe was different.","After a few communications with Cosmos Gods, Jian Wushuang learned that there were more and more probing attacks from the Void Universe to the Divine Power Universe in the Offworld Battlefield. It was highly possible that a great war would break out at any moment.","On this day, outside the God Refining Sect, a strange guest suddenly came.","Within the Sect Master’s hall of the God Refining Sect.","A strong and muscular old man with white hair that reached his waist and a bare upper body, wearing only a pair of black trousers, was slowly turning two silver balls in his hands.","The white-haired, burly old man’s upper body was covered with long, hideous scars. He was playing with the two spinning silver balls in his hands. Every time they collided, a soft thunder-like roar would be heard, and countless electric arcs would burst out.","Just by standing there, he exuded an aura as deep as the abyss and as heavy as five mountains. It was even faintly suppressing the God Refining Sect Master.","“Lord Emissary, are you here because the war is finally about to begin?”","The God Refining Sect Master said in a neither servile nor overbearing manner.","“That’s right.” The white-haired old man nodded and said in a deep voice, “The seal on Lord Void God’s side is about to be lifted. At most, in 60 years, Lord Void God will be able to completely lift the seal. At that time, we will attack the Divine Power Universe.”","“I’m here to ask you to prepare for the God Refining Sect’s funeral. Then, you can follow me into the Void Forbidden Land and wait for Lord Void God’s orders.”","“Is the battle finally coming...” the God Refining Sect Master mumbled to himself as a glint flashed across his eyes.","After taking a deep breath, the God Refining Sect Master cupped his hands and replied, “Your Excellency, I understand.”","“Yes.” The white-haired old man nodded in satisfaction and said, “Ba Huang, I’ll be staying here for a while or two. You should go and make your funeral arrangements.”","“Alright.” The God Refining Sect Master nodded his head and walked out of the main hall. A look of hesitation flashed across his face.","It seemed that it was time to decide who would be the next Sect Master after he left.","After pondering for a while, the God Refining Sect Master’s eyes flashed with determination and he spoke in a deep voice.","His voice was like rolling thunder, directly exploding above the God Refining Sect and into the ears of every disciple.","“The Heavenly Dao has sensed that I will leave the God Refining Sect soon to search for the true essence of the Great Dao!”","“Therefore, I’ve decided that my disciple Wushuang will temporarily take over the position of Sect Master and monitor the movements of the sect. The five Grand Elders will assist him together. If Wushuang has violated the interests of the sect or has failed to lead the sect well, he will be dismissed together!”","“If this Sect Master doesn’t return for a long time, Wushuang will work hard and live up to this Sect Master’s expectations, but will truly take over the throne and become the Sect Master!”","“Disciple Wushuang is to head to the Sect Master’s main hall to receive his title!”","As soon as he finished speaking, it was as if a stone had caused a thousand waves. The entire place fell into a short dead silence, and then it erupted!","“What? Jian Wushuang is going to be the next Sect Master?”","“He... it’s actually so fast?”","“Lord Sect Master is leaving?”","“In the future, won’t we have to obey Wushuang?”","In an instant, countless disciples were dumbfounded and shocked.","Elder Mi Feng, who was in the middle of condensing the immortal’s body, said ‘good’ three times in a row and laughed happily.","“Wushuang, this old man congratulates you!”","In one of the sleeping chambers, Elder Pan Shan, who was cultivating with his legs crossed, slowly walked out. He looked at the heated atmosphere in the God Refining Sect with a strange expression.","“This kid is going to be the Sect Master?” he muttered and shook his head. It was really rare to sneak into an enemy sect and become the head of the enemy sect.","He was looking forward to seeing how far Wushuang would lead the God Refining Sect after he became the Sect Master.","...","The seventh Corpse Caves of the limestone mountain.","Nu Xiong, Hei Chi, Zhengheng, and the other head disciples had complicated expressions.","In the past, Jian Wushuang was just a newbie that they could easily control. However, in just ten years, Wushuang had not only killed Yan Dan and broken through to the Scar level, but he was also about to become the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. He had reached a level that they could not even catch up with.","It really made one sigh.","“I knew this guy wasn’t an underground worm, but a dragon in the sky.”","Nu Xiong, who had fought with Jian Wushuang once, shook his head and sighed.","When he had been defeated by Jian Wushuang in one move, he knew that Jian Wushuang was not an ordinary person. Now, it seemed that his guess was right.","On the slope of the limestone mountain.","The alluring Jiu Sha, who was dressed in red, leaned against the entrance of the corpse cave with a dazed look in her eyes.","The speed of this man’s growth made her feel a little unreal.","The next time they met, it would not be that Junior Brother Wushuang, but the high and mighty Lord Sect Master.","...","All of a sudden, within the God Refining Sect, regardless of whether it was the disciples or the Elders, they all raised their heads and looked up at the sky. Their expressions were filled with wonder.","All in all, when the God Refining Sect Master finished his sentence, the entire God Refining Sect exploded!","On the peak of the limestone mountain.","...","“I’m going to be the Sect Master?” Jian Wushuang touched his nose. Not to mention the others, even he himself was dumbfounded.","He had guessed that the God Refining Sect Master would pass the position to him, but he did not expect it to happen so quickly.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang did not think too much about it. After putting away the divine corpse, he took a step forward and shot toward the Sect Master’s hall.","This time, the disciple in charge of guarding the hall was extremely respectful when he saw Jian Wushuang. He first greeted Jian Wushuang with fear and trepidation, afraid that Jian Wushuang would have a bad impression of him. Then, he hurriedly welcomed Jian Wushuang in.","As he walked into the hall, Jian Wushuang saw the God Refining Sect Master sitting on the main seat and the white-haired, burly old man with a bare upper body who was spinning a thunder ball in his hand.","When Jian Wushuang looked at the man, the white-haired, burly old man also turned his eyes to Jian Wushuang with interest."]},{"number":4519,"title":"Chapter 4519 Dark Yin Palace","paragraphs":["4519 Dark Yin Palace","Buzzzzzz!","The eyes of the white-haired burly old man and Jian Wushuang met in the air. Jian Wushuang felt as if two thunderbolts had shot into his eyes. He could not help but shrink his pupils and take half a step back.","When Jian Wushuang opened his eyes to look at the person again, his face was solemn.","The white-haired, burly old man in front of him was another Six Scar Void Master. In terms of strength, he was probably even more powerful than the God Refining Sect Master!","“Eh?”","The white-haired burly old man was even more surprised. He was a Void Warrior who specialized in thunder techniques and the power of thunder had already penetrated his body. Although he did not use his void power, the pressure and violent aura that came with his gaze was something that even a Three Scar Void Warrior would not be able to withstand.","However, this person only took half a step back?","“Looks like Ba Huang’s new Sect Master replacement isn’t a simple character.”","The white-haired old man shook his head, but he did not think too much about it.","“Wushuang, this is the Lord High Emissary.” The God Refining Sect Master introduced.","“Lord High Emissary.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and nodded at the white-haired burly old man. He then looked at the God Refining Sect Master and said, “Sect Master.”","“Mm, Wushuang. Now that you’re going to take over my position as the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, I’ll be direct with you.”","The God Refining Sect Master nodded slightly. He thought for a moment and said, “Wushuang, the Lord Emissary has come to the God Refining Sect to take me to a place that is extremely dangerous. I don’t know if I can return safely. Our God Refining Sect can not be without a leader. Therefore, I have decided to pass on the position of Sect Master to you. You will temporarily take over the position and supervise the sect. Are you willing?”","“I will do my best to protect the God Refining Sect!” Jian Wushuang stepped forward, cupped his hands, and said in a deep voice.","When the God Refining Sect Master heard this, a look of satisfaction flashed across his eyes. He then said, “Good. Wushuang, I’ve already sent a message to the five great Grand Elders before you arrived, asking them to assist you. These five Grand Elders are the true pillars of our God Refining Sect. Among them, Elder Pan Shan and the others have been in the God Refining Sect for even longer than I have. I believe that with the help of the five of them, you will be able to get through all matters, big or small, safely. Thus, you do not need to worry too much.”","Pausing for a moment, the God Refining Sect Master continued, “In the past, when my God Refining Sect’s Sect Master changes, we would often announce it to the universe and let thousands of dynasties come to congratulate us. This time, I left in a hurry, so I’m afraid I didn’t have time to make it too grand.”","“But my God Refining Sect can’t be so perfunctory and lose face. I’ll send the corpse crows to all the sects we’re on good terms with later to invite them to the banquet and witness your ascension.”","“However, there’s one place that I need you to personally make a trip to show your sincerity.”","“What place? Please speak your mind, Sect Master,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Dark Yin Palace.” The God Refining Sect Master spat out three words.","“Dark Yin Palace?”","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. After all, he had been in the Void Universe for a long time, so he more or less understood the power division in the Void Universe.","The Dark Yin Palace was also a top force in the Void Universe. It was an Immortal orthodoxy, but it did not seem to have a good relationship with the God Refining Sect.","How could he, a person who was about to become the Sect Master, personally deliver the invitation?","As if he had seen through Jian Wushuang’s confusion, the God Refining Sect Master smiled bitterly and said, “Wushuang, you may not know this, but the Dark Yin Palace is actually from the same body as our God Refining Sect. Back then, the divine corpse of our God Refining Sect’s Founding Grandmaster gained intelligence, and he established a sect of his own. That sect is the Dark Yin Palace.”","“Our God Refining Sect focuses on the art of refining corpses, but this Dark Yin Palace cultivates itself as a divine corpse.”","“All these years, our God Refining Sect and the Dark Yin Palace have had many disputes because of our ideals.”","“However, the ancestral teachings of our God Refining Sect states that whenever there is a change in the Sect Master, we must personally visit the other sect and invite them to sign the alliance agreement.”","“It’s the same for the Dark Yin Palace. I’m afraid that when they have a new Palace Master, they will also come to our God Refining Sect.”","After the God Refining Sect Master finished speaking, Jian Wushuang nodded in understanding and replied, “This disciple understands. Then this disciple will set off today.”","To Jian Wushuang, it was just a process. There was no trouble, so it was naturally not a problem.","“Yes, I will arrange for a disciple to accompany you. You can set off tomorrow morning,” the God Refining Sect Master said.","Then, the God Refining Sect Master told Jian Wushuang a few more things that he would be responsible for after he became the Sect Master and let him leave.","The white-haired, burly old man did not say a word from the beginning to the end. Instead, he listened quietly. After Jian Wushuang left, he said to the God Refining Sect Master meaningfully, “Ba Huang, I can see that this person’s emotions are not good, and his tone is neither humble nor arrogant. I’m afraid he’s a meticulous and shrewd person.”","The God Refining Sect Master was stunned. He did not understand what the white-haired old man was trying to say.","As for the white-haired old man, he only shook his head and said nothing more.","...","The next morning.","After Jian Wushuang packed up, he planned to leave the God Refining Sect and head to the Dark Yin Palace.","From a distance, Jian Wushuang saw a tall and graceful woman in red standing at the gate, waiting.","“Jiu Sha?” Jian Wushuang took a step forward and raised his eyebrows.","Could it be that the accompanying disciple that the God Refining Sect Master was talking about was her?","“Wushuang, Wushuang, the Sect Master has sent me to accompany you and take care of you. Moreover, the Sect Master has said that I will become your personal maidservant and will be at your beck and call.”","Jiu Sha lowered her head and did not dare to look at Jian Wushuang.","Ever since that incident in the Sect Master’s main hall that day, the two had stopped contacting each other. In Jiu Sha’s heart, she had an inexplicable fear of this seemingly kind and gentle Junior Brother Wushuang, who was actually cold and arrogant.","Yes, it was fear.","“Oh, then let’s go.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and released the giant bone bird that the master of the God Refining Sect had given him. He took a step forward and landed on the back of the giant bone bird.","He knew why the God Refining Sect Master had sent Jiu Sha with him. It was probably because of the conflict between Jian Wushuang and Yan Dan in the hall that day.","Although this conflict had nothing to do with Jiu Sha, it was still because of Jiu Sha. Therefore, the God Refining Sect Master wanted to ‘compensate’ him in a disguised way.","Jian Wushuang felt helpless about this.","“Oh well, I’ll find a chance to explain it to the God Refining Sect Master when I return.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang saw Jiu Sha get on the giant bone bird and step on it with her right foot.","In an instant, the giant bone bird let out a clear cry. It flapped its wings and instantly turned into a stream of light. It soared into the sky and disappeared from the entrance of the God Refining Sect.","...","logo"]},{"number":4520,"title":"Chapter 4520 The Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace","paragraphs":["4520 The Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace","Whoosh!","The giant bone bird was hundreds of feet wide, and its wings were like clouds hanging from the sky. Every time it flapped, it would tear the void apart and cause a sonic boom.","The strong wind that it stirred up directly turned into several tornadoes as thick as water buckets. It was as if the surrounding area had turned into a raging sea that rolled out.","Jiu Sha was swayed by this intense wind, and her face turned pale.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but frown. He waved his hand and formed a light shield to block the strong wind for Jiu Sha.","“Thank... thank you. Thank you!”","Jiu Sha looked at Jian Wushuang gratefully, then lowered her head and gasped slightly.","“It’s fine.” Jian Wushuang nodded and did not continue the conversation. He sat down cross-legged and started to cultivate.","The strong wind kept blowing Jian Wushuang’s hair. Jiu Sha stood behind Jian Wushuang and looked at his back silently. She wanted to say something several times, but she swallowed it back before she could. After hesitating for a long time, she said softly, “Wushuang, what happened that day... I’m sorry, I didn’t think too much at that time. I was too selfish and didn’t consider your feelings.”","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting in front, had no expression on his face. His eyes were closed the whole time, but he let out a sigh.","He, Jian Wushuang, had always taken revenge for the smallest grievance. ‘If you bullied me by one foot, I’ll return it by a hundred feet.’","However, in the end, he was never a narrow-minded person.","He naturally did not want to vent his anger on a mere girl like Jiu Sha.","There was only one reason why he did not want to bother with Jiu Sha.","After all, he was not from the Void Universe. From the root, it was destined that he would stand on the opposite side of Jiu Sha in the future.","As such, he did not want to get too involved in too much karma, be it with Jiu Sha or Elder Mi Feng, who had treated him well.","After a long while, Jiu Sha heard Jian Wushuang’s calm words.","“It’s fine. I didn’t take what happened that day to heart, so there’s no need for you to fuss over it.”","Upon hearing this, Jiu Sha’s heart trembled and a slight joy appeared on her pale face.","“Alright,” she said.","Her voice was a little higher.","After that, the two of them did not speak again.","A few days later.","They arrived at a dark blue Star Field. In the middle of the Star Field, a mountain gate was like a giant mouth of a monster, suppressing the starry sky.","“Wushuang, we’ve arrived at the Dark Yin Palace,” Jiu Sha said softly.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and stood up.","Before they even reached the Dark Yin Palace, they could already smell a thick corpse Qi. It was much thicker than the God Refining Sect.","“This is the Dark Yin Palace?” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Then let’s go.”","Jian Wushuang stepped lightly and jumped down from the giant bone bird. Then, he put the giant bone bird away.","Jiu Sha followed behind Jian Wushuang respectfully.","When they arrived at the entrance of the Dark Yin Palace, the disciples who were in charge of guarding the gate had sharp eyes and immediately saw Jian Wushuang and Jiu Sha who had jumped off the giant bone bird.","“Are you the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang?”","The disciple of the Dark Yin Palace quickly came up to him and said with a smile.","It seemed like the God Refining Sect Master had already informed them.","“That’s right, it’s me!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Yes, yes. The Palace Master has ordered me to wait here for a long time. Please come this way.”","Immediately, the disciple of the Dark Yin Palace welcomed Jian Wushuang.","Even though the Dark Yin Palace and the God Refining Sect had some differences in their ideals in recent years, the two great sects had the same roots after all. They were close allies and Jian Wushuang was the next Sect Master. To the disciple of the Dark Yin Palace, he was a high and mighty figure. He had no choice but to be respectful.","Walking into the Dark Yin Palace, it was full of vitality. Along the way, he saw many disciples of the Dark Yin Palace, all of whom were emitting a faint glow. It was obvious that they had the power to train their physical body and refined themselves as indestructible divine corpses.","A moment later, under the guidance of this disciple, the three of them quickly arrived in front of a palace on a flying platform.","The disciple of the Dark Yin Palace said, “Your Excellency Wushuang, please wait here for a moment or two. The Palace Master is inside approaching the number one genius of our Void Universe, the current Sky Glory Holy Son of the Sky Glory Holy Land. After the reception is over, the Palace Master will see you.”","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, Jiu Sha, who was standing behind him, frowned.","By right, Jian Wushuang was the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. In terms of status, he should at least be on the same level as the Palace Master of the Dark Yin Palace.","Who would make Jian Wushuang wait outside the door?","However, seeing that Jian Wushuang did not speak, she naturally would not cross the line.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I’ll have to trouble you to go in and inform the Palace Master to hurry up.”","The disciple of the Dark Yin Palace agreed with a smile.","...","In the main hall.","Two people were sitting cross-legged across a tea table.","The person on the left was a young man with a handsome face and a handsome appearance. He was dressed in a white robe that was more blood-red than blood. Anyone who looked at him could not help but praise, “The people in this world are like jade, and the Young Master is unparalleled in this world. In the Void Universe with all kinds of strange appearances, he was simply a clear stream.”","The person on the right was wrapped in white gauze, only revealing a single eye on his right. His entire body was lifeless, but his aura was extremely powerful.","“Palace Master, the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang, has arrived.”","The Dark Yin Palace disciple who had gone to pick up Jian Wushuang quickly walked to the one-eyed man and whispered in his ear.","...","“Oh? He’s quite fast. Let him wait outside and grind his temper.” the one-eyed man raised an eyebrow and said indifferently.","“This disciple understands!”","The disciple quickly took his leave and closed the door.","“Dark Yin Palace Master, is the Sext Mect master of the God Refining Sect here?” the young man sitting opposite the Palace Master asked with a smile.","“That’s right, he’s just a little kid who still reeks of his mother’s milk, there’s no need to pay too much attention to him.”","Dark Yin Palace Master nodded, then rolled up his sleeves and poured a cup of spirit tea for the young man in front of her. He smiled and said, “Come, nephew Sky Glory, let’s continue our conversation. I remember the last time I saw you, you had just broken through to the Scar level not long ago. Now that we’ve met again, you’ve already reached the Three Scar level. Such talent really makes me feel inferior. You’re truly worthy of your reputation as the number one prodigy of the Void Universe...”","...","Time slowly passed.","Outside the hall, Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back, his face expressionless.","On the other hand, Jiu Sha’s face was filled with dissatisfaction as she said in a low voice, “Wushuang, this Dark Yin Palace Master’s attitude is so disdainful. I’m afraid he wants to use this opportunity to show you his strength. Should we cut the Gordian knot and turn from passive to active, and enter directly?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied indifferently, “If this person doesn’t display basic manners, he’s the one losing face. It’ll only make him seem petty. We can’t be rude.”","...","“I understand.” Jiu Sha nodded, not fully understanding.","After another two hours, the disciple of the Dark Yin Palace who was responsible for receiving Jian Wushuang ran over quickly and said with a smile, “Your Excellency, sorry for the long wait. Please come in.”"]},{"number":4521,"title":"Chapter 4521 The Sky Glory Holy Son","paragraphs":["4521 The Sky Glory Holy Son","Creak.","The door to the main hall of the Dark Yin Palace was pushed open from the inside. A handsome young man dressed in snow-white clothes walked out of the main hall with two respectful servants in tow.","He first looked at Jian Wushuang and shook his head contemptuously. Then, his eyes inadvertently fell on Jiu Sha, who was behind Jian Wushuang. His eyes suddenly lit up and there was a flash of surprise.","He narrowed his eyes as if he had an idea. However, he did not say anything and walked past Jiu Sha and Jian Wushuang.","“Take care, Sky Glory Holy Son.”","The disciple respectfully sent the young man off. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang, extended his hand, and invited him in. He said with a smile, “Sir Wushuang, let’s go. The Palace Master is waiting for you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and walked in. Just as Jiu Sha was about to follow him, the disciple of the Dark Yin Palace stepped forward and stopped her. He said, “Young Lady, please stop. My Palace Master only allowed Sir Wushuang to enter and didn’t mention you.”","When Jiu Sha heard this, she could not help but frown.","She did not want to stop there. She did not know why, but the way the Sky Glory Holy Son looked at her just now made her feel uneasy. She had seen that look on Yan Dan’s face before.","“It’s fine. Jiu Sha, just wait for me here. With me here, no one can hurt you.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Jiu Sha and said indifferently. Then, he stepped into the hall.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Jiu Sha felt relieved and did not say anything.","Creak.","The wooden door of the hall closed again.","Jian Wushuang walked in with his head held high and his chest out.","The room was rather dark, and a stooped old man wrapped in gray-white bandages with only his right eye exposed was sitting cross-legged in front of a tea table.","This person was the Palace Master of the Dark Yin Palace.","“Wushuang, right? Come, sit.”","He stretched out his hand to the opposite side of the coffee table, indicating for Jian Wushuang to sit down.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and sat opposite the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace.","“Wushuang, Ba Huang has already informed me of the general situation. He says that you will be the next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect.”","The Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace said calmly. He poured a cup of tea for Jian Wushuang and continued, “I believe Ba Huang has told you about the situation between the God Refining Sect and the Dark Yin Palace. Although we have some grudges recently, it is not to the point of not seeing each other for the rest of our lives. After all, we are of the same origin and have the same ancestral teachings. We were once the closest people.”","“Therefore, when the banquet begins, I will personally go to your God Refining Sect to witness your ascension ceremony.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang did not say much. He reached out his hand and took a sip of the tea.","The two of them chatted for a while before the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace waved his hand and said tiredly, “Alright, Wushuang. This Palace Master knows that you’re about to ascend the throne and that you’re busy with official matters. I won’t keep you any longer. When I arrive at your God Refining Sect, I’ll have a detailed meeting with you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang knew that the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace was going to drive him away. “Palace Master, please rest well. I’ll take my leave first.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang put down his teacup, stood up, and walked out of the door.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s back, the Palace Master of the Dark Yin Palace snorted and shook his head in disdain.","He pushed open the wooden door and walked out of the dark room. He frowned.","Jiu Sha had disappeared.","“Lord Wushuang, your maid has been invited to the Divine Wine Pavilion by the Sky Glory Holy Son.”","The disciple of the Dark Yin Palace who was standing guard outside quickly came over and said.","“The Sky Glory Holy Son? They went to the Divine Wine Pavilion?”","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown again.","He believed that he knew a little about what kind of person Jiu Sha was. She was also the personal maidservant that the God Refining Sect Master had personally instructed him to do. It was impossible for her to suddenly follow someone else.","He had heard of the Sky Glory Holy Son before. He was publicly acknowledged as the number one genius in the Void Universe. He had not even cultivated for a void era, but he had already become a Three Scar Void Master. His background was also from the Sky Glory Holy Land, one of the most powerful orthodoxies in the Void Universe. He could be said to be favored by the heavens and earth and blessed by great fortune.","In terms of status in the Void Universe, he was not inferior to Jian Wushuang in the Divine Power Universe. In fact, he might even be better.","“Bring me there,” Jian Wushuang frowned and said.","“Yes.” The disciple saw the coldness in Jian Wushuang’s eyes and could not help but raise his eyebrows. He quickly led Jian Wushuang to the Divine Wine Pavilion.","To him, the Sky Glory Holy Son was a dragon-like figure in the sky, and Jian Wushuang was also a behemoth that he could not afford to provoke.","However, along the way, he could not help but hint to Jian Wushuang.","“It’s probably because the Sky Glory Holy Son has taken a fancy to your maidservant. You should quickly do him a favor and hand your maidservant over to the Sky Glory Holy Son. It’ll also form a good relationship with the Sky Glory Holy Son.”","Although the disciple of the Dark Yin Palace did not make his words very clear, that was what he meant.","He did not notice that Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows were getting colder and colder.","...","After a while, the disciple led him to the Divine Wine Pavilion.","The Divine Wine Pavilion was a place of entertainment built by the Dark Yin Palace. It contained all kinds of top-notch divine wine in the Void Universe. Usually, when the disciples of the Dark Yin Palace were not cultivating, they would invite a few friends to the Divine Wine Pavilion to relax.","Cultivation was important, but so are mortal desires and pleasure.","After entering the Divine Wine Pavilion, the disciple brought Jian Wushuang to a private room on the second floor.","Jian Wushuang gently knocked on the door of the private room and stepped in.","There were three people sitting at a table.","They were the Sky Glory Holy Son, Jiu Sha, the head disciple of the Dark Yin Palace, Yin Shan, and the two old slaves standing behind the Sky Glory Holy Son with their heads lowered.","Seeing Jian Wushuang come in, Jiu Sha’s eyes flashed with a look of pleading for help, while the Sky Glory Holy son’s mouth slowly opened into a smile.","“Are you the new Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang?” the Sky Glory Holy Son said with a faint smile.","...","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent. “That’s me.”","The Sky Glory Holy Son smiled brightly and extended his hand. “Come, come, come. Sit, Wushuang, let’s have a few cups together.”","After Wushuang sat down, the head disciple of Dark Yin Palace beside the Sky Glory Holy Son, Yin Shan, was in charge of pouring him a cup of wine.","The Sky Glory Holy Son raised his wine cup and raised it to Jian Wushuang. He squinted his eyes and smiled, “Wushuang, this is your maidservant, Jiu Sha, right? You wouldn’t mind if I asked her to drink a few cups of wine, would you?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and did not reply.","Jian Wushuang’s disregard made the Sky Glory Holy Son’s hand, which was raising his cup, freeze.","However, he did not get angry. Instead, he continued, “Come, everyone, let’s have a toast.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yin Shan, who was in charge of accompanying him, quickly drank it in one gulp. Jiu Sha looked at Jian Wushuang and was about to speak, but Jian Wushuang gave her a look to calm down.","Then, Jian Wushuang also drank the cup of wine.","Jian Wushuang put down the wine cup and looked at the Sky Glory Holy Son, the number one genius in the universe.","He wanted to see what tricks this person was up to.","..."]},{"number":4522,"title":"Chapter 4522 Kneel Down!","paragraphs":["4522 Kneel Down!","In the Divine Wine Pavilion’s Sky Room No. 1.","Everyone raised their cups and drank together. Under the seemingly harmonious scene, a trace of coldness could not be concealed.","“That’s more like it.”","The Sky Glory Holy Son looked at Jian Wushuang and Jiu Sha. They both drank the wine in their cups and smiled.","“The mortals in the world all say that we are Immortals, but forget ‘Immortal’, were are still human, after all. I have an open personality all my life, uninhibited and wanton. I like the rivers, mountains, beauties, and wine in cups. This time, I’ll make it clear that no one is allowed to use void energy to cleanse the alcohol, and we must drink it the natural way. You must accompany me to get drunk for 3,600 rounds. How about it?”","As soon as he said this, the head disciple of the Dark Yin Palace, Yin Shan, who was in charge of accompanying them, quickly added, “The Holy Son is right! This time, Lord Holy Son has finally come to our Dark Yin Palace, we will definitely drink to our hearts content with you.”","“Good, good, good. You’re quite smart, Kid.”","The Sky Glory Holy Son stretched out his hand and patted Yin Shan’s head with a smile, as if he was petting a little dog wagging its tail. Then, he raised his wine cup to Jiu Sha and said, “Come, Lady Jiu Sha, have another cup with me.”","Upon hearing this, a hint of hesitation flashed across Jiu Sha’s already red face.","This divine wine was made from the Hundred Brew Fragrant Fruit and was specially made for Scar-level Void Warriors to drink. She was only a Star-level Void Warrior and had long been unable to hold her liquor.","Jiu Sha wanted to refuse, but when she saw the Sky Glory Holy Son’s cold eyes, she was shaken.","She had already figured out the identity of the young man in front of her.","The current Holy Son of the Sky Glory Holy Land, the Sky Glory Holy Son!","He was the number one genius in the universe!","The Sky Glory Holy Land was one of the strongest Immortal orthodoxies in the Void Universe. There was more than one Six Scar Void Master in the Holy Land. Although the God Refining Sect was also one of the top forces, it was still far inferior to the Sky Glory Holy Land.","This was not the most important thing. The most important thing was that the God Refining Sect Master was about to step down and Jian Wushuang would be the new Sect Master.","If she offended the Sky Glory Holy Son, it would be equivalent to offending the Sky Glory Holy Land.","At that time, not to mention how the Sky Glory Holy Land would suppress the God Refining Sect, even the God Refining Sect, with Jian Wushuang as the Sect Master, would be unable to do anything if they spread the word in the universe.","Gulp!","Thinking of this, Jiu Sha gritted her teeth, raised her glass, and drank it in one go.","Suddenly, a flame seemed to burn in her body. Jiu Sha felt her blood boiling and her head spinning. She felt extremely uncomfortable.","“That’s the way.”","The Sky Glory Holy Son smiled in satisfaction and raised his glass again.","“I didn’t expect Miss Jiu Sha’s alcohol tolerance to be so good despite her low cultivation. Come, give me some face and have another cup.”","Seeing this, Jiu Sha finally could not help it. Her expression changed slightly, but she still forced a smile on her pretty face and said in a nice voice, “Lord Holy Son, I really can’t drink anymore.”","“You can’t drink it?”","Hearing this, the Sky Glory Holy son’s eyes slowly narrowed. The smile on his face disappeared, and his voice became cold. “Lady Jiu Sha, it seems like you’re not giving me any face?”","Upon hearing this, the smile on Jiu Sha’s face froze.","“Lord Holy Son, that’s not what I meant...”","She was about to explain when the Sky Glory Holy Son interrupted her and continued, “Miss Jiu Sha, even if you don’t think for yourself, you should think for the sect behind you and for your Sect Master Wushuang, right?”","Upon hearing this, Jiu Sha’s body trembled.","This undisguised threat was already obvious.","Jiu Sha looked at the expressionless and silent Jian Wushuang and could not help but laugh bitterly in his heart.","From the beginning to the end, whether it was in the God Refining Sect or outside, she was just a chess piece in the hands of the big shots.","“I’ll drink.” Stretching out her trembling hand, Jiu Sha picked up the glass and was about to drink it.","Seeing this, the Sky Glory Holy Son’s face once again had a warm smile as he nodded in satisfaction. Beside him, Yin Shan also had an evil smile on his face.","He knew very well what the Sky Glory Holy Son wanted to do.","Pa.","At this moment.","Jiu Sha was holding a wine glass and was about to drink it when her right hand was grabbed by a large hand. A strong force came from this large hand, and she was unable to move.","Jiu Sha raised her head in a daze and only saw Jian Wushuang’s angular face, which was cold and indifferent.","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang said in a cold and deep voice.","“Your face?”","“I can fight ten trash like you with one hand. Do you think you’re worthy of talking about face in front of me?”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked.","Yin Shan’s face was filled with shock.","He did not expect that Wushuang from the God Refining Sect would be so presumptuous!","Did he know who the Sky Glory Holy Son sitting in front of him was?","“How audacious!” Yin Shan slammed the table and wanted to teach this ignorant thing a lesson on behalf of the Sky Glory Holy Son. He wanted to take credit and show off.","However, before he could do anything, Jian Wushuang’s divine light grew and he looked at him.","Whoosh!","In an instant, Yin Shan felt a great horror of life and death coming at him. Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes were like two divine swords that could split the sky and earth and tear the endless sky apart. He felt like he was pierced and killed thousands of times.","Thud.","...","Yin Shan fell to the ground on his butt. A chill ran from his back to his head, making him feel like he had fallen into an ice cellar.","When he looked again, his entire back was already drenched in a cold sweat.","The smile on the Sky Glory Holy Son’s face froze, and his face slowly darkened.","“Wushuang, even your Sect Master doesn’t dare to speak to me like this. Are you seeking death?”","“Kneel down and apologize. Give your maidservant to me, and I’ll take your words as frivolous and drunken words. I won’t take it to heart.”","After saying that, the Sky Glory Holy Son stood up and looked down at Jian Wushuang.","However, just as he got up, his body was still not straight.","“I kneel?”","Jian Wushuang sneered and activated his Chaos Overlord Body. He suddenly stretched out his right hand and smacked the Sky Glory Holy Son’s head.","“You kneel!!!”","Rumble!!!","...","Endless power burst out from Jian Wushuang’s palm.","The Sky Glory Holy Son felt as if a million mountains were pressing down on him. He knelt on the ground, and his knees left a web of cracks on the ground.","As far as Jian Wushuang was concerned, as long as he was not an Invincible Supreme, no one could defeat him!","The Sky Glory Holy Son was only at the Three Scar level. He was even inferior to Luo Ming, the Chief of the Crimson Whale Gang. How would he dare to be impudent in front of him?","“Young Master!!”","“Lord Holy Son!!”","The two old slaves guarding the door of the private room were furious. Just as they were about to charge at Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “Tarot!”","Crack!","A crack appeared in the void behind Jian Wushuang. The divine corpse of Tarot, who was covered in a large black robe, took a step forward and stretched out his hands to attack the two old slaves."]},{"number":4523,"title":"Chapter 4523 Single-Handedly Defeating the Saint","paragraphs":["4523 Single-Handedly Defeating the Saint","Boom!","The divine corpse of Tarot punched out with two fists. Instantly, endless power burst forth. Dao patterns circulated in his hands, turning into violent and surging Sword Qi that smashed into the chests of the two old slaves.","These two servants of the Sky Glory Holy Son had only just entered the Scar level. How could they be the opponents of the Tarot divine corpse?","This was Supreme Tarot! Even if the current Supreme Tarot corpse was only at the Piramy Supreme stage, how could they be able to contend against it?","Pfft!","In an instant, it was as if the two old slaves had been hit by two Cosmic Warships. Their bodies immediately crashed through the door of the Divine Wine Pavilion and flew out.","Whoosh.","Two black dots flickered in the sky. The two old slaves were punched by Tarot divine corpse, and they were sent flying so violently that they not only left the Dark Yin Palace, they even flew out of the entire Dark Yin Star Field!","“This!”","Instantly, the head disciple of Dark Yin, Yin Shan, who had been paralyzed with fear and was sitting on the ground, could not help but be dumbfounded as he watched this scene. His entire body trembled.","What did he see?","The Sky Glory Holy Son’s head was pressed down by Wushuang’s palm, and he was forced to kneel!","The two old servants of the Sky Glory Holy Son were sent flying out of the Dark Yin Star Field by Wushuang’s divine corpse!","This was too violent!","Then, the head disciple of Dark Yin shivered.","Something big happened!","Something big was about to happen!","“Wushuang, you’re looking for death!” The Sky Glory Holy Son’s handsome face was twisted to the extreme. He roared and activated all the void power in his body.","Suddenly, the Sky Glory Holy Son’s void power was like a high-speed Whirlpool, spinning with a loud bang. Waves of power that could destroy stars burst out from his body like a tide, rolling and surging, trying to push away Jian Wushuang’s right hand that was pressing on his head.","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows when he felt the impact force.","As the number one heavenly pride of the Void Universe, the Sky Glory Holy Son was indeed quite capable. In terms of power, the force of the collision was not weaker than that of a Four Scar Void Warrior.","If Jian Wushuang had not broken through to the Intermediate Supreme level, he might have been in a predicament as well.","“But it’s a pity that the current you is far from enough.”","Jian Wushuang snorted and the veins on his right hand bulged. He grabbed the Sky Glory Holy Son’s head and threw him out of the Divine Wine Pavilion, smashing his body through the window.","Seeing this scene, Jiu Sha could not help but feel a little worried. “Wushuang, this person is the Sky Glory Holy Land’s Holy Son after all. We won’t bring you any trouble by doing this, right?”","“It’s fine.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and took a step forward. He appeared outside the Divine Wine Pavilion and looked down at the Sky Glory Holy Son, who had been thrown to the ground.","The commotion between the two immediately attracted the attention of all the Dark Yin Palace disciples inside and outside the Divine Wine Pavilion.","“What? The Sky Glory Holy Son was actually thrown out?”","“Who is so bold? You dare to attack the Sky Glory Holy Son?”","For a moment, everyone was shocked.","Then, they saw Jian Wushuang step out of the Divine Wine Pavilion. He was walking in the void with an expressionless face.","“It’s him?”","“The new Sect Master of the God Refining Sect?”","“Didn’t this person just break through to the Scar level not long ago? How did he manage to throw the Sky Glory Holy Son out?”","“Who knows? It’s probably a sneak attack. After all, the Sky Glory Holy Son is the number one Heaven’s Favorite expert in our universe. He’s invincible in the same realm. No matter what, Wushuang shouldn’t be the Sky Glory Holy son’s opponent.”","Everyone started whispering to each other.","“Wushuang, you lowly worm! You deserve to die!!!”","In the Divine Wine Pavilion, the Sky Glory Holy Son’s expression was twisted.","The surging killing intent almost materialized and circulated in his eyes.","He was born with pride. Whether it was his extraordinary family background or his own invincible luck, or his unprecedented talent, all of them made him develop a high and mighty attitude, and he never respected anyone.","When had he ever suffered such humiliation?","Wave after wave of hatred washed through his body. In a short moment, the Sky Glory Holy Son’s eyes turned red and he wanted to tear Jian Wushuang into pieces!","With a low growl, the Sky Glory Holy Son’s body glowed brightly and he charged toward Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang looked indifferent and said, “I’ve already said that all I need is one hand to deal with you!”","The next moment!","With his left hand behind his back, Jian Wushuang formed a fist with his right hand and punched the Sky Glory Holy Son!","This punch could shatter stars and destroy the sun, and overturn mountains and rivers!","Countless rays of golden light emitted from Jian Wushuang’s right fist. It was as if he was pushing a rolling sun or a golden carriage that was driving out of the sun and crashing toward the Sky Glory Holy Son!","Crash!","The sound of a mirror shattering could be heard in the air as ripples spread out.","“Quickly retreat!”","Instantly, the many disciples of the Dark Yin Palace who were watching the show retreated and flew into the universe.","Boom!!!","...","This punch finally landed on the Sky Glory Holy Son’s body.","In an instant!","The Sky Glory Holy Son was sent flying at a speed faster than when he had charged forward. The entire ground started to shake.","However, very quickly, a dark yellow barrier of light faintly appeared in the sky above the palace. It released a restrictive power that suppressed the shockwaves of the battle as much as possible.","Otherwise, Jian Wushuang’s punch alone would have been enough to blow up the sun. The aftershock that spread out would have been enough to cause the entire Dark Yin Palace to collapse.","“Ah!”","“Wushuang, you should be killed!”","The Sky Glory Holy Son crawled up from the ground. His handsome face was twisted with madness, and his eyes were bloodshot.","He charged at Jian Wushuang again.","“You’re so stubborn.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. He took a step forward and instantly appeared in front of the Sky Glory Saint Son as if he had teleported. His right fist struck out like a mad dragon, turning the surrounding area into a raging sea of tornadoes.","...","Bang!","The Dao patterns on Jian Wushuang’s right fist circulated and gave off a trembling sound. Like a giant axe that split the sky and earth, he smashed the Sky Glory Holy Son’s head.","“You’re the Sky Glory Holy Son, right? Today, I’ll teach you how to behave.”","...","In the Palace Master’s main hall of the Dark Yin Palace.","The eyelids of the cross-legged Dark Yin Palace Master twitched.","“Eh? What’s happening?”","He slowly opened his eyes and looked up.","Thud, thud, thud, thud!","At this moment, a disciple of the Dark Yin Palace ran in with a panicked expression.","“Palace Master! It’s bad! The next Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang, is fighting with the Sky Glory Holy Son outside the Divine Wine Pavilion!”","“What?” Dark Yin Palace Master’s eyes narrowed slightly. Then, divine light flashed in his eyes. His gaze pierced through the netherworld void and saw the scene of Jian Wushuang beating the Sky Glory Holy Son.","“Bastard!”","Instantly, the Palace Master’s face turned ashen. With a slight movement of his shoulder, he disappeared from the main hall."]},{"number":4524,"title":"Chapter 4524 Dark Yin Palace Master Takes Action","paragraphs":["4524 Dark Yin Palace Master Takes Action","Outside the Divine Wine Pavilion.","Smoke and dust filled the air.","The power that was enough to destroy the galaxy and shatter the stars was like a violent beast. It roared, but before it could spread out, it was blocked by the formation of the Dark Yin Palace.","“Wushuang, Wushuang, the sins of the heavens can be forgiven, but the sins of man can not be lived. You’re courting death.”","The Sky Glory Holy Son stood up from the ground, trembling. His hair was disheveled, and his nose and eyes were bleeding. He no longer looked like the confident and handsome Holy Son from before. Instead, he looked like a vicious man who had been forced into a dead end.","However, he was in a sorry state. A vast, terrifying, and indescribable power began to gather on his body.","Wisps of thick red light began to gather in his chest. The aura that seeped out directly annihilated the surrounding starry sky and turned it into chaos.","When the surrounding disciples of the Dark Yin Palace saw this, they felt a chill in their hearts.","“Not good! It’s a Void Explosion!”","“The Sky Glory Holy Son has already lost his mind. He’s going to fight to the death!”","“Stop? With what? Hurry up and report to the Palace Master! Only the Palace Master can solve this problem!”","For a moment, the spectators outside the Divine Wine Pavilion were in a panic.","“Void Explosion?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","He had been in the Void Universe for some time. In his opinion, the Void Universe was almost the same as the Divine Power Universe. The only thing worth mentioning was the accompanying divine power that every Void Warrior in the Void Universe had, Void Explosion.","The Void Explosion could instantly erupt over a hundred times the power of one’s entire body. It was the greatest killing move of the Void Warriors of the Void Universe!","“I’m sorry, I have can do it too.”","Crack.","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang raised his arm, spread his fingers, and pointed in the direction of the Sky Glory Holy Son.","In his palm, the Qi started to spin like a gyroscope. The speed of the spin was getting faster and faster!","Boom!","In the end, a small black whirlpool that looked like a black hole appeared in Jian Wushuang’s palm.","The divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body started to boil. Then, it gathered toward his palm in a frenzy and gradually formed a terrifying black ball the size of a fist!","“A black Void Explosion?”","“There’s actually a black-colored Void Explosion?!”","“Void Explosion is divided into seven grades. The lowest grade is white, the second grade is gold, and the third grade is purple... What grade is black? How come I’ve never heard of it before?”","“I don’t know! However, the power compressed within this black Void Explosion was truly terrifying! He was even stronger than the Sky Glory Holy Son! The Sky Glory Holy Son is a ninth-grade Void Explosion!”","The disciples of the Dark Yin Palace were dumbfounded when they saw this.","“Black?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","Back when Jian Wushuang had swallowed the Void Power Crystal Core that Elder Ban Shan had given him, he had awakened the Void Explosion. However, this was the first time he had used it after such a long time.","As for its power, Jian Wushuang was still looking forward to it.","“Go to hell!” At this moment, the Sky Glory Holy Son erupted first!","The red ball in his chest shot toward Jian Wushuang like a cannonball!","In an instant, the Qi dispersed and the earth cracked. The light shield above the Dark Yin Palace, which was like an upside-down bowl, suddenly rumbled.","Crack, crack, crack.","Like a broken mirror, the palace-protecting formation, which blocked all the shockwaves, let out an unpleasant sound of breaking.","Wisps of Qi energy seeped out from the light shield, causing the entire Dark Yin Palace to shake violently.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to release the Void Explosion–","“Stop!”","A voice came from a hundred miles away. Then, a hunched figure covered in bandages took a step forward, which seemed to cause ripples in the void. He stood between Jian Wushuang and the Sky Glory Holy Son.","Bang! Bang!","One of the bandages burst open, revealing a shriveled, greenish-gray palm.","The Palace Master reached out with his right hand and caught the Sky Glory Holy Son’s destructive ball with his bare hands.","Whizzzz!","The Sky Glory Holy son’s illusionary round ball fell into the Dark Yin Palace Master’s palm like a marble. It spun rapidly and sent out countless sparks.","However, the palm of the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace seemed to be made of molten iron from the Nine Heavens. No matter how much power the void ball exploded, it could not hurt him at all. In the end, the speed of its rotation gradually slowed down, and it was crushed by the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace.","The aura of a Six Scar Void Master emanated from the Palace Master’s body.","In the face of this aura, both the Sky Glory Holy Son and Jian Wushuang were as small as ants.","Six Scar, or rather, an Invincible Supreme, was far too different from other levels of Void Masters. They were not on the same level at all!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he withdrew the power of the Void Explosion in his palm.","“Dark Yin Palace Master, you’re going to stop me for this brat?!”","However, the Sky Glory Holy Son did not give up. He turned his eyes and stared at the Dark Yin Palace Master.","...","“Ah.”","The Palace Master of the Dark Yin Palace sighed. He was a mighty lord of a region in the universe and a Six Scar Void Master, so he naturally did not need to care too much about the Sky Glory Holy Son.","However, the Sky Glory Holy Son did not just represent himself. He also represented the behemoth that was the Sky Glory Holy Land!","The Sky Glory Holy Land was one of the most powerful Immortal orthodoxies in the Void Universe. Its historical background was almost the best in the entire Void Universe. Even if the God Refining Sect and the Dark Yin Palace combined, they probably would not be a match for the Sky Glory Holy Land.","On the other hand, the Sky Glory Holy Son had amazing potential. In the future, he would definitely be on equal footing with him or even stronger.","If not for the fact that he had no other choice, he really would not have stepped out to get involved in this mess.","However, if he did not come out, the entire Dark Yin Palace would probably be destroyed.","“Holy Son, give me some face and let this matter go, how about it?” the Palace Master said to the Sky Glory Holy Son.","The Sky Glory Holy Son did not say anything. Instead, his face darkened.","Although he was arrogant, he was not a brainless fool.","He was indeed very talented, and he had the support of the Sky Glory Holy Land. Even though the Dark Yin Palace Master was polite to him, the Sky Glory Holy Son knew that he did not have the ability or qualifications to be impudent in front of a Six Scar Void Master!","...","After the Palace Master finished speaking, he looked at Jian Wushuang and his face turned ashen. “Wushuang, is this how that Ba Huang fellow taught you to do things? I think you want to drag the God Refining Sect into a land of eternal damnation!”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and just shrugged his shoulders.","“Wushuang, Ba Huang hasn’t left yet. He can still protect you. However, once he leaves, you’ll be in charge of the God Refining Sect. If you do this, you’ll bring disaster to the God Refining Sect sooner or later!”","Dark Yin Palace Master looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and said.","This sentence came from his heart."]},{"number":4525,"title":"Chapter 4525 I Am the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect","paragraphs":["4525 I Am the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect","Even though the Dark Yin Palace and the God Refining Sect had been on bad terms in recent years, they were still of the same origin and were an existence that was connected by their origins.","He hoped to suppress Jian Wushuang to achieve his goal of suppressing the God Refining Sect in the future, but it did not mean that he really wanted Jian Wushuang to cause a disaster.","“I’m only returning the favor,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Stubborn and unrepentant,” the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace grunted and did not say anything else.","In the end, Jian Wushuang was about to become the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. In terms of status, he was on equal footing with him.","To put it bluntly, he, the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace, was not qualified to teach Jian Wushuang a lesson. This was because it was equivalent to slapping the face of the entire God Refining Sect.","The scene fell into silence.","The Sky Glory Holy Son’s gaze was cold as he looked at Jian Wushuang and then at the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace. Finally, he took a deep breath and said coldly, “Wushuang, this time, for the sake of Dark Yin Palace Master’s face, this Holy Son will not argue with you. But don’t be happy too soon. This Holy Son will remember today’s matter. In the future, this Holy Son will make you regret it!”","The Sky Glory Holy Son snorted and took a step forward. He turned into a beam of light and shot into the sky, disappearing from the Dark Yin Palace.","After the Sky Glory Holy Son left, many disciples of the Dark Yin Palace looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","In the battle between Jian Wushuang and the Sky Glory Holy Son, although neither of them had used their full strength, they had watched Jian Wushuang beat the Sky Glory Holy Son with one hand.","This Wushuang’s realm must be lower than the Sky Glory Holy Son’s, right?","From this, didn’t it mean that Wushuang’s talent was even more terrifying than the Sky Glory Holy Son’s?","Dark Yin Palace Master also turned to look at Jian Wushuang, but his expression was not too good.","“Wushuang, you should leave. Our Dark Yin Palace does not welcome you. Once your Ascension ceremony begins, I will be there,” the Palace Master of Dark Yin Palace said coldly.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and did not say much.","The divine corpse of Tarot, who was standing behind Jian Wushuang, took a step forward and stepped on Jian Wushuang’s back. Then, his entire body disappeared, as if he had become Jian Wushuang’s shadow.","Then, with a wave of his sleeve, Jian Wushuang left the Dark Yin Palace with Jiu Sha.","After flying into the universe, Jian Wushuang released the giant bone bird and it flew toward the Divine Life Palace.","The two of them did not notice that not long after they flew out...","A white-robed figure walked out from behind a planet.","“Wushuang, right? No one who I want to kill has ever survived!”","...","On the back of the giant bone bird.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back, his face expressionless.","Jiu Sha stood behind him with a look of shame on her face.","In her opinion, it was because of her that Jian Wushuang had such a disaster.","“Wushuang, I’m sorry. I’ve caused you trouble again...”","Jiu Sha lowered her head and clutched the corners of her clothes tightly.","She was prepared to be scolded by Jian Wushuang.","After all, that was the Sky Glory Holy Son. Behind her was the Sky Glory Holy Land, one of the most powerful forces in the universe.","“It has nothing to do with you.”","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jiu Sha could not help but be stunned.","She opened her mouth and wanted to say something, but Jian Wushuang had already sat down cross-legged and closed his eyes.","Time flew by.","A few months later, Jian Wushuang returned to the God Refining Sect.","From a distance, Jian Wushuang could see the God Refining Sect’s decorations. It was a festive scene. However, there was a sense of solemnity hidden in this festive atmosphere. It seemed that the God Refining Sect had been preparing for the Ascension Ceremony all this time.","After entering the God Refining Sect, Jian Wushuang went to the Sect Master’s hall first and told him what had happened in the Dark Yin Palace.","After hearing that, the God Refining Sect Master’s eyes widened and he said, “You beat up the Sky Glory Holy Son?”","After getting Jian Wushuang’s confirmation, the God Refining Sect Master could not help but sigh.","The Sky Glory Holy Land was an existence that even he felt pressured about.","He had not expected that Jian Wushuang would attract such a disaster before he became the Sect Master.","If he left, what would the future of the God Refining Sect be like?","For a moment, the God Refining Sect Master could not help but regret it. Was it the right decision to hand the God Refining Sect over to Wushuang?","However, now that the Ascension Ceremony was almost ready and the news had been released, if they changed the person at the last minute or asked Wushuang to apologize, wouldn’t the God Refining Sect become a joke?","“Wushuang, what should I say about you? She’s just a maid, so why bother...”","The God Refining Sect Master shook his head and sighed, “Forget it. The Sky Glory Holy Land’s patriarch happens to be at the place where I’m going. I’ll go talk to him.”","...","Dozens of days later.","All the major powers in the universe sent their emissaries to the God Refining Sect to congratulate them.","Some of the weaker sects even had their Sect Masters come personally. They were afraid that the God Refining Sect would feel that they were being disrespectful.","The God Refining Sect Master called for Jian Wushuang to follow him and entertain the guests. He explained to him the close relationships between the God Refining Sect and the various sects.","In this complicated communication, Jian Wushuang’s Ascension Ceremony finally began.","...","As one of the top forces in the Void Universe, the God Refining Sect had a good reputation. Basically, all the sects in the universe, big and small, had sent gifts, including the Sky Glory Holy Land and the other orthodoxies that were as famous as the Sky Glory Holy Land.","Everyone came and congratulated the new king.","During the coronation ceremony, the emissaries from the various major forces gathered in the God Refining Sect’s square. It was a dense crowd.","After the Void Master Ba Huang gave a speech, he handed Jian Wushuang a token that represented the position of the God Refining Sect Master.","From then on, the old king retired and a new king rose.","“From today onwards, Wushuang will be the seventh Sect Master of the God Refining Sect!”","On the high platform, the Void Master Ba HHuang said in a deep voice. His voice was like rolling thunder that resounded in everyone’s ears.","Then, he strode away.","Jian Wushuang walked out of the light and stood in front of the crowd.","Immediately, countless people raised their heads and fixed their eyes on the expressionless Jian Wushuang.","“He’s Wushuang? He’s so young!”","...","“I heard that this person joined the God Refining Sect and became the new Sect Master not long after. What a genius!”","“He’s become a Sect Master and an Overlord at such a young age. He has a bright future ahead of him!”","“This is how a man should be!”","Countless people exclaimed in admiration.","Someone else said, “Don’t you know? Wushuang had started fighting with the Sky Glory Holy Son in the Dark Yin Palace. Although the situation of this battle had been sealed by the Dark Yin Palace and no one knew how the battle was going, Wushuang had definitely offended the Sky Glory Holy Son! I really don’t know what the future will be like.”","“The Sky Glory Holy Son has always been vengeful. I’m afraid that after Eight Desolations is gone, the God Refining Sect will suffer.”","A series of discussions sounded.","Jian Wushuang stood on the high platform expressionlessly. He looked around and said in a deep voice, “From today on, I, Wushuang, will be the Seventh Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. From now on, I will protect the God Refining Sect and ensure its prosperity for all eternity! It will prosper for a long time!”","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone in the God Refining Sect, regardless of whether they were new disciples or grand elders, knelt down.","“We welcome the Seventh Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang!”"]},{"number":4526,"title":"Chapter 4526 The Catastrophe Is About to Rise","paragraphs":["4526 The Catastrophe Is About to Rise","“We welcome the God Refining Sect Master, Wushuang!”","“Welcome, God Refining Sect Master Wushuang!!”","In an instant, the entire God Refining Sect square was in an uproar. Tens of thousands of God Refining Sect disciples knelt on the ground and shouted in unison.","The sound of their greetings to Jian Wushuang turned into rolling sound waves that rose to the sky and resounded throughout the entire God Refining Sect.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang had changed into a Sect Master’s robe. The golden thread at the corner of the robe reflected a bright light under the scorching sun.","He had a delicate face and cold eyes, but he exuded a profound calmness that made people feel dignified without being angry.","His eyes, in particular, were so sharp that no one dared to look him in the eye.","“Get up.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he raised his right hand.","All of a sudden, all the disciples stood up.","...","The Ascension Ceremony of the God Refining Sect gradually came to an end.","After Jian Wushuang greeted all the forces that came to congratulate him, he personally sent them off. Among them, Dark Yin Palace Master’s expression was not too good. Before Jian Wushuang could send him off, he snorted coldly and left the God Refining Sect.","After that, it was the arrangements made by the Void Master Ba Huang before he left.","In the Sect Master’s hall, there were only Jian Wushuang and Void Master Ba Huang.","“This should be the last time I’ll be sitting on this seat.”","Void Master Ba Huang sat on the throne that only the Sect Master could sit on. He placed his hands on the black and gold armrests and rubbed the fine patterns on the armrests with his thumb. He was slightly emotional.","Jian Wushuang stood beside him and lowered his head in silence.","“Wushuang, I haven’t interacted with you for a long time, but the impression you give me is that you’re a meticulous and shrewd person. This is a good thing, but it’s also a bad thing.”","“I can vaguely feel that you seem to be hiding something in your heart. However, I can’t guess or figure it out. I’m not someone who will get to the bottom of things. I only hope that, no matter what, you have already taken over my position and become the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. In that case, it is best that you put the interests of the sect first and your personal interests second. Don’t do anything that will bring the God Refining Sect into the abyss.”","“To be honest, Yan Dan is not as good as you in terms of magnanimity, talent, and comprehension. But if he doesn’t die, I will still pass the position of Sect Master to him...”","Ba Huang said slowly. This was the first time he had been so honest with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was silent, but he sighed in his heart.","Ever since he had joined the God Refining Sect, both the Sect Master and Elder Mi Feng had left him with a good impression.","It was a pity that they were destined to stand on opposite sides in the future and meet with swords.","At that time, Jian Wushuang would stand against Void Master Ba Huang and the others in the Offworld Battlefield. What would it be like?","Void Master Ba Huang did not expect an answer from Jian Wushuang. Instead, he continued, “Wushuang, the place I’m going to this time is my mission. It’s extremely dangerous, and it’s very likely that I won’t be able to return. Therefore, please help me look after the God Refining Sect.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","...","The next day.","Early in the morning, Void Master Ba Huang and the white-haired, burly old man left the God Refining Sect.","At the gate of the God Refining Sect, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes as he watched Void Master Ba Huang and the white-haired burly old man leave.","In the end, Void Master Ba Huang had not told him about the Void Forbidden Land. At the same time, Jian Wushuang believed that the God Refining Sect’s foundation was not so simple.","“I’ll still have to rely on myself to slowly explore,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","At this moment.","An excited voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Young Master, we’ve discovered a new situation!”","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and did not reply immediately. Instead, his eyes lit up and he walked back to the Sect Master’s hall.","“Sect Master!”","“We pay our respects to Lord Sect Master!”","The two disciples in charge of guarding the mountain gate quickly knelt down and respectfully said.","“Yes, guard the mountain gate.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, then took a step forward and soared into the sky.","The land under Jian Wushuang’s feet shrank.","In just a few seconds, Jian Wushuang landed in the Sect Master’s hall.","In the hall, some servants who were in charge of serving the Sect Master were cleaning the hall. When they saw Jian Wushuang enter, they immediately knelt down.","“All of you can leave,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Yes!” The servants all left.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to close the heavy door of the Sect Master’s hall. Then, he turned around and entered the sleeping Palace that only the Sect Master could enter.","There were many books in the bedroom, all of which were about the secrets of the God Refining Sect and all kinds of secret techniques of refining corpses.","In the middle, there was a Yin Yang Eight Trigrams Formation, and countless void power and corpse Qi gushed out from the center of the formation.","Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged and started to absorb the void power.","With the Void Power Crystal, Jian Wushuang’s body had an additional conversion machine that could convert all the divine power he absorbed into void power!","...","The eight trigrams formation under Jian Wushuang not only controlled the sect-protecting formation of the God Refining Sect, but it could also absorb all the corpse Qi and void power in the sect!","In other words, as Jian Wushuang sat on the formation eye of the eight trigrams formation, all the void power and corpse Qi of the entire God Refining Sect would be poured into him!","What kind of terrifying number was this?","However, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to activate the formation. Instead, he sent a message to the Chief of the Crimson Whale Gang, Luo Ming.","“Tell me in detail,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Yes!” Luo Ming’s voice was filled with excitement. “Young Master, our Crimson Whale Gang is responsible for keeping an eye on the sect members of the various top factions. In the past few days, the Sect Masters of those top factions or the ancient Elders who have been in deep sleep have all awoken. They are all rushing toward the Void Forbidden Land!”","“In the Void Forbidden Land, we also found that Void Master Gu Heng and the others were all in seclusion.”","“Something big is definitely going to happen!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","From the looks of it, the second great catastrophe was about to begin?","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “I see. Have you prepared the map and markings of the Void Forbidden Land I asked you to prepare last time?”","...","“Young Master, the map was completed the day before yesterday!” Luo Ming nodded hard.","“Alright, send some people from the sect to the God Refining Sect. Remember, this person must be a direct descendant of yours, the one I planted the restriction on that day!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied.","“I understand. I’ll make the arrangements immediately,” Luo Ming quickly replied.","“Okay, go and make the arrangements. If anything happens, contact me immediately.”","After giving this order, Jian Wushuang cut off the communication."]},{"number":4527,"title":"Chapter 4527 Upgrade","paragraphs":["4527 Upgrade","Within the Sect Master’s Palace.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the Eight Trigrams Yin Yang Formation, his eyes flickering.","“It seems that the second Great Catastrophe is about to begin. I have to increase my power one more time before it begins.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and muttered to himself.","Although Jian Wushuang had never experienced the terror of the Great Catastrophe War, he had heard about it from Cosmos Gods and the others.","The tragedy of this Great Catastrophe simply could not be described with words.","In the Great Catastrophe, Supreme martial artists were like ants. They could die with a flip of their hands. Only Top Supreme realm martial artists could barely protect themselves.","That was the stage for the Invincible Supremes!","Only an Invincible Supreme would be able to slaughter his way through the Great Catastrophe without fear.","However, even an Invincible Supreme was in danger of dying.","At the very least, in the last Great Catastrophe, the number of Invincible Supremes who had died in the Divine Power Universe could be counted with two hands.","Jian Wushuang’s current strength was, at most, the strongest fighting power below an Invincible Supreme. He was still far from being a true Invincible Supreme.","“Formation, activate!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and activated the Eight Trigrams Formation.","Suddenly, the patterns on the Eight Trigrams Formation gushed with white light. Then, the formation began to rotate. A vast and surging void power gushed madly into Jian Wushuang’s body with the rotation.","The pure and vast void power almost caused Jian Wushuang to explode in an instant!","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang was a super Perfect Life Form with an amazing capacity and Chaos Overlord Body, so he avoided the situation of exploding from the void power.","“Swallow!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed and he immediately devoured the vast void power like a giant beast with its mouth wide open.","Boom, boom, boom!","Jian Wushuang’s entire body let out a muffled thunder-like roar.","Then, after this vast and turbulent void power was refined, it was transformed into pure divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s aura started to rise.","...","The Sect Master’s main hall was completely silent.","Without Jian Wushuang’s order, no one dared to step in.","Three months later.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a ray of light flashed across his eyes.","“Three months of cultivation, the increase in divine power is more than three thousand years of cultivation!” Jian Wushuang lowered his head and muttered to himself.","In the past three months, Jian Wushuang had absorbed and refined almost all the void power of the God Refining Sect.","In the past three months, not only had he completely stabilized his Intermediate Supreme realm, but he was also only one step away from reaching the peak of the Intermediate Supreme realm!","What kind of terrifying speed was this?","If he had not received a message from Luo Ming of the Crimson Whale Sect, informing him that the Crimson Whale Sect disciple in charge of sending the map of the Void Forbidden Land had arrived at the God Refining Sect, Jian Wushuang would at least have continued his cultivation and shot all the way to the peak of an Intermediate Supreme realm!","“Tarot!” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","A black-robed figure suddenly walked out from the shadow behind Jian Wushuang.","Then, Jian Wushuang ordered the corpse to sit at the position of the Eight Trigrams Formation.","Waves of corpse Qi were poured into the corpse. The injuries that the corpse had suffered from Great Void Divine Emperor’s attack, which could normally only recover gradually with time, instantly recovered.","Not only that, but the aura of the corpse of the Supreme Tarot also started to become stronger, and it was gradually moving toward the Intermediate Supreme realm.","“The next step is to raise the Tarot divine corpse to the Intermediate Supreme realm.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes, pushed open the door of the master’s bedroom, and strode out.","“Sect Master!”","The two disciples who were guarding the door were in a daze. When they saw Jian Wushuang walk out, they could not help but shiver and quickly half-knelt to salute.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly at them in response. Then, he stepped out and disappeared at the door of the Sect Master’s hall.","“Hey, did you notice that Wushuang is becoming more and more like a Sect Master? He gives off an unfathomable feeling that no one would dare to offend her.”","After Jian Wushuang left, a disciple who was in charge of guarding the door whispered.","“What do you mean you’re becoming more and more like a Sect Master? Wushuang is the Sect Master, alright? But you’re right, you don’t know how cold I felt when the Sect Master looked at me just now, as if I had no secrets in front of him.”","The other disciple glared at the disciple who had just spoken, and then whispered.","“Ah, we’ve been guarding this Sect Master for 30 million years, and we’re just gatekeepers. Wushuang has only been here for a short time, and he’s already become the Sect Master. The difference between people is really too great.”","The disciple who spoke earlier sighed.","...","Outside the gate of the God Refining Sect.","A man with a protruding mouth and ape-like cheeks was anxiously pacing back and forth in front of the God Refining Sect’s main gate, scratching his ears and cheeks.","“Ah, didn’t I say that I came to find Young Master Wushuang? Quickly let me in!”","This person was naturally the one Luo Ming had sent to deliver the map of the Void Forbidden Land.","...","However, from the looks of it, this person seemed to have encountered some trouble.","“Shut up! Wushuang is the Lord Sect Master of our God Refining Sect. How can you call him by his name? How could he have become the Young Master of someone like you?”","The two young disciples who were responsible for guarding the mountain gate immediately frowned and scolded.","“Hurry up and leave! You have a pointed mouth and monkey cheeks, and small eyes. You’re sneaky and don’t look like a good person. If you don’t leave, don’t blame us for killing you!” another disciple said in disdain.","When the Crimson Whale Gang disciple heard this, he laughed in anger.","“Damn it, I’m not a good person just because I’m a little ugly?”","His eyes flickered with fury. This ugly-looking Crimson Whale Gang disciple snorted coldly, thinking to himself, ‘If this wasn’t our Young Master’s property, I would have killed you two little kids today!’","Taking a deep breath, the Crimson Whale Gang member suppressed his anger and smiled apologetically. “The two of you, please make an exception and go to the Young Master... No, I’m going to report to your Sect Master.”","“Aiya, why are you so stubborn? It seems like you really want to be killed by us?”","The two God Refining Sect disciples raised their eyebrows and rolled up their sleeves, ready to explode.","“Alright, the two of you may leave.”","...","At this moment, a calm voice sounded behind them.","The two disciples turned their heads and looked behind them. When they saw who it was, their expressions changed and they knelt down in fear.","“Disciple Luo He and Disciple Shi Lang greet Lord Sect Master!”","“I, Feng San, pay my respects to the Young Master!”"]},{"number":4528,"title":"Chapter 4528 The Map of the Void Forbidden Land","paragraphs":["4528 The Map of the Void Forbidden Land","“All of you, rise.”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand to the three of them.","Instantly, the two disciples in charge of guarding the door and Crimson Whale Gang Disciple, Feng San, stood up respectfully.","“The two of you, continue to guard the mountain gate. You, follow me.”","!!","Jian Wushuang gave a few instructions and immediately led Crimson Whale Gang’s disciple, Feng San, toward the Sect Master’s hall.","“Alright,” Feng San responded with a smile and immediately glared at the two disciples who were in charge of guarding the gate triumphantly. Then, he followed Jian Wushuang and flew toward the Sect Master’s hall.","Looking at the backs of Jian Wushuang and Feng San, the two disciples who were guarding the gate couldn’t help but look at each other.","“That guy just now really knows the Sect Master.”","“From the looks of it, Sect Master seems to have other forces outside.”","...","After returning to the Sect Master’s hall, Jian Wushuang dismissed the servants who were in charge of cleaning again. He then turned around and sat on the main seat, saying, “Feng San, give me the map of the Void Forbidden Land.”","“Alright,” he said.","Feng San first responded with a flattering smile. Then he fumbled around and took out a jade cylinder from his sleeve and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","“Young Master, the markings and maps here were all written and drawn by me personally. There are basically no errors. Please take a look.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and spread the jade cylinder open. His eyes suddenly lit up.","The map of the Void Forbidden Land was extremely detailed. A total of 99 void cracks were clearly marked. In addition, the guards of each void crack and the ups and downs of each mountain range were all accurately depicted.","It could be said that there was nothing more detailed than this map about the Void Forbidden Land.","The 87 void cracks on the ground were marked with a red tick, with the word ‘unknown’ written on it.","Jian Wushuang could understand that Feng San had failed to enter the 87th void crack. Naturally, he would not force Feng San to do so.","Jian Wushuang continued to read and found a long list of names and detailed remarks.","The first one was the Illusionary Divine Gu Heng whom Luo Ming had told him about previously.","The ancient Void Master had made his name 30,000 void eras ago. When he had disappeared from the universe. his cultivation base had been at the six marks, and he was skilled in using techniques...","The Nine-Finger Emperor had made his name fifty thousand void eras ago. His cultivation base had been at the Six Scar when he had disappeared from the universe, and he was skilled in using techniques...","...","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed as he looked at Feng San.","Feng San hurriedly replied, “Young Master, these are the auras of a few Void Masters that the Crimson Whale Gang discovered in the crack in the void. We’ve identified them after that. Although it’s not perfect, it should be the number of Void Masters stationed in the Void Forbidden Land.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak.","However, a tsunami was set off in his heart, and he could not help but reveal a look of joy.","This name list was too important!","He could use this list and the recent movements of the top forces to speculate the battle power of the Void Universe in this Great Catastrophe, so that the Divine Power Universe could make preparations as soon as possible.","Pa.","After closing the bamboo tube, Jian Wushuang looked at Feng San with admiration in his eyes and said, “You’re not bad.”","Hearing this, Feng San was immediately delighted. He immediately smiled and said, “This is what I should do. As long as Young Master is satisfied, it’s fine.”","After that, the two of them exchanged a few more words before Jian Wushuang sent Feng San away and let him continue to watch the Forbidden Void Land.","After Feng San left, Jian Wushuang sat on the throne alone, his eyes flickering.","Now that the Great Catastrophe was about to begin, he had to make a trip back to the Divine Power Universe personally and pass the news to Cosmos God so that the Divine Power Universe could make preparations.","However, if he wanted to go back, there were two problems that were more difficult to solve.","First of all, he had just ascended the throne not long ago, and there must be many eyes watching him. If he left now and did not show up for a long time, it was inevitable that he would be speculated about and suspected by people with ulterior motives.","Secondly, Jian Wushuang had no idea how to return to the Divine Power Universe.","“According to this bamboo map, when I left the Divine Power Universe and entered the Void Universe, the void crack that appeared was the 23rd one. That’s why I didn’t meet the true experts of the Forbidden Void Land at the beginning. They’re all gathered at the 87th void crack.”","From this, it could be deduced that besides the 87th void crack, which could return to the Void Universe, the 23rd void crack could also do the same.","“However, all of this is just my prediction. If there’s a slight mistake, it’ll be a disaster.”","Jian Wushuang massaged the space between his eyebrows and pondered.","“Whether this prediction is correct or not, I can only find out after I go to the Void Forbidden Land.”","“Other than that, there is the first question. How do I leave the God Refining Sect without being suspected?”","Jian Wushuang gradually frowned as he pondered.","A moment later, his eyes lit up as if he had thought of something.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang stood up and walked toward the Sect Master’s bedroom.","There were countless secret skills and books in the chamber.","Jian Wushuang then took out a book and started to read it. After a while, he put the secret skill back on the shelf and walked toward the divine corpse of Tarot.","Pfft!","Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged on the back of the corpse and pressed his palms on the back of the corpse.","Boom!","...","Suddenly, countless void power gushed out of Jian Wushuang’s hands and poured into the body of Tarot divine corpse.","Suddenly, a strange scene happened.","The appearance of the Tarot divine corpse changed rapidly. His tall and burly figure became a little thinner, and his stiff and numb face gained some color and vigor.","His facial features changed slightly and he looked like Jian Wushuang.","In a short moment, two Jian Wushuangs appeared in the Sect Master’s bedroom.","Not only did they look exactly the same, but even their auras were the same.","Even those who were closest to Jian Wushuang would not be able to tell which one was the real Jian Wushuang.","The divine corpse of Supreme Tarot stood up as if he had come to life. With a smile on his face, he bowed to Jian Wushuang and said, “Master.”","Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction.","The secret manual he was reading just now was the incarnation technique that the God Refining Sect had cultivated.","He injected his consciousness and aura into the divine corpse, which had a heart blood connection with him, making it like an avatar.","...","In the past, in the God Refining Sect, there were many disciples who were about to die and use this secret technique to cause themselves to be reborn.","This secret skill was much more overbearing than ordinary secret skills that could create an incarnation. For example, Jian Wushuang could now give a simple command and make it move freely. He could also instantly shift all of his consciousness to the corpse of Supreme Tarot, making it his second life."]},{"number":4529,"title":"Chapter 4529 Void God Descends, a World of Great Struggle!","paragraphs":["4529 Void God Descends, a World of Great Struggle!","Within the Sect Master’s Palace.","There were two identical Jian Wushuang, one standing and the other sitting, with the same aura. It was extremely strange.","“You stay here and help me look after the God Refining Sect.”","Jian Wushuang stood up, looked at the divine corpse of Tarot, and said indifferently.","!!","“Alright, Master can leave now. I’ll stay here and look after the God Refining Sect,” Jian Wushuang, who was transformed from Tarot divine corpse, replied with a smile.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and then left the bedroom in big strides.","That night, Jian Wushuang went to where Elder Ban Shan was and asked him to look after the God Refining Sect.","When Elder Ban Shan heard that Jian Wushuang was about to return to the Divine Power Universe, he was stunned and his murky eyes dimmed.","If not for the fact that they had no choice, who would be willing to wander around and leave their home?","“Jian Wushuang, you go. I will take care of the God Refining Sect.”","After taking a deep breath, Elder Ban Shan suppressed the throbbing in his heart and spoke in a deep voice.","“Then I’ll have to trouble you, Elder Ban Shan.”","Jian Wushuang looked deeply at Elder Ban Shan and nodded.","Then, Jian Wushuang walked out of Elder Ban Shan’s bedroom.","When he reached the door, Jian Wushuang stopped and said softly without turning back, “Just bear with it for a little longer. Once the Great Catastrophe War is over, it will be time for us to truly return to the universe.”","“Alright.” A smile appeared on Elder Ban Shan’s face.","After Jian Wushuang left, Elder Ban Shan raised his head and looked at the boundless void through the ceiling.","“I... I’m looking forward to that day.”","...","At the entrance of the God Refining Sect.","The two disciples of the God Refining Sect were still in charge of guarding the gate.","“Ah, so boring. It’ll take another hundred years for the next shift.”","The disciple on the left complained.","“Hahaha, if you have any complaints, you can talk to Lord Sect Master,” the disciple on the right replied with a smile.","The two of them joked around and didn’t feel that bored anymore.","Whoosh!","At this moment, the two of them suddenly felt their vision turn black, as if a black shadow had passed by them.","A slight gust of wind blew at the corners of their clothes.","“Eh? What happened just now?”","The disciple on the left rubbed his eyes and looked around in confusion, but he did not see anything.","“It’s probably because of the wind,” the disciple on the right replied with a shrug.","After that, the two of them completely forgot about what had just happened and continued to joke around.","At the same time, in the Star Field outside the God Refining Sect.","A figure in a loose black robe and a hood that covered half of his face, only revealing his chin, turned back to look at the God Refining Sect, then strode away.","His initial speed was not fast, but it got faster and faster. In the end, he was like a thunderbolt, tearing the vast sky apart and shooting toward the Void Forbidden Land.","...","At the same time.","In the Void Forbidden Land, outside the 87th crack.","A solemn ceremony was being held in a rainforest.","Countless white bones were piled together, forming a tall platform. Each white bone was carved with mysterious patterns, emitting a monstrous evil Qi.","On the high platform, a white-haired brawny old man with a bare upper body held three long incense sticks in his hand and kept sticking them into the gaps between the white bones.","Under this high platform, more than ten men and women in black robes with solemn expressions stood respectfully.","If an expert from the Void Universe saw these black-robed people at this time, he would definitely be extremely shocked and his expression would be aghast!","This was because these black-robed men had all once reached the peak of the Void Universe. They had looked down on all living beings and ruled over all beings!","Each of them had a glorious past, and each of them had once dominated an era. However, in the end, they all silently disappeared in the long river of time.","He did not expect that they would actually be gathered together at this moment.","Wisps of invisible Qi exuded from their bodies and gushed toward the high platform.","On the high platform, the white-haired burly old man put on a bronze mask on his face after he inserted the black incense in his hand. He held a black wooden staff in his hand and began to dance.","Rumble...","The sky seemed to be pulled by something and began to spin rapidly.","The smoke from the burning incense shot straight into the sky.","“Great Lord Void God, I’m your citizen. Tuhe...”","“Can you feel our summoning?”","“Wake up, your people need your protection...”","...","The white-haired old man looked at the sky as he chanted. At first, his voice was still weak, but each sentence was higher than the last. In the end, his voice exploded like thunder!","“Awaken!!!”","Boom!!!","A huge explosion was heard in the sky!","At this moment, the sky cracked open!","An extremely terrifying aura, along with billowing black smoke, spread down from the crack in the sky, as if a demon had arrived!","The terror of this aura was far beyond what an Invincible Supreme could compare to. It was enough to make the world tremble, and even the almighty had to bow down to it!","“Lord Void God!”","In an instant, the white-haired old man’s eyes gushed with extreme joy and excitement as he knelt down.","Below the high platform, the dozen or so top experts who had once ruled over the world were also overjoyed and knelt down toward the sky.","“Lord Void God!”","...","Demonic fog filled the sky, and an extremely ancient and deep voice came from the torn Sky.","“Once I awaken, I will defeat all my enemies in the world!”","“Cosmos God, wait for me!”","...","At the same time.","At another entrance of the Void Forbidden Land.","A black-robed figure was moving quickly.","Suddenly.","“What’s the situation?!”","Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks. A vast, ancient, and extremely terrifying aura came from the other side of the sky, which almost made him kneel down!","He only felt a little bit of this aura, but all his hair stood on end. A great horror of life and death surged in his heart!","“That’s the 87th crack. What happened there?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the 87th crack in horror.","However, the other side was covered by the black demonic fog. Even though Jian Wushuang used his divine power to look at it, he could not see through it.","“I have to hurry up. I’m afraid that the Great Catastrophe War will come faster than I thought!”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth. His speed, which was already extremely fast, soared again. His whole body was like a flash of flowing light, and he instantly crashed into the Void Forbidden Land.","Supreme Gongyang, who had communicated with him earlier, was already waiting at the 23rd crack.","Seeing Jian Wushuang flying over, Supreme Gongyang’s expression turned ugly. He took a step forward and said, “Jian Wushuang, did you feel the terrifying aura just now?”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a serious expression and said, “Let’s go. We’ll return to the Divine Power Universe first and report this matter to Cosmos God.”"]},{"number":4530,"title":"Chapter 4530 The Return","paragraphs":["4530 The Return","At the 87th crack.","The summoning of the priest continued, and waves of pressure spread out in an overwhelming manner.","Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang had already stepped into the 23rd crack.","Whoosh!!","!!","The crack in the void twisted and swallowed Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang. Then, the two of them disappeared.","The familiar feeling of dizziness hit them again. When Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang opened their eyes again, they were already in the starry sky.","It was the same starry sky, but the aura in the universe was different.","Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang looked at each other, and their hearts stirred.","Sure enough, other than the 87th crack, the 23rd crack could also allow him to go back and forth between the Divine Power Universe and the Void Power Universe.","The two of them were about to walk toward Cosmos God camp.","A loud shout suddenly exploded!","“Intruder, go to hell!!!”","Rumble!","A white dragon with six claws was riding on the clouds and rushing over at high speed!","In his mouth, there was a huge fireball, as if he had the sun in his mouth.","“Stop!” Supreme Gongyang’s expression changed. He suddenly recalled that the two of them had just come out of the crack in the void. They must have been mistaken as people from the Void Universe.","However, before he could explain, the fireball had already come crashing toward them at high speed. It created a broken passage in the void and headed straight for Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang.","Just the pressure and scorching temperature of this fireball was far beyond what Supreme Gongyang could withstand.","Just as Supreme Gongyang’s face was filled with despair, Jian Wushuang, who was standing beside him, took a step forward and grabbed the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword at his waist.","Sword draw!","Buzzzzzz!","A shocking bolt of lightning, like a river of stars, directly split the huge fireball into two.","The flames spread out, turning Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang’s faces red.","Clang.","After putting away the Tarot Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the six-clawed white dragon in the huge dragon’s eye. He said calmly, “Long Qing, I haven’t seen you for so long. I didn’t expect you to still be so reckless and stupid.”","Crack.","The six-clawed white dragon that was tens of thousands of feet long flashed with white light and turned into a young man with two horns on his head. He was wearing a white robe with golden edges.","“Jian Wushuang?” Long Qing squinted his eyes and snorted.","Jian Wushuang’s long ears returned to their original state and he transformed his void power into divine power. He returned to his human appearance.","“This guy didn’t die in the Void Universe.”","“Moreover, this guy seems to have become stronger again!”","Long Qing’s eyes were filled with surprise.","This time, other than Cosmos Gods who knew the details of Jian Wushuang’s trip to the Void Universe, the rest, even the two disciples of Cosmos Gods, were not clear about the details of Jian Wushuang and the others in the Void Universe or what they had done.","Therefore, Long Qing thought that Jian Wushuang had died in the Void Universe.","Whoosh, whoosh!","After that, several more figures arrived. When they saw that it was Jian Wushuang, they were stunned and their eyes were filled with disbelief.","“It’s Jian Wushuang?!”","“Jian Wushuang has returned from the Void Universe?”","“Jian Wushuang is the first person to return from the Void Universe, right?”","Everyone was shocked.","Jian Wushuang frowned and ignored them. He said indifferently, “Please make way.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Gongyang turned into two streams of flowing light and instantly streaked across the sky, heading toward the base camp where Cosmos Gods were.","This time, the reason why Jian Wushuang did not choose to send a message to Cosmos God but instead came back personally was that it was a matter of great importance. For example, the map of the Void Forbidden Land and the deployment of the fighting forces, as well as the information that Elder Ban Shan had spent tens of thousands of chaos cycles gathering. Jian Wushuang would only be at ease if he personally handed it over to Cosmos God.","After a few hours.","They had arrived at the base camp.","After not seeing each other for hundreds of years, there was not much difference in the main camp. The only difference was that it had become more solemn. The people in charge of patrolling the main camp all had serious expressions. It seemed that they had also guessed that a great war was about to break out.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and the cultivator in charge of guarding the base camp was about to stop him. When he saw who it was, he suddenly asked in surprise, “You are the Vice-Captain, Jian Wushuang? You’ve returned from the Void Universe?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the man and saw that he was wearing the robe of Team 7. He was a member of Team 7 and had once fought side by side with Jian Wushuang during the 5,000 years of war.","“It’s me,” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Bring me to Lord Cosmos God.”","The member of Team 7 saw Jian Wushuang’s serious expression and understood that the situation was urgent. He quickly led Jian Wushuang to Cosmos God’s hall.","Along the way, many people looked at Jian Wushuang. At first, they were surprised, then they were shocked.","Jian Wushuang is back!","“He’s back from the Void Universe!”","Jian Wushuang ignored the discussions and stepped into the hall.","...","In the great hall of Cosmos God, an aged-looking Cosmos God was draped in a large cloak and was flipping through books. Lan Lan and Lan Su stood on both sides and lit up the lamps for him.","Hearing the sound of footsteps, Cosmos God raised his head and saw Jian Wushuang enter. He did not look surprised. Instead, he smiled and nodded, “You’re here.”","Waving his hand, he motioned for Lan Su and Lan Lan to leave.","“Yes.” Lan Su and Lan Lan replied. When they passed by, they looked at Jian Wushuang with surprise.","After the two of them left, only Cosmos God and Jian Wushuang were left in the hall.","“Lord Cosmos God.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at Cosmos God.","“There’s no need for formalities between us.” Cosmos God put down the book in his hand and patted the seat beside him, indicating for Jian Wushuang to sit beside him.","“You’ve worked hard during this period of time.”","Cosmos God looked at the corners of Jian Wushuang’s eyes and sighed softly. For some reason, he felt a little heartache.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting beside Cosmos God, laughed when he heard that.","With this one sentence from Cosmos God, everything was worth it.","...","Only the heavens knew that while Jian Wushuang looked calm and peaceful in the God Refining Sect, he was in fact very tense every day. He did not dare to relax for fear of being exposed.","The amount of effort it took was simply uncountable.","“Lord Cosmos God, take a look at these two items first.”","Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and flipped his right hand. The map of the Void Forbidden Land, the list of fighting forces, and the bamboo tube that Ban Shan had given him all appeared in his hands.","“Good!”","Cosmos God did not waste any words. He understood in his heart that a great battle was about to begin and that this was not the time to reminisce about the past.","He first opened Ban Shan’s bamboo tube and looked at it carefully.","In the great hall of Cosmos God, the candlelight flickered. Cosmos God looked over slowly and his brows started to furrow."]},{"number":4531,"title":"Chapter 4531 Fengtian Flag","paragraphs":["4531 Fengtian Flag","Within the Great Hall of Cosmos God, it was completely silent.","Cosmos God lowered his head and read through the information that Ban Shan had spent tens of thousands of void eras to gather. His brows furrowed even more, and his expression turned ugly.","Jian Wushuang sat aside in silence.","There was no need for him to say anything. He knew that there was definitely some bad news in the bamboo tube. Otherwise, the expression of Cosmos God would not be so grave.","A moment later, Cosmos God finished reading the contents of the bamboo tube. He raised his head to look at the sky and let out a long sigh.","Rubbing the space between his brows, Cosmos God continued to flip through the map of the Void Forbidden Land.","The moment he opened up the map, the brows of Cosmos God, who had been wearing a rather grim expression, immediately shot up.","“Eh? What is this?” He turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang replied, “Lord Cosmos God, this is the map of the Void Forbidden Land opposite the Void Universe. The Void Forbidden Land is the entrance to our Divine Power Universe.”","“Is that so?” Lord Cosmos God nodded upon hearing this.","The expression of Cosmos God did not change even after he had finished reading the map. When he saw the calculation of the Void Universe’s combat power at the back, the divine light in his eyes suddenly brightened, and a look of joy appeared on his face.","“Good, good, good. This combat strength calculation is too timely!”","Cosmos God turned to look at Jian Wushuang and his eyes flashed with a strange color. He was full of admiration.","He naturally understood the importance of this item.","With this list of battle strength calculations, he could make arrangements before the Great Catastrophe came. He could make corresponding plans for every expert above the Six Scar level.","What was the most terrifying?","The unknown was the most terrifying.","Now that he had this list of combat powers, it was equivalent to understanding the details of the Void Universe.","“I didn’t expect that the Void Universe would still have such a rich foundation after experiencing the first Great Catastrophe War. There are still so many Invincible Supremes in the universe.”","Putting down the map, Cosmos God sighed with emotion.","The number of Six Scar Void Masters on this list alone could be counted with two hands.","He believed that this was only a part of it. There must be many more Six Scar Void Masters who were not recorded in it.","“Jian Wushuang, I have a request.” Cosmos God turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","“Lord Cosmos God, your words are too serious. If there’s anything you need me to do, just let me know,” Jian Wushuang’s face turned serious and he replied seriously.","“Very well.” Cosmos God nodded before replying, “Jian Wushuang, after you return to the Void Universe, please make a detailed list of all the Six Scar level Void Masters who have not died. These people are very likely to participate in the Great Catastrophe.”","“No problem,” Jian Wushuang nodded and said. It was not a difficult request for him.","The topic changed.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have thought of something and his expression gradually became serious. He said, “Oh right, Lord Cosmos God, I encountered an unexpected situation when I was returning to the divine power cosmos.”","“Oh? What’s the situation?”","Cosmos God raised his eyebrows. For Jian Wushuang to have such a serious expression, it was definitely not a trivial matter.","Then, Jian Wushuang told Cosmos God about the aura that he had felt in the Void Forbidden Land.","After he finished speaking, the divine light in the eyes of Cosmos God suddenly increased by three inches. A fierce look appeared on his usually calm face.","“Jian Wushuang, if I’m not wrong, the aura you felt in the Void Forbidden Land should be Void God!”","“Void God?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“That’s right.” Cosmos God nodded and said, “Void God is the ones who triggered the last Great Catastrophe. He’s also the most powerful being in the Void Universe. Even I don’t dare to say that I’m stronger than him.”","“It’s a good thing that our Divine Power Universe was the home of the Great Catastrophe back then. Void Gods would be suppressed by the Great Dao laws in our universe, and their strength would be weakened. That’s why I was able to defeat him and injure him so badly.”","“Do you still remember the black arm you met in the Offworld Battlefield?” Cosmos God asked.","“Of course I remember.” Jian Wushuang nodded. That was his first battle since he came here. Nine Stars Saint had died in that battle. Naturally, he had a deep impression of it.","Jian Wushuang had naturally improved since then, and his realm had reached the Intermediate Supreme realm. However, he still felt a chill on his back when he saw the black arm that covered the sky.","It was a terrifying existence that was on a completely different dimension from him.","“The owner of this black arm is Void God. From that day on, I knew that this guy was about to wake up. The Great Catastrophe was coming again.”","“It’s a pity. No matter how much I calculated, I still believed that it would take at least several thousand chaos cycles for Void God to truly awaken, break free from his shackles, and return to the world.”","“But according to what you said, I’m afraid that Void God... He’s already awake!”","At this point, a cold glint flashed across the eyes of Cosmos God.","“So fast?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s breathing quickened.","An urgent sense of urgency welled up in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems like we have to speed up.”","“We have to get our hands on one of the Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons, the Fengtian Flag, before the Great Catastrophe begins!” Cosmos God said after taking a deep breath.","“As long as we get the Fengtian Flag, we’ll have a chance of winning the battle of the Great Catastrophe. Otherwise, the army of the Void Universe can attack and retreat at will. We’ll have a hard time dealing with them.”","“As long as you get the Fengtian Flag, you can enter the Void Universe and insert the Fengtian Flag into the Void Forbidden Land, completely cutting off their retreat!”","“At that time, under the suppression and rejection of the Great Dao laws, I’m confident that we can lead our Divine Power Universe to defeat them completely!”","“Even if we can’t end this Great Catastrophe on the spot, we can at least damage their vitality and help our Divine Power Universe win.”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood the importance of the Fengtian Flag.","“Lord Cosmos God, how do we obtain this Fengtian Flag?” Jian Wushuang asked.","...","Upon hearing this, the eyes of Cosmos God flickered as he spat out these words.","“Southern Ocean Immortal Island. Find the Fengtian Patriarch.”","“The Fengtian Patriarch?”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked at Cosmos God with a strange expression.","“Jian Wushuang, I know that you are curious why I didn’t take the Fengtian Flag when I knew where it is.”","Cosmos God shook his head and let out a bitter laugh. “I’m old friends with this Fengtian Patriarch, and we can be considered to be of the same origin. Back when I was still not strong enough, I had a conflict with him and stole his fate of the Dao. I feel guilty toward him.”","“If I go to him and ask him to hand over the Fengtian Flag, he will definitely not agree. I might even be met with a rebuff. If it is not a last resort, I do not want to force him and kill him.”","“Therefore, I can only send you to the Southern Ocean Immortal Island first. If that Fengtian Patriarch is stubborn and refuses to take the big picture into consideration, then I will have to use some extreme means.”"]},{"number":4532,"title":"Chapter 4532 Southern Ocean Immortal Island, Fengtian Patriarch","paragraphs":["4532 Southern Ocean Immortal Island, Fengtian Patriarch","Within Cosmos God Palace, the candlelight flickered.","The conversation between Jian Wushuang and Cosmos God lasted for an entire night.","“Are we going to the Southern Ocean Immortal Island to look for Fengtian Patriarch?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he pondered.","This trip would probably take some time. However, with the Tarot divine corpse overseeing the God Refining Sect and the assistance of Elder Ban Shan and the others, it should not be too much of a problem.","“Alright,” Jian Wushuang nodded and agreed.","At the sight of this, a look of gratification flashed in the eyes of Cosmos God. “Jian Wushuang, I have to remind you that old man Fengtian has a strange temperament and doesn’t like to play his cards according to common sense. If you meet him, just be polite and don’t give in to him all the time. Otherwise, he will definitely play tricks on you.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed, indicating that he understood.","Finally...","Cosmos God stretched out his right hand and patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder. For the first time, he said in a serious tone, “Jian Wushuang, the rise and fall of our universe depends on you.”","“Lord Cosmos God, you’re too kind. I, Jian Wushuang, will definitely go through fire and water for the sake of the universe. I’ll even die a thousand times,” Jian Wushuang replied solemnly.","In fact, Jian Wushuang had already mastered the cultivation method of the Void Universe. Even if the Divine Power Universe was destroyed, he could continue to cultivate in the Void Universe. Moreover, he was the sect master of the God Refining Sect. In terms of reputation and status, he was not any worse than he was in the Divine Power Universe.","However, the divine universe was his home. It was the place where he had grown up. His lover, his family, and his master were all deeply rooted in the Divine Power Universe!","For this, he was willing to die ten thousand times!","The next day, before anyone noticed, Jian Wushuang had already left the base camp and headed toward the Southern Ocean Immortal Island.","The South Ocean Immortal Island was located in the South Ocean Star Field. It was not considered the center of the universe. According to its location, it could be considered a wild land.","Within the Star Field, most of the residences were ordinary mortals.","Half a year later.","At the edge of the universe, a black-robed figure stepped out of the universe passage.","“Is that the South Ocean Star Field?”","A trace of fatigue flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Even he felt a little tired from the continuous full-speed travel.","Just as he was about to release his divine power to find out where South Ocean Immortal Island was in the South Ocean Star Field, he realized that the entire South Ocean Star Field seemed to be covered in a layer of mist. His divine power could not penetrate it.","It was obvious that this was the work of the Fengtian Patriarch.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and did not mind. He tried to use his divine power to locate Fengtian Patriarch. After all, he had come to ask for a favor. It would be rude if he did that.","Whoosh.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and landed in the most prosperous city in the South Ocean Star Field.","“Tanghulu, I’m selling Tanghulu”","“Suzhou’s Jinlan Square’s cakes, quickly come and take a look ”","This city was bustling with activity. Many mortals were taking a walk on the streets, and there were peddlers and servants shouting on both sides. It was quite a mortal world scene.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help sighing in his heart. Ever since he became powerful, he had to face countless killings every day. His mind was tense and he had never stopped to look at the scenery along the way.","“A mortal’s life may be short, but it has its own joys.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang stopped an old man and asked with a smile, “Old man, do you know where the Southern Ocean Immortal Island is?”","“The Southern Ocean Immortal Island?” The old man was stunned and asked, “Young Man, are you also going to find the Old Immortal Master to listen to his lessons?”","“Old Immortal Master?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. The Old Immortal Master the old man was talking about was probably the Fengtian Patriarch.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Old Man, do you know where the Southern Ocean Immortal Island is?”","“Once you leave the city, head south and you will see the South Sea. There, you will find a boat that goes out to fish. Spend some silver to rent a boat and head south. If you are fated, you will find the Southern Ocean Immortal Island. If not, you will search the entire South Sea and you will not find the Old Immortal Master.”","The old man said.","“Many thanks.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at the old man and then disappeared.","This scene caused a wave of shock in the eyes of the passing mortals. Countless people knelt down and called Immortals.","However, the old man smiled when he saw Jian Wushuang leave.","“Little Guy, it won’t be so easy to find me.” Shaking his head, the old man also disappeared.","However, the passers-by did not seem to notice it.","...","In just a breath’s time.","Jian Wushuang arrived at the edge of the South Sea. Countless fishermen were drying the fish with their nets on wooden frames.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and did not go straight to the Southern Ocean Immortal Island. Instead, he picked up two stones and turned them into silver. Then, he bought a black-awning boat from a fisherman.","Splash.","The black-caped boat sailed into the sea. Jian Wushuang stood at the bow of the boat with his hands behind his back. The strong wind blew his hair.","No matter how turbulent the waves were, he remained unmoved, unspeakably relaxed.","The black-caped boat drew a long trace on the blue sea. Jian Wushuang saw many other boats among them, all of which were people who went out to visit Immortals.","Three days later.","Jian Wushuang frowned.","According to common sense, with his speed, he should have already explored the entire Southern Sea.","However, he discovered that he seemed to have fallen into a fog formation and was constantly circling around.","...","“Are you playing with me?” Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked into the distance, his eyes showing a touch of impatience.","From the moment he arrived in this Star Field, he had not deliberately concealed his aura. The Fengtian Patriarch should have known of his existence long ago.","Jian Wushuang believed that he had been polite to the Fengtian Patriarch after arriving in the Star Field. No matter what, he should have shown himself.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang’s brows furrowed tighter and the impatience in his eyes became more obvious.","...","At the same time.","In the middle of the South Sea, there was a small island surrounded by clouds and mist. The island was filled with Immortal Qi and Immortal cranes. It was like a paradise on earth.","On the island, in a bamboo forest.","An old man with a silk headdress and a feather fan in his hand was sitting cross-legged on the ground.","In front of the old man, there was a Go board. There was no one on the other side of the board, but every time the old man placed a white piece on the board, a black piece would automatically appear on the board to play against him.","“Master, that person has been trapped in the formation for three days. Shouldn’t we go and take care of him?”","...","A young girl with red lips and white teeth stood beside the old man and asked in a low voice.","logo"]},{"number":4533,"title":"Chapter 4533 When the Nest Is Overturned, No Eggs Will Be Left Intact","paragraphs":["4533 When the Nest Is Overturned, No Eggs Will Be Left Intact","In a bamboo forest on the Southern Ocean Immortal Island.","The Fengtian Patriarch, who came from the same era as Cosmos Gods, was playing chess by himself.","Beside him, a Little Daoist girl with red lips and white teeth stood quietly, holding a bowl-sized alms bowl in her hand.","The alms bowl was filled to the brim with tea. However, what was reflected in the tea was a scene.","In the image, a black-haired youth with pale golden eyes stood on a black-awning boat with her hands behind her back. She was spinning the alms bowl.","“Master, how do you think this person found you? You don’t even care about the world and have retired from the universe for so many years. Most people don’t even know of your existence.”","The Little Daoist girl asked in a low voice.","Clack!","Fengtian Patriarch placed a chess piece on the board and snorted coldly. “Who else could it be? It must be that old fool, Cosmos God, who informed this person and got him to come and get the Fengtian Flag from me.”","The Little Daoist girl could not help but click her tongue when she heard that. In the entire universe, her Master was probably the only one who dared to call Cosmos God an old man, right?","“Master, why don’t we just lend out the Fengtian Flag? I observed the sky last night and found that there were seven stars in a row, forming a dragon-slaying momentum. I’m afraid that a Great Catastrophe will arise soon and cut off the luck of our universe.”","After hesitating for a moment, the Little Daoist girl said boldly.","The hand that was about to land on the chess piece paused. Fengtian Patriarch glared at the Little Daoist and said, “Are you the Master or am I the Master? Since when do I need you to teach me how to do things?”","With a cold snort, Fengtian Patriarch said, “If not for that old fogey snatching away my opportunity back then, how could the position of Cosmos God be suitable for him? I should be the one sitting there!”","“Did he consider my feelings when he snatched my fortune? Now that the universe is in trouble, you want to come to me? Hmph, what does he think I am? His tool?”","Hearing this, the Little Daoist could not help but stick out her tongue and say no more.","She knew that her Master had always been brooding over that incident. After all, that was the only opportunity to break through the current realm. It was not an exaggeration to say that there was a great hatred between them for such an opportunity to be snatched away.","“Then, master, should I go tell this person to leave?” the Little Daoist girl asked tentatively.","“Why should I tell him? This person has been trapped in the formation for a few days, so he’ll naturally retreat and leave on his own.”","Fengtian Patriarch continued to point as he shook his head.","However...","At this moment.","Suddenly, as if he had sensed something, Fengtian Patriarch’s expression changed drastically. “What is this guy trying to do?”","The next moment.","The figure of the Fengtian Patriarch disappeared in an instant.","...","Meanwhile, in the South Sea.","Jian Wushuang stood on the bow of the black-awning boat and looked at Fengtian Patriarch, who had not appeared for a long time. The impatience between his brows finally exploded.","“Fengtian Patriarch, it’s fine if you don’t want to come out, but I’ll destroy the South Sea and all the living beings on this planet! In any case, by the time the otherverse attacks, everyone will be dead. It’s better to die early and reincarnate early!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He stomped his right foot heavily and flew up to the sky, standing above the South Sea.","As Jian Wushuang clenched his right hand, billions of tons of water in the South Sea boiled up and formed a water tornado that was tens of thousands of feet high.","At this moment, all the mortals living in the South Ocean could see this devastating water tornado. Their faces were filled with shock, and they knelt on the ground, begging for mercy.","“Stop!”","At this moment, a figure that looked like a rotating meteorite broke through the air and arrived quickly, leaving a long trail of flames in the air.","In an instant, a terrifying pressure spread out in all directions. The tens of thousands of seawater that formed the tornado collapsed and returned to the sea.","“Brat, are you looking for death?!” An old man in a shabby Daoist robe, with his hair tied up with a thin wooden stick, was staring at Jian Wushuang.","“Fengtian Patriarch?” Jian Wushuang turned to look at Fengtian Patriarch.","The pressure from Fengtian Patriarch was like thousands of mountains. In an instant, Jian Wushuang almost knelt down.","Jian Wushuang’s knees did not bend at all in the face of such deep and hellish pressure.","“Fengtian Patriarch, the entire universe is in danger now. Life and death can be decided with a single thought. All the Supremes in the universe are willing to die with no regrets for the safety of the universe, but you’re hiding here and only care about your own enjoyment. You don’t care about the life and death of the entire universe. You’re really rotten.”","Jian Wushuang felt slightly relieved when he saw that Fengtian Patriarch did not attack him immediately. He looked at Fengtian Patriarch coldly and said.","This was an attempt to guilt trip Fengtian Patriarch from the moral high ground, but he had to say it. Once the Divine Power Universe fell, all the living beings in the universe might be destroyed and slaughtered.","This matter was already closely related to everyone in the universe.","Furthermore, if he was unable to awaken the Fengtian Patriarch this time around, what awaited the Fengtian Patriarch would be the thunderous methods of Cosmos God.","No matter how strong the Fengtian Patriarch was, he would still be defeated when facing a Cosmos God.","In other words, he was not here to borrow the Fengtian banner, but to save the Fengtian Patriarch.","“Hmph, what does the life and death of the universe have to do with this old man? I’ve already set up tens of millions of formations here. Even if the people from the Void Universe come in, what can they do to me?” the Fengtian Grandmaster snorted coldly and said in disdain.","“Naive!” Jian Wushuang interrupted Fengtian Patriarch and said with a hint of mockery, “Fengtian Patriarch, do you really think that you can resist the million-strong army of the Void Universe with just these formations?”","When Fengtian Patriarch heard this, he was about to retort.","“Fine,” Jian Wushuang continued. “Even if you can find a place to stay among the million-strong army in the Void Universe, are you willing to hide here and there all day like a stray dog?”","Originally, Jian Wushuang had wanted to persuade Fengtian Patriarch nicely before he met him again. However, when he saw him, these thoughts disappeared.","He was going to use the most direct of words to turn into a slap and completely wake the Fengtian Patriarch up!","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang continued, “Fengtian Patriarch, I’m sure you know why I’m here. I’m here to borrow the Fengtian Flag from you.”","“But it seems like you won’t lend it to me. But I have something to tell you.”","...","“Protecting the universe and fighting for the universe is never an individual’s matter. It is the matter of everyone in the universe!”","“Everyone knows that when the nest is overturned, no egg can remain intact. When the country is broken, every family will cease to exist!”","“Fengtian Patriarch, you are my senior. You should understand this!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was as loud as thunder!"]},{"number":4534,"title":"Chapter 4534 I Would Rather Die Singing in the Rain Than Live Under Someone Else’s Roof","paragraphs":["4534 I Would Rather Die Singing in the Rain Than Live Under Someone Else’s Roof","When the nest was overturned, no eggs will be left intact!","The country was broken, no family will survive!","This old man should understand these principles!","After Jian Wushuang finished his words, his voice was like thunder, deafening and stirring up the sea water again!","At this moment, a Little Daoist girl was already flying over from the distance!","“Junior, how dare you insult me?!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Patriarch Fengtian trembled with anger. He pointed a trembling finger at Jian Wushuang, the veins on his forehead throbbing.","He, the Fengtian great ancestor, was born at the beginning of the universe, before the chaos opened. When had anyone dared to criticize him?","“I think you’re looking for death!” Endless primordial Qi gushed out of Fengtian Patriarch’s body, surging to the extreme.","“Master!” At this moment, the Little Daoist girl who was riding a beam of light grabbed Patriarch Fengtian’s arm and quickly advised, “Master, calm down, calm down. You’re already so old, why are you bickering with the younger generation? It’s not worth it to be angry and harm your body!”","As he spoke, the Little Daoist child winked at Jian Wushuang, urging him to quickly run away.","“Chu Zhi, you also want to make your master angry? Quickly release your master!”","Patriarch Fengtian glared at the Little Daoist.","On the other side, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said in a neither humble nor overbearing manner, “Senior Fengtian, I have no intention of humiliating you. I’m just telling you the truth.”","After a pause, Jian Wushuang continued, “Senior Fengtian, I’ll only say what I’m about to say once. After I’m done, it’s up to you whether you want to borrow the Fengtian Flag or not. I won’t force you.”","Hearing this, the anger in Fengtian great ancestor’s heart subsided a little, but his face was still dark.","“Hmph, Junior, I’d like to see what you’re going to say.”","“Very well.” Jian Wushuang nodded and said without hesitation, “Senior Fengtian, I know that Lord Cosmos God once snatched away your opportunities and caused you to lose the opportunity to reach that step. Hence, you have always harbored a grudge in your heart and were disheartened. You settled down in a corner and no longer cared about the fate of the universe.”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and changed the topic. His tone became a little more serious.","“However, do you know that Lord Cosmos God has used his body as a shield and sat alone in the Offworld Battlefield for hundreds of millions of years, not allowing the other races of the Void Universe to take a single step forward?!”","“Do you know that during the Great Catastrophe, countless universe Supreme beings would rather die in the rain than live under someone else’s roof to protect the universe?!”","“I once fought in the Offworld Battlefield for 5,000 years. I’ve seen countless geniuses who were proud throw themselves at the wind just to stop the Void Universe by half an inch!”","“I once knew that Sword Supreme Tarot was unrivaled in the world and suppressed the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands with one sword. However, in order to resist the alien races from the Void Universe, he buried the universe and turned everyone in his country into nothingness.”","“I once heard that Jie Dong, who was unparalleled in this universe in all of history. However, they also died at the hands of outsiders, and didn’t retreat even half a step before they died!”","“I’ve also seen the thousands of nameless people in my universe. They were geniuses, experts, they were Holy Land Masters, they were the Favored Children of Heaven, they were the pride of the world, but they silently died for the universe without a single word of complaint!”","“The reason why they were so willing to die was because they knew that this universe was their home! They knew that their families were behind them! Disciple! Wife and children!”","“Therefore, there is only one choice in this battle, and that is to fight to the death!!!”","At this point, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his tone became gentler. He looked straight at Patriarch Fengtian and said, “But none of them are obligated to die for the sake of the universe. They could’ve been like you, living in a secluded corner of the universe and not caring about the affairs of the world. When the otherverse armies arrive, they could’ve simply found a place to hide.”","After Jian Wushuang finished his words, he did not sing loudly or pretend to be sad. He just gave a plain description.","However, it was this calm description that revealed his shock. It was as if a heavy hammer had smashed into Patriarch Fengtian’s heart.","Patriarch Fengtian fell silent.","He looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze and did not speak.","He was not a person with a bad nature. Otherwise, when Jian Wushuang had threatened him with the lives of hundreds of millions of living beings at the beginning, he would have killed Jian Wushuang on the spot in a fit of rage.","However, he had a knot in his heart.","This was due to the appearance of Cosmos God, but he had firmly locked himself in place.","Jian Wushuang’s words still did not untie his knot, but it tied an even bigger knot in another place!","“Master, I think... why don’t you lend him the Fengtian Flag? If the universe falls, we’ll be the ones to suffer in the end,” the Little Daoist girl whispered with tears in his eyes.","“Shut up!” Patriarch Fengtian glared at the Little Daoist child and then looked at Jian Wushuang. Although he was also shaken, he pretended to be uncaring and mumbled, “They are willing to die because they are stupid, what does it have to do with this old man? Don’t try to use righteousness to suppress me!”","After saying that, he glanced at Jian Wushuang and saw that Jian Wushuang was really about to turn around and leave. He quickly shouted in exasperation, “Brat, stop!”","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang, who had originally given up hope on Patriarch Fengtian and intended to let Cosmos God take action, paused in his steps and turned to look at Patriarch Fengtian. He frowned and said, “Senior Fengtian, is there anything else you need?”","Fengtian Patriarch glared at Jian Wushuang, raised his head, and snorted. “Little Fellow, don’t be in such a hurry to leave. This old master didn’t say that I wouldn’t lend it to you, right? How about this, you play a game of chess with me. If you win, I’ll lend you the Fengtian Flag. How about it?”","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, the Little Daoist girl beside Fengtian Patriarch was overjoyed.","She knew all too well what her Master’s level of play was!","That would be a Terrible Chess Player, an existence that was purely a gift!","He quickly gave Jian Wushuang a look to signal him to agree.","Jian Wushuang frowned. Although he did not know what the Patriarch Fengtian was up to this time, he nodded and agreed when he saw the Little Daoist beside him jumping up and down in joy.","“Alright,” he said.","“Brat, follow me to the Southern Ocean Immortal Island and we’ll see who’s better!”","Patriarch Fengtian snorted and grabbed Jian Wushuang with his big hand. An invisible big hand grabbed Jian Wushuang, took a step, turned into a flowing light, and disappeared from the South Sea.","When Jian Wushuang’s vision blurred and he came back to his senses, he was already on an island surrounded by a dense fairy aura and a bamboo forest."]},{"number":4535,"title":"Chapter 4535 Chess Match","paragraphs":["4535 Chess Match","His field of vision changed rapidly.","By the time Jian Wushuang could see the situation in front of him, he was already on an island enshrouding in celestial light and white mist. Rows of red-crowned, white-feathered cranes with sharp beaks were stepping on the beach leisurely like elegant Fairies.","Startled by the fish in the sea, they immediately spread their wings and flew up, drawing white lines in the air, displaying their beauty to their heart’s content.","With a breath, even his divine power became much more abundant.","Jian Wushuang landed in front of a bamboo house.","Outside the bamboo house, the sun was shining and the sea breeze was warm.","On both sides of the chessboard, there were two jade plates filled with black and white chess pieces.","Fengtian Patriarch, who was sitting beside the black chess pieces, saw Jian Wushuang’s look of admiration as he looked at the island. He could not help but look slightly proud. “Junior, let this old man ask you, how is this old man’s island? Let me tell you, even if a mortal stays on this Island for a hundred years, they can become an Immortal and live forever. If a Supreme comes, their cultivation speed will be ten times faster. It’s even more powerful than the grotto-heavens and blessed lands of the so-called top powers in the universe.”","As he spoke, Fengtian Patriarch stroked his beard and smiled.","However, Jian Wushuang’s first sentence made his smile freeze.","“I’m just sighing. The universe is about to be destroyed, but Senior still has the mood to relax here. You’re really big-hearted.”","Upon hearing this, a look of shame and anger quickly appeared on Fengtian Patriarch’s face. He blew at his beard and glared. “Brat, other than using the righteousness of the universe to pressure this old man, what else do you know?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but be speechless. The Little Daoist girl beside him also covered his mouth and chuckled.","“Hmph, don’t be long-winded, come and play chess with this old man!” Fengtian Patriarch beckoned at Jian Wushuang impatiently.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and sat down cross-legged in front of him.","“Respect the old and cherish the young, this old man will go first!” Fengtian Patriarch took the lead and placed his black finger on the chessboard.","As his finger fell, it landed in the center of the chessboard, which was the position of Tianyuan!","After that, Fengtian Patriarch looked up at Jian Wushuang with a triumphant smile and said, “This move of mine directly determines the overall situation. In the center of the chessboard, there is a sharp sword that is directly pressed against your throat. Junior, let’s see how you’re going to fight me!”","Hearing this, the Little Daoist girl could not help but laugh again.","Master was going to bring out his bullsh*t theory again.","The falling finger of Tianyuan might seem cool, but it was actually the most noob way of starting.","Those who knew a little about chess could tell that her Master was a noob.","Thinking of this, the Little Daoist looked at Jian Wushuang with hope.","To be honest, she hoped that Jian Wushuang would win. He was different from Fengtian Patriarch. Fengtian Patriarch had sealed himself in this small Southern Ocean Immortal Island. Firstly, it was indeed because he had grudges with Cosmos God. Secondly, it was also because he was angry with him.","However, the Little Daoist girl did not have such a mentality.","Just as she thought that Jian Wushuang would easily defeat Fengtian Patriarch, the Little Daoist child was stunned.","Jian Wushuang was looking at the chess game with a serious expression. He frowned and looked like he was in deep thought.","The next moment.","Then, Jian Wushuang said seriously, “Senior’s chess skills are superb and have reached the acme of perfection. I’m afraid that you’ve reached the peak of chess.”","“However, I have my own way of dealing with it!”","Pa!","Jian Wushuang raised his white finger and placed it on the bottom left corner of the chessboard.","“Senior’s attack on Tianyuan is indeed fierce, but if I guard the four corners and slowly plan to surround them layer by layer, I’m sure I’ll be able to catch the turtle in the jar!”","“???” The Little Daoist girl was stunned.","This was... what?","“What a good catch a turtle in a jar! Watch how this old man will kill you in all directions and burn your boats!”","The eyes of Fengtian Patriarch flashed with killing intent. He pointed his finger again at the lower right corner of one of the four corners.","“Junior, you have a good plan and I have a ladder over the wall. Now that I’ve secured an escape route, I’d like to see how you can fight with this old man.”","Fengtian Patriarch stroked his beard and smiled. He was unfathomably profound and unpredictable.","“Hmph, watch me attack again!” Jian Wushuang pointed at one of the four corners again.","The Little Daoist girl stood at the side and looked at Jian Wushuang and Fengtian Patriarch, who were attacking each other with murderous intent.","She finally confirmed one thing.","These two were f*cking noobs!","If the Little Daoist girl was not really proficient in Go Chess, she would have been deceived by these two people’s confident and reasonable words.","“It’s fine if they’re just noobs, but they’re actually saying it as if it makes sense. I almost believed them.”","The Little Daoist girl muttered to herself, feeling a little hopeless.","As expected.","A moment later.","“Hahahaha, Junior, you’ve lost!”","Fengtian Patriarch slapped the chessboard, causing the chess pieces to tremble violently.","“Satisfying! Junior, you’re the first person I’ve won in thousands of years since I’ve become obsessed with Go Chess! Hahahaha!”","Fengtian Patriarch laughed maniacally.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale.","He did not expect that his plan would fail and the Fengtian Patriarch would block the last hole.","...","The Little Daoist girl held her forehead and smiled bitterly. What did she just see?","It was a superior chess game that relied on deduction and calculation. However, in the hands of Jian Wushuang and Fengtian Patriarch, it became a brutal game of blocking holes and seeing who would fill up the gaps first.","It was really a little painful to the eyes!","Jian Wushuang stood up and sighed.","A loss was a loss. He was not someone who could not afford to lose.","Since that was the case, he could only retreat first and let Cosmos God think of a way to retrieve the Fengtian Flag personally.","However, this Fengtian Patriarch was not a bad person by nature. No matter what, he still had to persuade Cosmos God to think of a way to keep this Fengtian Patriarch alive.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at Fengtian Patriarch and said, “Senior, Junior will take his leave.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang rode on his sword light and prepared to leave.","Fengtian Patriarch, who had been immersed in the joy of victory, was stunned.","He had asked Jian Wushuang to play Go Chess with him because he knew that his chess skills were terrible and he had never won before. He wanted to borrow the Fengtian flag to Jian Wushuang. In this way, he could save his face and have a way out. Secondly, Jian Wushuang could borrow the Fengtian flag.","...","However, if Jian Wushuang wanted to leave, wouldn’t that mean that his plan had been in vain?","“I really don’t know if I should say that you’re a disappointing Junior, or that my chess skills have advanced by leaps and bounds recently. Sigh, it’s hard to find a close friend, and I’m as lonely as snow.”","Fengtian Patriarch sighed in his heart. Then, he looked up at Jian Wushuang’s back and shouted.","“Hold on!”"]},{"number":4536,"title":"Chapter 4536 The Fengtian Flag in Hand","paragraphs":["4536 The Fengtian Flag in Hand","“Hold on!”","A loud shout exploded across the entire Southern Ocean Immortal Island!","Fengtian Patriarch’s eyes widened in anger. He waved his hand and countless spells gushed out, forming a huge light shield. Like invisible glass, it blocked Jian Wushuang from leaving.","“Senior Fengtian, what else are you thinking about?”","Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks and turned around to look at Fengtian Patriarch helplessly.","He had lost the game of chess, and Fengtian Patriarch should be proud of himself. Why did he suddenly stop him?","Could it be that he wanted to humiliate him?","“Junior, do you think you can come and go as you please in this old man’s Southern Ocean Immortal Island?”","Fengtian Patriarch glanced at Jian Wushuang and snorted.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help but shrink.","Could it be that the Fengtian Patriarch had changed his attitude?","Just as Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword and was prepared to break the formation and escape, Fengtian Patriarch waved his sleeve and said coldly, “Junior, you’re not going to borrow the Fengtian Flag today and you want to leave?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment, and then he was overjoyed.","“Many thanks, Senior Fengtian! The entire universe will be grateful to you for borrowing the Fengtian Flag today!”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and landed in front of Fengtian Patriarch.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart.","It was no wonder that the Cosmos God had said that the Fengtian Patriarch had a strange personality. It seemed like he was right.","This change in attitude was faster than flipping a book.","“I can’t figure this guy out.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, shaking his head.","“Don’t thank me yet. I can lend you the Fengtian Flag, but I have a condition,” Fengtian Patriarch glanced at Jian Wushuang again and said.","To this, Jian Wushuang nodded and did not refute.","The Fengtian Flag was one of the Seven Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons. Its power was unparalleled in the world, so Jian Wushuang did not expect to get it for free.","A Supreme Great Ancestral Weapon represented the most extreme power in the world.","The Tarot Divine Sword represented the most extreme killing power!","The Chaos Wuxu Cauldron represented the ultimate power of creation!","The Fengtian Flag represented the ultimate power of sealing and suppression!","“Senior, please feel free to speak,” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said.","“Alright.”","Fengtian Patriarch took a deep breath and his expression became serious for the first time. He pointed at the Tarot Divine Sword hanging on Jian Wushuang’s waist and said, “Junior, the Fengtian Flag is a Supreme Ancestral Weapon. If you want to borrow the Fengtian Flag from me, you must also exchange it for one of the Supreme Ancestral Weapons of the same level. If I’m not mistaken, the sword on your waist is the sword that represents killing among the Supreme Ancestral Weapons, right?”","After he finished speaking, he stared at Jian Wushuang with burning eyes.","This was a deal, but also a test.","He wanted to see if Jian Wushuang was really willing to sacrifice everything for the universe as he had said on the surface of the South Sea.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang fell silent.","It could be said that the reason why he could fight across realms, besides his extremely powerful divine abilities and sword arts talent, was partly because of the terrifying power that the Tarot Divine Sword had given him.","If he handed over the Tarot Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang’s fighting power would be greatly reduced.","If it was any other time, it would have been fine, but now that the Great Catastrophe was about to begin, if he wanted to go into battle to kill the enemy, the Tarot Divine Sword would definitely be indispensable.","After a moment of silence.","“Senior Fengtian, I’m sorry, but I can’t.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and spoke in a deep voice.","Hearing this, the Fengtian Patriarch was stunned for a moment, then he sneered in his heart.","Hehe, what dogsh*t righteousness of the universe, what willingness to die for the universe.","It was just nice words, it did not hurt to stand and talk!","Once it involved his own interests, he would reveal his true colors!","At the thought of this, Fengtian Patriarch’s eyes turned cold. Just as he was about to ask Jian Wushuang to leave, Jian Wushuang continued, “Senior Fengtian, the Tarot Divine Sword is my weapon. If a swordsman doesn’t have a sword in their hands, how will they be able to unleash their potential?”","“Senior, if you want the Tarot Divine Sword, I can give it to you after the war is over.”","“As for what you said about the Supreme Ancestral Weapon in exchange...”","Fwip!!","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand and a small bronze cauldron covered with ancient patterns fell into his hand.","“Senior, what do you think of this Junior’s item?”","“Chaos Wuxu Cauldron!!!” In an instant, the Fengtian Patriarch’s face fell!","The Chaos Wuxu Cauldron could be said to be the most precious of the Seven Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons!","That was because the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron represented creation!","Killing and destroying were easy, but creating was the hardest of all!","If one wanted to take the step to become as strong as Cosmos God, the most crucial factor was to comprehend creation!","...","“You... Why do you have the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron?”","The light in Fengtian Patriarch’s eyes brightened as he spoke with a trembling voice.","“Senior, you don’t need to know where I got this cauldron from. You just need to tell me if I can exchange it for the Fengtian Flag,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Upon hearing this, Fengtian Patriarch looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and said, “This Chaos Wuxu Cauldron seems to be damaged, right? But even so, it’s enough to exchange for the Fengtian Flag.”","At this point, Fengtian Patriarch paused and said in a deep voice, “Kid, I won’t take advantage of you. To tell you the truth, this Chaos Wuxu Cauldron is the key to breaking through the last step for my Ascension. However, with your current realm, you don’t need it for the time being. It’s a waste to hold it in your hands.”","“Therefore, I will promise you that after this catastrophe is over, I will return the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron to you. I will even give you the Fengtian banner. How about it?”","With that, he flipped his right hand and a stack of small black flags appeared.","He pushed the Fengtian Flag to Jian Wushuang first.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","Just as the Fengtian Patriarch had said, although the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron was good, it was not of much use to him at the moment. On the other hand, the Fengtian Flag was what he needed the most right now.","...","Jian Wushuang took the Fengtian Flag and gave the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron to Fengtian Patriarch.","“Senior Fengtian, now that the Great Catastrophe is about to begin, Junior still has many things to do. I won’t stay any longer. Farewell.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at Fengtian Patriarch.","“Alright.” Fengtian Patriarch nodded. He knew that there were many things to do at the moment, so he could not keep Jian Wushuang any longer.","“Senior Fengtian, we’ll meet again another day.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at Fengtian Patriarch and the Little Daoist girl. Then, he took a step forward and turned into a sharp sword light. Like smoke and tide, he soared into the sky and disappeared from the Southern Ocean Immortal Island, leaving only a long white mark."]},{"number":4537,"title":"Chapter 4537 Leaving the Mountain!","paragraphs":["4537 Leaving the Mountain!","Whoosh!","A long white mark flew across the sky. Jian Wushuang’s figure gradually turned into a small black dot and disappeared into the horizon.","The sea that had calmed down washed the beach in waves, bringing up countless things like shells, gravel, and starfish, reflecting the blue sky.","Fengtian Patriarch held the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron and stood with his hands behind his back. He looked at the sky calmly and did not come back to his senses for a long time.","!!","Behind him, the Little Daoist had her head lowered, not saying anything.","“Chu Zhi, do you think I’ve made a mistake all these years?” Fengtian Patriarch suddenly said. There was no emotion in his voice, but it gave off a vague feeling of confusion.","The Little Daoist girl was stunned.","She knew that her Master had always been a very kind person. If it was an ordinary person who had their opportunity to advance snatched away by others, they would have long been irreconcilable with that person.","However, her own Master did not do so. He had also never harbored any thoughts of taking revenge on Cosmos Gods in the past.","“Master, why do you think so?” the Daoist girl asked in a daze.","Hearing this, Fengtian Patriarch smiled bitterly and said, “In fact, in the last battle of the Great Catastrophe War, if I had to die, our Divine Power Universe wouldn’t have lost so many people.”","The Little Daoist girl was still a little dazed.","However, he knew that with his master’s power, if he really attacked, not only would so many people in the divine universe not die, but it was even possible to reverse the situation.","One must know that his own master was someone who came from the same era as the Cosmos Gods. Back then, he had even suppressed the Cosmos Gods. Even now, after the Cosmos Gods had reached that unspeakable realm, his master’s strength was only one level lower than that of the Cosmos Gods.","“Forget it, you’re still too young. You won’t understand even if I tell you.”","Fengtian Patriarch shook his head, pursed his lips, and did not say anything else.","Only he himself knew that he had trapped himself on South Sea Island for so many years because he had given up on himself and was unwilling to face reality.","Suddenly.","The Fengtian Patriarch let out a long breath and turned to look at the little Daoist, who was only as tall as his shoulders. He smiled and said, “Chichi, how many years have you been with your master?”","The little Daoist boy was stunned. Although he didn’t understand why his master would suddenly ask this, he felt that his master was a little strange today.","“A million years. You’ve been with me on this Island for a million years.”","The Fengtian Patriarch sighed and suddenly said something that made the little Dao child’s expression freeze.","“Chu Zhi, do you want to go out and take a look? What I mean is to see the real vast galaxy, the boundless sea of stars, to see the true appearance of this world.”","“I...”","The Daoist girl’s eyes widened, and her breathing became a little hurried.","Ever since she had been picked up by Fengtian Patriarch on the beach, she had never left this world.","In the beginning, she would go to the mortal countries to play, make friends, and have fun.","However, it did not take long for him to realize that mortals had life, old age, sickness, and death, and they had their own day and night.","When she came out of her seclusion and happily went to find her former friends, they had long been dead and buried in graves, and the grass on their graves were three feet tall.","A mortal’s life was perhaps just a period of time for him to meditate.","As time passed, he no longer went to the mortal countries to have fun. Otherwise, once there was a life-and-death separation, it would only add to her sadness.","It could be said that she had spent almost all of the past one million years on the Southern Ocean Immortal Island with her Master, Fengtian Patriarch.","She could not wait to see the wonderful universe that his master had talked about. She wanted to see the brilliant sea of stars.","However, she did not want to bring it up and put her Master in a difficult position.","She knew that her Master, who looked carefree on the surface and seemed to not take anything to heart, had a knot in the depths of his heart.","“... I want to.”","After hesitating for a long time, the Little Daoist girl took a deep breath and said the words firmly.","After he finished speaking, she thought that her Master would glare at her fiercely and then reprimand her. Therefore, she lowered her head and did not dare to look at her Master’s face.","However, what she got in return was a carefree laugh that her Master had never had before.","“Good! My disciple, I’ll take you to see what the universe really looks like!”","Fengtian Patriarch laughed heartily, carefreely, and uninhibited. He had never laughed so freely before!","The light in his eyes brightened, and an extremely terrifying overbearing intent emanated from his body.","On this day, the Fengtian Patriarch finally found the courage to undo the knot in the depths of his heart!","He was the number one expert below Cosmos God!","“Chu Zhi, since you’re going to the outside world, you can’t wear this set of clothes. The girls in the outside world don’t dress like you do.”","With a wave of his right hand, a purple silk dress with tassels appeared in his hand.","“Go and change into this.”","“Ah?” The Little Daoist girl was stunned for a moment. She took the dress from Fengtian Patriarch in a daze and ran into the bamboo house on the Southern Ocean Immortal Island.","A moment later.","A tall, slender, and curvaceous young lady in a long dress nervously clutched her dress as she timidly shuffled out of the bamboo house.","She had bright eyes and white teeth, her skin was as white as snow, and her clear eyes were like clear water, extremely clear.","The afterglow of the setting sun reflected on her face, reflecting a large patch of shyness.","Her facial features were exquisite, her small face had a high nose, and her chin was sharp.","There were many beauties in the universe, some cold, some enchanting, and some cold, but she had something that most women did not have.","...","She was ‘clean’.","The word ‘clean’ seemed simple, but it was the rarest word.","“Master, I... I’m a little uncomfortable, so I’ll change back to that Daoist robe.”","Chu Zhi pinched the hem of her clothes, lowered her head, and said in a weak voice.","She did not know why, but she felt that her heart was thumping and her palms were sweating.","“Silly disciple, you’re not allowed to switch back!”","Fengtian Patriarch glared at the youngling as he spoke in a threatening tone.","He sighed in his heart.","He was the only one who knew what he was going to do after leaving the Southern Ocean Immortal Island.","After taking her to see the universe, he would also go and do something for this universe.","Whether or not he would be able to return alive was unknown to the Fengtian Patriarch.","...","Chu Zhi did not know that this dress was an extremely powerful defensive Immortal garment that Fengtian Patriarch had refined with all his Supreme treasures. In terms of value, it was probably not much lower than a Supreme Ancestral Weapon.","This was a gift that the Fengtian Patriarch had made for her with his life’s savings.","“My disciple, if Master is not here in the future, I will rely on this Immortal robe to protect you.”","Fengtian Patriarch said silently in his heart. However, he raised his head and stretched out his hand, flicking Chu Zhi’s forehead.","His tone was a little fierce as he said, “Silly disciple, if Master finds out that you dare to change out of these clothes, Master will peel off your skin.”","“Alright, alright, I know. Master, why are you so fierce?” Chu Zhi rubbed her head where she had been flicked and mumbled in dissatisfaction.","Fengtian Patriarch snorted and did not say anything else. Instead, he lowered his head and looked at the ground beneath his feet. His eyes were filled with reminiscence.","“Old Friend, you’ve accompanied this old man here for so many years. You must have been bored for a long time, right?”","Bang!","Fengtian Patriarch chuckled to himself as he stomped his right foot lightly.","Rumble!!!","In an instant, the entire Southern Ocean Immortal Island began to tremble violently. The seawater within a radius of 10,000 miles began to explode like boiling water.","Boom boom boom!","The ground cracked open and the sea boiled. It was as if a giant beast was awakening under the feet of the Fengtian Patriarch!","The next moment!","Bang!","An earth-shattering boom erupted!","The entire Southern Ocean Immortal Island was lifted into the air, and an extremely dull buzzing sound was heard.","From afar, a black turtle emerged from the deep sea.","“Master, this is?!!”","Chu Zhi’s eyes flashed with a look of horror. She saw that under her feet was no longer the Southern Ocean Immortal Island, but a giant black turtle that was hundreds of thousands of feet wide!","Its four limbs were like four ocean-stabilizing divine needles, pillars that held up the sky!","And the Southern Ocean Immortal Island that she had lived on for a million years was just a shell on the back of this giant turtle.","The seething sea breeze ruffled the White hair on the sides of Fengtian Patriarch’s face. However, the smile on his face grew wider.","“Old Fool, I’ve come out of seclusion! It’s time to settle the score with you!”","“Oh, right, the alien races in the Void Universe, we have to deal with them first! I’ll put aside the score with this old man for now and blast these b*stards out of our universe first!”","On this day, in the endless territories of the South Ocean Star Field, countless mortals raised their heads and saw a giant turtle that covered the sky.","Hundreds of millions of living beings knelt on the ground and looked at the giant turtle in the sky with fanatical eyes. They shouted in unison to bid farewell to the Immortal.","On this day, there was no more legend about the old Immortal master in the South Ocean Star Field.","On this day, there was a strange combination in the universe.","It was a giant turtle that was as big as a star.","A disheveled old man and a beautiful purple-dressed girl were traveling around the universe.","It was a strange combination.","...","“Oh, this old man forgot to ask. What’s the name of the boy who played chess with this old man? I wonder if this boy has a Dao Companion. It’s time to find someone to entrust this young girl to.”","Shaking his head, this strange pair disappeared into the vast starry sky.","...","And in the distant starry sky.","Jian Wushuang, who was wearing a black robe and had a cold face, was already flying toward the Offworld Battlefield."]},{"number":4538,"title":"Chapter 4538 The End of the Catastrophe","paragraphs":["4538 The End of the Catastrophe","In the vast universe.","Jian Wushuang stepped on an escape light and quickly rushed toward the Offworld Battlefield.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at the base camp with his full strength.","Jian Wushuang had only left the base camp for a few months, but the entire base camp was filled with a bleak aura and everyone had a heavy look on their faces.","!!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help frowning. Could it be that something had happened during the few months that he had been away?","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang strode into Cosmos God’s hall.","The current Jian Wushuang was the only person who could freely enter and exit Cosmos God’s hall apart from the two great disciples of Cosmos God.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re back.” Cosmos God nodded at Jian Wushuang.","He still looked the same as when Jian Wushuang first met him, gentle and kind, with a smile on his face. However, Jian Wushuang could see deep fatigue on his face.","“Jian Wushuang, what’s the situation? Did the Fengtian Patriarch lend you the Fengtian Flag?”","Cosmos God asked after gathering his spirit.","“I didn’t fail you.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He flipped his right hand and a little black flag appeared in his hand.","“Alright!”","Upon seeing this, the eyes of Cosmos God lit up and he heaved a sigh of relief in his heart.","With the Fengtian Flag, he had some confidence in the battle of the catastrophe.","After a moment of silence, Cosmos God said, “Jian Wushuang, I have bad news for you.”","Without beating around the bush, Cosmos God continued, “In the past two months, many Void Warriors from the Void Universe have come out of the cracks in the void. In the short span of a month, nearly ten battles have broken out. The friction between us and the cracks in the void is getting bigger and bigger. I guess that the battle of Great Catastrophe may break out at any time!”","“What? So fast?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Even though he had already made preparations to deal with the battle of Great Catastrophe, when the battle really came, he still felt a little dazed.","“Therefore, Jian Wushuang, please hurry back to the Void Universe and wait for my orders!”","“Once the Great Catastrophe War begins and the core power of the Void Universe attacks our universe, I’ll send you an order. At that time, you can use the Fengtian Flag to set up a sealing formation in their Void Forbidden Land and cut off their escape!”","Cosmos God said with a solemn expression.","“Yes!” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded his head and his face also became serious.","The magnetic fields and nomological laws of the two universes were not connected, which meant that after the people of the Void Universe attacked the Divine Power Universe, they would consume void power and would not be replenished.","In the past, the reason why the Void Warriors of the Void Universe were so difficult to deal with during the Great Catastrophe War was that they would return to the Void Universe to replenish their energy once they were no match for the enemy or were exhausted. Then, they would attack again.","Once Jian Wushuang set up the Fengtian Flag in the void crack of the forbidden void land and blocked the 87th void crack, he would be able to cut off their escape route and divide the Void Warriors of the Void Universe.","At that time, under the leadership of Cosmos Gods, they would be able to obliterate them even if they had to spend a lot of time and effort.","The Void Universe was a level higher than the Divine Power Universe, both individually and as a whole.","In this case, the Divine Power Universe needed to reverse the outcome and turn the defeat into victory, which was the best countermeasure!","And Jian Wushuang played the most important role!","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang walked out of the hall with large strides.","When they arrived at the entrance of Cosmos God’s hall.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have thought of something. He tore off a corner of his clothes with his right hand and wrote a few lines of words with his hand as a pen.","“Lord Cosmos God, if I do not return alive this time, please help me pass this piece of cloth to my wife, Leng Rushuang.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and flicked his finger. The piece of cloth immediately fell into the hands of Cosmos God.","Upon hearing this, Cosmos God could not help but be stunned.","He wanted to say something to comfort him, but in the end, he only sighed and nodded.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to cut off the Void Universe’s escape route, he had to go deep into the Void Forbidden Land. The hope of survival was very small.","Jian Wushuang and Cosmos Gods understood this point.","After leaving the base camp, Jian Wushuang set off again to the crack in the void.","This time, Supreme Gongyang did not go back to the Void Universe. Instead, he stayed in the Divine Power Universe and waited for the war to break out to help.","Jian Wushuang would be alone in the Void Universe and start a different kind of battle.","...","He arrived at the Offworld Battlefield.","Right now, the ones in charge of guarding the battlefield were Teams 6 and 7.","The two team leaders seemed to have received the news from Cosmos Gods a long time ago. They did not ask much about Jian Wushuang’s intention to go to the Void Universe and only told Jian Wushuang to be careful.","At that moment, there was a war going on in the Offworld Battlefield. Therefore, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to step into the crack in the void. Instead, he waited for the battle to end.","Human-faced spiders the size of small mountains crawled out of the cracks in the void. They were so dense that they filled the entire sky.","Fortunately, although these human-faced spiders were large in number, they were not individually strong. The strongest among them was only at the Ultimate Ruler realm.","As a result, the members of Team 6 and Team 7 had an easy time.","According to what Supreme Blacksource had said, these human-faced spiders were not intelligent entities. They had most likely been created by some major power in the Void Universe in order to observe and test the power of the Divine Power Universe.","A moment later, the one-sided slaughter came to an end.","Human-faced spiders the size of small mountains fell from the sky like rain. The universe was filled with the broken limbs, flesh, and blood of the human-faced spiders.","The battle was over and it was time for Jian Wushuang to leave.","...","Supreme Blacksource looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression.","The Junior who had just entered the Supreme realm was now shouldering the heavy responsibility of the life and death of the universe.","“Jian Wushuang, I will wait for your safe return,” Supreme Blacksource said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile and replied with two words.","“For sure!”","Then, Jian Wushuang stepped into the void crack without hesitation.","Jian Wushuang’s black-robed figure was gradually swallowed by the black-hole-like crack.","No one had discovered it.","A strange red light flashed in the eyes of a human-faced spider corpse that had been dead for a long time, leaving only its head.","The image of Jian Wushuang stepping into the crack in the void was formed in his compound eyes.","At the same time.","...","In the Void Universe, in the Void Forbidden Land, in a cave in the 87th crack.","A statue-like ancient figure covered in mud, sitting cross-legged in the depths of the cave, slowly opened his eyes.","“Eh? Someone has entered the Void Universe?”"]},{"number":4539,"title":"Chapter 4539 Danger","paragraphs":["4539 Danger","In the forbidden void land of the void universe, in the 87th crack, there was a cave that was 10,000 feet deep.","The cave was filled with cobwebs. The spiders followed the cobwebs and climbed onto the walls. They kept spitting out silver threads as thick as hair from their mouths, shining with a cold light.","In the middle of the cave, a mud sculpture suddenly shook.","Shortly after, the earth began to crack and dust began to rise, revealing a strange old man with a face covered in tattoos and a body covered in spider fur.","!!","“Who is this kid...” The monstrous old man slowly opened his eyes, and a bright light flashed through them.","Just now, when countless of the gadgets he had created died, he suddenly saw a scene.","In the image, a black-robed young man with a cold expression stepped into the crack in the void.","“I need to report this to Lord Void God.”","The monstrous old man shook his head and immediately stood up.","Immediately, the countless spiders on the wall followed the spider web and crawled toward the monstrous old man.","Thump thump thump.","In the blink of an eye, all the spiders crashed into the monstrous old man’s body.","The pale-faced old monster’s face suddenly turned red.","Whoosh.","He took a step forward, and his body flickered, instantly disappearing from the deep pit.","...","The 87th void rift.","A huge building that looked like a beehive was built here, and it was filled with wormholes.","The monstrous old man’s body swayed and he instantly appeared in the honeycomb-like building. He strode towards the middlemost wormhole.","He strode in.","The 34 Void Masters and the Left and Right Void Emissaries were all in the main hall.","Each of the 34 Void Masters had the cultivation base of a six-scar Void Master and were the main force in this Great Catastrophe War!","Among them, many of them were old monsters who had survived the last Great Catastrophe War, and some were masters of Ancient Holy Lands, Sect Masters of Immortal orthodoxies, and so on!","The previous Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Void Master Ba Huang, was also here. However, his position was extremely far back, close to the bottom.","The left and right Void Emissaries and the one on the right were the white-haired, burly old man who Jian Wushuang had met once.","On the throne in the main hall, there was a silk-like cocoon.","Inside the cocoon, there was a thunderous sound of heartbeats.","Seeing the strange old man walk into the hall, the 34 Void Masters and two Void Emissaries sitting in the seats all let out a soft gasp.","“Why is the Sky Spider old freak willing to come up?”","“Tsk, he must have stayed in that dark and damp cave for too long and wanted to come up and take a walk.”","Everyone laughed and joked.","This Sky Spider old freak had outstanding strength and could be considered as one of the strongest among them. However, he was unsociable and unsociable. He usually stayed in the dark nest deep in the earth’s core.","The Sky Spider old man was expressionless. He ignored the teasing and knelt down on one knee toward the white silk cocoon at the head of the hall. He cupped his hands and said respectfully, “Sky Spider greets Lord Void God!”","Bang!","The intense sound of a heart beating came from the cocoon.","Then, he heard a low and hoarse voice that sounded like a man and a woman coming out of the cocoon.","“Sky Spider, what do you have to report?”","“Lord Void God is wise.”","Sky Spider flattered him at first, then he stood up and said in a deep voice, “Lord Void God, a Sky Spider larva that I took to investigate the Divine Power Universe died in the Offworld Battlefield. Before it died, it made a good discovery.”","“Oh? A good discovery?”","The 34 Void Masters in the hall raised their eyebrows slightly. For the Sky Spider old monster to come out of the deep pit of his nest to report, it must be more than a good discovery.","“Tell me.”","“Yes.” Sky Spider old freak nodded and replied, “Lord Void God, please take a look.”","With that, Sky Spider old man waved his right hand and an image appeared in the hall.","In the battlefield of the godly power universe, a young man with a cold and handsome face, wearing a loose black robe and a hood, strode into the crack in the void.","Everyone’s heart skipped a beat when they saw this.","“What? The people from the Divine Power Universe have entered?”","“Eh? What was going on? If the Divine Power Uower universe had entered our Void universe, we should have sensed it immediately. Why didn’t I sense someone coming from our 87th crack?”","“Why is it like this?” everyone said in surprise.","As for the cocoon, it fell into silence.","Only after a long while did the chrysalis make a sound again.","“Check all the cracks in the Void Forbidden Land and capture the person from the Divine Power Universe.”","As soon as he said that, everyone was stunned at first, then they reacted, and a look of surprise flashed in their eyes.","Could it be that there were other cracks in the void that could travel between the two universes in the Void Forbidden Land?","...","“Yes!”","The 34 Void Masters responded respectfully and stood up to check the cracks in the void.","The hall quickly quieted down, leaving only the Left and Right Emissaries and the strange trembling cocoon.","...","When the 34 Void Masters walked out of the hall, no one noticed that Void Master Ba Huang, who was walking at the back, had an uncertain look on his face.","“That person and Wushuang seem to be somewhat similar,” Void Master Ba Huang squinted his eyes and muttered to himself.","The suspicion he had for Jian Wushuang that had been dispelled long ago immediately surged into his mind again.","For some reason, he felt a little uneasy.","However, he did not tell Void GOd about this. Instead, he contacted one of the five great Grand Elders of the God Refining Sect, Elder Chen Gu.","This person was the backup that Void Master Ba Huang had left in the God Refining Sect. Every once in a while, he would report to him about the matters of the God Refining Sect.","It could also be said that Elder Chen Gu was a chess piece for Ba Huang sect to monitor Jian Wushuang in the God Refining Sect!","...","“Chen Gu, let me ask you. Has there been anything strange about Wushuang recently?”","Ba Huang asked in a deep voice.","“Reporting to Lord Sect Master, Wushuang has been in seclusion in the Sect Master’s main hall the entire time. I didn’t notice anything unusual.”","“Closed-door cultivation?” Ba Huang muttered to himself and said, “Chen Gu, immediately go to the Sect Master’s hall to see Wushuang and see if he’s still there.”","“Now?” Elder Chen Gu was taken aback.","“Now! Immediately! Immediately!”","A cold light flashed in the eyes of Void Master Ba Huang.","“Alright!”","Instantly, Elder Chen Gu’s voice rang out in Ba Huang’s mind.","After hanging up, Void Master Ba Huang sneered in his heart. If Wushuang was really in the Sect Master’s Hall, then Wushuang’s suspicion would naturally be cleared and his suspicion of Wushuang would also be completely removed.","And if he was not...","There was a flash of killing intent in the eyes of Void Master Ba Huang!","He wanted to let Wushuang taste the price of deceiving him and regret being born in this world!","Licking his lips, Void Master Ba Huang looked bloodthirsty."]},{"number":4540,"title":"Chapter 4540 Crisis Resolved, the Tarot Divine Corpse Makes a Breakthrough","paragraphs":["4540 Crisis Resolved, the Tarot Divine Corpse Makes a Breakthrough","A gust of cold wind blew past. Void Master Ba Huang looked up at the sky, his heart growing colder.","In his mind, Wushuang’s figure and the black-robed figure that he had seen stepping into the crack in the void in the main hall kept overlapping and then separating.","“Wushuang, I hope you won’t disappoint me.”","A moment later.","!!","Elder Chen Gu’s message was connected to him.","“Chen Gu, what’s the situation?” Void Master Ba Huang asked indifferently, his voice devoid of any emotion.","“Reporting to Lord Sect Master, I just saw Sect Master Wushuang in the Sect Master’s main hall. There was nothing unusual about Sect Master Wushuang, and his cultivation seemed to have improved. His mental state was also quite good.”","Elder Chen Gu’s voice rang in the mind of the Void Master Ba Huang. Then, he asked doubtfully, “Lord Sect Master, is there something the matter with Sect Master Wushuang?”","“Is there nothing unusual?”","Void Master Ba Huang did not answer Chen Gu. Instead, he narrowed his eyes.","In his mind, Jian Wushuang’s and the black-robed man’s overlapping and separating figures had been completely separated.","In his heart, he heaved a sigh of relief.","If Jian Wushuang was really a spy sent by the Divine Power Universe, he would naturally kill him without mercy. However, at the same time, the God Refining Sect and Void Master Ba Huang would become a laughing stock in the Void Universe.","To let a spy from another universe become the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect?","This was simply absurd.","Furthermore, Void Master Ba Huang’s heart skipped a beat. He was afraid that Lord Void God would think that the God Refining Sect was colluding with the Divine Power Universe. That would be a big problem!","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had been staying in the God Refining Sect. It seemed that he had nothing to do with the black-robed man.","Clearing his thoughts, Void Master Ba Huang said coldly, “Don’t ask what you shouldn’t be asking. Alright, continue to keep an eye on the sect. If anyone has any abnormal situation, report to me at once.”","After saying that, the Void Master Ba Huang hung up the transmission. He took a step forward and turned into a stream of light, starting to investigate the cracks in the void.","...","Outside the Void Forbidden Land.","Jian Wushuang’s speed was extremely fast. In the blink of an eye, he had covered tens of millions of miles and completely disappeared from the sight of the Void Forbidden Land.","A few days later.","At the main gate of the God Refining Sect.","The two disciples in charge of guarding the gate were still the same as last time.","“Sigh, it’s so cold and miserable. When will this job of guarding the door end?”","The disciple on the left named Luo He raised his head and sighed.","“Hahahaha, it’s great to be a gatekeeper. No one usually comes here, so it’s quiet.”","The disciple on the right, Shi Lang, laughed.","Just as the two of them were chatting and joking around.","Suddenly, their vision blurred, as if a black shadow had flashed past their eyes.","When the two of them looked again, they saw nothing.","“Hey, Shi Lang, do you think I’m having problems with guarding the door every day? I’ve been seeing things recently,” Luo He mumbled.","“Maybe. Even I’m seeing things now, let alone you.”","“Sigh, keep enduring.”","The two of them shook their heads and sighed for a while before they continued their banter.","They had completely forgotten about what had happened earlier.","At the same time.","Jian Wushuang had already stepped into the Sect Master’s hall.","He pushed down his hood and pulled his black robe.","Instantly, the black robe disappeared and was replaced by the white robe that represented the position of the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect.","His facial features changed, and his ears became long and sharp. In an instant, he turned from Jian Wushuang to the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Wushuang.","He reached out and pressed on a protruding stone behind the throne in the hall. Suddenly, the wall behind the hall let out a muffled sound, and the wall automatically pulled open.","Jian Wushuang stepped in.","Behind the Sect Master’s main hall was a secret room, which was also his sleeping palace.","The Eight Trigrams Formation continued to spin. In the center of the diagram, there was a figure that looked exactly like him, sitting cross-legged and cultivating. It was the Tarot divine corpse.","Seeing Jian Wushuang come in, the divine corpse of the Tarot quickly stood up and lowered his head, “My true self!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and pressed his hand on the head of the divine corpse of Tarot. Suddenly, his consciousness was pulled away from the divine corpse of Tarot and returned to Jian Wushuang’s body.","Instantly, the light in the eyes of Tarot, which had been in high spirits, quickly faded away. It became stiff again and returned to its original appearance.","As for Jian Wushuang, he closed his eyes and carefully felt the memories in his consciousness.","These memories were all of the events that happened when the Tarot divine corpse took over as the Sect Master.","“Oh? Elder Chen Gu had come? And after stammering and asking a few random questions, he left in a hurry?”","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown.","He did not have much of a relationship with Elder Chen Gu. In fact, it could be said that they had never even met before. Why would Elder Chen Gu suddenly come to find him? And even pretended to be concerned?","...","“It’s a little strange.”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment, but he couldn’t figure it out, so he simply gave up.","However, when he flipped through the memories again, a hint of anger flashed across his face.","The corpse of the Supreme Tarot, or rather, the corpse of the Supreme Tarot controlled by his consciousness, had almost killed Jiu Sha!","In his memory, the corpse of the Supreme Tarot had taken his identity and held morning meetings every day. After the morning meetings, Jiu Sha, who was now his maidservant, was about to clean up the bedroom for the corpse of the Supreme Tarot when the corpse of Supreme Tarot teased her with a few words. He almost started a fire with his words and the red waves rolled.","“Bastard!!!”","Jian Wushuang trembled with anger and the veins on his forehead throbbed.","He looked at Tarot divine corpse coldly. He wanted to throw a tantrum, but this was all under the control of his consciousness.","That feeling was as if he wanted to lose his temper, but there was no one to vent it on. He was really aggrieved to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang had been famous all his life. When had he ever let loose like this?","“It seems that I’d better not use the divine corpse clone technique in the future. Otherwise, I don’t know what other tricks it will play.”","...","Jian Wushuang shook his head and sealed the secret skill in his mind.","With a wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang’s divine power entered Supreme Tarot’s corpse. This time, he had a smile on his face.","Tarot divine corpse had broken through!","Before he left, the cultivation of the corpse was at Primary Supreme realm. However, when he checked it just now, the cultivation of the corpse had already reached the Intermediate Supreme realm!","“This Tarot divine corpse is truly worthy of being the incarnation of the Supreme Tarot. Its potential is astonishing, and its cultivation speed is so fast.”","Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction and looked at the formation eye of the Eight Trigrams of Yin and Yang. He continued to smile, “Potential is one thing. A large part of the improvement is because the Eight Trigrams Formation is too terrifying. It has absorbed the corpse Qi of the entire God Refining Sect into one for its cultivation. I’m afraid that if the corpse of the Supreme Tarot stays at the eye of the formation, it will be able to advance to the Top Supreme realm without any obstacles.”"]},{"number":4541,"title":"Chapter 4541 Opening the Curtain","paragraphs":["4541 Opening the Curtain","Within the Sect Master’s Palace.","Jian Wushuang looked at the divine corpse of Tarot who was giving off the aura of an Intermediate Supreme and nodded in satisfaction.","It was not wrong to say that the Divine Corpse Tarot was Jian Wushuang’s second avatar. The stronger Tarot’s corpse was, the stronger Jian Wushuang would be.","This gave Jian Wushuang more confidence in the upcoming battle of catastrophe.","!!","With a wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang put the corpse back into the Heaven-Suppressing Monument. Then, he sat in the center of the Eight Trigrams Array and began to absorb the void power.","A large amount of void power was absorbed into Jian Wushuang’s body. Then, it was transformed into the purest divine power through the Void Power Crystal Core.","This made Jian Wushuang feel very comfortable.","The next morning, Jian Wushuang called for a morning meeting.","This was the homework that he had to do as a Sect Master.","The content of the morning meeting was very simple. All the Elders would report the situation of the sect, such as the recent major events in the universe, or which talented disciple in the sect showed signs of breaking through to the Scar level, and so on.","Generally speaking, it was just some trivial matters and a mere formality.","It was the same for today’s morning meeting. After Jian Wushuang asked some regular questions, the Elders left one after another.","On the throne, Jian Wushuang massaged the space between his eyebrows, feeling a little tired.","It had to be said that being the Sect Master was tiring. Not only did he have to cultivate by himself, but he also had to manage tens of thousands of disciples in the sect. The amount of effort he had to put in was simply unparalleled.","“Sect Master.”","After everyone had left, Jiu Sha, who had an enchanting figure and a charming face and was wearing a light red dress, quietly walked over. She stood behind Jian Wushuang and stretched out her slender fingers to massage his shoulders.","As soon as her hands touched Jian Wushuang’s shoulders, Jian Wushuang suddenly stood up as if he had been electrocuted. He frowned and asked her coldly, “What are you doing?”","“Ah?”","Jiu Sha was startled by Jian Wushuang’s tone and a look of panic flashed across her face.","“Sect Master, I... I just saw that you were tired, so I wanted to help you relieve your fatigue.”","“No need,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Sect Master, didn’t you just ask me to serve you well a few days ago...”","Jiu Sha was startled when she heard this, and then she said with a blank expression.","Just a few days ago, after the morning meeting, ‘Wushuang’ grabbed her hand with a smile and asked her to serve him well.","For this reason, she had specially worn a more revealing red tulle today. One could vaguely see the spring light in her red dress, showing off her good figure.","Why did the Sect Master suddenly change his face today?","Wasn’t this change in attitude a little too fast?","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s mouth twitched. He did not need to think to know that this was a trick played by the corpse of Supreme Tarot.","“No need, I don’t need a maid.”","Jian Wushuang suppressed his anger and said, “Jiu Sha, from now on, you are no longer my maidservant. Return to the limestone mountain and cultivate. Cultivation is the foundation.”","Upon hearing this, Jiu Sha’s body trembled and her face turned pale.","Although Jian Wushuang’s words were tactful, to put it bluntly, he was driving her away.","“I understand.” Jiu Sha bit her lower lip and nodded. Then, she left in a somewhat embarrassed manner. Jian Wushuang looked at Jiu Sha’s back and could not help shaking his head slightly. Then, he turned around, pressed the secret room button in the Sect Master’s bedroom, and stepped into the secret room.","After entering the bedroom, Jian Wushuang sat down on the Eight Trigrams Yin-Yang Formation. A large amount of void power gushed toward him.","Now that the battle between the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe was about to start, he had to seize every minute to improve his strength!","...","At the same time.","In the 87th void rift.","Within the beehive-like palace complex, in the center palace.","Thud thud thud.","A series of heavy footsteps could be heard.","The 34 Void Masters strode into the main hall.","“Lord Void God, all the cracks in the Void Forbidden Land have been checked.”","On the throne in the hall, a low voice came from the cocoon.","“Eh? Did you find anything?”","As soon as he finished speaking, a Void Master with eyes and no hands stepped out and replied, “Lord Void God, you’re so wise. When we checked the 23rd crack, we found that it could lead to the Divine Power Universe! It’s just a pity that we didn’t manage to capture the black-robed man who escaped into our universe.”","After a pause, the low and hoarse voice that sounded like a man and a woman came out of the cocoon again.","“If that’s the case, then let’s start the Great Catastrophe ahead of schedule!”","As soon as these words fell, the faces of everyone in the hall changed, and then joy gushed out of their eyes.","Hearing the words of Lord Void God, could it be... Lord Void God had completely recovered?","Crack.","Crack, crack.","Before they could think further, a crack appeared on the cocoon wrapped in layers of white silk.","Wisps of pitch-black mist came out of the crack.","...","Crack, crack, crack!!!","Then, more and more cracks appeared!","Finally!","Bang!","An earth-shattering boom rang out, and the entire cocoon exploded!","A tall figure shrouded in endless black mist slowly stood up from within the cocoon.","His entire body was shrouded in a black mist, making it impossible to see him clearly. Only his pair of scarlet and evil eyes revealed a dominating and soul-stirring aura.","Under this pair of eyes, the world had to bow its head and the universe had to boil. He was above all living beings, sitting alone on the clouds, like a god, looking down on the world.","“We pay our respects to Lord Void God!”","“We pay our respects to Lord Void God!”","Immediately, all the 34 Void Masters in the hall, including the Left and Right Void Emissaries, knelt down.","...","Whether they were the Masters of Holy Lands, the Sect Meaders of Immortal orthodoxies, or extremely ancient existences, they all knelt at the feet of the figure in the black fog with extremely fanatical eyes.","Void God, the Master of the entire Void Universe!","No one dared to disobey his orders!","He was the one and only heaven of the Void Universe!","Void God, who was covered in black mist, only glanced at them and said nothing.","His figure rose straight into the air, as if Heaven’s Duke was kneeling at his feet and lifting him up.","“It’s been 100,000 void eras. Cosmos God, it’s time for us to meet again.”","Void God placed his hands behind his back and muttered to himself. His gaze seemed to penetrate through the two universes and see Cosmos God in the Divine Power Universe.","The next moment.","He pressed his right hand down slightly.","“Let the battle of the Great Catastrophe War begin.”"]},{"number":4542,"title":"Chapter 4542 The Great Era Is About to Start, Undercurrents Surging","paragraphs":["4542 The Great Era Is About to Start, Undercurrents Surging","Cosmic Calendar, year 6523.","The second Great Great Catastrophe War, which was called the ‘War of Changing Heavens’ by the later generations, had begun!","That day, Void God led the 32 Void Masters and the Left and Right Void Emissaries to attack the Divine Power Universe through the 87th crack!","Heaven and earth shook, and countless clouds churned. The world seemed to have fallen into an eternal winter night.","!!","The mountains and rivers reversed, the sun and moon changed colors, and even the stars in the sky dimmed. The sound of the Great Dao came from the horizon, profound and mysterious.","Except for some low-level Void Warriors who did not know what was going on, the experts who had not reached the 87th crack were all shocked.","They all looked at the Void Forbidden Land and murmured, “The Great Era is about to begin.”","...","Sky Glory Holy Land, floating tower.","The floating tower was built in the deepest part of the Sky Glory Holy Land. No one could enter the floating tower except the current Holy lord of the Sky Glory Holy Land and the Sky Glory Holy Son, who had extra authority.","This was because the floating tower was where the three Great Patriarchs of the Sky Glory Holy Land slept.","The reason why the Sky Glory Holy Land was able to suppress everyone and become one of the strongest in the Void Universe was because of the existence of these three Sky Glory Patriarchs.","Each of the three Sky Glory Patriarchs was an old monster who had survived since ancient times. They had been in the realm of the Six Scar Void Master for countless years.","The three of them usually slept in the floating tower and would only come out when the Sky Glory Holy Land was in a life-and-death crisis.","Now, no one knew that among the three Sky Glory Patriarchs, besides the Third Patriarch who was still in the floating tower, the First and Second Patriarchs had already gone to the Void Forbidden Land and become one of the 34 Void Masters under Void God.","Just as Void God led the crowd to set off the horn of the battle of Great Catastrophe and officially attack the Divine Power Universe, an old man in a black robe on the top floor of the floating tower, who had a rotten and ancient aura, slowly opened his eyes.","A sharp ray of light flashed through his muddy eyes.","“Has the Great Catastrophe War begun?”","This man was the Sky Glory Holy Land’s Third Patriarch!","“I hope this Great Catastrophe won’t end so quickly. I’ve been waiting for far too long, and I want to go up...”","The Third Patriarch muttered to himself, then closed his eyes again.","In this battle of the Great Catastrophe, Void Gods could be said to have gathered all the top combat forces of the entire Void Universe. They were going all out.","However, Void God did not gather all the top forces in the Void Forbidden Land. Instead, they divided them into several waves and kept changing. If any of the experts in front died or were seriously injured, they would retreat and be replaced.","The Sky Glory Holy Land’s Third Patriarch and the Palace Lord of the Dark Yin Palace were in charge of the later waves of reinforcements.","...","At the same time.","In another Void Forbidden Land of the Void Universe.","This place was shrouded in bone-corroding black fog and chilly wind all year round. It was a famous Void Forbidden Land in the Void Universe. Even a Scar level Void Master would be blown away by the black fog and chilly wind if they came to this Void Forbidden Land.","Therefore, the Void Universe was terrified of this Void Forbidden Land and never dared to set foot in it.","However, the people at the peak of the Void Universe knew that this Void Forbidden Land was where the Devourers, the most mysterious organization in the entire universe, was located.","At this moment, in the center of the Void Forbidden Land.","An ancient bronze coffin was floating in the sky.","The ancient bronze coffin was covered with mysterious blood-like patterns. Wisps of black mist and cold wind spread out from the cracks of the coffin.","If anyone were to see this scene, they would definitely be dumbfounded and shocked.","The black fog and Yin wind that could destroy even a Scar level Void Master was actually from a mere ancient bronze coffin.","Around the ancient bronze coffin, more than ten men and women in black clothes with powerful auras were sitting cross-legged quietly.","If Jian Wushuang were here, he would have realized that some of the men and women with powerful auras were the mysterious experts who had chased after him in Nine Luminaries Great Star Field of the Divine Power Universe.","As Void God led the Void Masters to attack the Divine Power Universe, the dozen men and women sitting cross-legged with their eyes closed seemed to sense something and opened their eyes.","“Hehehehe, Void God is finally going to attack the Divine Power Universe?”","A seductive woman with two ponytails, black clothes that only covered her buttocks, and a large chest with the word ‘S’ printed on the left side of her bright and transparent forehead laughed.","Her name was Devour Four. She looked cute and playful like a young girl, but in fact, the number of people from the two universes who died in her hands was more than all the disciples of the God Refining Sect combined.","“Hehe, the two universes have been peaceful for too long. There’s going to be a good show to watch this time.”","Another man from devour said with a faint smile.","Very quickly, these ten or so black-robed men started discussing in low voices. Their faces were filled with excitement and strangeness. From their words and actions, no matter if they were Void Gods or Cosmos Gods, they did not have the slightest bit of respect for them.","Just as everyone was discussing, an evil and lazy voice came out from the ancient bronze coffin.","“Devour One, Devour Two, Devour Three... Devour Seven, you guys go to the two universes and take a look.”","This sentence was obviously very ordinary, but his voice was full of charm, as if there were thousands of accentuations, constantly repeating in his ears.","“Yes, Lord devouring Emperor.”","Hearing this man, all seven of them stood up.","Each of these seven people had a powerful aura, and the man called Devour One had a profound cultivation base. Even a Six Scar Void Master would feel weak in front of him.","He wore a red mask on his face, only revealing one eye. This eye actually had three pupils.","“Go on.”","A strange sound wave that seemed to be made up of countless sounds came from the bronze mirror.","In the next moment, the bodies of seven people, from Devour One to Devour Seven, began to melt starting from their feet.","...","After the seven of them left, the Void Forbidden Land gradually returned to peace, leaving only the mumbling laughter from the ancient bronze coffin.","“Xuan Yi, I’ll give you the results of the two universes you’ve chosen.”","“Hurry up and show yourself. I can’t help but wring your head off!”","...","With the activation of the second Great Catastrophe War, the entire Void Universe was in turmoil. Countless ancient experts who were in seclusion were all awakened.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting cross-legged in the Sect Master’s bedroom of the God Refining Sect, suddenly opened his eyes.","“What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. Then, he disappeared. When he reappeared, he was already in the sky above the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the sky. Suddenly, his pupils shrank as if he had seen something extraordinary."]},{"number":4543,"title":"Chapter 4543 The Almighty Awakens","paragraphs":["4543 The Almighty Awakens","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed.","He could see the countless Qi activities and fate energy of the Void Universe all surging toward the Void Forbidden Land.","“This... could it be that the Great Catastrophe War has begun?”","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","!!","Following that, a transmission from Cosmos God connected with Jian Wushuang.","“Lord Cosmos God, has the Great Catastrophe War started?” Jian Wushuang asked after taking a deep breath.","“That’s right. Void God has completely awakened and led the army of the Void Universe to attack the Divine Power Universe!”","Cosmos God’s tone had never been so heavy before.","“Then, what should I do?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Cosmos God pondered for a moment before saying, “Jian Wushuang, don’t do anything for now. When the people in the Void Universe completely let down their guard and enter the Divine Power Universe, I’ll contact you and you’ll plant the Fengtian Flag in the Void Forbidden Land to block their escape!”","“At that time, your mission will be completed, and this old man will do his best to kill them all!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang could feel the killing intent in Cosmos God’s voice even though it was just a message!","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang nodded heavily and said, “Alright!”","Although what Jian Wushuang wanted to do most now was to return to the foreign battlefield and kill everyone to vent his anger, he knew that he had more important things to do.","In the battlefield, Jian Wushuang’s absence would not affect the situation.","However, what he was going to do next would, to a large extent, completely determine the life and death of the two universes!","“Well, Jian Wushuang, the situation is urgent, so I won’t talk to you anymore. I’ll contact you when I need you to set up the Fengtian Flag.”","After saying that, Cosmos God hurriedly hung up the transmission.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Not long after the message was hung up, the five great Grand Elders, including Grand Elder Mi Feng, Grand Elder Chen Gu, and Grand Elder Ban Shan, all soared into the sky and stood beside Jian Wushuang.","They squinted and looked up into the sky, and they all caught the invisible Qi that kept surging toward the Void Forbidden Land.","Only Elder Mi Feng let out a soft sigh.","“The Great Catastrophe War is about to start. No matter if we win or lose, we will all pay a painful price. Why bother?”","After saying this, Elder Mi Feng let out a soft sigh.","He was a rare non-warmonger in the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang and Elder Ban Shan did not speak. They just looked at each other.","The two of them knew that the battle that would change the fate of their two universes had arrived!","...","At the same time.","In the Offworld Battlefield, Cosmos God had borrowed Jian Wushuang’s name list and had already made various plans to deal with the 34 Void Masters.","The Divine Power Universe was the main battlefield because of the Great Catastrophe. Therefore, the Divine Power Universe was several times more powerful than the Void Universe!","On this day, the entire Divine Power Universe rumbled and the Great Dao wailed. The sky was gray and heavy rain fell.","The heavy rain covered the entire divine power universe. Countless thunderbolts exploded, and silver snakes danced like lightning.","The entire Divine Power Universe seemed to have fallen into an apocalyptic world.","Countless cultivators looked up at the sky in horror. They sent out their divine power and sensed that something was wrong. However, no matter how hard they tried, they could not figure out anything.","As for the top sects in the Divine Power Universe, such as the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Cosmos Temple, and the Divine Life Palace, they all received the message from Cosmos God.","As a result, the ancient mighty figures who had fallen into deep sleep woke up one after another.","...","Divine Life Palace.","After tens of thousands of years of recuperation, the Divine Life Palace had finally recuperated.","Not only that, but Supreme Xue Bo had also broken through to the Half Invincible Supreme realm. He was now the strongest person in the Divine Life Palace.","As for Supreme Jun Fu, he had completely recovered from his previous injuries. Furthermore, his divine body seemed to have been reconstructed, and he was even more powerful than before. If he was allowed to grow, it wouldn’t be long before he broke through to become a Half Invincible Supreme.","In addition, many ordinary Supremes had died in the Divine Life Palace. For example, the Ruler Demonic Wind, who had once had a conflict with Jian Wushuang, had broken through to the Primary Supreme realm.","Moreover, perhaps because the Cosmos Palace had also suffered great losses and was busy recuperating, a large amount of new blood had entered the Divine Life Palace.","Although there were no Perfect Life Forms like Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King, there were only a handful of Special Life Forms at the Creation Stage.","It could be predicted that the Divine Life Palace would be full of vitality in the future, and all kinds of new talents would spring up like bamboo shoots after the rain.","At that time, the Divine Life Palace would reach a new peak!","Just as the second Great Catastrophe War broke out, Xue Bo, Jun Fu, and the other Supremes, who had been in the middle of a discussion in the Supreme Temple, changed their expressions. Their figures suddenly swept out and came to the empty hall.","Above the Nine Heavens, the Qi dynamic was in chaos as violent thunderbolts exploded continuously with crackling sounds. Electric snakes shuttled and danced in the gray clouds, emitting white lightning. The strong wind roared like a giant beast, as if it was roaring in one’s ears.","The faces of Supreme Xue Bo and the others immediately changed.","They were all powerhouses who had participated in the Great Catastrophe. Although they were still weak at that time and only played the role of flag-waving and cheering, they were all too familiar with this scene.","This was the result of the collision of the laws between the two universes, resulting in the fluctuations of the universe!","“Jun Fu, Tian Yi, you two are in charge of guarding the Divine Life Palace. I’ll go to the Offworld Battlefield to take a look,” Supreme Xue Bo said in a deep voice after taking a deep breath.","Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi exchanged a glance upon hearing this, before nodding solemnly.","...","The Great Catastrophe War was related to the survival of the universe. If it was not for the fact that the Divine Life Palace had to send people to guard it, they would have wanted to go to the Offworld Battlefield.","“Alright, I’ll take my leave then.”","Supreme Xue Bo’s expression was grave. He took a step forward and transformed into a streak of light that shot into the sky.","Before he could rush out, an ancient, vast, and gentle force gently dragged him down.","The next moment.","An aged voice rang in their ears.","“Xue Bo, you stay in the Divine Life Palace. I’ll go.”","Supreme Xue Bo, Supreme Jun Fu, and Supreme Tian Yi were momentarily stunned when they heard this voice. However, they were soon overjoyed and turned around to look.","“Lord Gai Fu?!”"]},{"number":4544,"title":"Chapter 4544 Rising Together","paragraphs":["4544 Rising Together","“Lord Gai Fu?!”","Supreme Xue Bo, Supreme Jun Fu, and Supreme Tianyi all turned their heads to look.","An old man with age spots all over his face and turbid eyes walked out of the Divine Life Palace.","After sleeping for hundreds of thousands of years, the aura of decay on Supreme Artist Gai Fu’s body had become even stronger. His entire body was shriveled, his eyes were sunken, and he was emaciated.","!!","However, his appearance was like a stabilizing force that instantly calmed the anxious Supreme Xue Bo and the other two.","From the moment they joined the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Master Gai Fu had actually been with them for far longer than the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.","In their hearts, they had long since regarded Supreme Gai Fu as their Elder.","“Lord Gai Fu.”","Supreme Xue Bo and the others hurriedly walked over and reached out to support Supreme Gai Fu, who was in his last years.","When Supreme Artist Gai Fu saw this, he could not help but smile and wave his hand, saying, “I’m not old enough to need you to help me.”","Supreme Xue Bo and the others sniffed upon hearing this.","In the past, Supreme Gai Fu was full of mettle. In the end, he fought several ancient Six Scar Void Masters during the Great Catastrophe War, causing him to be seriously injured and his life source to be destroyed.","If he had gone into secluded meditation to recuperate, his injuries would have been completely healed, but the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had sent word that he had no choice but to suppress his injuries and step out of the Divine Life Palace to stand guard over it for 100,000 chaos cycles, making sure that no one would ever be able to harm it.","In the end, when the Six Forces besieged the Divine Life Palace, he fought the Dragon clan alone for Jian Wushuang and fell into a deep sleep.","It could be said that the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had founded the Divine Life Palace, but the person who had truly made the Divine Life Palace stand tall and unshaken was Supreme Gai Fu!","Supreme Gai Fu had given up his entire life for the Divine Life Palace.","The entire Divine Life Palace was in awe.","“Where’s Jian Wushuang?” Supreme Gai Fu asked with a smile.","“Lord Gai Fu, Jian Wushuang went to the Offworld Battlefield nearly 10,000 years ago,” Supreme Xue Bo replied.","“Oh? Weren’t only Supreme experts allowed to go to the Offworld Battlefields? This little fellow has broken through to the Supreme realm?”","Supreme Gai Fu’s eyebrows twitched as he asked in surprise.","“That’s right. Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme realm after the Universe Great Clan Gathering. He defeated the Six Forces all by himself. Apart from the Dragon clan and Cosmos Temple, which still exist, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and other superpowers have all been destroyed.”","The Xue Bo Supreme nodded.","When he mentioned Jian Wushuang, he could not help but look proud.","He had brought Jian Wushuang into the Divine Life Palace!","He was proud of Jian Wushuang’s achievements.","Supreme Gai Fu was silent for a moment. After a long time, he said heavily, “Alright!”","It was a simple word, but it was filled with gratification and acknowledgment of Jian Wushuang.","After saying that, Supreme Gai Fu stood with his hands behind his back and looked up at the sky. He smiled and said to himself, “In this case, I can be completely at ease. As long as we survive this Great Catastrophe, the Divine Life Palace will definitely shine and shine under Jian Wushuang’s leadership in the future.”","As soon as he finished speaking, no one noticed that a look of determination to die had already flashed across Supreme Gai Fu’s eyes.","He understood his body the best.","It had long reached the point of no return.","Now, he was only willing to use his body to make the most brilliant strike for the Divine Power Universe!","Bang! Bang!","With a single step, Supreme Gai Fu soared into the sky and shot toward the Offworld Battlefield.","Supreme Xue Bo, Supreme Jun Fu, and the others exchanged glances and sighed.","...","At the same time.","In the Glacial Forbidden Land of the Divine Power Universe.","This was the place where the Overlord Patriarch was.","In the Glacial Forbidden Land, under a hundred thousand feet glacier.","A brawny, bare-chested old man exuded an air of authority and dominance as he sat cross-legged.","He was like a fireball in a furnace. The extremely cold glaciers could not get close to him at all. The bone-piercing cold air was melted by this old man as soon as it came over.","“Those otherverse trash are starting to cause trouble again, huh...”","A low voice came out of the mouth of the Overlord Patriarch.","Then, he slowly opened his eyes, and an extremely hot golden light burst out from his eyes.","“Back then, that Void Emissary managed to escape from me. This time, he won’t be able to escape.”","His shoulder shook slightly.","Crack, crack!!!","In an instant, the glacier, which was tens of thousands of feet tall, started to crack like a glass mirror that had fallen to its death. Then, it shattered with a loud bang!","A figure as hot as the sun rose into the sky and flew toward the battlefield.","...","In a remote Star Field, on a planet where mortals lived.","The streets were bustling with noise and countless mortals were walking around.","...","At the entrance of an inn.","An old beggar in tattered clothes, one could vaguely see that he was wearing a starry Daoist robe, was leaning against the door frame of the inn. He held a wine gourd covered in dust in his hand and raised his head to drink. He muttered in a half-drunk and half-awake voice, “I have dreamed for 3,000 years, and I have gained countless Epiphanies”","The passers-by all looked at the crazy alcoholic with disgust. Even the young children ran away when they smelled the alcohol on the old beggar.","“Hey, you crazy alcoholic old beggar. If you want to lie down, go somewhere else. Don’t block our business.”","The inn’s waiter covered his nose and kicked the old beggar in disgust.","“Hehe, I’ll go now...”","The old beggar opened his hazy and drunk eyes and glanced at the waiter. He grinned, revealing his mouth that was missing a front tooth.","Then, he took a step forward and flew up to the sky.","“Umm... umm...”","The surrounding passersby and the disdainful waiter were all stunned.","“Its a God!”","...","Immediately, countless people knelt down and kowtowed.","The old beggar took a second step forward.","Today, he had once again entered the Unparalleled Supreme stage!","...","At the center of the universe.","A sword mountain was suspended in the air. At the entrance of the sword mountain, there was a plaque with four big words written on it.","Starry Sky Sword Sect!","On this day, 13 flying swords came out of the mountain and sailed into the starry sky like a small boat!","On this flying swords, 13 experts’ clothes fluttered in the wind, showing the elegance of sword Immortals.","Standing on the first flying sword with her hands behind her back was a tall woman in red sleeveless silk armor. Her hair was tied up with a wooden hairpin in it, and she had a cold expression.","She was Wu Jianxian, the number one swordsman in the world!","The Sword Qi filled the sky, and the boundless starry sky seemed to be split into two.","...","Similar scenes were happening in the Divine Power Universe.","On this day.","Whether it was Supreme Gai Fu who had just woken up from a deep sleep... Or the old beggar who had looked at the world in a drunken state... Or the number one person in the world who had come out of the Heavenly Mountain and dominated the starry sky, Supreme Wu Jianxian...","Their destination was the same place.","That was the Offworld Battlefield!"]},{"number":4545,"title":"Chapter 4545 Left Ear","paragraphs":["4545 Left Ear","On this day, the universe was in turmoil!","In the billions of miles of the universe, in the major Star Fields, from time to time, there would be legends of ‘Immortals appearing’.","These so-called Immortals did not like to form groups or factions. Instead, they traveled alone in the universe, measuring the earth with their feet and comprehending the mortal heart with their divine heart.","They usually did not care about anything in the universe, but now, for the safety of the universe, they all revealed their true bodies and rushed to the Offworld Battlefield!","!!","The Overlord Patriarch, White Ape; The old beggar, Immortal Hulu; Emperor Ling Tian, Xing Dou Patriarch...","The ancient powers that had once ruled over the universe were all revived and walked out of the universe toward the Offworld Battlefield.","Other than that.","The three overlords of the universe — the Dragon race, the Qilin race, and the Phoenix race — also had powerful beings walking out from their ancestral lands.","At the beginning of the universe, when the chaos was just started, the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin fought for the position of the Overlord of the universe and suffered heavy casualties. Not long after that, the Great Catastrophe War broke out. The Ancestral Dragon of the Dragon clan who won the great battle between the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin also died in the Great Catastrophe War. Following that, mighty figures from the Phoenix and Qilin clans also died in the Great Catastrophe.","The Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans had completely declined. They each found a Forbidden Land to cultivate in seclusion and recuperate.","Thus, Cosmos God rose to power and won the battle of the Great Catastrophe, becoming true Master of the Universe.","Now that the Great Catastrophe War started again, even if the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin races did not want to contribute, they could only pinch their noses and force a few of their sleeping patriarchs, to rush to the Offworld Battlefield under the call of Cosmos God.","Countless ordinary cultivators who did not know the inside story felt a knot in their hearts even though they did not know what had happened.","The sky was about to change.","This was a brilliant era that had never been seen before!","...","And at this moment.","In the Void Universe.","There were also countless almighties who had awakened. However, they did not rush to the Void Forbidden Land immediately like the Divine Power Universe. Instead, they waited quietly for the Void Gods to dispatch them.","At the same time, in the God Refining Sect, in the Sect Master’s bedroom.","Jian Wushuang and Ban Shan sat cross-legged.","“Jian Wushuang, what should we do next?” Elder Ban Shan asked worriedly.","He had stayed in the Void Universe for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, so he knew exactly how powerful it was.","The top fighting power of the Void Universe was not much more than that of the Divine Power Universe in terms of numbers, but in terms of actual fighting power, it was stronger than the Divine Power Universe.","For example, Snake God who dominated the universe when the Void God was asleep was not much weaker than the Void God.","Moreover, the Void Universe still had the Devourers, a special existence.","“Bide our time and wait for the next order.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he spoke.","When Elder Ban Shan heard this, he could not help but be taken aback. He said in surprise, “We’re just not doing anything?”","“That’s right, a little impatience will mess up the overall situation.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Before the second Great Catastrophe completely erupted, his heart was filled with uneasiness.","However, when the Great Catastrophe truly broke out, Jian Wushuang found that his state of mind had calmed down.","There was a saying among mortals, “Two tigers can not live on the same mountain. Where there was Jianghu, there would be fighting and killing.”","This sentence was equally appropriate in the universe.","From the moment the channel between the two universes was opened, it was destined that only one side would emerge victorious.","“Alright.” Ban Shan bitterly smiled and shook his head.","At the same time, he looked at Jian Wushuang’s calm face and could not help but feel emotional.","Jian Wushuang was so young, but his ability to remain calm was so profound that he could still maintain his rationality and calm when war broke out.","This made him feel inferior.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll take my leave first. If anything happens, let me know immediately. I’ll cultivate in seclusion for a while,” Ban Shan said after taking a deep breath.","“Alright.”Jian Wushuang nodded. He knew that Ban Shan was not calm. If he was not calm, he would not be able to think rationally. Once he could not think rationally, he would reveal his flaws sooner or later.","Thus, it was the best choice for Ban Shan to go into seclusion.","After Ban Shan left, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on his seat and his eyes flickered.","He knew that all he had to do now was to wait!","This morning, he had already spoken to Cosmos God.","Cosmos God told him that the battle between the two universes could not be considered a direct confrontation yet. They were still in the process of probing and rubbing against each other. Cosmos God did not intend to reveal his strength and directly engage in a life-and-death battle with the Void Universe.","After that, Jian Wushuang would take the net!","After pondering for a while, Jian Wushuang received a message from Luo Ming, the Chief of the Crimson Whale Gang.","“Young Master.” Luo Ming’s respectful voice came.","He had been paying attention to the Void Forbidden Land and had a rough idea of the battle.","From this, Jian Wushuang’s identity was naturally revealed.","However, even though he understood this, he did not point it out.","From the moment Jian Wushuang planted the restriction in his life source, he knew that his life no longer belonged to the universe or even himself.","It only belonged to one person, Jian Wushuang!","He would be the fiercest dog under Jian Wushuang and he would only serve Jian Wushuang.","...","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Luo Ming, from now on, split up all Crimson Whale Gang members and withdraw from the various top factions and the Void Forbidden Land. We don’t want Crimson Whale Gang to exist either. Only the core members who have set up the restriction will be allowed to go underground and change their name.”","Now that the Great Catastrophe War had begun, Jian Wushuang had to find a way to hide all his secrets at this critical moment.","“We’re dispersing”","Luo Ming was startled when he heard this, but he nodded without hesitation and replied, “Young Master, I understand. If you want to change the name, what should we call ourselves?”","Jian Wushuang thought about it. Luo Ming and the others were acting as his eyes and ears in the Void Universe.","Since that was the case...","“How about this, you guys will call yourselves ‘Left Ear’ in the future.”","“Serve me for ten million years. After ten million years, I will remove the restriction and return you your freedom.”","Jian Wushuang finished his words indifferently.","Ten million years later, the war between the two universes would have ended. At that time, it would not be a problem to return their freedom.","“Alright!” Luo Ming clenched his fists, his heart slightly excited.","...","“Okay, I’ll contact you again if there’s anything.” Jian Wushuang cut off communication with Luo Ming and walked out of the Sect Master’s hall. He came to the railing where he could overlook the entire God Refining Sect.","The sky turned dark and heavy snow fell from the sky, covering the God Refining Sect in white.","A snowflake fell on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder.","Jian Wushuang tightened his Sect Master’s cloak and looked at the dark sky. He muttered to himself, “The middle of winter has arrived, and the eternal night is coming.”"]},{"number":4546,"title":"Chapter 4546 The Wind Rises","paragraphs":["4546 The Wind Rises","Time flew by, and three days passed.","To cultivators, three days passed in the blink of an eye. However, to the current Void Universe and Divine Power Universe, it was extremely slow.","Although there were various top-notch existences in the Divine Power Universe that had gone to the Offworld Battlefield to help Cosmos Gods, Cosmos Gods did not choose to engage in a decisive battle with the Void Universe. Instead, they chose to retreat in a roundabout way.","Meanwhile, the Void Universe was closing in step by step, compressing the living space of Cosmos God and the others.","!!","At the same time, in the battlefield outside the Divine Power Universe.","The Void Warriors of the Void Universe had already set up camp and completely occupied it.","In a tent in the middle of the camp.","Void God, who was surrounded by endless black mist, sat on a large chair.","On his two sides were the Left and Right Void Emissaries, and below him were the 34 Void Masters.","They were discussing their next battle plan.","A Void Master who had countless tentacles quickly walked into the tent and knelt down in front of Void God. He said, “Void God Lord, the people from the Divine Power Universe still haven’t started a direct battle with us. Instead, they retreated after one attack and kept shrinking their defense line.”","Void God sat on the main seat and did not speak. Instead, he raised his head and narrowed his eyes, making it impossible for others to understand what he was thinking.","The emissary of the right standing next to him was a skinny old man wearing a shaman’s feathered hat. He said softly, “Void God Lord, there must be something wrong if things are abnormal. This Divine Power Universe isn’t fighting us head-on. Instead, it keeps retreating. I’m afraid there’s some scheme.”","As soon as he said this, the other Void Masters also frowned and said, “That’s right, Void God Lord. This Divine Power Universe is obviously setting a trap to lure us in. I think they’ve set up an ambush not far ahead.”","In the main camp, there was a lot of discussion.","Void God looked at them indifferently, and a magical voice came out of his mouth.","“So what if there’s an ambush? So what if they have schemes? One man can overcome ten.”","After saying that, he shook his head and waved his hand.","“Pass down the order. If you see anyone from the Divine Power Universe, don’t stay back to test them. Kill them directly. If they don’t want to fight with us, we’ll fight them.”","“The initiative has never been in their hands, but in our hands.”","His words were plain, but his words were filled with a terrifying domineering aura that showed that he did not respect the enemy at all.","“No matter how many schemes and plots you have, I’ll take you down by force! Overbearing suppression!”","...","Within the Divine Power Universe.","The Void Warriors all boarded the dragon bone ship and slowly retreated.","Cosmos God stood on the deck of a dragon bone ship with his hands behind his back. He raised his head and looked at the starry sky in the distance.","There was a connection between great beings. He could sense that 100,000 void eras ago, the being in the Void Universe was not far from him, looking at him through the air.","Void God!","His old enemy!","“Lord Cosmos God, the people from the Void Universe seem to have sensed that we are keeping them in check. They have not been attacking rashly in the recent few attacks.”","The leader of Team 8, Supreme Sui Xi, who was famous in the universe for her divine ability ‘One Qi for Three Purities’, stood beside Cosmos God and said softly.","His eyes were filled with worry.","Just as the Void God had said, their Divine Power Universe had set up countless killing formations to kill Immortals and Gods in their base camp tens of thousands of miles away from the Offworld Battlefield!","Each of the killing formations was not only powerful, but Cosmos God had also made use of the list that Jian Wushuang had given him. Each killing formation had a specific attribute that could restrain the enemy.","Once the people of the Void Universe fell into the trap, what awaited them would be a storm of thunderous attacks!","“It’s okay. I know Void God. He always values power above all else. He’s invincible. Don’t worry. He won’t back down. On the contrary, he’ll increase his attack.”","Cosmos God chuckled.","This was an old enemy of his that he had fought for 100,000 chaos cycles. Thus, Cosmos God was extremely familiar with the nature of Void God.","Moreover...","To Cosmos God, the countless killing formations were merely a pretense to attract their attention. The real killing move was Jian Wushuang!","However, Cosmos God did not tell anyone about these plans.","The Captain of Team 8, Sui Xi, took a deep breath and said, “Alright, I hope so.”","...","Three days later.","“Lord Cosmos God, it’s just as you expected. The Void Warriors of the Void Universe have launched a fierce attack!”","The Captain of Team 8, Sui Xi, rushed over and said excitedly.","With the countless killing formations, the current Divine Power Universe was not afraid of the Void Universe becoming reckless. It was afraid of the Void Universe becoming cautious!","Now that the Void Universe had launched a fierce attack and was in hot pursuit of them, they had fallen into their trap.","“Alright, don’t fight with them. Drag them into the killing array.”","Cosmos God nodded and waved Supreme Sui Xi away. After that, he started to communicate with Jian Wushuang.","...","Within the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and was cultivating.","“Jian Wushuang.” Cosmos God’s words reverberated in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","...","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and there was a flash of light in his eyes.","“Lord Cosmos God, are you going to start the plan?”","“That’s right. Jian Wushuang, you can go to the Void Forbidden Land now and set up the Fengtian Flag.”","Cosmos God nodded. He then took in a deep breath and his expression turned solemn.","“Jian Wushuang, your task is of utmost importance. You must succeed!”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and a determined look flashed in his eyes.","Even if he died nine times, he would not regret it!","“Finally.”","Cosmos God paused for a moment before his tone turned gentler. He said deeply, “Jian Wushuang, come back alive after this. I’ll wait for you in the universe.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Don’t worry, I’ll come back alive.”","After that, Jian Wushuang hung up the communication with Cosmos God.","...","The Sect Master’s sleeping chamber fell silent.","Jian Wushuang stood up and walked out of the Sect Master’s hall with a calm look in his eyes.","The slightly cold wind ruffled Jian Wushuang’s black hair.","“The wind rises,” Jian Wushuang looked up at the sky and muttered to himself.","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and was already outside the Star Field where the God Refining Sect was located.","Standing in the starry sky, Jian Wushuang had already changed into a loose black robe.","He lowered his head and looked at the God Refining Sect. He understood that he would probably never return here again.","“Goodbye.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang pulled up the wide hood of his black robe and pulled down the edge of the hood, revealing only his chin.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s body turned into a bolt of lightning and shot toward the Void Forbidden Land!"]},{"number":4547,"title":"Chapter 4547 Entering the Arena","paragraphs":["4547 Entering the Arena","In the vast universe.","A figure was shooting toward the Void Forbidden Land.","The God Refining Sect was not far from the Void Forbidden Land. Hence, it did not take long for Jian Wushuang to arrive at his destination.","When he arrived at the Void Forbidden Land, the defense was much tighter than before.","!!","There were Scar level Void Masters everywhere, guarding the entrances.","The ranks of these Void Masters were not high. Most of them only had Two or Three Scars. They had been selected by the Elders of the top sects and had not participated in the Great Catastrophe War. They were responsible for guarding the Void Forbidden Land.","“You at the front. Who are you?”","A middle-aged man with bright eyes and a halo of the great path behind him looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Your Excellency, I’m Luo Ming.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and pushed down his hood, revealing a face that was exactly the same as Luo Ming’s.","At the same time, a faint fluorescent light streaked across Cosmos God’s token on his waist, causing his aura to become indiscernible.","“Luo Ming?”","The middle-aged man who was sitting cross-legged and guarding the entrance raised his eyebrows.","He had heard of the name Luo Ming before.","He was the notorious leader of Crimson Whale Gang. He had always made a living by robbing others. Although he was not weak, he did not have a good reputation in the universe. He often bullied the weak and feared the strong, committing all sorts of evil deeds. As a result, not many people thought highly of him.","In the eyes of this middle-aged man, Luo Ming was just an insignificant character.","What was this guy doing here?","Shaking his head, the middle-aged man revealed a mocking smile and said, “Luo Ming, what are you doing here instead of staying in your Crimson Whale Gang? There’s no one here that you can rob.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang pretended to be angry and glared at him. He grunted, “What nonsense are you talking about? Could it be that in your impression, I only know how to do those shady business?”","“Hahaha, isn’t that so?” The middle-aged man laughed mischievously, and the mocking look on his face became even more obvious.","“Alright, Luo Ming, this is not a place you should be. Go back to where you came from.”","The middle-aged man waved his hand and said impatiently, trying to send Jian Wushuang away.","“Get lost! Who do you think you are? Does your family own this Void Forbidden Land? You think I’ll leave just because you told me to?” Jian Wushuang glared at the middle-aged man and said fiercely.","Long before he entered the Void Forbidden Land, Jian Wushuang had already planned to impersonate Luo Ming.","Luo Ming was quite well-known in the Void Universe, but because of his status, he didn’t have many close friends.","In addition, the impression that Luo Ming gave to the public was that he was a devil incarnate. Even if he did something out of line, it was reasonable in everyone’s eyes, which was in line with his character.","These were all the labels on Luo Ming.","Hence, this was the most suitable identity for Jian Wushuang to enter the Void Forbidden Land.","As for the risk of forcing his way through, Jian Wushuang did not want to do so unless it was the last moment.","“You really have a foul mouth...”","The middle-aged man’s expression changed slightly when he heard this, and a cold look appeared in his eyes.","“I want you to leave. This is not a place you should be. Don’t you understand?”","The middle-aged man stood up as he spoke.","The powerful pressure of a fourth-level Void Master spread out from his body.","Although his cultivation realm was the same as ‘Luo Ming’, he was confident that ‘Luo Ming’ could not compare to him since he was born in the main sect.","If ‘Luo Ming’ dared to talk back to him, he would not mind teaching this notorious Crimson Whale Gang’s first master a good lesson.","“What’s wrong? You want to fight?” Jian Wushuang sneered and looked at the middle-aged man without fear.","With the identity of ‘Luo Ming’, Jian Wushuang was not worried at all that his seemingly arrogant performance would arouse any suspicion.","“You’re looking for death!”","The middle-aged man’s eyes flashed coldly and he said, “Luo Ming, you’re usually doing evil things. It’s fine if you don’t cause any big trouble, but now you actually dare to provoke me. Do you think that I am one of those soft persimmons you can pinch at will?”","Whoosh!","A black bone blade was pulled out from the middle-aged man’s body.","A surge of void power exploded from his hand!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly, but his expression did not change. He took a step forward and looked straight at the middle-aged man.","Their gazes collided in the air, creating countless invisible sparks.","A pin against an awn!","Just as the two of them were about to fight.","An unexpected voice suddenly came from the distance.","“Luo Ming? What are you doing here?”","Then, he saw a red-robed elder. After seeing Jian Wushuang, he was stunned at first, then his face lit up with joy and he quickly came to greet him.","“Hey, Void Master Hei Dao, Luo Ming, why are you two fighting?”","When the red-robed old man approached, he saw that the atmosphere between Jian Wushuang and the middle-aged man was not right. He immediately thought to himself, “Oh no.”","He and Luo Ming could be considered as good friends, and he knew Luo Ming’s temperament the best.","With a bitter smile, the red-robed old man immediately became the peacemaker.","...","The middle-aged man obviously knew the red-robed old man. He snorted coldly and said with an ugly expression, “Hong Fo, you can ask this person yourself. He kept asking me to get lost. He spoke rudely. I’m already being kind by not killing him.”","Jian Wushuang’s mind was racing. The red-robed elder was one of the few good friends the real Luo Ming had in the universe.","Later on, he had to find an opportunity to ask Luo Ming about the situation of this red-robed old man, otherwise, it was very likely that he would be exposed.","Although he had many thoughts in his mind, Jian Wushuang glared at him and pretended to be angry, “Hong Fo, this guy asked me to leave first. He’s just a gatekeeper. Does he really think he’s Lord Void God? We’re all in the same cultivation realm, what right does he have to order me around?”","“Luo Ming! Who are you calling a gatekeeper? I’m guarding the last line of defense for Lord Void God! Don’t talk nonsense!”","The middle-aged man’s face was filled with anger again.","“You’re really good at putting gold on your face.” Jian Wushuang sneered in disdain and retorted.","In just a few words, Jian Wushuang and the middle-aged man were about to fight again.","Seeing this, the red-robed elder felt a headache. He could not help but stop Jian Wushuang, who was still talking, and said with a bitter smile, “Alright, can you all give me some face and speak less?”","The red-robed old man saw that the two of them had suppressed their anger and stopped. He could not help but let out a sigh of relief. He turned to Jian Wushuang and asked, “By the way, Luo Ming, why did you suddenly come here?”","He remembered that Luo Ming did not know about the Great Catastrophe War.","..."]},{"number":4548,"title":"Chapter 4548 Setting up an Array","paragraphs":["4548 Setting up an Array","The Great Catastrophe War.","In the Divine Power Universe, it was a secret that only spread among the top-tier powers, and it was the same in the Void Universe.","Logically speaking, with Luo Ming’s strength, he was qualified to know about the Great Catastrophe. However, Luo Ming’s social relations were too poor and he had always been at odds with the top sects who knew about the news. Therefore, no one would naturally tell him.","The red-robed elder knew this.","!!","Therefore, he was also quite curious about how Luo Ming knew about the Great Catastrophe War.","Of course, Jian Wushuang already had an answer to this.","He raised his eyebrows and deliberately put on a nonchalant look. He pursed his lips and said, “What’s wrong? You’re the only ones allowed to know? There are many men in Crimson Whale Gangg who have informed me of this matter long ago.”","The red-robed old man could not help but nod with a bitter smile.","Although Crimson Whale Gang consisted of a bunch of small fry with few capable of taking on major responsibilities, they did have many members. It was not difficult for them to gather information.","“Luo Ming, I haven’t seen you for tens of millions of years, but you still speak with a sharp tongue,” the red-robed old man said with a sigh.","Before Jian Wushuang could answer, the middle-aged man, Void Master Hei Dao, sneered and replied, “So what if you know? What do you want to do now that you know? Do you really think you’ll be able to participate in the Great Catastrophe?”","Jian Wushuang also sneered and replied, “It’s not up to you to decide whether I will participate in the battle or not. I think you’re a busybody.”","“You!” Hearing this, Hei Dao venerable was furious.","The red-robed old man saw that the two of them were about to quarrel again, so he quickly put his hand on his forehead and said, “Alright, everyone, be quiet!”","Jian Wushuang and Master Hei Dao looked at each other, then snorted and stopped talking.","Taking a deep breath, the red-robed old man said, “Now is the time for our Void Universe to use people. Whether Luo Ming can participate in the battle is not up to the two of you, nor me. Wait here for a moment. Let me ask the master who is in charge of guarding the camp this time, Void Master Ba Huang.”","With that, the red-robed old man looked at the two of them and strode into the Void Forbidden Land.","After the red-robed elder left, Jian Wushuang relaxed a little.","There was no need to continue acting. They just had to wait for the results.","Therefore, he simply closed his eyes and looked down, turning a blind eye to Master Hei Dao’s fiery gaze.","...","The 87th crack in the Void Forbidden Land was completely sealed.","Among the densely packed palaces, there was a side hall with a few oil lamps.","The first batch of main forces of the Void Universe had already followed Cosmos God and entered the Divine Power Universe.","However, they still sent an expert to suppress the main camp in case of emergency.","A white-robed middle-aged man was sitting cross-legged on a futon, cultivating quietly.","Behind him, endless corpse Qi appeared automatically, forming a scene of mountains of corpses and seas of blood.","He was Void Master Ba Huang, the previous Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, and the person in charge of guarding the camp this time.","“Lord Ba Huang,” the red-robed old man quickly walked in and first respectfully called out softly.","Although Void Master Ba Huang was ranked at the bottom of the 34 Void Masters because they were all powerful figures who had been revived from the ancient times, he still had great prestige for Void Warriors who had not entered the Six Scar level.","“Hong Fo, what’s the matter?”","Void Master Ba Huang slowly opened his eyes and glanced at the red-robed elder. His tone was still polite.","Although the red-robed old man had yet to enter the Six Scars, he had been in the Five Scars level for tens of thousands of void eras. In terms of cultivation time, he had been in this realm for even longer than the Void Master Ba Huang.","However, on the path of cultivation, one’s strength was not determined by cultivation time, but by experience.","“Lord Ba Huang, Crimson Whale Gang’s Luo Ming has come to join us. He wishes to contribute in this upcoming Great Catastrophe War,” the red-robed old man said respectfully.","“Luo Ming? Is he the famous galactic pirate?” Void Master Ba Huang raised an eyebrow.","“That’s right, this is the person. Lord Ba Huang, I’ve known this Luo Ming for over a hundred void eras. Although he’s a little stubborn at times, he’s not weak and he’s not bad,” the red-robed old man said.","“Is that so?” Void Master Ba Huang rubbed his chin and smiled. “Then Hong Fo, you can decide for yourself. Let him see if there are any other cracks that need to be guarded and send him to guard them.”","For Void Master Ba Huang, it was not a big deal to arrange for Luo Ming. Moreover, the red-robed elder had just said that he was on good terms with Luo Ming, so he would do him a favor.","“Yes!”","The red-robed old man was slightly overjoyed and cupped his hands in gratitude toward Ba Huang.","In the dark of the Void Universe, countless people called this battle the ‘Battle of Deification’.","This was because if they won this battle, they would receive a reward from Lord Void God.","This was a rare opportunity.","Luo Ming could be considered as one of his best friends. The red-robed old man naturally hoped that this good friend of his would also be able to get such an opportunity.","After bidding farewell, the red-robed elder returned to the Void Forbidden Land.","“Luo Ming, come with me. Lord Ba Huang has already agreed to your request. I’ll bring you around to familiarize you with the Void Forbidden Land first. After that, I’ll find a place with weaker defense and let you take over,” the red-robed old man said with a smile.","“Hahaha, Hong Fo, you are the best.” Jian Wushuang laughed loudly and did not say any polite words. Instead, he reached out his hand and hit the red-robed elder’s chest heavily.","He triumphantly glared at the middle-aged man, whose face was terrifyingly dark. Then, he followed the red-robed elder and strode into the Void Forbidden Land.","“A small man intoxicated by success.”","The middle-aged man grunted in anger and sat back down. He closed his eyes and began to cultivate.","No one noticed that Jian Wushuang, who was following closely behind the red-robed elder, had a faint smile on his face.","A small black flag slipped from his sleeve and inserted itself into the void. Then, it disappeared without a trace.","Only Jian Wushuang could sense that the nearby void had been suppressed by the Fengtian Flag. With a thought from Jian Wushuang, the Fengtian Flag could be fully activated and seal off everything, forming a forbidden land!","...","“Luo Ming, I’ll bring you around the Void Forbidden Land first. I’ll also tell you what the situation is like in this Great Catastrophe War,” the red-robed old man walked in front and said.","Jian Wushuang had the same intention. When he heard the red-robed elder’s words, he was moved and nodded.","“Alright,” he said."]},{"number":4549,"title":"Chapter 4549 The Fate Energy of the Universe","paragraphs":["4549 The Fate Energy of the Universe","Time slowly passed.","The red-robed elder led Jian Wushuang to familiarize himself with the Void Forbidden Land.","“Luo Ming, there are void cracks everywhere in the Void Forbidden Land, and the magnetic field is chaotic. Our void consciousness often can’t spread out completely, or we may send some wrong information. Therefore, we need to measure inch by inch with our feet and get familiar with the terrain.”","The red-robed old man walked in front and said patiently.","!!","Jian Wushuang followed them without saying anything. He just kept looking at the Void Forbidden Land.","As the saying went, ‘What you get from paper will always feel shallow’.","Although Jian Wushuang had the detailed map of the Void Forbidden Land that Crimson Whale Gang had drawn for him and he had memorized it by heart, it was still somewhat different from seeing it with his own eyes.","As he walked, Jian Wushuang secretly set up the Fengtian Flag.","A few hours later, they were halfway through the Void Forbidden Land.","There were not many Fengtian Flags left in Jian Wushuang’s hand. The entire Void Forbidden Land was almost under his control.","At this moment, the red-robed elder stopped in his tracks.","“Luo Ming, I think you only know the general idea of the Great Catastrophe War. You don’t know the details. Today, I’ll tell you about the Great Catastrophe War in detail.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. To be honest, he did not know much about the Great Catastrophe War.","He believed that there must be an important reason he did not know about as to why Void God had attacked the Divine Power Universe like this. He attacked without caring about casualties. There must be other reasons besides pure ambition.","“Hurry up and tell me, don’t keep me in suspense,” Jian Wushuang urged, which was in line with Luo Ming’s character.","“Luo Ming, do you know about the existence of fate energy?” The red-robed elder turned around and smiled at Jian Wushuang.","“Fate energy?” Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. It was the first time he had heard such a thing.","“That’s right, it’s fate energy.” The red-robed old man nodded and replied, “Luo Ming, you’re still a Four Scar Void Master and you don’t have a deep understanding of fate. When you reach the Five Scar level, you’ll realize the importance of fate and luck.”","After a pause, the red-robed old man continued, “In the universe, it’s not rare to have a Five Scar level Void Master. Generally speaking, as long as you break through to the Scar level and don’t die halfway, after a long period of cultivation, you can reach the Five Scar level Void Master as long as you’re not too weak.”","However, although the Five Scar Void Master and the Six Scar Void Master seemed to be just a small difference, the actual difference was like heaven and earth. It was not an exaggeration to say that there was a natural chasm between them.","“To break through to the level of Six Scar Void Master, not only do you need top talent, comprehension, and the opportunity of seizing heaven and earth, but there is also the most crucial factor, which is luck! It’s fate!”","“All Six Scar Void Masters are considered the sons of the Heavenly law. Their own fate energy is already connected to this universe.”","“Therefore, since ancient times, almost no one has been able to defeat a Six Scar Void Master without entering being Six Scar level themselves!”","The red-robed old man’s eyes flickered, then he sighed and said, “I’ve been a Five Scar Void Master for tens of thousands of void eras. In terms of cultivation years, many Six Scar Void Masters are still behind me. However, on the path of cultivation, the one who has achieved success is the teacher. I have cultivated for so long, but I am still inferior to them. I am truly ashamed.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer but continued to think about the word ‘fate energy’ that the red-robed elder had mentioned.","It was not only difficult for a Five Scar Void Master to break through to the Six Scar level in the Void universe. In the Divine Power Universe, there was a world of difference between a Half Invincible Supreme and an Invincible Supreme.","There were many top-notch Supreme experts and Half Invincible Supreme experts in the universe, but there were pitifully few Invincible Supreme experts.","People like Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Jun Fu were considered extremely talented in the universe, but there was still a barrier before they could break through to become an Invincible Supreme.","He was probably also lacking the word ‘fate’, or ‘luck’.","“Luo Ming, the importance of the word ‘luck’ is not limited to this. For us, although we need luck or fate to break through from the Five Scar level Void Master to the Six Scar level Void Master, throughout the ages, there have been people who have broken through by force. However, it is absolutely impossible for a Six Scar Void Master to take that crucial step without luck!”","“The level above the Six Scar Void Master?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned and his eyes flickered.","If he did not guess wrong, Void God or Cosmos God should be at that level.","If that were the case, it would explain why the Six Scar Void Masters, ancient existences born from the chaos, spared no effort in attacking the Divine Power Universe.","It was probably because a universe had limited fate energy.","If a universe’s fate energy was divided into ten portions and a Void God already had seven portions, the only way for others to reach the Void God level was to attack another universe!","“What is that step called?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“This is not something I can come into contact with. I will only understand the specific situation after I have broken through to the Six Scar level,” the red-robed old man shook his head and said.","“Let’s go. I’ll take you to the place you’re guarding.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and did not ask further.","After two hours.","A huge basin appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Luo Ming, you’ll be in charge of guarding this place,” the red-robed old man said.","After a pause, the red-robed elder patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and said with a smile, “Usually, nothing major will happen. You just need to wait here for Void God to return in triumph and then receive the credit.”","After giving a few more instructions, the red-robed old man left.","Jian Wushuang looked around and sat down with his legs crossed. A Fengtian Flag slid down from his sleeve and inserted itself into the void. Then, it disappeared.","“Open.”","Jian Wushuang shouted and his dark golden eyes suddenly flickered with countless lights.","An invisible map appeared in his eyes.","This map was the Void Forbidden Land!","The Void Forbidden Land was almost full of Fengtian Flags. With just a thought, Jian Wushuang could instantly activate the formation and seal the Void Forbidden Land!","“There’s still one more place to go before the Fengtian Formation is complete,” Jian Wushuang looked at the 87th crack and muttered to himself.","“I have to hurry up and plant the Fengtian Flag in the 87th crack!” he muttered.","...","...","The next day.","Jian Wushuang stood up, as if he was tired of the boring guarding work, and swaggered around.","Many of the guards were surprised at first, but when they knew it was Luo Ming, they snorted and said nothing.","In their eyes, Luo Ming was just a country bumpkin who did not know how to follow the rules, so it was normal for him to do this.","After wandering around for a while, Jian Wushuang saw that the time was right. He immediately walked toward the 87th crack.","Three Fengtian Flags appeared in his hands."]},{"number":4550,"title":"Chapter 4550 The Completion of the Fengtian Array Formation","paragraphs":["4550 The Completion of the Fengtian Array Formation","Within the Void Forbidden Land.","In a loft, the red-robed old man held the railing with both hands and listened to the report from the servants about Luo Ming wandering around. He could not help but shake his head and said, “This old friend of mine has a really active personality. I knew he wouldn’t be so content. As expected, he can’t sit still after only one or two days of peace.”","After a pause, the red-robed old man turned around and asked, “Where is Luo Ming now?”","“Lord Hong Fo, Luo Ming should be heading to the 87th crack now.”","!!","The servant cupped his hands and said, “Yes.”","The red-robed old man nodded. He pondered for a while before saying, “This place is different from other places. I’d better go and see him. I don’t want to cause any trouble.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the red-robed old man took a step forward and walked toward the 87th crack.","...","The 87th crack was more heavily guarded than the other places.","From a distance, Jian Wushuang saw a huge building that looked like a beehive floating in the air. Behind the building, there was a crack about 30 meters wide that was constantly twisting.","This crack was the 87th crack, the bridge that connected the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe.","This was the most crucial part of sealing the Void Forbidden Land and cutting off the advanced army in the Divine Power Universe.","That was why Jian Wushuang had to plant three Fengtian Flags there.","Whoosh.","The first Fengtian Flag slid down from Jian Wushuang’s hand and disappeared in the void.","Then, Jian Wushuang walked toward the 87th crack.","“Halt!” Before he got close, he saw two long-necked weirdos in strange robes blocking his way.","Jian Wushuang glanced at them, scratched his head, and said casually, “Hey, my two brothers, I’m in charge of guarding the Void Forbidden Land. Let me go in and take a look.”","The two long-necked eccentrics looked at each other and frowned. “Without Lord Ba Huang’s summons, you are not allowed to enter this place!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly.","Ba Huang?","Was Void Master Ba Huang the person in charge of guarding this Void Forbidden Land?","Jian Wushuang’s mind was racing, but he muttered, “Then why don’t you just go and inform Lord Ba Huang?”","The two long-necked strongmen said, “Lord Ba Huang is currently speaking with Lord Void God. He will not accept any reporting now! Quickly return to the place you’re guarding!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang lowered his head.","He had just spoken to Cosmos God, and Cosmos God had told him that the war between the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe had already broken out. Cutting off their escape route could not be delayed.","“It seems like I can only use force,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","The next moment.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward. Before the two long-necked monsters could react, he had already turned into a flowing light and rushed toward the 87th crack.","“How audacious!”","“Impudent!”","The two long-necked monsters came back to their senses and immediately flew into a rage. They activated their void power and chased after Jian Wushuang.","Although the two long-necked monsters were only in charge of guarding the place, they were actually Two Scar Void Masters after unleashing their cultivation.","Their necks suddenly stretched like rubber and turned into giant pythons. Then, they wrapped around Jian Wushuang.","“Get lost.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed and he reached out his hands to grab the necks of the two long-necked monsters.","In his hands, countless wind and lightning surged.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed with a cold light. He twisted his hands and tied a knot on the two long-necked monsters’ rubber-like necks. Then, he slapped them away.","“Men! Someone has trespassed into the crack!”","The two long-necked monsters roared, and the entire Void Forbidden Land was filled with ear-piercing alarms.","Jian Wushuang had already arrived in front of the crack in the void.","A strong gust of wind came from the 87th void crack and it revealed a familiar aura.","The last two Fengtian Flags slipped out of Jian Wushuang’s hands and into the crack in the void.","In an instant, all the Fengtian Flags sensed each other and became one, firmly sealing off the Void Forbidden Land.","Then, Jian Wushuang started to communicate with Cosmos God.","“Lord Cosmos God, the Fengtian Flags have been placed in place. We can activate the formation at any time.”","...","Some distance away from the 87th void crack.","The red-robed old man was approaching, but before he could reach the 87th crack, a sharp alarm suddenly exploded in the sky.","“What’s the situation?”","The red-robed old man’s expression changed. He instantly thought of the servant who had just reported to him that Luo Ming had gone to the 87th rift.","Instantly, his eyelids twitched, and a bad feeling welled up in his heart.","“Could it be that Luo Ming, that guy, did something?”","Whoosh!","...","Instantly, the red-robed old man took a step forward, and his speed increased.","...","Beehive Palace complex.","Void Master Ba Huang was communicating with Void God.","All of a sudden, an ear-piercing alarm sounded.","“What?” Void Master Ba Huang frowned and apologized to Void God. He cut off the communication and said, “Men, what’s happening outside?”","A servant ran in in a hurry, knelt down, and said, “Lord Ba Huang, someone is trying to force his way into the 87th crack!”","“What?” Ba Huang’s face changed and his expression instantly turned dark. He asked coldly, “Who is the one who broke through the 87th crack?”","“Lord Ba Huang, it’s Luo Ming from Crimson Whale Gang!”","“Luo Ming? He’s so bold!”","Void Master Ba Huang snorted and strode out of the tent toward the crack.","...","...","At the entrance of the 87th void crack.","“Jian Wushuang, activate the Fengtian Flag immediately!”","Cosmos God said in a deep voice.","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded and took a deep breath.","99 Fengtian Flags appeared in his eyes.","“Activate!”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang spat out a word.","The sky and earth suddenly changed color. Countless gusts of wind whistled. The entire Void Forbidden Land let out a muffled roar as if there was an earthquake. The earth began to shake violently.","Dust flew up as palm-sized cracks spread out.","Pow!!!","Bolts of lightning struck down like thunder on a clear day, and all the void energy in the Void Forbidden Land was quickly sucked away by an invisible force.","Countless black chains appeared out of thin air and sealed the area within a hundred thousand feet.","“What’s going on?”","The red-robed elder and Void Master Ba Huang, who had just arrived at the crack, were both shocked. They looked up at the crack in the void and saw Jian Wushuang, who was still calm.","“Luo Ming! What have you done?”","“Quickly stop! Are you looking for death?”","The red-robed elder looked at Jian Wushuang in shock and anger.","At the same time, he felt a sense of uneasiness.","For some reason, he suddenly felt a sense of unfamiliarity when he looked at the calm Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4551,"title":"Chapter 4551 The Outbreak of a Battle","paragraphs":["4551 The Outbreak of a Battle","Bang! Bang!","Just as the red-robed elder was about to scold Jian Wushuang, Void Master Ba Huang had already turned into a streak of flowing light and reached out to grab Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked back at the two of them and sneered. He did not waste time talking to them. The moment the Fengtian Formation was activated, he stepped into the crack in the void.","“Die!”","!!","Void Master Ba Huang’s right hand reached out, but what he caught was only an afterimage.","Instantly, Void Master Ba Huang’s face turned extremely ugly.","The red-robed old man rushed to the side, his expression shocked and angry.","He had thought that with Luo Ming’s temperament, he would definitely cause some trouble, but he did not expect that he would cause such a great disaster.","Looking at the ashen expression of Void Master Ba Huang, the red-robed elder said guiltily, “Void Master Ba Huang, I’m sorry. I didn’t know Luo Ming would do such a thing...”","Before he could finish, Void Master Ba Huang looked at him coldly and said, “Hong Fo, can’t you tell that this man is not Luo Ming?”","“What?” The red-robed old man was startled upon hearing this, and he immediately began to carefully recall.","As he thought about it, he immediately thought of countless clues.","When he showed Jian Wushuang around the Void Forbidden Land, he talked to Jian Wushuang several times about the interesting things that happened between them, but Jian Wushuang brushed him off with vague words.","At first, he did not think in this direction, so he did not notice anything. Now that he thought about it, he could not help but think, that person must be afraid that he would be exposed.","“Then who is this person?” the red-robed old man’s heart skipped a beat as he asked.","“Hmph, it doesn’t matter who he is now. Hong Fo, you were the one who brought this person into the Void Forbidden Land. Just wait for Lord Void God to come back and question you.”","Void Master Ba Huang snorted.","In the past, given the red-robed elder’s years of cultivation experience, he would still be rather polite. However, on such a major event, Void Master Ba Huang would naturally not act as usual.","At the same time, he could not help but think of the image of the Sky Spider old monster. He had seen the black-robed man step into the crack in the void from the Divine Power Universe and enter the Void Universe.","“From the Divine Power Universe?” Void Master Ba Huang squinted his eyes and muttered to himself.","Immediately, Void Master Ba Huang stopped thinking and planned to contact Void God to inform him of the situation.","However, just as he was about to send a message to Void God, his expression changed drastically.","He realized that the communication line between him and Void God seemed to have been cut off by an invisible pair of scissors. He could not communicate with Void God at all.","“Something big is going to happen!”","Void Master Ba Huang’s heart sank. Since he could not communicate with Void God, he tried to step into the crack in the void and enter the divine power universe to talk to Void God face to face.","However, the moment he took that step, his heart turned cold.","There seemed to be an invisible barrier in front of the 87th crack, which completely blocked the path to the Divine Power Universe.","The channel between the two universes had been sealed!","Void Master Ba Huang understood what this meant. Since he could not go over, Void God and the others in the Divine Power Universe would naturally not be able to return.","This made Ba Huang feel as if he had fallen into an ice cellar and his body shivered.","“Hong Fo, you should atone for your sins with your death.”","Void Master Ba Huang turned around and stared at the red-robed elder.","...","Offworld Battlefield.","Jian Wushuang’s body turned from transparent to solid and finally, he was completely revealed.","“Whew.”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. With the successful activation of the Fengtian Formation, the heavy stone that had been weighing on his heart was finally lifted.","He looked around and saw that the Offworld Battlefield, which was originally an important place for militarists, was now empty. Only the shockwaves from the battle between the Supreme martial artists and the Void Masters and countless broken limbs were left.","Boom, boom, boom!","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked forward. His dark golden eyes were bloodshot.","His eyes pierced through thousands of miles of void space and saw the base camp of the Divine Power Universe, where the two universes were fighting!","“It’s my turn.” Jian Wushuang twisted his neck and his eyes were burning with fighting intent.","A strong desire to fight surged in his chest.","Bang!","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot and turned into a thunderbolt, shooting toward the battlefield.","...","In the base camp of the Divine Power Universe.","The people from both universes finally started a real war here, clashing with their weapons!","Countless killing formations were activated, killing the 34 Void Masters and the two Void Emissaries under Cosmic God, as well as the other Void Masters with Four and Five Scars.","The moon rose from the sea, the Celestial King descended from the Nine Heavens, and the Nine Stars were connected...","One after another, strange phenomena appeared in the starry sky.","The moment the two universes clashed, it was the time when they were at their most white and hot. The sound of killing filled the sky as countless spells collided. Each of them had the power to destroy stars and cut the Milky Way!","In terms of overall advantage, although the Divine Power Universe had the support of the killing formation, it still could not win against the Void Universe. The battle between the two sides was in a tit-for-tat situation.","...","Not to mention the nine teams under the command of Cosmos God and the battle between the Void Masters under the Six Scar level brought by Void God.","The scene of the fight between the Invincible Supremes and the Six Scar Void Masters was extremely terrifying.","The moment the battle started, Void God and Cosmos God had already split open space and entered another dimension to fight.","Therefore, what really shocked people and played a decisive role on the battlefield was the battle between a Six Scar Void Master and an Invincible Supreme.","The Overlord Patriarch, White Ape, who had awakened from the glacier and unparalleled physical strength, was fighting against one of the strongest fighting powers under Void God, the Right Void Emissary, who was also the white-haired, burly old man that Jian Wushuang had met once in the God Refining Sect.","They watched as Overlord Patriarch punched out. It was as if he was pushing a blazing sun. It emitted a golden light that caused the void to explode. Countless air was drawn out and smashed onto the body of the Right Void Emissary.","As for the Emissary, he had also exploded with unbelievable and terrifying strength.","The two thunder balls in his hands exploded and turned into a sea of thunder. It was as if the ancient Thunder God who controlled the Thunder Laws of the world had descended to the world. Terrifying thunderbolts came crashing down one after another toward Overlord Patriarch like a violent storm.","Every single bolt of lightning was more than enough to annihilate a Half Invincible Supreme!","At this moment, millions of Tribulation Lightning bolts of this level of power struck the body of the Overlord Patriarch. The power of this was simply indescribable.","The crazy alcoholic old beggar, who had also dominated the ancient era and later hid in the mortal world was fighting with the Left Void Emissary.","...","The crazy alcoholic pulled open the lid of the wine gourd, and a stream of primal chaos sunflower water gushed out like a river, submerging the Left Void Emissary, who looked like a mantis."]},{"number":4552,"title":"Chapter 4552 Each Displaying Their Own Abilities","paragraphs":["4552 Each Displaying Their Own Abilities","“Weak weak weak weak weak! Too weak! Right Emissary, it seems you haven’t made any progress in the past hundred thousand chaos cycles!”","The Overlord Patriarch swallowed the Tribulation Lightning and went head to head with the lightning. Each punch was enough to blow up hundreds of suns, and the force was extremely heavy and overbearing.","“I’ll get drunk 36,000 times, and I’ll get rid of eternal sorrow with you.” The crazy alcoholic, who looked like an old beggar, turned the entire galaxy into his water domain. The sound of waves rose.","Battles of such nature were constantly taking place in the starry sky.","Whether it was the unrivaled supremacy of the Divine Power Universe or the Six Scar Void Master of the Void Universe, each of them was a top figure who had led and dominated an era.","At this moment, these ancient powerhouses had all woken up from their long sleep, and their fight was extremely loud.","Some of them shattered the stars and moons with a finger, some of them shattered the Milky Way with a stomp, and some of them transformed into a hundred million feet tall figure and swallowed the starry sky in one gulp.","The shockwaves from their battle seemed to have destroyed countless great worlds. Chaos was about to boil and restart. Heaven and earth were about to crack and shatter.","It was not an exaggeration to say that it was the end of the world.","The overlords of the three races also showed their power.","An evil Dragon with eight claws swallowed a cluster of bright stars and turned it into the purest energy, shooting out a destructive Dragon Breath.","A seven-colored Phoenix soared into the sky after letting out a clear cry. Its body was burning with countless divine flames of the great path, turning the starry sky into a turbulent sea of fire. The void was burning with crackling sounds.","A Five Scar Void Master fell into the endless sea of fire and turned into ashes, not leaving any residue.","The Qilin race was even more terrifying. A three-headed Qilin would leave a flame mark in the void with every step it took. It exuded endless tyrant’s might, making people want to bow down and kowtow.","Their opponents were the First and Second Sky Glory Patriarchs, who had been sleeping since ancient times, and an old monster who was no weaker than them.","Facing these three people, the powerful cultivators of the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans had no chance of winning.","“Sword, come.”","The divine power of the number one Sword Dao in the universe was that of Wu Jianxian. With one sword, she could overturn millions of galaxies and suppress the starry sky.","A cold light flashed in her eyes. Although she was a woman, she was not weaker than anyone present. Sometimes she opened the Heavenly Gate with a sword strike, and sometimes her Sword Qi rushed into the sky.","Her strength had unknowingly reached a level that even Supreme Tarot might not have been able to reach.","There were also a few other team leaders like Great Void Divine Emperor, Supreme Zerowood, Supreme Sui Xi, Supreme Blacksource, and others who also erupted with an incomparably resplendent light.","This kind of battle was simply unprecedented!","In such a battle, who dared to claim to be invincible? Who dared to claim to be on top?","The Invincible Supremes and Six Scar Void Warriors all displayed their abilities and shook the world.","For a moment, they were fighting each other. After all, at their level, there was not much difference in combat strength. Each of them had their own trump card, and it was difficult to determine the winner in a short time.","However, the battle between ordinary Scar level Void Masters and Supreme experts was much more intense.","In this battle, the Scar level Void Masters and Supreme Masters, who were considered big shots in the universe, were not even considered cannon fodder. From time to time, Supreme Masters would die, letting out cries of Great Dao.","The number of casualties among them was rising in a straight line.","The worst thing was that the situation between the ordinary Supreme experts and the Void Masters began to tilt in the favor of the Void Universe.","All of this had come from a monster with a dog head and a human body, wielding a giant axe.","He was wearing a set of broken lava armor, and his body was surrounded by a faint blue light. There were no pupils in his eyes, only blue light. Staring into his eyes was like staring into the abyss.","On his left shoulder, which was not covered by the lava, five long scars were extremely dazzling.","On the battlefield, he was simply a war machine, a death god that had returned from hell.","No one could stop him!","He held a giant axe that looked like a Pharaoh’s scepter in his hands, and the blue light around his body formed a Halo. He smashed down fiercely and instantly killed a Half Invincible Supreme expert of the Divine Power Universe!","What was even more bizarre was that after the Half Invincible Supreme expert was killed by the dog-headed monster, he turned into a long string of blood beads that automatically fell into the dog-headed monster’s mouth and was swallowed.","The dog-headed human-bodied monster’s slight injuries were instantly healed, and his aura rose sharply.","If he were to kill a few more people, he would probably be able to threaten an Invincible Supreme!","It could be said that this dog-headed human-bodied monster alone had affected the entire battle!","“Not only did he recover from his injuries, but he’s also stronger. What kind of monster is he?”","Long Qing, who was in an extremely embarrassing situation with his dragon scales damaged, looked at the dog-headed monster with a frightened face. There was no dignity in his eyes anymore, only extreme fear.","He was a Half Invincible Supreme, and he could be considered an expert of this cultivation realm. He would not have been killed by a single axe strike, but he was not any better off. He was sent flying by the dog-headed human-bodied monster’s axe strike, and a section of his Dragon horn was cut off. There was also a huge wound on his body that was so deep that his bones could be seen.","In the distance, Ninth Kalpa King’s face was also extremely gloomy.","He could not defeat this dog-headed human-bodied monster.","If he had been at the same cultivation level as the dog-headed monster, he was confident that he could defeat him, or even kill him. However, his cultivation level was too low, and he was still a step away from reaching the High Supreme level.","“If this goes on, all the ordinary Supremes in the universe will be killed by him and turned into nourishment for his strength. When that time comes, once he powers up more, the short-term balance between the Invincible Supreme and the Six Scar Void Master will be broken. At that time, it’s very likely that we will lose everything.”","At this moment, the Ninth Kalpa King, who had always been proud and arrogant, also felt bitterness in his mouth and despair in his heart.","“Trash from the Divine Power Universe, quickly surrender to me, the Hell King!”","The dog-headed human-bodied monster laughed wildly, looking at Ninth Kalpa King, Long Qing, and the others with eyes full of contempt and disdain.","“Is this the power of a Divine Power Universe? It’s so weak that it’s scary.”","The dog-headed monster shook his head and licked his lips. His eyes were filled with greed and cruelty.","As long as he could kill all these people and turn them into his nourishment, it would be enough for him to break through to the Six Scar level, right?","At the thought of this, the dog-headed monster chuckled and walked toward the ordinary Supreme in the Divine Power Universe with the giant axe in his hand.","He raised his giant axe high and prepared to strike.","...","Under his giant axe, several High and Top Supreme realm martial artists were in despair.","Before he could strike–","Ding!!!","A bright sword light, like a heavenly river flowing backward, crossed the sky and suddenly came from the distance!"]},{"number":4553,"title":"Chapter 4553 The Invincible Hell King","paragraphs":["4553 The Invincible Hell King","“What?”","The dog-headed human-bodied monster, who was holding a giant axe and was about to slash down, felt the cold Sword Intent that was locked on him and charging at him at high speed. He could not help but slow down and slowly turn his head to look.","“Huh?” The dog-headed monster let out a soft gasp, and his pupils could not help but shrink.","At the same time, Long Qing, Ninth Kalpa King, and many other people who were fighting all stopped their movements and looked up at the bright sword light that cut through Yin and Yang!","“This is?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang is back!”","Countless people in the Divine Power Universe shuddered and exclaimed.","In the 5,000 years that Jian Wushuang fought, he conquered countless people with his own strength and made a great reputation for himself.","Swish!","In the blink of an eye, the Sword Light arrived with a loud bang and ruthlessly struck the dog-headed monster.","“Weak trash!”","Seeing this, the dog-headed monster laughed fearlessly. The long axe in his hand swept out and collided with the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand!","Ding! Ding!","An extremely sharp explosion sounded. Immediately after, a huge shock wave spread out from where the two were fighting in a fan shape. The terrifying power it contained shattered the void and raised dust into the sky.","“Quickly retreat!”","The cultivators and Void Warriors who were fighting around them all changed their expressions and quickly retreated.","Immediately after, everyone saw that the muscular dog-headed human-bodied monster, who called himself ‘Hell King’, seemed to have been hit by a heavy hammer. His entire body drew an arc and shot out from the dust that filled the sky, his legs leaving two long traces in the void.","Gradually...","The smoke and dust gradually dispersed, revealing the figure of a black-clothed youth.","This young man was dressed in black and had black hair. His face was cold and indifferent, and his pale golden eyes were emotionless. The purple ‘Chuan’ character between his eyebrows was dazzling and flirtatious.","His five well-defined fingers held the Tarot Divine Sword, and a powerful sword pressure materialized. With him as the center, it spread out and suppressed all directions.","“It’s Jian Wushuang indeed!”","“Jian Wushuang has become stronger!”","“An Intermediate Supreme martial artist! Jian Wushuang had broken through to the Intermediate Supreme stage! What a fast cultivation speed!”","Instantly, countless people’s pupils shrank.","They could feel that Jian Wushuang was stronger than before. Not only was his cultivation stronger, but his entire person was also stronger.","The current Jian Wushuang was like a peerless divine sword that could tear the Nine Heavens apart. His eyes were filled with great pressure that no one dared to look at directly.","Jian Wushuang looked around indifferently and immediately saw countless familiar faces.","Ninth Kalpa King, the Overlord Patriarch, Moluo Yangu, Long Qing...","There were too many people who had grudges with him, and they were all injured and in an extremely miserable state.","“I’m back.”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with battle intent.","The battlefield was where he should be!","Then, Jian Wushuang tilted his head slightly and looked at Hell King.","Although Hell King was sent flying by Jian Wushuang’s sword, his aura did not weaken at all. The deep sword wound on his chest grew new flesh rapidly. In just a few breaths, he had recovered.","“Weak trash, do you know that you’re challenging a great existence?” Hell King said with a sinister smile, and an even more terrifying aura emanated from his body.","Sensing this aura, everyone’s expression changed. It was as if Hell King with a dog’s head and a human’s body had turned into the abyss of death.","“You’re noisy.” Jian Wushuang looked at him expressionlessly. Then, he turned into a golden light and charged at Hell King again!","A vast sword essence gushed out of Jian Wushuang’s hands. In an instant, Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword disappeared.","In the world, only the sword light that broke through all darkness and brought dawn to the world remained!","It was domineering, fierce, and sharp. No words could describe this terrifying sword strike.","“Life is a part of reincarnation, and your part has already ended.”","“Mortal Strike!”","Hell King roared and endless blue light gathered on the blade of his long axe. Then, he chopped down on Jian Wushuang!","This attack was far more powerful than the previous one. It could be said that it was already standing at the peak of the Half Invincible Supreme realm!","Rumble!!","As the two attacks collided, the heavens and earth shook as if countless worlds were collapsing.","An even greater shock wave spread out instantly, enough to annihilate hundreds of stars in an instant.","People from both universes who were fighting around them retreated again. A Three Scar Void Master was just one step slower and was crushed into powder by the aftermath of the battle between Jian Wushuang and Hell King.","Jian Wushuang’s right hand, which was holding the sword, trembled. The power of the axe was enough to blow up the sun. Even with his chaotic domineering body, he still felt a little tired.","And this was not the most important thing.","The most important thing was that Hell King’s axe seemed to have devouring power. At the moment of the fight, it wanted to devour Jian Wushuang’s life force and cultivation.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang was a Perfect Chaotic Life Form. He only needed to circulate his divine power slightly to suppress the devouring power.","...","“Oh? He actually blocked it? It seems like you’re stronger than those ants.” Hell King squinted his eyes, and a slightly surprised look appeared on his face.","However, the next moment, his lips curled into a deep and sinister smile.","“However, in front of me, you’re just a slightly stronger ant. It can’t change your weak nature!”","“Mortal Strike!” Countless rays of blue light gathered on the blade of the long axe in Hell King’s hand and he hacked down at Jian Wushuang!","“You’re too slow.” Jian Wushuang sneered and immediately activated the secret skill of Dragon blood. His speed suddenly increased by ten times and in a flash, he appeared behind Hell King. The Sword Qi of the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand burst forth and he slashed at Hell King’s head!","“Open Sky!”","“Annoying trash, do you only know how to sneak attack?” Hell King frowned. Speed was indeed his weakness.","However, he also had a way to deal with it.","Clang!","He first raised his long axe to block the sword strike, then took a step forward to put some distance between him and Jian Wushuang.","In the end, he raised his right hand, pointed it at Jian Wushuang, and said, “Void technique, Withering Rhythm!”","...","As soon as he finished speaking, countless blue lights gushed out of the void and gathered in his palm, forming a blue vortex.","The next moment, the blue light rushed out of his palm and pierced into Jian Wushuang’s body.","All of a sudden, Jian Wushuang’s speed slowed down and his aura began to decline. Like a flower bud in the autumn wind, it gradually withered."]},{"number":4554,"title":"Chapter 4554 Taking on the Hell King","paragraphs":["4554 Taking on the Hell King","In the void, the entire universe had been split apart!","The battle between the Invincible Supremes and the Six Scar Void Masters was the most dazzling. They could crush stars with their hands and shatter the Milky Way with their feet. Each of them was an ancient existence, and the aura they exuded was enough to annihilate 3,000 worlds.","Apart from the battle between the Invincible Supremes and the Six Scar Void Masters, the most eye-catching battle was the battle between Hell King and Jian Wushuang.","The Hell King was an evil god worshipped by many in the depths of the Void Universe. He had been in a deep sleep until the universe erupted in a catastrophic war. Only then was he awakened by the Void God.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was undeniably the number one genius of the Divine Power Universe. He was truly unbeatable below the Invincible Supreme realm.","With the two of them as the center, a vacuum was created within a radius of 10,000 miles.","Hell King held a long axe and looked at Jian Wushuang, whose aura was weakening, with contempt. He sneered and said, “Your life will come to an end here.”","“Let me, the great Hell King, end your life!”","“Mortal Strike!”","With a roar, Hell King took a step forward and turned into a blue shadow. He held the giant axe and chopped at Jian Wushuang again!","Jian Wushuang could not help but squint his eyes and his face turned slightly serious.","He was already mobilizing his divine power to suppress and expel the power of decay in his body, but it would take at least ten more breaths to completely remove it.","And ten breaths was enough to determine life and death in the duel with Hell King!","“Tarot Sword Manual, third move, Dusk.”","“Tarot Sword Manual, fourth move, Four Seasons.”","“Innate divine power, Primordial Universe!”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth slightly and spat out these words coldly. Then, he brazenly used three divine techniques!","For a moment, the Hell King’s feet, which were originally shooting forward, could not help but slow down, as if he had sunk into a muddy pool. His speed seemed to have been slowed down, and moved in slow-motion.","This was an innate divine power, the Primordial Universe!","“Eh? A divine power similar to mine?”","Hell King squinted his eyes. Before he could react, an extremely terrifying suction force suddenly came from under his feet. Like a big hand, it grabbed his bare feet and pulled them down ruthlessly!","“This is?”","For the first time, a look of shock appeared on Hell King’s face.","Below him, a huge pit appeared like a black hole.","Be it dark matter in the universe or all kinds of energy aftershocks, they were all affected by the gravitational force of the twilight pit at the same time and sank into the concave pit.","At this moment, it was as if the universe had collapsed.","In this crater, the vast and majestic Sword Qi was like a huge millstone that silently destroyed everything.","In an instant, the bones and flesh of the Hell King’s feet were ground away.","Nearly 10,000 years ago, when Jian Wushuang was just a Primary Supreme, he had almost killed Wang Liu, who was also a Five Scar Void Master, with the Dusk move. Now that Jian Wushuang had broken through to the Intermediate Supreme, his strength was more than ten times stronger.","And this was not the end!","The fourth move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Four Seasons, descended!","Countless swords rained down on Hell King, and the entire universe changed!","The moment the three divine arts were used at the same time, there was a faint sound of the Great Dao collapsing.","At this moment, everyone, regardless of whether they were from the Divine Power Universe or the Void Universe, was dumbfounded and flabbergasted by this scene. Their bodies trembled non-stop.","“This... this is still a battle between ordinary Supreme martial artists?”","“I’m a Top Supreme expert, but I have a feeling that I won’t be able to hold on for even one breath of time in the face of Jian Wushuang’s three divine powers!”","“He’s too strong! Just by looking at the battle between these two, and without considering their cultivation levels, I’m afraid they’re close to being Invincible Supremes!”","The people from the divine universe looked at each other and said.","Ninth Kalpa King’s pupils shrank, and a complicated look flashed across his face. He quietly clenched his fists.","He had been arrogant and conceited all his life and only regarded Jian Wushuang as his opponent.","However, in just over 100,000 years, Jian Wushuang, who was inferior to him in all aspects, had burst out with an attack that made him admit defeat and feel inferior.","The Hell King, who had suppressed him and made him feel despair, was now on the verge of being killed by Jian Wushuang.","The one with even more complicated emotions was Long Qing from the Dragon clan.","“This guy, how did he grow so fast?!”","He looked at Jian Wushuang with extreme jealousy.","In the past, Jian Wushuang was just an ant struggling at death’s door in his hands. But now, the battle strength that Jian Wushuang had displayed was an existence that he could only look up to but not reach!","Compared to the shock of the Divine Power Universe, the Void Universe was filled with fear!","“Other than the Six Scar Masters, Hell King is the most powerful being in our universe! He’s going to be defeated?”","“If Hell King is defeated, what can we do to stop him?”","The eyes of the Void Warriors flickered. They hesitated, wondering if they should launch a Void Explosion together to support Hell King.","Let’s not talk about the reaction of the crowd for now...","...","In the corner of the void.","Seven black-robed men were standing in the air with their hands behind their backs.","...","The leader was a strange man wearing a mask with red stripes that only revealed one eye.","“Hey, that little guy...”","All of a sudden, Devour Seven, who was ranked seventh, turned his eyes slightly and looked at Jian Wushuang and Hell King, who were fighting.","Then, he squinted his eyes and said, “If I remember correctly, that sword-wielding little fellow...”","“What’s wrong, Devour Seven?”","Devour One, who was wearing a red mask, noticed the strange tone in Devour Seven’s voice and asked indifferently.","“Lord Devour One, that little guy with the sword seems to be related to Xuan Yi. I wanted to catch him back, but the Supreme Master of this universe saved him. I didn’t want to make a big deal out of it, so I let him go.”","“I didn’t think that this person would improve so quickly in just 100,000 years. He was only a Second Stage Ruler back then, but he’s already grown to such a level,” Devour Seven said.","Hearing that, Devour One did not change his tone. He just nodded and said, “There’s nothing impossible about someone related to Xuan Yi.”","“Should we capture him now?” Devour Seven continued to ask.","Devour One thought for a while and shook his head indifferently, “There’s no rush. Let’s see how he performs first. I think he might be a key chess piece in Xuan Yi’s big plan.”","...","As soon as he finished speaking, a golden card appeared in his hand, trembling slightly.","...","“Die!”","On the battlefield, Jian Wushuang looked at Hell King, who was trapped in the dusk pit, and a cold light flashed in his eyes. He then activated the three super powers to the extreme."]},{"number":4555,"title":"Chapter 4555 After Killing Hell King, Devour Is Ready to Take Action","paragraphs":["4555 After Killing Hell King, Devour Is Ready to Take Action","Rumble!!!","In an instant, three forces landed on Hell King’s body.","Hell King’s burly body was suddenly filled with divine blood. Thousands of Sword Qi slashed him until he was skinny, as if it was raining blood.","The people from the two universes were shocked to the extreme when they saw this scene.","“I can’t believe that an Intermediate Supreme martial artist can unleash such power! This is simply unprecedented!”","“He’s too strong! My scalp is going numb!”","“Jian Wushuang’s sword is so terrifying that it’s going to explode!”","Countless people exclaimed in admiration.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as his body gradually rose into the air.","“Tarot Sword Manual, fourth move, Four Seasons!”","“Winter to Spring, Spring to Summer!!”","As soon as he finished speaking, a huge sun appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","The surface area of this sun was even larger than ten ordinary suns. The scorching heat burned everything, reflecting a red light on the universe. On the surface of the sun, there were burning flames as if ten suns had fused into a huge fireball. It was indescribably terrifying.","The next moment.","“Explode!”","In an instant, the huge fireball rolled toward the dog-headed Hell King!","In the void, there was a loud explosion.","Hell King looked up at this scene, and finally, he could no longer maintain his composure. He roared.","“Break!”","“Death Incarnation!!”","As soon as he finished speaking, something terrifying happened.","Buzzzzzzzz!","Countless blue flames rose from Hell King’s skin, forming a thick flaming armor.","He stood proudly in the netherworld with a long axe in his hand. His entire body was burning with blue flames, and the universe around him began to wither at the same time as if the god of death had descended!","“Shatter!”","A look of madness flashed in his eyes. He first raised the long axe in his hand and chopped down fiercely, shattering the twilight pit under his feet. Then, he opened his mouth again and let out a roar that shook the Nine Heavens and ten lands toward the rolling lava sun!","“Void Explosion–!!!!”","Boom!!!","The blue flames burning all over his body gathered in his open mouth, forming a huge blue ball with thunder and lightning!","As soon as this blue ball appeared, it immediately exuded a surging world-destroying might that far exceeded all of his previous moves!","“Hell King is forced to use Void Explosion. It seems that Jian Wushuang has forced him to use his trump card!”","“As long as Jian Wushuang can survive this move, Hell King will die!”","Countless Supreme experts of the Divine Power Universe clenched their fists, and their hearts were in their throats.","Whizzzzz!!","The blue ball turned into a pillar of light as thick as the mouth of a bowl and instantly shot out from Hell King’s mouth, heavily hitting the falling lava sun!","In an instant, the world went silent.","A dazzling light burst out from between the two.","In the next moment, everyone saw that the lava sun was directly pierced through the middle by Hell King’s Void Explosion blue ball and scattered in all directions.","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He did not look panicked at all. Instead, his eyes were burning with fighting intent.","The surging battle intent soared into the sky and shook the Nine Heavens!","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth move, Tarot!!”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, word by word.","In an instant, a Dharma power appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","A handsome young man with a flagon in his left hand and a sword in his right hand appeared behind Jian Wushuang. He was staggering, but he looked extremely unrestrained.","It was none other than the man who had laughed at the heavens and earth at his peak, Supreme Tarot!","Previously, Jian Wushuang had not been able to fully display the power of the fifth move of the Tarot Sword Manual. Now, after Jian Wushuang had broken through to the Intermediate Supreme realm, the power of this sword move was no weaker than a real strike from Supreme Tarot!","As Jian Wushuang slowly raised the Tarot Divine Sword, Supreme Celestial Tarot appearance behind him also raised the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he spat out the word.","In that instant!","Tarot Supreme and Jian Wushuang had become one!","A dragon-like Sword Qi was instantly slashed out by the Tarot Divine Sword, splitting the heavens and earth, piercing through the sun and the moon!","Before this sword strike, it had already surpassed the realm of a Half Invincible Supreme!","...","After the sword was slashed out, the entire sky seemed to dim, leaving only the brilliance of the sword.","Even many Invincible Supremes and Six Scar Void Masters who were fighting in the distance could not help but turn to look at Jian Wushuang.","“This guy’s attainments in the way of the sword have already reached such a high level?”","The Captain of Team 7, who had once been the number one expert in the Dao of the Blade in the entire cosmos, Supreme Blacksource, sighed in admiration.","“This little fellow is becoming more and more like Tarot.”","Wu Jianxian’s beautiful eyes also flashed with a strange color. Just now, she actually felt a bit of the heroic aura of Supreme Tarot from Jian Wushuang.","This made her heart skip a beat.","“Hell King lost.”","Meanwhile, in the void, where Devour One was standing...","Devour One, who was wearing a red mask and stroking the golden card in his hand, shook his head and said indifferently.","The next moment.","...","He stopped playing with the golden card.","“When this kid grows up, he will become a trump card in Xuan Yi’s hands. I should bring him back for modification.”","...","Bang!!!","The dragon-like sword rainbow finally collided with Hell King’s Ball of void explosion.","This sword could flatten mountains, fill oceans, kill Immortals, subdue demons, subdue demons! And even kill Gods!","Almost in an instant, the overbearing and destructive void round ball was cut open diagonally by the sword as if it was a knife cutting tofu!","With a wave of his hand, the sword cut through the thorns and once again slashed toward Hell King!","“No!” Hell King’s expression changed drastically, and his eyes were filled with fear.","He had just woken up from a deep sleep, and he still had to show off his skills in the universe. He still had countless grand plans and great undertakings to do.","How could he die here?","To die at the hands of this ant that he had regarded as trash?","Just as he was about to turn around and escape, he saw the most brilliant sword, which had turned heaven and earth into a line, cut into Hell King’s body.","Rip!","In an instant, a sword mark appeared on Hell King’s majestic body from his left shoulder to his right waist.","Immediately after.","Swish!","Hell King’s body was split into two by the sword!","Swish...","Hell King’s body twisted and struggled, trying to be revived. However, the overbearing Sword Qi crushed him repeatedly.","Hell King’s life force quickly dissipated. In just ten breaths, Hell King had completely turned into a pile of black ash. With a stir of the Sword Qi, he turned into nothingness.","With one sword strike, Hell King was killed!"]},{"number":4556,"title":"Chapter 4556 Golden Card, Dimension-Reduction Attack!","paragraphs":["4556 Golden Card, Dimension-Reduction Attack!","The Hell King had fallen.","His body quickly crumbled and turned into countless black ashes, which were stirred by the strong wind in the air and completely dissipated.","In the void created by Hell King and Jian Wushuang’s fight, only Jian Wushuang was left. He stood with his sword, his face proud, and his black robe untainted by the mortal world. He looked like an Immortal or the peerless Sword God, Ling Chen.","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze.","They had not expected the battle to end so quickly.","They had expected that Jian Wushuang would win, but they had never thought that Hell King, who had just used Void Explosion, would be suppressed by Jian Wushuang with a single strike.","This victory came too quickly, so fast that they could not even react.","“Jian... Jian Wushuang won just like that?”","Ninth Kalpa King, Overlord Patriarch, and countless Supremes of the Divine Power Universe looked at each other in shock.","For a moment, the entire place was deathly silent.","Three breaths later.","The entire universe was boiling!","“The heavens bless the Divine Power Universe!”","An old Supreme expert clenched his fists tightly as his entire body trembled with excitement!","“The heavens have blessed my Divine Power Universe! How could such a monstrous genius like Jian Wushuang be born!”","“Back then, the Six Forces, including the Great Void Temple, the Dragon clan, and the Cosmos Temple, wanted to kill Jian Wushuang. Fortunately, Jian Wushuang survived. Otherwise, we would have been in great danger!”","“Jian Wushuang is the treasure of our universe and the hope of the future of our universe. You can’t have any other thoughts about him!”","Countless people were emotional.","The few Supreme masters who were about to die under the Hell King’s axe but were saved by Jian Wushuang in passing widened their eyes and looked at Long Qing, who was cowering at the side. They said pointedly, “Jian Wushuang is my savior. From now on, I will follow his lead!”","“Not bad! Without Jian Wushuang, I, Tian Fang, would have died in the hands of the dog-headed human-bodied monster. In the future, anyone who dares to say anything bad about Jian Wushuang will be my enemy!”","“This old man too! Jian Wushuang, you’re the one who gave me my life. From now on, if you have any orders, just tell me. If I, Jiu Luan, dare to say no, I’ll be struck by lightning and die a horrible death!”","These people spoke one after another.","Long Qing shrank to the side and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated look. A touch of fear flashed in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s sword had split heaven and earth, separated the chaos, and pierced through the sun, moon, and star river. It was too terrifying.","He asked himself, he absolutely could not receive this sword strike.","“How did this guy’s strength increase so quickly?” Long Qing muttered to himself.","He had cultivated for 130 chaos cycles and become a Half Invincible Supreme. He was an inconceivable figure in the entire universe, and even amongst the Dragon race, he would be ranked in the annals of history. He had been one of the leading figures of the fourth generation of the Dragon race.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, had already surpassed him in battle strength even though he had cultivated for less than a million years.","The difference was so great that he felt despair.","....","In the void.","As Jian Wushuang killed Hell King, the morale of the entire Divine Power Universe rose a little. On the contrary, the people of the Void Universe looked ashen and trembled like a sieve.","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew in the wind as he stood proudly in the void and said coldly.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and turned into a sword rainbow that pierced through the sun and the moon again. He then charged toward the camp of the Void Universe.","Behind him, the Supremes of the Divine Power Universe roared in response.","“Kill!”","“Kill!”","“Kill!!!”","“Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill!!!”","Countless Intermediate, High, Top, and even Half Invincible Supremes, led by Jian Wushuang, burst out with earth-shattering killing intent and charged toward the camp of the Void Universe!","They were like a sharp knife that was ruthlessly stabbed into the Void Warriors of the Void Universe, and Jian Wushuang was the sharpest tip of the knife!","“Sundering Stars!!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he raised the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed down!","In an instant, the low groans of Buddhas and the wailing of Demonic Gods came from the Tarot Divine Sword.","The Tarot Divine Sword’s blade instantly trembled a million times, forming a silver sword rainbow that was 100,000 feet long!","This sword crossed the Heavenly River and dominated the starry sky. It was as if an Immortal from the Hine Heavens had descended.","Swish!!!","With one sword attack, he had killed over 100 Void Masters!","The entire camp of the Void Universe was in a state of mourning.","Even if there were experts who did not die from the sword, they would be killed by Ninth Kalpa King, Old Monster Iron Fence, Overlord, and others who followed closely behind Jian Wushuang.","After a while, the scale of victory between ordinary Supremes and ordinary Void Masters gradually leaned toward the Divine Power Universe, not to mention the battle between Void Gods and Cosmos Gods, or the battle between the Invincible Supreme and the Six Scar level Void Master.","...","In the void, where Devourers was located.","...","“Devour One, aren’t we going to attack?” Devour Five said with a frown.","Devour One, who was wearing a red mask, did not reply immediately. Instead, he just stared at Jian Wushuang with his right eye.","His eyes, which were usually calm, flashed with a slight splendor.","“Xuan Yi... you’ve got a good hand.”","As if sighing, Devour One sighed softly.","Then, he raised the golden card in his hand and threw it at Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, the golden card spun out of his hand.","“Then let’s do it.”","On the battlefield.","As Jian Wushuang was slashing with his sword, he suddenly seemed to sense something. He raised his head and stared at a certain direction in the void. A touch of surprise flashed in his eyes and all the hair on his body stood up!","The next moment.","...","A golden card jumped out of the void and enlarged in Jian Wushuang’s eyes!","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of great terror from the moment of life and death. A chill ran from his back to the top of his head!","The card had a sense of danger that he had never felt before!","“This is?”","Jian Wushuang was shocked and he subconsciously wanted to run away.","However, before he could lift his foot...","A strange power suddenly exploded from the golden card!","In an instant, a power that could fold time and space came out of the golden card, and the entire universe began to tremble quickly!","The next moment!","Then, something terrifying happened.","It was as if the three-dimensional time and space had become two-dimensional. Whether it was Jian Wushuang, the starry sky in the universe, or the other members of the two sides who were fighting, all of them stopped moving and turned into a painting.","Jian Wushuang, the countless stars, and the others all disappeared.","All that was left was a painting that floated down from the void.","As for Jian Wushuang and the others, they had all become the people in the painting.","This was... Dimension-Reduction!"]},{"number":4557,"title":"Chapter 4557 Supreme Master Gai Fu Appears","paragraphs":["4557 Supreme Master Gai Fu Appears","What was the Dimension-Reduction Attack?","If the universe was a three-dimensional space, and everyone was a three-dimensional existence, then the two-dimensional space was completely different from the three-dimensional space.","For example, the pictures in the paintings, the characters in the little human-sized books, etc. They were flat, rigid, and without any vitality.","This golden card could fold the space in all directions, forming a direction in the three-dimensional universe. It compressed and folded the space, causing it to collapse.","All of this was too terrifying!","Jian Wushuang did not even have the space to struggle. He felt that his entire body had been shackled and he could no longer move.","In the distance, some people from the two universes who were not within the attack range of the dimension reduction suddenly gasped in shock.","What kind of supernatural method was this?","They looked at each other, their eyes filled with intense disbelief.","Such a method was far beyond their understanding.","Even an Invincible Supreme, who could destroy millions of stars, crush countless galaxies, and Swallow the Sun with a single breath... Even they were shocked.","They had never heard of a small card that could change the structure of the universe directly without a sound.","Only some of the older Void Masters of the Void Universe were dazed for a moment, then they seemed to have thought of something and trembled.","“The Devourers!”","“Devourers are here!”","“Back then, Ancestor Hong Ye’s sect had tens of thousands of disciples. They offended the Devourers and were annihilated by the Devourers’ Dimension-Reduction strike.”","They looked around in panic. The Devourers had come out of the Void Universe with them, but they did not feel happy when they saw the Devourers. Instead, they were in a panic.","Devourers could not be predicted with common sense.","They were mysterious, strange, and powerful, like a bottomless ocean that no one could see through.","Even Void God had never mentioned the Devourers during the two Great Catastrophe Wars, nor had they forced the Devourers to take action.","This group’s background was terrifying.","As expected, after they finished speaking, seven figures in black robes walked out of the void.","They were all dressed in loose black robes and had different figures and appearances. There was a woman with an enchanting appearance and a sinister smile that could charm all living beings, a tall monster with a wolf head holding a long black saber and a body full of strange tattoos, a fat giant like a meatball, and a thin person who was wearing a red mask that only revealed one eye walking in the front.","He was Devour One. Even in Devour, he was the most mysterious existence. Even the other members of the Devourers did not know much about him.","“It’s them!”","The pupils of the many Void Masters in the Void Universe shrank, and they quickly dodged, staying far away from these seven people, not daring to block their way.","The Devourers walked into the universe with an indifferent expression.","He stretched out his hand and the golden card that reflected the starry sky, as well as Jian Wushuang and the others, immediately rotated and flew back into his hand.","Buzzzzzzzz!","Just as the golden card was about to fall into Devour One’s hand...","An old giant hand covered with age spots suddenly appeared in the void. When the golden card was about to reach Devour One’s hand, it grabbed the golden card and pulled it back into the void.","“Oh?” Devour One slightly raised his eyes, looking at the void where the giant hand had retracted.","An old man with turbid eyes, age spots all over his face, and an aura of decay was slowly walking through the air.","The old man was none other than Supreme Gai Fu, the leader of the five head Supremes of the Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Gai Fu remained silent, but his back was straight. He held the golden card in his hand and looked at the seven Devourer members with a calm expression.","When Devour One saw Supreme Master Gai Fu take the golden card, his expression was also calm, but a slight surprise flashed in his eyes. He said, “Oh? This universe actually has people of this level?”","As he finished speaking, he shook his head as if he was feeling sorry. He then muttered to himself, “It’s a pity that my life source has been severely damaged. I’m afraid I don’t have many years left to live. It’s impossible for me to take this step and reach another level.”","When the people around them heard this, they could not help but scratch their heads, and a look of confusion flashed across their faces.","Take this step? What level was he at?","What did that mean?","Supreme Gai Fu’s turbid eyes did not waver at all when he heard this. He only said indifferently, “With me here, you can’t take Jian Wushuang away today.”","After saying that, a red flame gushed out from Supreme Gai Fu’s hand and burned the golden card.","The golden card immediately burst into green smoke and began to twist.","After a few breaths.","Jian Wushuang and the others, who had been sealed in another dimensional space by the Dimension-Reduction Attack, leaped out of the void one after another.","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, and his forehead was full of sweat. He first looked at the seven members of the Devourers with deep fear in his eyes.","This Dimension-Reduction Attack was extremely terrifying.","In the face of this Dimension-Reduction, he could not resist at all. He was suppressed and sealed directly. He could not use any of his divine powers.","Even though he had been saved by Supreme Gai Fu, he still could not help but feel shocked and furious.","At the same time, he had a flash of understanding.","He finally understood why the billions of living beings in the Tarot Divine Kingdom, which had been established by the Supreme Tarot, had all been killed in an instant.","After hearing what Gai Fu said, Devour One did not look angry. He just looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and said, “Believe me, we will meet again.”","As soon as he said that, a pool of black water appeared under the feet of the seven people led by Devour One.","The seven of them gradually sank and disappeared from the starry sky.","...","Jian Wushuang finally heaved a long sigh of relief after they had left. He looked at Supreme Master Gai Fu with surprise, but he was more grateful.","“Senior Gai Fu, thank you for saving me.”","He paused for a moment.","“You...” Jian Wushuang asked. “Are you okay now?”","Supreme Gai Fu nodded his head. Just as he was about to reply, his old face flushed red and he opened his mouth to spit out black divine blood.","As he spat out this mouthful of divine blood, Supreme Master Gai Fu’s already rotten aura became even more dispirited.","“Senior Gai Fu!”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he quickly reached out to help Supreme Master Gai Fu."]},{"number":4558,"title":"Chapter 4558 I Have No Regrets!","paragraphs":["4558 I Have No Regrets!","“Don’t mind this old man!”","Before Jian Wushuang could reach out to support Supreme Master Gai Fu, he saw Supreme Master Gai Fu wave his hand at Jian Wushuang, indicating that he was fine.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could only stop what he was doing, but his heart sank.","Supreme Gai Fu’s body... won’t last much longer.","!!","When Supreme Master Gai Fu saw Jian Wushuang’s expression, he forced a smile on his face and comforted him, “Jian Wushuang, you don’t have to worry. Life and death are normal. I’m relieved to see your achievements today. Even if I really leave this time, I think that with you taking care of the Divine Life Palace in the future, the Divine Life Palace will definitely be better than under my leadership.”","The situation was not optimistic for the Divine Power Universe.","Although Jian Wushuang’s participation had basically secured the victory in the war between ordinary Supremes and Scar level Void Masters, the real deciding factor between the victory and defeat of the two universes still depended on the battle between the Invincible Supremes and the others, as well as... it was a battle between Void God and Cosmos God.","Thanks to the reinforcements from all directions, the number of Invincible Supremes in the Divine Power Universe was not much less than that of the 34 Void Masters. However, in terms of battle strength, they were still inferior.","White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, was fierce and overbearing. Every punch had the power to explode stars. It attacked from the left and right. Under a series of indiscriminate attacks, it immediately suppressed the Right Void Emissary and forced him to retreat.","However, aside from him, the other Invincible Supremes were all at a disadvantage.","Wu Jianxian, who was originally invincible with her sword, immediately fell into a disadvantage after fighting the Void Master Gu Heng.","Void Master Gu Heng, an ancient figure who had once dominated an era in the Void Universe. In terms of cultivation time, he was several times longer than Wu Jianxian. All kinds of killing magical powers emerged from his hands, forcing Wu Jianxian to helplessly block without the power to fight back.","The most important thing was that the Void Master Gu Heng had a pair of copper rings. This pair of copper rings was hard and indestructible. They were unusually firm and had the ability to enlarge and shrink. The two copper rings were each other’s horns and could be pulled from left to right. It was extremely difficult to deal with.","“Absorb!”","Void Master Gu Heng put his hands together and shouted.","In an instant, a yellow light surged from the copper rings and extended out like a rope. One of the copper rings first wrapped around Wu Jianxian’s divine sword, causing the other copper ring to hang around Wu Jianxian’s body. Then, it suddenly tightened and bound Wu Jianxian.","Wu Jianxian’s expression changed. She wanted to break free, but this copper ring was like the five elements mountain that suppressed her. It grew as big as Wu Jianxian and shrank as she shrank. It did not give her the slightest chance to escape.","“Hahahaha, little girl, just surrender obediently. I see that you’re a good girl, so as long as you’re willing to be my servant, I’ll spare your life. If you’re more obedient, I can even ask the Void God Lord for a reward when I conquer this universe. It’s not impossible for you to be the master of a Star Field.”","Void Master Gu Heng laughed, but he did not show any mercy. A short blade the size of a finger suddenly appeared from the copper ring that bound Wu Jianxian, trying to kill her.","“You’re looking for death!” When Wu Jianxian heard this, a cold glint flickered in her beautiful eyes. Her killing intent had reached an extreme.","“Divine power, Shapeshifting.”","Wu Jianxian coldly spat out these words. As soon as she finished speaking, there was a flash of light from her body. Not far from her, a figure that looked exactly like her appeared out of thin air.","Bang!","Wu Jianxian, who was bound by the copper rings, was instantly ground to death by the copper rings, turning into a pile of shadows.","“Kill!”","Wu Jianxian’s face turned pale for a moment. Then, she took a deep breath and once again raised her sword to attack the Void Master Gu Heng.","On the other side of the battlefield.","A Six Scar Void Master with a pair of wings on his back and a hunched waist had his hands hanging down to his knees.","Then, his hands twisted and turned into two long and narrow sharp knives.","“Dragon clan? Hehe, I’ll eat you!”","The Six Scar Void Master stepped forward and leaped like a flying mantis toward one of the Third Generation Dragons.","His hands, which had turned into sharp knives, flickered with a fierce cold light in the air, enough to split the stars and cut the moon.","“Roar!”","Seeing this, the Third Generation Dragon’s eyes flashed with panic, and he spat out a planet-sized ball of purple poison.","...","The battle between the Invincible Supremes and the Six Scar Void Masters had become more and more intense and had entered a state of white heat.","Although no one had died yet, it was only a matter of time before the Invincible Supremes of the Divine Power Universe died.","At that time, once an Invincible Supreme died, the balance between the top fighting forces of the two universes would be broken, and the Void Universe would have free hands, creating a situation of two against one.","At that time, the defeat of the Divine Power Universe would be decided.","...","Turning back to the scene of Jian Wushuang and Supreme Master Gai Fu.","“A single spark can start a prairie fire.”","Supreme Gai Fu took a deep breath, and a determined look flashed across his eyes.","“Then I’ll use my old body to turn into the fire that will set the prairie on fire!”","Just as he was about to jump up and burn himself to become the first fire to burn the Void Universe, Jian Wushuang suddenly patted his shoulder.","“What?” Supreme Gai Fu turned his head, puzzled.","“Senior Gai Fu, I won’t stop you if you want to do something. However, before that, I want you to see something,” Jian Wushuang said softly.","Then, he flipped his right hand and an iron token appeared.","The token was given to Jian Wushuang by Supreme Dao Yan, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, in the Land of Gods.","Supreme Gai Fu was stunned when he saw the rusty token. Then, his turbid eyes suddenly turned red.","It had been 100,000 void eras!","It was unknown whether the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace was alive or dead, but Supreme Master Gai Fu was the one who carried the flag.","The world only knew that the Divine Life Palace had been established by Supreme Dao Yan, who was then guarded by Supreme Gai Fu.","No one knew that...","...","Back then, Supreme Master Gai Fu had been the shadow behind Supreme Dao Yan and the most loyal old servant.","“Young Master... he’s still alive?”","Supreme Gai Fu said.","He did not address him as Palace Master, but as Young Master. Perhaps it had been a long time since he had called him ‘Young Master’, so when he said it, it sounded a little stiff and obscure.","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","Supreme Master Gai Fu laughed when he received Jian Wushuang’s confirmation.","For the first time, he laughed freely, as if he had been relieved of a heavy burden, and as if he had nothing to worry about.","“Jian Wushuang, since the Young Master has given you the Palace Master Token, you are now the second Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.”","“I... I have no regrets!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Gai Fu raised his head and looked at the battlefield between the Invincible Supremes and the Six Scar Void Masters.","An unprecedented powerful aura gushed out of his body!"]},{"number":4559,"title":"Chapter 4559 Supreme Master Gai Fu Falls","paragraphs":["4559 Supreme Master Gai Fu Falls","“What?”","“What’s going on?”","“This aura is...”","In an instant, the Six Scar Void Master and the Invincible Supreme who were fighting in the Void Universe stopped fighting and looked down in confusion.","!!","Thus, they saw Supreme Gai Fu, whose entire body was burning with Supreme divine power.","“It’s him!”","“It’s this guy!”","“He’s still alive?”","Some of the people who had participated in the previous Great Catastrophe War and knew Supreme Gai Fu had looks of fear on their faces.","Back then, Supreme Master Gai Fu had still been young, but he had been one of the main forces of the Divine Power Universe. He had almost no rivals at his level.","For this reason, the Void Universe had specially sent several Six Scar Void Masters to besiege Supreme Master Gai Fu. They clearly remembered that Supreme Master Gai Fu had been seriously injured and on the verge of death.","“Quickly retreat! This lunatic is planning to take us down with him!”","Suddenly, a Six Scar Void Master’s pupils shrank as if he had realized something and he shouted in horror.","As soon as he said this, the faces of these Six Scar Void Masters changed and they retreated rapidly.","Some of the Invincible Supremes from the Divine Power Universe were also shocked, and they couldn’t believe what they were seeing.","“That guy. Gai Fu...”","Great Void Divine Emperor ended the battle and panted slightly. He looked at Supreme Master Gai Fu with a complicated gaze.","He and Supreme Gai Fu could be considered enemies and friends. Before the Great Catastrophe War, the two of them had many grudges. However, after the Great Catastrophe, the two of them became comrades who fought side by side.","Supreme Gai Fu even saved his life on the battlefield.","Thus, his feelings for Supreme Gai Fu were rather complicated.","It was precisely because of this complexity that when Jian Wushuang had almost killed Supreme Bing Ye, he had only reminded Jian Wushuang and not killed him. Instead, he had left the depths of the universe with Supreme Bing Ye.","Otherwise, with Great Void Divine Emperor’s power, even if he had killed Jian Wushuang, the Divine Life Palace would not have been able to do anything to him.","“Jian Wushuang, I’m leaving. The world belongs to you young people in the future.”","After patting Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, Supreme Gai Fu finally turned his head and took a deep look at Ninth Kalpa King. Then, without hesitation, he stomped his right foot heavily and turned into a soaring flame, like a meteorite that cut through the sky with a trail of flames. With a kind of righteous posture, he ruthlessly crashed into several Six Scar level Void Masters who were retreating.","“Teacher!”","It was Supreme Gai Fu who had brought him back from a remote Star Field and given him a home.","This was his first time cultivating, his first time awakening a perfect-grade Special Life Form, his first breakthrough, and his first time being called the number one prodigy of the Divine Life Palace...","All of this had been bestowed upon him by Supreme Gai Fu.","To him, what really made him fight with his back to the wall was not the billions of living beings in the universe or the people in the Divine Life Palace, but the look of approval in Supreme Gai Fu’s eyes.","This was the last look he saw.","However, there was only sorrow in his heart, not joy.","Boom!!!","Under countless gazes, Supreme Master Gai Fu ruthlessly crashed into several Six Scar Void Masters!","With this collision, Supreme Gai Fu broke through his shackles and returned to his peak!","This collision was the most powerful attack that Supreme Gai Fu had unleashed at the last moment of his life!","This collision was unstoppable and as easy as crushing dry weeds and rotten wood!","“No!”","Void Master Gu Heng roared in fear.","“Void Explosion!!!”","At the same time, Sky Spider, whose body was covered in spiders, used his most powerful technique, Void Explosion, and blew up all the tentacles!","There were even more Six Scar Void Masters who used all their skills.","However, in front of Supreme Gai Fu, all of this was useless. All of this was useless!","These sacred arts were instantly obliterated the moment they came into contact with the soaring flames that Supreme Gai Fu had transformed into.","They retreated rapidly, trying to return to the Void Universe through the void crack to avoid this attack.","However...","To their despair, just as they were about to enter the void rift and return to the Void Universe, they were shocked to find that the void rift between the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe had been sealed for some reason!","“What’s going on? Why is it like this?”","“What happened to the tear in the void?”","“Damn it, damn it, damn it!!”","The faces of countless Six Scar Void Masters turned ashen. Looking at the fire in their eyes, which was getting bigger and bigger, they felt as if their hearts were being torn apart!","There was no escape! They could not avoid it!","Even the cracks in the void had been sealed for some unknown reason!","They did not have time to think.","Whoosh!!!","...","Supreme Master Gai Fu turned into a raging flame and swallowed all these Six Scar Void Masters in an instant!","In the fire, the desperate roars of the Six Scar Void Masters were heard, as well as the screams of horror.","This was a strike unleashed by Supreme Gai Fu, who had burned his life force. It was dazzling, dazzling, and shocking.","Boom!!!","A moment later, it was as if a huge brilliant firework had exploded in the boundless starry sky.","It was so huge, so poignant.","Countless people looked at this firework and forgot to breathe. Their eyes were dazed.","As the fireworks gradually dissipated, Supreme Gai Fu was nowhere to be seen. Along with him, at least three Six Scar Void Masters had also disappeared.","It was as if the world had deleted it. There was no aura left in the void.","The raging flames that had burned the sky and turned all life into fury not only burned the Six Scar Void Master of the Void Universe, but also Supreme Master Gai Fu himself.","Supreme Gai Fu had fallen.","Countless people were stunned, as if they had been frozen. They looked at this scene stiffly, with only endless shock and admiration in their eyes.","With his own body, he turned into a towering rage, shattered the sky, stepped into the nine nethers, and had no wish or regret.","“Old friend.”","There was a complicated look in the eyes of the Overlord Patriarch as he sighed softly.","He had once discussed the Dao with Supreme Gai Fu in the Eastern Sea. He had once used the boundless starry sky as a chessboard and the stars in the sky as chess pieces, forming a deep friendship with Supreme Gai Fu.","“Supreme Gai Fu. You are worthy of respect.”","The sloppy Daoist Immortal Hulu took a deep breath and poured out a cup of clear wine from the gourd in his hand, sprinkling it into the starry sky. “I’m sorry to have met you in such a way.”","Even though he was not acquainted with Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, he was completely awed by his courage and fearlessness.","“Teacher.”","Ninth Kalpa King’s face turned pale in an instant. As if he had been drained of all his strength, his legs turned soft and he almost fell from the sky.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the crowd, did not speak. However, he felt as if there was a heavy stone on his chest. It was extremely heavy and even his breathing became slow."]},{"number":4560,"title":"Chapter 4560 Travelling 3,000 Miles with One Move, Leading a Million Troops with One Sword","paragraphs":["4560 Travelling 3,000 Miles with One Move, Leading a Million Troops with One Sword","In the Divine Power Universe.","The 34 Void Masters had already retreated to the edge of the Offworld Battlefield. Behind them was the crack in the void.","However, the void crack that was originally unimpeded and allowed them to enter and exit as they wished had been completely sealed.","There was no path behind him, but there were pursuers in front.","!!","Supreme Gai Fu’s attack, which was formed from the burning of his life source, had reversed the situation.","At least a few of the 34 Void Masters at the Six Scar level had already fallen to Supreme Gai Fu’s desperate blow.","The remaining 30 or so Void Warriors all had their robes torn apart and were in a sorry state.","They looked at each other, their faces ashen.","“Lord Void Emissary, what should we do now?” a Six Scar Void Master said in a deep voice.","The white-haired, burly old man with a bare upper body did not reply. Instead, he glared at the Overlord Patriarch and the others with a cold gaze, his eyes filled with fear.","Although Supreme Master Gai Fu’s desperate attack had taken away several Six Scar level Void Masters, including ancient almighty experts like Void Master Gu Heng and Sky Spide, this was not the worst news.","What made the white-haired old man’s heart sink the most was the closing of the void rift.","He had just tried to communicate with the people who had survived in the Void Universe, but he realized that as the crack closed, their communication was also cut off.","This meant that they did not know what was happening in the Void Universe.","And most importantly, they could not go back.","The laws of the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe were not connected, and even the things they cultivated were different. This meant that they could not recover and replenish their void power in the Divine Power Universe.","The battle with the Divine Power Universe had just come to an end and they were at their weakest. They couldn’t replenish their void power, so the Divine Power Universe could slowly wear them down.","After taking a deep breath, the Right Void Emissary of the Void Universe, the white-haired, burly old man, had a flash of determination in his eyes. He said, “Contact Lord Void God immediately. Otherwise, we’ll all die here.”","After saying that, the Right Void Emissary squeezed out a drop of black blood from his fingertip and pressed it between his eyebrows.","In an instant, the Right Void Emissary seemed to have sensed something. He immediately knelt on the ground and kept muttering the words to summon Void God.","“Kill!”","On the other side, the eyes of the Overlord Patriarch flickered, and he coldly uttered the word ‘kill’. He turned into a rolling sun first, and his right fist gathered thousands of wind sounds, blasting toward the 34 Void Masters of the Void Universe!","The other Invincible Supremes also unleashed all sorts of killing techniques and followed closely behind.","Take his life while he’s down!","It was not just Invincible Supreme who moved. At this moment, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and the other ordinary Supremes also had killing intent in their eyes.","Jian Wushuang took the lead and rode his sword across the sky.","Behind him, Ninth Kalpa King activated his innate magical ability, the evolution of gods and demons!","“Kill kill kill kill! All of you will die!”","“All of you, go and be buried with Teacher!”","Ninth Kalpa King’s white hair turned into a coquettish red at this moment, and two blood moons appeared in his eyes.","A violent and crazy aura gushed out of his body!","“What?”","Jian Wushuang turned back to look at Ninth Kalpa King and he could not help but be shocked.","Ninth Kalpa King was possessed by the devil?","If Supreme Master Gai Fu’s death had dealt the greatest blow to anyone, it would undoubtedly be Ninth Kalpa King.","In Ninth Kalpa King’s heart, Supreme Master Gai Fu’s position was more important than his parents.","He had helplessly watched Supreme Gai Fu fall in front of him. At this moment, he had actually fallen into bedevilment!","“Die!”","A Three Scar Void Master stood in front of Ninth Kalpa King.","Before the Void Master could make a move, Ninth Kalpa King’s big hand had already slammed on his head. His head was directly smacked into his chest and then turned into a pool of meat sauce.","“Die, die, die, die, die!”","“Go to hell!!!”","Ninth Kalpa King’s palms danced wildly, and each palm strike directly killed a Void Master.","Ancient black divine patterns emerged on his skin, and his aura rose at a rapid pace","The peak of the Intermediate Supreme realm!","Perfect Intermediate of the Supreme realm!","Bang!","High Supreme realm!","He had broken through!","After breaking through, Ninth Kalpa King’s combat strength had simply soared!","Previously, Ninth Kalpa King was calm, proud, and indifferent.","But now, he had completely turned into a human weapon, a raging sea!","However, his aura did not stop there. It was still soaring!","His cultivation level was rising at an unprecedented speed.","...","No one was a match for him. The area within a hundred miles of him had completely turned into a purgatory of Asura.","Not only were the ordinary Void Masters in the Void Universe scared out of their wits, but even the Supreme Masters in the Divine Power Universe felt their eyelids Twitch and their hearts tremble in fear.","“One is Ninth Kalpa King, and the other is Jian Wushuang. These two people from the Divine Life Palace are more abnormal than the other.”","An old Supreme expert said.","“In my opinion, as long as Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King join forces, I’m afraid these two can sweep away all the ordinary Void Masters in the entire Void Universe, right?”","“It’s a resplendent era, an era of great struggle!”","“I’m afraid the current Ninth Kalpa King is not much weaker than Jian Wushuang.”","The Supreme martial artists sighed with emotion.","On the other side, after Jian Wushuang took a glance at Ninth Kalpa King, he also began to kill.","Jian Wushuang’s massacre was even more direct and destructive than Ninth Kalpa King’s!","He was like a scholar who traveled far with a book, but also like an Immortal who did not touch the mortal world. There was no expression on his handsome and cold face.","However, the sharp Sword Qi from the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand swept out in all directions and shot into the sky, frantically harvesting the lives of the Void Masters in the Void Universe.","Many of the weaker Void Warriors had just seen Jian Wushuang’s sword move, and the sword that was like a white dragon had already killed them.","Countless people looked at Jian Wushuang and they all thought the same thing.","“He could travel 3,000 miles with one move, and command a million troops with one sword!”","“Who said that a scholar is useless? A scholar holding a sword is also a king!”","Just as the slaughter reached its peak.","The Right Void Emissary, who was constantly sending messages to the Void God, stopped talking.","Immediately.","Rumble!!!","The sky cracked.","The figure of an old man with white hair and a white beard was the first to fly out of the crack in the sky.","“Lord Cosmos God!”","Everyone’s eyes narrowed slightly.","The expression of Cosmos God remained the same. However, there was an obvious crack on his right sleeve.","Everyone’s hearts sank when they saw this.","Then, they saw Void God shrouded in endless black fog walk down from the sky with his hands behind his back.","He did not use any void power, but it was as if heaven and earth were automatically lifting him up, as if the Demon God from the Nine Heavens had descended.","The world and the universe were playing a sad song for him.","Void God’s red eyes, which were only revealed, moved slightly. He saw the many Void Masters who had been forced to shrink to the side and the right Void Master who was kneeling on the ground.","“Useless trash.”"]},{"number":4561,"title":"Chapter 4561 The Passageway Is Completely Opened","paragraphs":["4561 The Passageway Is Completely Opened","In one life, the grass and trees had three autumns.","Those who did what they wanted to do were called gentlemen.","Those who did not do anything were heroes.","The meaning of a hero was not to save the common people from fire and water.","A hero dared to risk the world’s condemnation, knowing that there was a tiger in the mountain, but still went to the mountain.","!!","Although there were tens of millions of people, he still went forward.","Thus, Supreme Gai Fu was worthy of the title of a hero.","He had used his own body to start the epic beginning of this Great Catastrophe War, reversing the situation of victory and defeat between the two universes.","However, as Void God walked out of the crack in the sky, an extremely magnificent power instantly descended on the scene, isolating the countless Divine Power Universe Supreme beings who were killing each other.","“Lord Void God.”","The Right Void Emissary knelt on the ground with a guilty expression. As the two commanders of this battle, he and the Left Void Emissary had undoubtedly failed in their command.","“Useless trash.”","Void God shook his head coldly. He then turned his gaze to Cosmos God and let out a low, masculine voice.","“Cosmos God, it’s been 100,000 void epochs since I last saw you. Your improvement has truly disappointed me.”","The expression of Cosmos God sank when he heard this, but he did not reply.","Void God was born by devouring all the negative emotions in the world, such as desire, greed, obsession, blood, and resentment. 100,000 void eras ago, he had been wounded severely. Unexpectedly, after 100,000 void eras, not only had he recovered, but his power had also improved. It was hard for anyone to deal with him now.","Void God shook his head and said, “Cosmos God, I know what you’re planning. You’ve sent someone into our Void Universe and used the Fengtian Flag to close the void rift’s passageway, right?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank immediately.","“He knows about the existence of the Fengtian Flags?”","Before Cosmos God could reply, Void God’s gaze turned again and swept across the faces of the Supremes of the Divine Power Universe one by one. Finally, his gaze fell on Jian Wushuang.","“If I’m not wrong, this is the person who entered the Void Universe, right?”","Void God stretched out his finger and pointed at Jian Wushuang.","Suddenly, his fingertips seemed to have turned into a vortex. Black fog gathered at his fingertips and turned into a terrifying black light beam that instantly hit Jian Wushuang.","He did not expect that Void God would suddenly attack him!","The change happened so quickly that it caught everyone off guard. Under the black light, Jian Wushuang was like an ant facing the collapse of the five mountains. He could not resist at all.","The gap between him and Void God was too big.","He was like a weak infant facing a mythological giant that was hundreds of millions of feet tall. Even if he blew on him, Void God could kill Jian Wushuang.","Just as Jian Wushuang clenched his fist and a trace of madness and unwillingness surged in his eyes, a low and cold snort suddenly sounded in the void.","Then, Cosmos God appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Void God, isn’t it too much to attack a Junior like this?”","Cosmos God spoke indifferently. At the same time, he extended his hand and waved it.","In an instant, the black light beam was brushed away by Cosmos God and disappeared.","Void God did not look regretful, but shook his head indifferently.","“Cosmos God, do you think that just because you used the Fengtian Flag to seal the tear in the void, I have no other way?”","“Let’s go,” Void God said with a faint smile. Black mist immediately surged out of Void God’s body. It was mixed with something that looked like a Rubik’s Cube, and it quickly rushed toward the crack in the void.","The moment Cosmos God saw the Rubik’s Cube, his expression changed slightly. He frowned and said, “Spacetime Tunnel Lock? Void God, did you make a deal with the Devouring Emperor?”","Void God did not answer. Instead, he raised his head and closed his eyes. He spread his arms as if he was hugging the world.","“Open, Spacetime Lock.”","Rumble!!!","In an instant, more and more black mist rose from Void God’s body!","In the end, they all rushed into the crack in the void!","In the black fog, there were terrifying sound waves that sounded like the wails of vengeful spirits, making one’s scalp tingle.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Muffled sounds kept coming from the cracks in the void, followed by the aura of the Void Universe!","The crack began to spread at a speed visible to the naked eye, and the crack gradually grew larger.","It was like a giant that was about to open its eyes and wake up from a deep sleep.","“The Fengtian Flag has loosened!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","He could sense that the 99 Fengtian flags, which had been deeply inserted into the void in the Void Forbidden Land of the Void Universe, were being pushed out by a strange force.","It was like a nail that had been deeply rooted in the ground and was ruthlessly pulled out.","One side...","Two sides...","Three sides...","99 Fengtian flags appeared from the void.","The void crack that led to the two universes was still getting bigger.","...","...","In the Void Universe, in the Void Forbidden Land.","Hong Fo and the Void Master Ba Huang had been as anxious as ants on a hot pan. They paced back and forth with gloomy faces, not knowing what to do.","Suddenly, Elder Hong Fo’s face lit up and he said, “Lord Ba Huang, look! The seal of the Void Forbidden Land is loosening!”","“What?”","Ba Huang looked up and immediately noticed that small black flags with divine patterns were constantly appearing in the void.","Not only that, but the 87th spatial crack was also expanding at a shocking speed.","“It must be Lord Void God’s doing!”","...","In the Divine Power Universe, the Offworld Battlefield.","Countless Void Masters of the Void Universe looked at the expanding crack in the void and felt the aura from the Void Universe. They were instantly invigorated and their faces lit up.","“Lord Void God, your power is heavenly!”","The 99th Fengtian flag was pulled out of the Void Forbidden Land.","Boom!!!","All of a sudden, a loud explosion rang out!","The channel connecting the two universes had been completely opened!","The crack in the void had already expanded to about 10,000 feet. It was like the giant mouth of a monster, quietly pressing down on the void.","Even the wind from the Void Universe had already blown out from the crack.","The Supreme experts of the Divine Power Universe were shocked.","Even the hearts of Cosmos God sank.","“Lord Cosmos God, I would like to go and kill them immediately. Otherwise, once they return to the Void Universe and recover, it will definitely be a great calamity for our Divine Power Universe!”","Supreme Sui Xi, the Captain of Team 9, took a step forward and said in a deep voice.","“That’s right. We can’t let them go back. It’s a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to annihilate them. Once they escape and return, we’ll have a chance to recover and make a comeback. That’ll be the real disaster for our Divine Power Universe.”","The crazy alcoholic Immortal Hulu also said with a cold expression.","“It’s too late.”","Upon hearing this, Cosmos God shook his head and sighed."]},{"number":4562,"title":"Chapter 4562 The Only Way Is to Die Fighting","paragraphs":["4562 The Only Way Is to Die Fighting","It was as though he was trying to verify the words of Cosmos God.","Just as the Divine Power Universe was about to give it a try and gather all its strength to kill all the Void Masters in the Divine Power Universe, Void God turned around and looked at the 30 Void Masters behind him, who were all in varying degrees of weakness. He snorted and said, “Let’s go.”","After saying that, Void God cultivator rolled up his sleeve and put the 30 Six Scar Void Masters and hundreds of ordinary Void Masters into his sleeve. Then, he stepped into the crack in the void.","The Divine Power Universe had come with an invincible posture, but in the end, it had ended in a sorry state.","However, none of the people from the divine universe showed any joy.","!!","It seemed that the Divine Power Universe had won the head-on battle between the two universes, and the Divine Power Universe had been defeated.","In reality, this was not the case. Although the Divine Power Universe had defeated several Void Masters in this battle, it was not a serious injury.","The Divine Power Universe had set up all kinds of means for this battle, such as the hundreds of killing formations and the 99 Fengtian Flags that Jian Wushuang had set up in the Void Forbidden Land.","They were planning to greatly damage the Divine Power Universe or even annihilate it completely in one fell swoop.","However, the reality was the complete opposite of what they had expected.","Opportunities were fleeting.","However, this opportunity had already passed away for the Divine Power Universe.","He did not need to think to know that the next time the Divine Power Universe made a comeback and attacked, it would definitely be fully prepared.","At that time, it would be a catastrophe for the Divine Power Universe.","And this day was clearly not going to be long.","“Detestable!”","An Invincible Supreme punched the air in front of him, shattering it like a mirror as he vented his frustration.","Although the other Invincible Supremes did not express their inner depression like this person, their faces were all gloomy and unsightly.","Jian Wushuang put the Tarot Divine Sword back into its scabbard and sighed.","Without the Devourers’ interference, they might have achieved their goal.","At least, Jian Wushuang was sure that the ordinary Void Masters in the Divine Power Universe would definitely be annihilated. None of them would be able to escape.","Without the Spacetime Lock provided by the Devourers, Void God would not be able to open the channel between the two universes. At least half of the Six Scar Void Masters would die here.","Unfortunately, no matter how they planned, they did not expect the Devourers.","“Alright, let’s go back and prepare.”","Cosmos God took in a deep breath and spoke in a deep voice.","He was the leader of the Divine Power Universe. Although he was also depressed about this battle, he knew he could not show it.","If he showed any signs of dejection, the Divine Power Universe would be finished.","The Divine Power Universe might seem tough, but it was actually a rope that was tied to Cosmos God.","“Alright.”","Everyone nodded their heads and followed behind Cosmos God as they headed back to the base camp.","The Offworld Battlefield became quiet again. Only a pile of broken limbs and countless divine power fluctuations were left, confirming the tragic battle just now.","However, as time passed, these traces of battle would be silently swallowed by the universe and repeated.","The universe would never change.","It was like a ruthless and constantly running machine, silently watching the change of times, the rise and fall of the tide.","Even if the people of the Divine Power Universe entered, the ones who would disappear would be the cultivators living in the Divine Power Universe.","...","Back at the base camp.","Some of the Supreme experts in charge of guarding the camp saw everyone’s serious faces and silent appearances. They also knew that this battle would not end well.","Hence, they did not open their mouths to ask anything. Instead, they called out ‘Lord Cosmos God’ in a low voice and did not say anything else.","“Yes.” Cosmos God nodded at them before saying, “Come to the main hall and discuss the next step of the plan.”","There was a hint of fatigue in his voice.","After saying that, Cosmos God did not say anything more. He walked toward the great hall by himself.","At this moment, everyone realized.","Unknowingly, Cosmos God’s back, which was originally straight and upright, had become slightly hunched. His back view appeared thin and lonely.","Seeing this, everyone could not help but look at each other and sigh.","The pressure on Cosmos God was the greatest among them.","He had shouldered too much.","“Let’s go.”","The Overlord Patriarch took in a deep breath and followed behind Cosmos God with large strides, heading into the great hall.","After entering the hall, everyone cupped their hands and said, “We pay our respects to Lord Cosmos God.”","“At a time like this, there’s no need to talk about these unnecessary formalities.”","Cosmos God waved his hand, a hint of fatigue in his eyes.","After saying that, Cosmos God did not say anything else. Instead, he cast his gaze toward the Great Hall.","Some of the seats were already empty.","One of the seats closer to the front was the seat of Team 5’s Captain, Supreme Zerowood.","It was empty there. The position was still there, but the person would never come back.","...","“Supreme Zerowood died at the hands of the First Ancestor of the Sky Glory Holy Land in the Divine Power Universe...”","The Captain of Team 4, Supreme Jin Yan, said softly.","Among the nine Captains, he had the best relationship with Supreme Zerowood.","The two of them lived in the same era and were the two Heaven’s Favorites of that era. Later on, they entered the Offworld Battleground together and fought side by side. It could be said that they were the closest family in the world.","“Yes.” Cosmos God nodded his head. “Little Lan, later on, go to the heroic rankings and inscribe Supreme Zerowood’s name on it.”","“Yes, Master,” Lan Lan replied softly.","Even though she was the disciple of a Cosmos God and had a revered status, she had also joined this battle. Furthermore, her face was pale and her aura was weak. She had suffered considerable injuries on the battlefield.","Without letting his negative and sorrowful emotions spread, Cosmos God took in a deep breath and forced himself to focus. His gaze regained its sharpness as he swept his gaze across everyone’s faces and said, “What are your plans for the future?”","As soon as he said this, everyone looked at each other, and no one spoke.","He had already used all the methods he could. In a battle of this level, ordinary schemes and intrigues were no longer of any use.","After a long time.","White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, stood up from his seat and said with a resolute tone, “There’s no other way, we’ll deal with it when the soldiers come, we’ll deal with it when the water comes, we’ll fight to the death!”","“A battle to the death?”","Upon hearing this, Cosmos God’s eyes narrowed before he nodded. His eyes were filled with boundless killing intent and determination.","“That’s right, we’ll fight to the death!”","Upon hearing this, the other Supreme martial artists’ eyes lit up.","Indeed, at this point in time, all schemes and intrigues were just a joke if he wanted to defeat the Divine Power Universe.","They only had one path to take, and that was to fight to the death!","“I agree!”","Wu Jianxian coldly spat out these two words.","“Seconded!”","“Seconded!”","“Seconded!”","“Seconded...”"]},{"number":4563,"title":"Chapter 4563 Leaving","paragraphs":["4563 Leaving","All of a sudden, the entire great hall of Cosmos God was filled with the sound of ‘agreement’. The word ‘fight to the death’ shot up to the heavens and shook the Nine Continents!","Cosmos God took a deep breath and looked at the Supremes in the hall. He nodded slightly in his heart.","As long as the morale was still there, all obstacles were just waiting for them.","“I’ll fight force with force, and accompany you to the end.”","An Invincible Supreme expert said, his eyes surging with battle intent.","!!","“That’s right, if you want to fight, then fight. At most, you’ll die!”","“As cultivators, why should we hesitate to fight?”","“When the Yin and Yang are in chaos, I will dye the sky with my divine blood!”","The other Invincible Supremes also spoke out.","To be able to cultivate to this realm, which one of them was not a Dragon or Phoenix among men, an existence that ruled over all ages?","Life and death had long been disregarded by them. From the moment they stepped into the Offworld Battleground, they did not even care about their own lives.","Only the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin races remained silent and avoided the gaze of Cosmos God.","Cosmos God could only pretend not to see this.","“Alright, everyone. In that case, all of you should go back and recuperate and prepare yourselves while waiting for the great battle to begin.”","The eyes of Cosmos God flickered as he spoke in a deep voice.","In this battle, the people from the Void Universe suffered heavy injuries, but the people from the Divine Power Universe were also injured. They had to make full use of their time and maintain their peak condition.","“Yes.”","The crowd dispersed, and the hall returned to silence.","Cosmos God’s straight back relaxed and he sighed softly. He no longer concealed the fatigue between his brows.","He had been far, far too tired after defending for 100,000 chaos cycles.","Rubbing the space between his brows, Cosmos God turned to Lan Lan and said, “Little Lan, go to the depths of the universe again on my behalf and summon all the Invincible Supremes who are still in the depths of the universe to the Offworld Battlefield.”","“Alright.” Lan Lan did not waste any time. After nodding in agreement, she walked out of the hall, released a Cosmic Boat, and shot into the depths of the universe.","After Lan Lan left, only Cosmos God and Lan Su were left in the great hall.","“Master, if all of the Invincible Supremes are transferred here, I’m afraid that without the suppression of the Invincible Supremes in the depths of the universe, there will inevitably be people who will take advantage of this opportunity to wreak havoc in the world.”","Lan Su said worriedly.","Hearing this, Cosmos God frowned and glanced at Lan Su. “Desperate times call for desperate measures. At this point, if we can’t hold this battle, the entire Divine Power Universe will be destroyed. There’s no need to worry about anything else.”","Pausing for a moment, Cosmos God continued, “If anyone dares to cause trouble at this time and we lose this battle, naturally we can forget about this. If we win, this old man will go and settle the score.”","“Yes, I understand.” Lan Su nodded in a daze.","“Yes, you can leave too. Let me be alone.”","Cosmos God waved his hand and dismissed Lan Su. He first looked down at the torn sleeve on his right hand, then looked up at the sky. His gaze seemed to penetrate the roof of the hall and looked at the endless starry sky. He sighed softly.","The thing that made his heart sink the most happened because he could no longer suppress Void God after the battle.","“I have to let the others grow up quickly.”","Reining in his thoughts, the eyes of Cosmos God flashed with a look of Enlightenment.","...","At the same time, in the depths of the starry sky.","A giant black turtle the size of an entire star field was swimming back and forth.","Some space pirates and cultivators who were passing by were shocked when they saw the giant turtle. They quickly moved away and did not dare to block the way.","“This... this is a f*cking turtle?”","“This turtle head is bigger than a planet!”","“Let’s go, let’s go! It must be some old monster!”","The cultivators and space pirates all exclaimed in amazement.","On the turtle’s back, no one could hear the excited screams of a young girl.","“Wow wow wow, Master, so this is the depths of the universe?”","“This is too beautiful!”","“Wow! Aohou! Aowu!”","The young girl was none other than the young girl who had met Jian Wushuang once at the Southern Ocean island.","During this period of time, she traveled the entire universe with Fengtian Patriarch and finally arrived at the depths of the universe, which was also the most prosperous area in the universe.","Chu Zhi’s eyes glowed as she looked at the countless galaxies orbiting in front of her. Countless galaxies were drawn horizontally, and countless races were shuttling back and forth in the universe.","In the past, when she was at the Southern Ocean Immortal Island, the starry sky she saw was only so big. She thought that the starry sky was really only so big. It was only at this moment that she realized that the starry sky in the universe was so bright and beautiful. It was a beauty that she had never imagined.","“Calm down, calm down... Chu Zhi! Calm down!”","Just as Chu Zhi was making a big fuss, her head suddenly exploded. She could not help but hold her head in pain and grimace.","“Master, why did you hit me?”","The child opened its big bright eyes and looked at Patriarch Fengtian with a wronged expression.","“Don’t act like you’re being wronged.”","Fengtian Patriarch blew at his beard and glared at the girl. He then said with a look of disdain.","“My dear disciple, your Master, I, am a respected figure in the universe. You’ve made yourself look like you’ve never seen the world before. It’s embarrassing for your Master.”","...","“Oh...”","Chu Yang’s ‘oh’ was dragged out, making the meaning of the ‘Oh’ sound a little awkward.","“Master, I haven’t seen anyone greet you along the way. They’re all very respectful.” Chu Zhi mumbled softly.","“What are you saying?”","Upon hearing this, Fengtian Patriarch was instantly infuriated. He snorted coldly and said, “When I dominated the universe back then, the depths of the universe were still in chaos. It’s normal for these little guys to not recognize me.”","When Chu Zhi heard this, she could not help but stick out her tongue playfully.","“Alright, I can’t be bothered to talk to you about this.”","After a pause, the expression of the Fengtian Patriarch gradually became solemn. He said in a deep voice, “Disciple, I’m leaving.”","“Leaving?”","Chu Zhi was stunned when she heard this, but her eyes immediately lit up with excitement as she nodded with a smile, “Sure, when are we leaving?”","Fengtian Patriarch took a deep breath and shook his head. “Disciple, it’s not us. I’m the one who will be leaving, alone.”","“Huh?” Chu Zhi was stunned when she heard this, and her face revealed a confused expression.","Ever since she was an infant and had learned how to speak, she had been by the side of the Fengtian Patriarch.","She had never thought that her Master would leave her one day.","She did not know why, but she suddenly felt as if all her strength had been sucked out of her. Her feet became lighter and heavier, as if she was stepping on clouds. It also felt as if a large stone was blocking her chest, causing her breathing to become somewhat sluggish."]},{"number":4564,"title":"Chapter 4564 Rebellious","paragraphs":["4564 Rebellious","The atmosphere fell into an unprecedented silence.","After a long while, Chu Zhi forced a smile on her face and asked, “Master, where are you going?”","Fengtian Patriarch noticed the expression on her young face, and a hint of pity appeared in his eyes.","If it was possible, why would he want to leave this child?","This silly disciple of his was so innocent and pure. If he was no longer around, who would protect her?","She would definitely be deceived, right?","In the long years, the old and the young had already depended on each other and became an unbreakable bond.","However, in the next moment, the heartache in the eyes of the Fengtian Patriarch was replaced by determination.","He turned his head and no longer looked at Chu Zhi. He looked toward the distant battlefield and tried to calm his voice, “I’m going to a place where I should be.”","Chu Zhi fell silent once again. She knew that he had to go and make up for his regrets.","Her Master did not participate in the last Great Catastrophe War, and the entire universe was covered in corpses. Although Fengtian Patriarch rarely spoke about this, Chu Zhi knew that her Master had always been brooding over the fact that he had not helped the universe.","And now, the Great Catastrophe War had broken out once more. It was time for her Master to complete his mission.","“Okay.” Chu Zhi’s face squeezed out a brilliant smile, and her eyes turned into crescent moons.","“Master, the sooner you leave, the sooner you return. I’m still waiting for you to accompany me to continue touring the universe.”","“Haha, I hope that the next time I see you, you’ll have found someone who’s willing to accompany you through the sea of stars and not this old man.”","Reaching out to stroke her young hair affectionately, the Fengtian Patriarch heaved a sigh of relief.","Fortunately, this disciple of his was not completely unable to accept his departure, and her emotions were still relatively stable.","With that, he could rest assured.","However, he had forgotten that Chu Zhi had always been a very sensible girl.","“Disciple, I’ll be leaving then. The next time I see you, if your cultivation level doesn’t improve, I’ll punish you.”","“I’m off,” Fengtian Patriarch said with a smile. Without any hesitation, he left a sensing mark on Chu Zhi’s body. Then, he took a step forward and turned into a beam of light, flying into the distance.","With a single jump, he crossed hundreds of millions of miles, crossing countless galaxies and stars. His speed was extremely fast, and in a short moment, he disappeared into the depths of the universe.","...","Offworld Battlefield, main camp.","All the Supreme martial artists went into seclusion to recuperate, and the entire Offworld Battlefield was silent.","However, everyone knew that this was just a sign of the coming storm.","What about the great hall of Cosmos God?","Cosmos God sat on the main seat and massaged his glabella. He had not taken a break for the past few days as he continued to refine Supreme treasures and divine medicines. He hoped that he would be able to give these Supremes of the Divine Power Universe a helping hand.","“Master, these are the tea leaves from the Jilong Mountain in the Bright Sun Star Field. I picked them some time ago. They can help you rest in peace. Please try them.”","Lan Su carried a ceramic glazed teacup with both hands and walked over respectfully.","A hint of tea fragrance mixed with steam rose from the teacup.","However, what was surprising was that after the hot air rose, it did not dissipate, but turned into the appearance of a small Qilin.","“Eh? The Nine Gods Tea Tree is guarded by the Tianji clan at Jilong Mountain. You’re really kind to be able to get these tea leaves from them.”","Cosmos God smiled and took a sip of tea from the teacup. He was slightly pleased.","“Master’s words are too serious, this is all disciple’s duty.” Lan Su replied with a smile.","After drinking a mouthful of tea, Cosmos God felt his mood improve slightly.","Seeing this, Lan Su had an idea and asked, “Master, how confident do you think we are in winning this battle?”","“I’m afraid it’s not even 30 percent,” Cosmos God replied after some thought.","“Is that so?” Lan Su nodded as a thoughtful look flashed across his eyes. He then used a probing tone and said softly, “Master, you’ve already been standing guard here for 100,000 chaos cycles. If... I mean, if the Divine Power Universe is really broken, do you still want to die with it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the atmosphere suddenly became strangely quiet.","Cosmos God put down his teacup, and the smile on his face gradually disappeared. He looked at Lan Su expressionlessly and slowly said, “What do you mean by that?”","Lan Su’s heart trembled when he heard this.","“Master, I...”","He opened his mouth a few times as if he wanted to say something, but in the end, he seemed to have thought of something. He gritted his teeth and raised his head to look at Cosmos God. He said in a deep voice, “Master, other than Void God, Snake God isn’t weak in the Void Universe, and they seem to have the Devourers’ support. If I may be so bold as to say this, the Divine Power Universe doesn’t have much chance of survival.”","“Instead of being buried with the Divine Power Universe, Master, you might as well discuss with Void God and see if you can rule the Divine Power Universe by drawing stars. With your strength, as long as you talk with Void God, I’m sure he won’t be brainless. He’ll definitely be happy to form an alliance with you...”","“Bastard!!!” Without waiting for Lan Su to finish his sentence, Cosmos God had already sent out a palm and slapped Lan Su’s face ruthlessly.","“Lan Su! Are you asking me to give up the entire universe for the sake of my own life and death, regardless of the billions of lives in it?”","Bang!","The slap sent Lan Su flying, and a huge pit appeared on the ground.","“This disciple...”","Lan Su turned over and stood up. He quickly knelt on the ground and kept kowtowing. His forehead shook the floor until it made a muffled sound. “This disciple doesn’t dare!”","Upon hearing this, the expression of Cosmos God turned extremely ugly. He berated sternly, “Get out of here! If Master hears your treasonous words again, don’t blame Master for ending your life without considering the master-disciple relationship!”","He did not notice that when Lan Su, who had buried his face deep in the ground, heard this, a hint of resentment appeared on his face.","“...This disciple knows his mistake!”","Lan Su squeezed out these words from between his teeth.","“Why aren’t you getting lost?” Cosmos God shouted out once more.","“... Yes!” Lan Su stood up and left respectfully.","However, no one noticed that his gaze had stopped on the teacup beside Cosmos God for an instant. A look of pain and pleasure appeared on his face.","“Master, I don’t want to be buried with the Divine Power Universe. Since you’re so stubborn and can’t tell right from wrong, then don’t blame me for taking the initiative.”","Lan Su muttered to himself and left Cosmos God Great Hall with large strides.","Within the great hall, only Cosmos God was left.","He kept breathing in and out to adjust his emotions, but his face was still ashen, and his anger had not subsided.","Other than anger, he felt even more heartache.","He had never thought that the disciple he had brought up would say such treacherous words."]},{"number":4565,"title":"Chapter 4565 The Arrival of the Fengtian Patriarch","paragraphs":["4565 The Arrival of the Fengtian Patriarch","Offworld Battlefield, main camp.","Team 7. In a palace.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on a futon with his eyes closed and his brows furrowed.","The battle between the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe had reached the most critical stage. It was almost foreseeable that when the Void Universe came back again, it would strike like a thunderbolt. It was bound to have a life-or-death battle with the Divine Power Universe.","The Divine Power Universe had already come up with a plan to deal with this.","There was no other choice but to fight to the death.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang should not have any other thoughts. He only needed to improve his power quietly and wait for the two universes to fight again.","However, Jian Wushuang had been feeling uneasy these days.","He knew the reason.","That was because when he was at the God Refining Sect, Ban Shan had mentioned the word ‘spy’ to him.","There were spies in the Divine Power Universe.","And this spy was hiding in the base.","Jian Wushuang had thought that the spy hiding among the higher-ups of the Divine Power Universe would reveal himself after the great battle. However, the first great battle had already ended, and the infiltrator had not revealed anything.","This made Jian Wushuang’s heart sink. This ‘lurker’ was probably up to something big.","“Chaotic world...”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang stopped thinking about it and started to improve his cultivation.","...","As time gradually passed.","More and more Invincible Supremes arrived at the Offworld Battlefield.","The patriarchs of the top forces had all been in deep sleep, but for this battle, they had all woken up from their long sleep. They had come to the Offworld Battlefield despite the danger.","They had been the last trump card and foundation of the Divine Power Universe, but now they had all come out. It could be said that the Divine Power Universe was willing to pay any price for this battle.","With the arrival of the Fengtian Patriarch, the entire Offworld Battlefield was finally in an uproar!","“Fengtian Patriarch! Back then, he was an existence on the same level as Lord Cosmos God!”","“I can’t believe that the Fengtian Patriarch has finally reappeared after 100,000 chaos cycles!”","“Back then, Fengtian Patriarch was an existence who could subdue the ancestral Dragon! I just don’t know why the Fengtian Patriarch’s black tortoise didn’t appear.”","“With the Fengtian Patriarch here, what’s there to worry about?”","“Victory is ours!”","Countless old and experienced Invincible Supremes who knew of the Fengtian Patriarch stroked their beards and laughed heartily.","Meanwhile, those who did not know the Fengtian Patriarch were overjoyed after hearing the story.","Why were so many people so worried and hopeless about the battle between the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe and could only fight to the death?","It was because beside Void God, the Snake God was also unbeatable!","The Snake God was an existence that had already taken that step. Although he had yet to reach the level of Void God and Cosmos God, he was only slightly weaker than them.","This was what gave the Divine Power Universe the biggest headache.","This was because no one in the entire universe could keep the Snake God in check.","However, things were different now.","The Fengtian Patriarch had arrived!","The Fengtian Patriarch was a Xiantian Life Form born in the chaos. If the Ancestral Dragon, the Phoenix Ancestor, and the Qilin King were still alive, they would have to call him ‘Senior’ respectfully when they saw him.","He was the same as the Snake God. The only thing he was lacking from becoming as powerful as Cosmos God and Void God was a bit of luck!","The Fengtian Patriarch was enough to turn the tide and change the outcome!","“Senior Fengtian.”","“Senior Fengtian...”","Some of the Invincible Supremes who had dominated an era greeted the Fengtian Patriarch one after another.","Even the Overlord Patriarch, White Ape, who had always been unruly and looked down on everyone, took the initiative to step forward and smile. “Old Brother Fengtian, long time no see.”","Fengtian Patriarch looked at White Ape and nodded slightly. Then, he smiled and replied, “White Ape, it seems like you’re going to take that step and join our ranks.”","Hearing this, Overlord Patriarch waved his hand and replied with a bitter smile, “This step seems simple, but it’s not. Since ancient times, countless people have been stuck at this step.”","Fengtian Patriarch did not refute this. Indeed, people like the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace and Supreme Gai Fu, who had used his life source to launch a brilliant attack, were all rare heroes and geniuses, but they were all stuck at this step.","As for himself, if he wanted to take this step and reach the realm of Cosmos God, it would be even harder.","“Old Brother Fengtian, do you want to go and meet Cosmos God first?” White Ape changed the topic and asked with a smile.","“See him?”","Upon hearing the name of Cosmos God, the originally amiable and smiling old Fengtian Patriarch instantly turned unhappy. He huffed and said, “Why are we meeting this old man? Let’s go, don’t mention him.”","When Overlord Patriarch heard that, he could not help but rub his nose, not knowing whether to laugh or cry.","He did not expect that after so many years, the Fengtian Patriarch would still be brooding over this matter.","However, he could understand. He smiled and said, “Brother Fengtian, come with me. I’ll find a place for you to settle down.”","“Alright.” The expression on Fengtian Patriarch’s face eased slightly, and he started chatting with Overlord Patriarch again with a smile.","Meanwhile, in Cosmos God’s hall, Cosmos God was also speechless when he found out that the Fengtian Patriarch had arrived but refused to meet him.","“This guy, after so many years, he’s still as stubborn as ever. What a childish heart.”","Even though he said that, Cosmos God still felt more relaxed in his heart.","He was well aware of the strength of the Fengtian Patriarch. He was definitely no weaker than Snake God, who had been at the height of his power for tens of thousands of chaos cycles.","Although he might not be able to defeat Void God, he was confident that he could still trap Void God.","That was enough.","“We might not lose this battle.”","Cosmos God narrowed his eyes, revealing a hint of battle intent.","...","A month after the Fengtian Patriarch arrived at the Offworld Battlefield.","The Void Universe had finally made a comeback!","This time, the Void Universe had mobilized all its forces, gathering all the peak combat power of the entire Void Universe!","They were mighty, blocking out the sun and occupying the entire starry sky. The pressure they exuded was enough to collapse the primordial era and shake the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","The first to walk with his hands behind his back was Void God, who was shrouded in endless black mist and only revealed a pair of scarlet eyes.","Closely behind him was a nine-headed serpent, and on the foreheads of the serpent were the symbols of the sun, moon, and other stars.","This huge snake’s strength was also extremely terrifying. With a slither of its body, it drew a pitch-black passage in the void.","This person was Snake God from the Void Universe!","Back then, Wang Liu, who had wanted to seize control of Jian Wushuang’s divine body, was the junior of Snake God."]},{"number":4566,"title":"Chapter 4566 The Outbreak of Battle","paragraphs":["4566 The Outbreak of Battle","Snake God!","He was an important figure in the Void Universe!","Ever since the battle between Void God and Cosmos God and the Snake God fell into a deep sleep, the Snake God had risen to power and took over as the leader, becoming the new Overlord of the Void Universe.","Compared to Void God, Snake God’s strength was far inferior. However, this did not mean that he was weak.","Snake God’s strength was on par with Fengtian Patrairch. He had already taken that step and was in between Six Scar and Void God’s level. The reason why he had not reached Void God’s cultivation realm was that he lacked some fate energy.","Behind Void God and the Snake God were the two Void Emissaries on the left and right. These two were the peak existences among the Six Scar Void Masters!","After that, they walked out together. Each of them had different appearances and auras, but they were all extremely powerful Void Masters of the Six Scar level!","The Third Patriarch of Sky Glory Sect, the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, and the Palace Master of the Dark Yin Palace — The second batch of Six Scar Void Masters that had been left in the Void Universe — were also summoned by Void God and mobilized.","When they stood together, their combined aura shot up into the sky, giving people an extremely powerful visual impact!","Behind them was the army of ordinary Void Masters. They were also the largest in number, filling the entire sky and blocking out the sun. No one dared to look at them.","The most terrifying thing was that in the void not far away from them, there were faint fluctuations and seven figures in black robes were revealed.","That was... The Devourers!","At this moment, when they were united, it could be said that this force was enough to destroy the heavens and earth, rush up to the nine Heavens and blue skies, and shake the nine netherworlds!","It was indescribably terrifying!","At the same time.","In the base of the Offworld Battlefield.","Ring!!!","A sharp alarm suddenly exploded in the sky!","Everyone who was in their respective chambers opened their eyes almost at the same time.","The next moment.","The low voice of Cosmos God rang out in their minds.","“The final battle has begun. Gather quickly.”","Rumble!!!","Team 7. Jian Wushuang’s bedroom.","“It’s finally starting.”","The divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes grew by three inches and his whole body was filled with a sharp aura.","Then, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, picked up the Tarot Divine Sword, and put it back into the scabbard at his waist. He stood up.","“Then let’s start!”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and disappeared from the bedchamber.","...","When Jian Wushuang walked to the main hall of the base camp, the spacious hall was already filled with people.","Seeing Jian Wushuang coming, these ordinary Supreme experts looked at him with respect and took the initiative to make way for him.","Without realizing it, Jian Wushuang had already conquered everyone. He was unbeatable below the Invincible Supreme, but he was also a formidable leader of the Supreme experts!","The word ‘leader’ was extremely heavy.","Jian Wushuang walked closer and nodded at the Supreme experts in response.","Some of the Invincible Supremes turned around to look at Jian Wushuang with admiration in their eyes.","“Long time no see, Little Guy.”","The Overlord Patriarch smiled at Jian Wushuang.","“Senior White Ape!”","Jian Wushuang also smiled at Overlord Patriarch.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s shoulder was patted heavily by someone and a loud voice was heard.","“Hahahaha, Little Chicken, I see you again!”","The corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth twitched. He turned around and saw Patriarch Fengtian looking at him with a smile.","“Senior Fengtian.” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and cupped his hands at Patriarch Fengtian.","“Hehe, Little Guy, I finally get to see you. I forgot to ask you last time, what’s your name again?” Patriarch Fengtian stroked his beard and smiled.","“Senior Fengtian, I am Jian Wushuang,” Jian Wushuang replied honestly.","“Jian Wushuang? Mhm, this old man is somewhat familiar with this name. When I was travelling the universe recently, I seem to have heard people mention you. You’re the number one genius of this era in our universe, right?”","Patriarch Fengtian sized up Jian Wushuang and said with interest.","“Junior doesn’t dare to accept such an honor.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Just as Patriarch Fengtian was about to say something else, a figure with white hair and a white beard walked out from the depths of the hall.","Seeing the appearance of Cosmos God, Patriarch Fengtian’s face fell. He snorted coldly and turned his head away, not saying another word.","As for the others, they were also making slanderous remarks. They looked straight at Cosmos God and their expressions became solemn.","Cosmos God was expressionless as he swept his gaze across everyone’s faces. He did not say anything unnecessary and merely said four simple words.","“Follow me to battle.”","“Yes!”","All the people in the area responded, their voices reaching the sky and shaking the Nine Heavens!","Of course, that was excluding the Patriarch Fengtian.","“It’s quite like that. It’s all gaudy.”","He pouted slightly.","Cosmos God did not care about him. He stomped on the ground and turned into a stream of light, flying toward the direction of the Offworld Battlefield.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of muffled sounds rang out, and everyone followed closely behind.","...","Less than 10,000 miles away from their base camp, the people from the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe met in the starry sky.","Cosmos God stopped in his tracks, and so did everyone else.","The two sides stood facing each other. Although they did not say anything, a shocking battle intent was already emitted from the two sides.","Swords drawn and bows drawn, ready to fire at a touch!","“You won’t be able to stop us this time around, Cosmos God.”","Void God said indifferently with his hands behind his back.","The black mist that surrounded him was like a tidal wave crashing against the shore. It continuously dispersed and surged.","“Is that so?”","Cosmos God was expressionless.","“You’re so stubborn.” Void God shook his head and continued, “Cosmos God, our fight is nothing more than a fight for the fate of this universe. If you are willing to dissipate your cultivation, no, die under this starry sky, this seat can promise that I will not touch a single blade of grass or tree in your universe.”","This sentence immediately pushed Cosmos God to the opposite side of the universe with divine power!","Fortunately, there was no change in the expression of Cosmos God. The Supreme experts behind Cosmos God also had no expression on their faces.","Those who could become Supreme martial artists were all determined people. How could they be fooled by a few words?","With Cosmos God, the Divine Power Universe still had a chance to turn the tables. Once Cosmos God died, the entire Divine Power Universe would become a piece of meat on the chopping board, waiting to be slaughtered by Void God.","Void God did not mind. He just sighed and waved his hand.","“Then let the slaughter end all of this.”","Whoosh!!!","In an instant, dozens of Six Scar Void Masters led a black mass of ordinary Void Masters and rushed out from behind Void God. They passed by Void God and rushed toward the people from the Divine Power Universe with vicious smiles!","The battle had erupted!"]},{"number":4567,"title":"Chapter 4567 Drastic Changes (1)","paragraphs":["4567 Drastic Changes (1)","The black clouds pressed down on the city, and the armor light opened up to the sun!","The entire sky was occupied by the dozens of Six Scar Void Masters and ordinary Void Masters. Like locusts passing through, the aura they emitted directly shattered the void.","“Kill them all!”","Wu Jianxian’s beautiful eyes turned cold as she said in a cold voice.","As soon as she finished speaking, Wu Jianxian took the lead and charged out on his sword.","!!","She was like a Sword God, with a sword in hand, she could kill all enemies in the world!","“Little girls shouldn’t be dancing around with swords and spears. Come at me then!”","The First Sky Glory Patriarch of the Sky Glory Holy Land from the Void Universe laughed sinisterly. He pulled with his right hand and opened a Secret Realm. He dragged the Wu Jianxian in and began the duel.","“I wasn’t satisfied last time. Let’s do it again!”","The eyes the Overlord Patriarch, White Ape, flashed with a bright light. The fighting spirit in his body shook the Nine Heavens. His boiling Qi and blood were like the sun, and no one dared to look at him directly.","He threw a punch, and it was as if he was pushing a golden carriage. The ancient heavenly court’s war drum was sounded, and the punch was blasted toward the right emissary.","“The water of the great river comes from the heavens.” The crazy alcoholic in his tattered robe shook his head and sighed.","Instantly, an endless amount of innate sunflower water gushed out of the gourd and rushed toward the Left Void Emissary like an upside-down Heavenly River.","In just a few short moments, everyone had found their opponents.","Snake God, who was close behind Void God, stuck out his nine heads at the same time and sized up the entire scene.","In the next moment, all nine pairs of eyes fell on Jian Wushuang at the same time.","“You have the smell of my junior on you.”","Snake God’s voice was hoarse as he spoke in a cold voice.","“I suppose that little fellow, Wang Liu, died in your hands?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the head on the right opened its mouth slightly and gathered a lot of void power.","A terrifying aura spread out from the mouth of the snake head.","Just as Snake God was about to kill Jian Wushuang...","Suddenly, the middle snake’s head was patted by someone from behind.","“When did this guy appear?” Snake God narrowed his eyes and turned around, only to see Fengtian Patriarch looking at him with a faint smile.","“He’s also an existence that took that step? Since when did the Divine Power Universe have such a powerful being?”","Snake God was slightly surprised. There was no news of the Fengtian Patriarch in the information he had received.","However, in just a moment, he came back to his senses and lightly spat out two words.","“Interesting!”","“Is that so?” Fengtian Patriarch grinned and raised his palm again, slamming it down on Snake God’s head.","In this palm, it seemed as if countless great worlds were destroyed and chaos appeared. Its power had reached the extreme.","“I’ll show you something even more interesting.”","Bang!!!","Just as the palm that resembled a chaotic deity was about to land on Snake God’s head, Snake God’s huge tail had already whipped through the void and slashed at Fengtian Patriarch like a giant axe!","...","In the distance.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Even though he was now the strongest person below the Invincible Supreme realm, there was still a huge gap between him and Snake God, who had already taken the step to Ascend from the Invincible Supreme realm.","Fortunately, Snake God was now entangled with Fengtian Patriarch, and the various Invincible Supremes each had their own opponents. No one in the Offworld Battlefield could stop him!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold and his eyes were cold. Suddenly, he rode his sword and turned into a shocking sword light, rushing toward the vast army of Void Masters!","Behind Jian Wushuang were Ninth Kalpa King, the Overlord Patriarch, Supreme Gongyang, Golden Crow Emperor, and many other Top Supreme realm martial artists!","They immediately formed a sharp knife and ruthlessly stabbed into the army of Void Masters.","Instantly, flames of war and smoke of wolves rose up, and killing ensued.","“Divine corpse, come!”","On the side of the Void Universe, the leader of the ordinary Void Masters was none other than Elder Mi Feng of the God Refining Sect!","This time, the Void Universe had mobilized all its forces. Not only have they reinforced their numbers with Six Scar Void Masters, but the number of ordinary Void Masters had also skyrocketed.","From the God Refining Sect alone, three Five Scar Void Masters — Mi Feng, Chen Gu, and Lanyue — had rushed to the battlefield.","Elder Mi Feng waved his right hand, and a tall, armored divine corpse holding a saber walked out from the void behind him. He looked like a War God of the Heavenly Court.","Elder Mi Feng roared and immediately attacked the tall divine corpse from the left and right.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang cut a three-headed and six-armed Void Master in half with his sword and then looked at Elder Mi Feng.","Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh.","All in all, during the time he had spent in the God Refining Sect, Elder Mi Feng had left a good impression on him. If he had not been protected by Elder Mi Feng, Jian Wushuang would have died in the God Refining Sect.","“Kill!” Jian Wushuang, who was about to collide with Elder Mi Feng, turned his sword peak slightly, brushed past Elder Mi Feng, and slashed at the other Void Warrior.","“What?” Elder Mi Feng could not help but be slightly stunned.","He had seen Jian Wushuang’s power and he had some guesses. Jian Wushuang must be one of the most powerful experts in the Divine Power Universe.","He was not confident in facing Jian Wushuang.","Hence, when he saw Jian Wushuang charging at him, he had already made up his mind to fight to the death.","He did not expect that Jian Wushuang would pass by him.","“What’s going on?” Elder Mi Feng was a little puzzled, but he did not suspect anything and continued to kill the others.","“I’m your opponent.”","At this moment, a deep and cold voice sounded in his ear.","He turned his head slightly and saw a cold-looking young man with blood-red hair, black divine patterns all over his body, and blood-red moons in his eyes.","This person was Ninth Kalpa King, who had become demonic.","After becoming a demon, not only did Ninth Kalpa King’s strength skyrocket, but his temperament also became colder.","“One Thought Divine Kingdom,” Ninth Kalpa King said coldly.","On the other side, Jian Wushuang shook his head as he watched the scene.","It was already praiseworthy enough that he did not initiate a fight with Elder Mi Feng. Naturally, he could not ask others to not be hostile to Elder Mi Feng and allow him to slaughter them as he pleased.","“Elder Mi Feng is in danger,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","After Ninth Kalpa King became demonic, he broke through to the peak of the High Supreme realm. In terms of strength, he was no longer much weaker than him.","“Forget it, life and death are up to fate.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang stopped thinking. He turned into a golden light and killed his way through the army of Void Masters.","...","The war had already broken out.","In the entire area, other than Void God and Cosmos God, everyone else was engaged in a battle.","“Void God, come. Let this battle settle everything.”","The white hair of Cosmos God fluttered in the wind as his eyes flickered with a brilliant light.","However, Void God chuckled and said in a playful tone, “Cosmos God, the human heart is a very complicated thing, don’t you think so?”","“What?”","Cosmos God’s eyes narrowed slightly, feeling a little puzzled.","However, he did not think too much about it. He circulated his divine power and planned to fight the final battle with the Void Gods.","However, at the next moment!","The expression of Cosmos God changed drastically as disbelief filled his eyes."]},{"number":4568,"title":"Chapter 4568 Drastic Changes (2)","paragraphs":["4568 Drastic Changes (2)","“How did this happen?”","Cosmos God gasped in disbelief.","Just now, when he was about to use his divine power, he found that the terrifying divine power in his body that could make the universe explode and restart chaos had become extremely slow.","It was as if countless vengeful spirits were tearing at his divine body, which caused his strength to drop by at least half.","“Void God!”","!!","Cosmos God took a deep breath and looked at Void God. His expression turned grave for the first time.","Although he did not know why his body would have such a change, he was sure that it was Void God’s doing.","This battle was most likely dangerous.","“Cosmos God, don’t look at me like that. I hate using such methods to deal with you.”","Void God shrugged and said with a faint smile, “You only have yourself to blame for all of this. Even the people closest to you can’t stand what you’re doing and can see the trend.”","Upon hearing this, Cosmos God’s expression did not change. However, his heart sank.","Then, as if he had thought of something, he turned around and slowly said, “It’s you?”","Lan Su and Lan Lan were standing side by side in the void behind Cosmos God.","Among them, the gaze of Cosmos God landed on Lan Su.","“Master...” Seeing the gaze of Cosmos God, Lan Su subconsciously felt fear in his heart and took a step back.","“I... I didn’t.”","Lan Su did not dare to meet the gaze of Cosmos God and said in a flustered manner.","“Master, what’s wrong?” Lan Lan was stunned and asked in confusion.","Cosmos God did not reply to Lan Lan. Instead, he took in a deep breath and looked straight into Lan Su’s eyes, which were constantly avoiding eye contact. He said in a low voice, “Little Su, you have had a habit since you were young. When you lie, your eyes will look everywhere.”","“So, please don’t lie to Master.”","“Come, tell me. Were you bewitched by Void God and betrayed the Divine Power Universe? Tell me and take responsibility. I won’t blame you.”","Before Lan Su could reply, Void God laughed sarcastically as if he had heard something funny. “Hahaha, Cosmos God, I didn’t bewitch him. It was your disciple who came to the Void Universe to find me and asked me to give him a drop of my Seed of Origin.”","As soon as he said that, Lan Lan, who was standing at the side, understood what had happened.","As for the heart of Cosmos God, it had completely sunk.","The Seed of Origin!","The Seed of Origin required the accumulation of thousands of Life Blood Essence in order to integrate with a life seed. It was extremely powerful. Once someone was planted with the Seed of Origin, it was equivalent to their life and death being controlled by the other person.","This disciple of his was so ruthless!","“Junior Sister! I’m doing this for everyone’s good!”","Lan Su seemed to be overwhelmed by the gazes of Cosmos God and Lan Lan. He gritted his teeth and stepped out.","He forced himself to raise his head and look straight at Cosmos God.","“Master! Don’t blame disciple for doing this, if you want to blame someone, blame yourself for being too stubborn!”","“Why can’t you see that our Divine Power Universe is no longer a match for the Void Universe? The Void Universe has already unified the two universes!”","“Rather than leaving corpses strewn all over the ground and wasting the lives of innocent people, why not make a wise decision and choose to surrender?”","“Honored Master, your disciple will put it bluntly. Isn’t the reason why you’ve organized everyone to resist the Void Universe all for the sake of your position as Cosmos God? For your own fate energy? You know that once the Divine Power Universe surrenders, you won’t be able to fight alone. You won’t be a match for Void God!”","“But Master, your life is valuable, but aren’t our lives valuable too? Why did you let everyone die with you for your own selfish desires? Master, you’re too selfish!”","A series of words came out of Lan Su’s mouth like a string of bullets.","It was as if he had been suppressing these words for a long time, just to burst out at this moment!","After saying these words, Lan Su seemed to have used up all of his energy. He placed his hands on his knees and panted slightly, but there was a hint of ferocity between his brows.","Cosmos God looked at Lan Su in a daze.","The Seed of Origin from Void God had already taken effect in his body. It was as if countless bugs were gnawing at his body.","However, this heart-piercing pain could not overcome Lan Su’s words.","Lan Su’s words were like a knife that stabbed into his heart, cutting it apart.","Lan Lan covered her mouth and looked at Lan Su in disbelief.","Was this still his humble, gentle, and modest Senior Brother?","At this moment, in Lan Lan’s eyes, Lan Su had turned into a deformed and twisted demon that was about to devour people!","As for Lan Su, after resting for a moment, he took a deep breath and looked at Cosmos God again. His gaze became sincere as he said, “Master, Lord Void God has already promised me that as long as you’re willing to cut off your cultivation and disperse all your fate energy, he’s willing to stop this battle and return peace to the two universes.”","“Master, don’t worry. I’ll never forget the kindness of your upbringing. As long as you’re willing to do so, I’ll definitely let you take care of your old age and live in peace.”","After saying that, Lan Su looked at Cosmos God with a face full of anticipation.","When Void God heard this, the mockery on his face became even more apparent. He turned his gaze slightly and looked at the cosmic God with a faint smile.","“Your disciple is right. Cosmos God, as long as you are willing to do so, I will immediately stop this battle. How about it?”","Cosmos God did not reply. Instead, he looked at Lan Su in disappointment and shook his head, “Lan Su, you are too naive.”","“Do you really think that the war will stop just because I’m dead? I’m telling you, the billions of creatures in the entire Divine Power Universe will become the slaves of the Void Universe and be slaughtered. It will also cut off the cultivation path of the entire Divine Power Universe. When that happens, it will be a real disaster.”","“And you, do you really think you can still live? You won’t be able to live.”","This time, Cosmos God called out Lan Su’s name, and no longer addressed himself as his Master.","His meaning was obvious.","Lan Su’s body trembled when he heard this. He pursed his lips and said, “No! It wouldn’t be like that! Lord Void God promised me that he wouldn’t do this!”","However, this time around, Cosmos God did not bother about him. Instead, he turned around and looked at Void God expressionlessly. A look of determination flashed in his eyes.","“Void God, you can’t win.”","“Oh? Is that so?” Void God stood in the air, and the corners of his mouth slowly curled up. “You’re still so stubborn even at this point?”","Cosmos God did not reply. Instead, he took in a deep breath and said slowly, “Ancestral Technique, Chaos Awakening!!”"]},{"number":4569,"title":"Chapter 4569 From Now On, We’ll Take Over This War","paragraphs":["4569 From Now On, We’ll Take Over This War","Boom!","In an instant, Cosmos God formed hand seals with both hands. His white hair and long beard fluttered in the wind, and his eyes were extremely sharp.","Gusts of strong wind suddenly spread out from beneath the feet of Cosmos God.","Immediately after, the entire universe rumbled.","The sky collapsed and the earth cracked.","!!","The stars moved, the sun and moon changed, and the entire starry sky was boiling.","An ancient aura from the chaos spread out and enveloped the entire universe as if it was going to return everything to chaos.","The face of Cosmos God turned pale rapidly as his entire body trembled.","However, there seemed to be two balls of fire burning in his eyes.","That was the will to die!","Countless people from the two universes who were fighting a bloody battle felt this extremely strong and terrifying aura that came from the primordial chaos. Their expressions changed drastically, and their hearts were filled with shock as they stared at Cosmos God.","Jian Wushuang was also among them. When he saw the expressions of Cosmos God, Void God, Lan Su, and Lan Lan, he instantly understood everything.","“Is Lan Su a spy?” Jian Wushuang’s heart sank.","This was something he had never thought of.","As for the ‘spy’, he had some guesses in his heart. He had thought about whether it would be the Dragon clan, Great Void Divine Emperor, and even the Captain of Team 9 in the Offworld Battlefield.","The only thing he did not expect was that the spy was Lan Su.","Jian Wushuang’s face flashed with surprise and astonishment.","This was simply too unbelievable. Lan Su was the disciple of Cosmos God. In this universe, his status was only second to that of a Cosmos God!","“He’s really a bastard.”","Jian Wushuang let out a long breath. At the same time, he understood that since Lan Su had chosen to reveal his identity, he must have succeeded in his goal!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Explosions rang out continuously between heaven and earth as everything collapsed. Even time and space began to reverse, trying to annihilate everything and return everything to chaos.","“Yin-Yang space-time reversal!!!”","“What’s going on?”","“How did this happen?”","In an instant, countless people raised their heads in shock. Even the Unparalleled Supremes who stood at the peak of their era could not hide the shock in their eyes.","The technique of Cosmos God was simply too mighty. It was not wrong to say that it could split the heavens and earth apart. It was as if the God of Creation had descended to the world and wanted to reshape the purity and turbidity of the heavens and earth.","With his own power, he had suddenly pried open the entire universe!","At this moment, time began to reverse.","The divine light in Void God’s eyes brightened and his face changed.","“Impossible! That was impossible! Even existences like us might have a slight chance of opening it, but we can’t reverse the entire universe and forcefully reverse the laws of the universe.”","“Void God, you’re right. I can’t reverse the entire universe, but I can open a space-time tunnel and seal you and me into the space-time turbulence.”","The corners of Cosmos God’s mouth slowly pulled open, revealing a sinister smile.","Today, he was already doomed to die.","However, he could also use his rotten body to make a final contribution to the universe.","“You’re crazy!” Void God man’s expression changed.","Without waiting for him to make a move, Cosmos God had already torn apart the void with his hands.","The torn void was like a mirror, reflecting a corner of chaos.","“Come with me.”","Cosmos God let out a loud bellow as his eyes snapped open. His eyes were wide with Fury.","“Rise!”","At the next moment, the corner of the chaos suddenly shot out a black and yellow light that sucked in Cosmos God and Void God.","A flash of anger appeared in Void God’s eyes, and he said coldly, “Cosmos God, 10,000 years. This technique can trap me for 10,000 years at most. After 10,000 years, I will be able to return from the space-time turbulence!”","“When the time comes, I’ll exterminate the entire Divine Power Universe!”","“And you, will die in this chaos!”","A cold and cruel voice came out of Void God’s mouth.","Cosmos God did not reply. Instead, just as he was about to be sucked into the space-time turbulence, he swept his gaze across the faces of everyone in the Divine Power Universe and shouted in a deep voice, “Everyone, remember, as long as the flames of our Divine Power Universe continue to burn and the inheritance continues, there will be a day when our Divine Power Universe will welcome a new dawn!”","Pausing for a moment, Cosmos God turned to look at Fengtian Patriarch and said, “Fengtian, you’ve fought with me for 100,000 chaos cycles, and you’ve held a grudge against me for 100,000 chaos cycles. I’m now going to apologize to you!”","“You...” Patriarch Fengtian clenched his fists and took a deep breath. He then shouted, “Old man, you better stay alive. I want you to apologize to me in front of the entire universe!”","After all, he and Cosmos God came from the origin source and were once the closest and best friends.","If he really bore a grudge against Cosmos God, why would he appear here at this moment? He would have long sought refuge with the Void Universe and wished for nothing more than to kill Cosmos God.","At this moment, the life source of Cosmos God was getting weaker and weaker, and his death intent was getting stronger and stronger. All the unhappiness he felt in the past had long disappeared.","Cosmos God chuckled. He could feel that Void God’s Seed of Origin was already flaring up violently in his body.","He could not hold on much longer.","“Fengtian, lead everyone to retreat, and preserve the Next Generation.”","“They are our hope for the future.”","In the end, Cosmos God took a look at Lan Lan and sighed softly. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang deeply.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll give you a great fortune. Take it!”","Boom!!!","A ball of white light slowly squeezed out from the space between the eyebrows of Cosmos God. Then, it shot out and instantly entered Jian Wushuang’s body.","After doing all that, Cosmos God no longer hesitated. He followed closely behind Void God and entered the chaotic turbulence.","He was going to use his life force to suppress Void God for ten thousand years in the chaos of the universe!","Buzz...","The torn sky was restored to peace.","Before Jian Wushuang could take a closer look at what Cosmos God had given him at the last moment, he heard the nine-headed Snake God’s nine heads uttering sorrowful sounds at the same time.","“Void Universe, follow me and kill!”","“Roar!”","In an instant, the people of the Void Universe went into a frenzy again and charged toward the Divine Power Universe.","The expression of Fengtian Patriarch, who was standing at the forefront, darkened. He was about to block the attack.","All of a sudden, a black beam of light as thick as an arm shot out from the void and pierced through the shoulder of Fengtian Patriarch.","Then, seven black-robed men slowly walked out of the void in a row.","The first one was a thin figure with a red mask that only revealed his right eye.","Devour One!","“From now on, the Devourers will officially take over this war.”","Devour One’s indifferent voice spread out.","When Fengitan Patriarch looked up at Devour One, his pupils shrank, and his face turned serious for the first time.","“Everyone, prepare to escape.”","The deep voice of the Fengtian Patriarch rang out in everyone’s minds.","“Devourers, I don’t think it’s a good idea for you to come out and enjoy the fruits of others’ labor,” Snake God’s expression also changed slightly as he said.","“Do you not understand what I’m saying?”","Devour One looked at the Snake God.","The next moment.","Devour One raised his hand and gestured aggressively at the Snake God’s nine heads."]},{"number":4570,"title":"Chapter 4570 The Divine Power Universe Has Fallen!","paragraphs":["4570 The Divine Power Universe Has Fallen!","Bang!","Devour One’s slap was far away from Snake God, but it seemed to fold the void and hit Snake God’s nine heads.","Suddenly, the nine heads of Snake God shook, and a red handprint of five fingers appeared.","“Devour One, you’re courting death!!!”","In an instant, Snake God was enraged. His face was ashen to the extreme, and his entire body erupted with violent killing intent!","The area within a thousand feet of Snake God seemed to have turned into a thousand feet of glaciers. The cold killing intent was like a raging sea, crashing against the shore, wave after wave, rising and falling continuously.","Devour One was only in the same realm as him, and yet he dared to humiliate him like this?","However, just as Snake God was about to lose his temper, Devour One turned over his right hand, and a diamond-shaped token with a huge word ‘Devour’ on it appeared in his hand.","With a calm expression, Devour One looked at Snake God, who was about to go crazy, and said indifferently, “Snake God, I’m acting on the orders of the Lord Devouring Emperor. Are you sure you want to stop me? Do you want to be the Devourers’ enemy?”","As soon as he said this, Snake God, who was about to use his killing move, suddenly stopped. His pupils shrank and his expression became uncertain.","Devouring Emperor!","This name was definitely a nightmarish existence in the Void Universe.","Snake God was not afraid of Devour One. He did not even care about the Devourers.","However, he really did not know the Devouring Emperor’s background, so he did not dare to act rashly.","Even Void God, who had taken that step, did not mention anything about Devouring Emperor. Therefore, it was highly possible that Devouring Emperor had taken that step as well.","After a moment of silence, Snake God took a deep breath and let out a cold snort. He turned his head away and no longer spoke.","It was obvious that he had given in.","Seeing this, the people behind Devour One all showed mocking expressions.","Devour One no longer looked at Snake God. Instead, he turned to look at Fengtian Patriarch and said calmly, “Your name is Fengtian, right? His Majesty has ordered that if you are willing to give up, he is willing to accept you into his organization.”","After a pause, Devour One continued, “Fengtian, if you join Devourers, we can help you get out of the constraints of the universe’s fate energy. You can take that step.”","As soon as he said this, not only did Fengtian Patriarch’s expression change, but even Snake God turned his head abruptly and looked at Devour One’s masked face with shock in his eyes.","At their level, they naturally knew how difficult it was to truly take that step!","Otherwise, it would not be the case where since the birth of both universes, only Void God and Cosmos Gods were at that level.","This was too outrageous!","When the Supreme experts from the Divine Power Universe heard this, they immediately focused their eyes on Fengtian Patriarch’s face, and a touch of despair appeared on their faces.","Now that Cosmos God was no longer around, the person with the highest cultivation base here was none other than the Fengtian Patriarch. If even the Fengtian Patriarch chose to side with them, they would lose all ability to resist.","Hearing that, Fengtian Patriarch narrowed his eyes and looked at Devour One. The corners of his mouth slowly cracked open, revealing a smile.","“Get. The. F*ck. Out. Of. Here!!!”","Hearing that, Devour One did not get angry or furious, but sighed slightly.","“What a pity.” Devour One said indifferently, “Kill them all! Don’t leave a single one alive in the Divine Power Universe!”","“Yes!”","All of a sudden, the six members of Devourers walked out from behind Devour One, laughing. They twisted their necks with cruel smiles on their faces.","“I can finally make my move. I’ve been holding back for too long,” a meatball-like man from the Devourers said gloomily.","“I’ll eat you all!” The other strange man with mouths all over his body licked the corner of his mouth with greed in his eyes.","Once again, Devour One looked at Snake God with his hands behind his back and ordered, “You and the Void Universe, attack as well.”","“Devour One, are you ordering me around? I’m telling you, you’re still too young...” Snake God laughed in anger.","Before he could finish, Devour One interrupted him coldly, “After that, I’ll report to Devouring Emperor and ask him to let you join his organization.”","“... Fine.” Snake God took a deep look at Devour One and said, “Devour One, remember what you said.”","After saying that, Snake God’s eyes swept across the faces of the Void Masters in the Void Universe. A murderous intent flashed in his eyes as he spat out three words.","“Follow me and kill them!”","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, Snake God’s body shuttled back and forth. All nine of his heads opened up at the same time and bit down on Fengtian Patriarch.","“Kill!”","“Bastards from the Divine Power Universe, die!”","“Hahahaha, kill them all!”","Countless Void Masters laughed and followed Snake God.","Upon seeing this, not only did Fengtian Patriarch not back down, but the battle intent in his eyes also soared. He stroked his beard and laughed.","“If you want to conquer the Divine Power Universe, you’re not good enough!”","Boom!","Fengtian Patriarch waved his hand behind him, creating a long gully that was hundreds of millions of feet long. He said to Jian Wushuang and the others, “You guys, retreat! Remember, as long as our Divine Power Universe continues to burn and pass on, there will be a ray of light in the future!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he no longer hesitated. He burned his life force and rushed toward the Devourers, Snake God, and the people in the Void Universe.","This time, the aura of the Fengtian Patriarch rose sharply!","“I am Fengtian, and I’m here to die today!”","Taking a step forward, the Fengtian Patriarch broke through the shackles and his aura skyrocketed once more. He was now only a step away from being the same level as Cosmos God!","The pupils of Snake God and the members of the Devourers all shrank in fear.","“Quickly retreat! This person is going all out!”","“Retreat first. He can’t hold on for long!”","Instantly, the countless Void Warriors who were charging at the Fengtian Patriarch seemed to have stepped on the brakes. Their expressions changed drastically, and they retreated.","“Fengtian Patriarch!”","On the side of the Divine Power Universe, countless people saw this scene and were instantly enraged.","“No!”","Countless people wanted to rush over and help the Fengtian Patriarch.","However, the Fengtian Patriarch seemed to have anticipated this and created countless chasms earlier. It was like an invisible glass that blocked all of them, preventing them from moving an inch forward!","When Fengtian Patriarch saw this, he turned around and shouted with a cold expression, “Don’t you understand what I’m saying? Hurry up and run!”","“Keep your lives! You are... our hope!”","As soon as he said that, countless people were heartbroken. They looked at the Void Masters with eyes full of endless hatred!","“Let’s retreat.”","At that moment, Overlord Patriarch let out a long sigh.","“Don’t let the sacrifice of the Fengtian Patriarch and Lord Cosmos God go to waste. We can only have a future if we live.”","“One day, we will be able to make a comeback!”"]},{"number":4571,"title":"Chapter 4571 Sorrowful","paragraphs":["4571 Sorrowful","The battlefield outside the domain was filled with sorrow.","First was Supreme Gai Fu, who launched a dazzling attack after sacrificing himself, striking fear in the hearts of the enemy.","Later on, it was Cosmos Gods. In order to ensure that the Divine Power Universe would not be extinguished and that the Next Generation would be preserved, he unleashed the primordial chaos and suppressed Void Gods for 10,000 years.","And now, Fengtian Patriarch had burned his life source and turned it into a wall, allowing the Divine Power Universe a way out in the face of thousands of tribulations.","Many of their predecessors had fallen at the hands of the Void Universe for the sake of the Divine Power Universe.","Struggle, bitterness, resentment, sorrow, hatred... Negative emotions filled the air, and even a new cup of wine tasted turpid.","These seniors and martyrs will forever be respected!","“Let’s go.”","The Overlord Patriarch sighed softly and said, “Everyone, from now on, your life and death will be determined by the heavens. Protect yourself. When we wave the flag and gather the masses in the future, it will be the time for us to revive the Divine Power Universe!”","After saying that, the Overlord Patriarch took a step forward and strode away.","He did not value his life. He just knew that the Divine Power Universe was doomed to lose. The only thing they could do now is to preserve what they have left, and hope that they could help the universe revive.","“We have been defeated!”","The sloppy Daoist, Immortal Hulu, poured a cup of wine from his gourd and poured it on the vast starry sky and land of Divine Power Universe.","“This toast is for Gai Fu, Cosmos God, Fentian Patriarch, and the billions of heroic spirits in my Divine Power Universe!”","Then, he sighed and left.","After the sloppy Daoist left, the Supremes gathered in the Offworld Battlefield sighed and began to disperse.","Of course, there were also those who were willing to die and chose to stay on the battlefield to fight the Void Universe to the death.","The Divine Power Universe never lacked people who were brave and fierce!","The Captain of Team 7, Supreme Blacksource, was one of the people who had stayed behind to fight to the death.","“You want to leave?”","Snake God’s vertical pupils turned slightly, and he looked at the people of the Divine Power Universe who had scattered and fled. The corners of her mouth gradually curled up into a cold smile.","“A bunch of loose sand, you want to escape?”","After saying that, Snake God shook his head. The four heads on the right side of the nine heads suddenly chose to separate and break through the barrier drawn by Patriarch Fengtian. Then, it led the countless Void Warriors to hunt down the Divine Power Universe.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded without hesitation.","He was not a fool. He knew how important he was.","He understood his own talent and potential. As long as he was given time to grow, he would be able to fully mature.","Jian Wushuang was not afraid of death, but he did not want to die here. He still wanted to stay alive and take revenge for Supreme Gai Fu, for Cosmos God, for Fengtian Patriarch, and for the countless heroic spirits who had died in this battle.","“Hehehehe, trash from the Divine Power Universe, go to hell!”","A monster with no arms on the left but six arms on the right slashed at Jian Wushuang with six big sabers!","A sword light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He did not even look at him and the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand was already out of the sheath.","The six-armed monster only felt a vast expanse of white flash past its eyes before its vision turned black and it lost consciousness.","Swish!","Blood and severed limbs fell from the sky like a rain of blood.","“Let’s go.” Jian Wushuang looked at Ninth Kalpa King.","The two of them could be considered the most powerful fighting force of the Divine Life Palace. They had to return to the Divine Life Palace immediately and take them away.","Just as the two of them were about to leave, Jian Wushuang stopped and looked at a dazed woman not far away. He said, “Miss Lan Lan, are you leaving with us?”","“...Alright.”","Lan Lan nodded in a daze. Her mind was still blank, and her thoughts were stuck at the moment when Cosmos God had left.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang sighed and said nothing. He waved his hand and put Lan Lan into the Heaven-Suppressing Monument.","Then, Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King flew away.","On the other side.","“Why did it turn out like this? It should have ended in peace. Why did Master die...”","Lan Su’s face was pale. He pursed his lips tightly and his body went weak.","His original intention for instilling the Seed of Origin into Cosmos Gods was to let Cosmos Gods see the situation clearly and choose to surrender. By then, even if the fate of Cosmos God’s cultivation bases were to dissipate, the Divine Power Universe would be able to avoid a disaster and the war would end.","Void God state had promised him that as long as his Master was willing to give him the fate energy, he would retreat.","The worst outcome would be that the Divine Power Universe would become a subsidiary of the Void Universe.","He had never expected that the Divine Power Universe would fall to this point.","“Why? I just want to live. I want everyone to live. Is that wrong...”","Lan Su clenched his fists tightly and muttered to himself stubbornly.","In her mind, she kept replaying the last look in the eyes of Cosmos God. It was unfamiliar and filled with disappointment.","“You’re too na?ve!” The words of the Cosmos God kept on ringing in his mind.","“Go to hell!”","Just as Lan Su was in a daze, a sinister laugh suddenly exploded above his head.","Lan Su hurriedly looked up.","A Five Scar Void Master with a long halberd hacked down at him with a ferocious expression.","“Ah!” In the universe, Lan Su’s miserable cries could be heard.","The halberd-wielding Void Master split Lan Su in half from his head to his waist. Then, he grinned hideously and chased after another person.","Jian Wushuang, who had already fled far away, turned around and saw this scene with an expressionless face.","“Idiot.” Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward and turned into small black dots at the same time. They flew toward the distant starry sky at an extremely fast speed.","...","“Kill!”","A massacre began.","Countless cultivators of the Divine Power Universe who had chosen to fight to the death self-destructed one after another. They did not seek victory, but only to take away a few Void Masters of the Void Universe before they died.","Supreme Blacksource had slain 18 people in a row before self-detonating and dying.","The unparalleled heroes of the Divine Power Universe fell one after another.","This day was destined to be the sorrowful day of the Divine Power Universe.","On this day, the heavens and earth trembled as if they had sensed something and let out a mighty sad song.","...","In the void of the Offworld Battlefield.","Devour One stood with his hands behind his back and watched Jian Wushuang leave.","“Hey, Devour One, aren’t we going to catch this little guy?” Devour Four said.","A meaningful look flashed in Devour One’s eyes when he heard that. He said with a faint smile, “Don’t worry, he can’t escape. Let him run first. I’d like to see if Xuan Yi can still hide now that the balance between the two universes has been broken and one of the most important chess pieces has nowhere to go.”","Upon hearing that, Devour Four nodded.","Everything they had done was for Xuan Yi.","...","Cosmic Calendar, Chaos Cycle 6982.","The Divine Power Universe had fallen."]},{"number":4572,"title":"Chapter 4572 Fleeing","paragraphs":["4572 Fleeing","“Kill!”","The battlefield outside the domain was still filled with the sounds of killing.","Countless Supreme experts chose to fight to the death, and in the end, they fell one by one on the Offworld Battlefield.","The massacre lasted for three days.","Three days later.","The entire Offworld Battlefield was deathly silent. Only countless broken limbs remained floating in the air, as if silently recounting the tragedy of this battle.","In the center of the Offworld Battlefield, an old man sat cross-legged with his clothes in tatters and his aura on the verge of dying.","Countless corpses of the Void Universe were piled up around him. Among them, there were no less than ten Six Scar Void Masters, and even three Devourer members had died here.","There were even more Void Warriors around him, staring at the old man with fear. Although they knew that the old man was already at the end of his life, they still hesitated and did not dare to step forward.","They had already been scared out of their wits by the Fengtian Patriarch.","They had never seen someone who could fight against the entire universe by himself!","During these three days, the Fengtian Patriarch had not taken half a step back, and they had not been able to advance a single foot!","This was simply too shocking!","“During the last Great Catastrophe War, I hid for 100,000 chaos cycles, but in the end, I still can’t calm my anger.”","Fengtian Patriarch sat cross-legged and looked around at the Void Masters in the Void Universe. He suddenly smiled.","No one around them answered. They only held their weapons and looked at Fengtian Patriarch with fear.","After he finished speaking, he raised his head and looked up at the endless starry sky. He seemed to be sighing.","“Speaking of which, those old friends of mine have all left. Even the old fogey, Cosmos God, has left this time around.”","“I’ve fought with him for my entire life, and he’s also been ahead of me for my entire life.”","“I can’t believe that he’s still one step ahead of me in this last fight...”","With a bitter smile, Fengtian Patriarch lowered his head and no longer moved.","After a long time, the Void Warriors beings with weapons in their hands slowly walked in.","“Die!”","A Five Scar Void Master, holding a long saber, mustered his courage and shouted with a ferocious expression.","Then, the long saber stabbed into Fengtian Patriarch’s body. It came out of his body, but not a drop of blood fell.","“He’s dead! The demon is finally dead!”","Immediately, the Five Scar Void Master’s face was filled with ecstasy. He pulled back his long saber and planned to completely destroy Fengtian Patriarch.","Whoosh.","At this moment, a black-robed figure with a red mask on his face stepped forward and appeared in front of the Fengtian Patriarch.","With a flick of his finger, he sent the Five Scar Void Master flying with his saber.","This man was Devour One.","Then, Devour One mentioned that Fengtian Patriarch’s life source had been exhausted, and his body had fallen.","“A proper burial,” he said in a deep voice.","“A proper burial?”","Eight of Snake God’s nine heads had been blown off during the battle with the Fengtian Patriarch. He shrieked, “Devour One, this man almost destroyed my Dao Foundation and hurt my origin, and you want to bury him? Give me the corpse, I want to repeatedly crush and torture it, only then can I vent the hatred in my heart!”","“Since when have you made decisions for me?” Devour One looked at him coldly and pushed his right hand forward.","At that moment, the body of Fengtian Patriarch floated up on its own and rose all the way up until it finally disappeared into the universe.","“Born in the universe, die in the universe, rest in peace.”","Devour One shook his head and turned around, his eyes brutal and murderous again.","“Kill! Annihilate all the powers in the Divine Power Universe and reshuffle the cards!”","“Yes!” As soon as he finished speaking, the remaining four members of Devourers and countless Void Warriors all knelt on one knee and agreed.","In the process of fighting the Fengtian Patriarch, Devour One conquered everyone with his own strength!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Instantly, countless Void Masters flew up and flew toward the depths of the Divine Power Universe!","...","In the boundless starry sky of the Divine Power Universe.","The three divine lights were flying at high speed.","They were Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Lan Lan, who had escaped from the Offworld Battlefield.","“Jian Wushuang, what should we do next?”","After a period of recovery, Lan Lan’s mood was a little better than before. Although she was still immersed in grief, she was not at the stage of not being able to tell what was going on.","Now, Jian Wushuang was the only person who was on good terms with her. Naturally, he became her backbone.","Ninth Kalpa King also asked, “Jian Wushuang, now that the Divine Power Universe is broken, I’m afraid it won’t take long for the people from the Void Universe to attack us. And we are equivalent to the remnants of the Divine Power Universe. They will never allow us to exist. Therefore, we have to make plans for the next step as soon as possible.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and nodded to show that he understood.","He did not need to think to know that the Divine Power Universe would face a great purge soon. All the forces would be killed, and all order would collapse. Even if there were forces that had not been killed, they would become the dogs and prisoners of the Void Universe.","The Divine Power Universe was going to be reshuffled and a new era would begin.","“The only way is to hide in one of the Nine Forbidden Zones,” after thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","“Nine Forbidden Zones?” Ninth Kalpa King frowned upon hearing this.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “The Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans each occupy one of the Nine Forbidden Zones. Senior Overlord Patriarch occupies the Glacier Forbidden Land. The Deep Abyss, which is occupied by the descendants of the Dark Demon. The remaining four Forbidden Zones are more mysterious. Even an Invincible Supreme might not be able to come out alive after entering them. There has been no news of the Four Forbidden Zones for years. If we want to avoid this disaster, we can only hide in these Forbidden Zones.”","Ninth Kalpa King did not reply. Instead, he pondered for a long time before he said, “Jian Wushuang, the danger of these Forbidden Zones is no less than the threat of the Void Universe.”","“If we enter these four Forbidden Zones, I’m afraid we’ll die.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “Now is not the time to weigh the pros and cons and make a decision. If it were just the three of us, we would be able to find a place to hide no matter how big the universe is. But don’t forget that there are still tens of thousands of disciples waiting for us in the Divine Life Palace.”","Upon hearing this, Ninth Kalpa King was stunned and immediately stopped talking.","As for Jian Wushuang, he turned around and looked in the direction of the Divine Life Palace. His eyes flickered as he said, “Let’s go back to the Divine Life Palace first. We must move everyone in the Divine Life Palace to the Forbidden Zones before the great army of the Void Universe reaches the depths of the universe.”"]},{"number":4573,"title":"Chapter 4573 Arriving at the Divine Palace of Life","paragraphs":["4573 Arriving at the Divine Palace of Life","In the universe!","Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Lan Lan were flying in the direction of the Divine Life Palace.","Along the way, many top forces had already learned that the divine universe had fallen. They packed up their belongings and fled to the remote areas of the universe.","Only the sects and some mortals who lived at the bottom of the universe still did not know everything. They did not know that the world had changed.","The entire universe was in chaos.","!!","Among them, many people took advantage of the situation.","Many of the leaders of the various powers, the Patriarchs of the various clans, and all the famous and influential figures in the past, had all turned into cosmic pirates at this moment. They plundered everything in their path in order to prepare for their secluded cultivation.","Therefore, the road was filled with wails and the flames of war.","When people were not bound by order, they were no different from wild beasts.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang slapped an Intermediate Supreme who was confused and wanted to rob the three of them, turning him into dust. Then, he said, “We have to speed up. I’m afraid many forces have the same plan as us and want to hide in the Forbidden Zones.”","Ninth Kalpa King nodded in agreement.","The three of them did not waste any more time. They released their auras and flew toward the Divine Life Palace.","Some of the Supreme expertswho had wanted to take advantage of the situation suppressed their palpitations and let the three of them leave when they sensed their auras and knew that they were Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King.","A few months later.","The three of them arrived at the Divine Life Palace in the depths of the universe.","All in all, the deep part of the universe was still bustling. It was obvious that the news of the collapse of the Divine Power Universe had not yet reached this place.","The two disciples who were in charge of guarding the gate of the Divine Life Palace were chatting leisurely.","When he saw Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang coming, he immediately shuddered and quickly stood up and said respectfully, “Supreme Wushuang, Supreme Ninth Kalpa.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at him. Without wasting any time, he asked, “Where are the Supreme Xue Bo and the others?”","“Supreme Wushuang, Lord Xue Bo and the others are all in the Supreme Temple.”","Within the Supreme Temple, Supreme Xue Bo Supreme, Supreme Jun Fu, and Supreme Tian Yi were discussing the current situation. Their tone was quite optimistic.","Obviously, they did not know the news that the Divine Power Universe had been broken.","As soon as Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Lan Lan stepped in, Supreme Tian Yi, Jun Fu, and Xue Bo, who were facing the door, noticed the three of them.","“Eh? Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King? And a disciple of Lord Cosmos God? Why are you guys back?” Supreme Tian Yi asked, his brows twitching.","“At this time, shouldn’t Jian Wushuang and the others be fighting in the Offworld Battlefield against the Void Universe?”","“Could it be that they had already defeated the Void Universe?”","“That’s right. Why are the three of you the only ones who returned? Where’s Supreme Gai Fu?”","Supreme Jun Fu asked.","Jian Wushuang and the other two did not reply. Instead, they lowered their heads and sighed as they looked at the two people’s eyes that were filled with expectation and joy.","He did not know how to tell the three of them this cruel news.","Among the three of them, only Supreme Xue Bo noticed that Jian Wushuang and the other two’s expressions were somewhat abnormal.","He gestured for Jun Fu and Tian Yi to quiet down.","Then, he took a deep breath and looked at Jian Wushuang and the other two seriously. He asked slowly, “Jian Wushuang, did something happen on the Offworld Battlefield? You can speak your mind.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He was not an indecisive person. He knew that the news would spread to the depths of the universe sooner or later. The most important thing now was to evacuate.","“Supreme Xue Bo, we... lost.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he said this.","As soon as he finished speaking, it was as if a stone had caused a thousand ripples. Supreme Xue Bo and the other two were shocked and could not believe their ears.","“What? We’ve been defeated?”","Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi’s expressions changed drastically, and their eyes were filled with shock.","They had thought that even if the Divine Power Universe could not defeat the Void Universe in a short time, it could not have been defeated so quickly.","Of the three, only the Xue Bo chuckled wryly, not too surprised.","When he saw the three of them appear here together, he had a bad feeling in his heart. He did not expect that it would be as he had expected.","“Then... where’s Supreme Gai Fu?”","Supreme Xue Bo took three deep breaths in a row before he managed to suppress his emotions.","“Supreme Gai Fu has fallen. He’s not the only one who has fallen. Lord Cosmos God has also died on the Offworld Battlefield.”","Jian Wushuang replied again.","It was as if another bombshell had been dropped in the minds of the three Supreme experts.","When Surpeme Xue Bo and the other two heard this, their legs turned to jelly and they almost fell to the ground.","“How is that possible? How did this happen?”","The faces of Supreme Xue Bo and the other two were pale as if their blood had been sucked dry. They muttered in disbelief.","They had never thought that someone as powerful as Lord Cosmos God would die one day.","“Doesn’t that mean that the people of the Void Universe are about to attack?”","Supreme Xue Bo raised his head, trembling, and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“That’s correct.” Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Fengtian Patriarch used his life to delay the Void Universe. However, I’m afraid he won’t be able to delay them for long. The people from the Void Universe will completely erode the Divine Power Universe in no time.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Xue Bo and the other two were once again dazed.","Fortunately, the three of them were not emotional people. After a short while, they regained their spirits.","The past could not be traced back. The Divine Power Universe had already been destroyed, and Cosmos Gods and the others had died. What they should be thinking about next was what to do in the future.","“Supreme Xue Bo, my suggestion is for the entire divine Palace to move away from the depths of the universe and find another place.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning as he spoke.","“Move? Find another place?”","Supreme Tian Yi’s brows twitched upon hearing this, but he shook his head in a resolute manner. “No, I don’t agree. This is the root of the Divine Life Palace, the place where I, Tian Yi, was born. If you want to leave, you can leave. At worst, I’ll die in the Divine Life Palace. It’s just death. What do I have to fear?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but frown and said, “Supreme Tian Yi, this is a critical moment, a life and death situation. I hope you can consider the big picture.”","“Jian Wushuang, I know you mean well. Unfortunately, the Divine Life Palace has done a great favor for me. I can’t abandon it and leave. You can go. I’ll stay here and send the Divine Life Palace on its last journey. I’m willing to be buried with the Divine Life Palace.”","Supreme Tian Yi spoke resolutely.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but fall silent."]},{"number":4574,"title":"Chapter 4574 Do You Dare to Disobey?","paragraphs":["4574 Do You Dare to Disobey?","The Supreme Temple was deathly silent.","Jian Wushuang took a glance at Supreme Tian Yi, then turned to look at Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Jun Fu, only to find that the two of them were silent.","“Do you guys think so too?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Supreme Jun Fu did not say anything, but Supreme Blood Wave let out a bitter laugh and said, “Jian Wushuang, you may not know our situation. The three of us have built the Divine Life Palace since we were young and weak. To us, the Divine Life Palace is not only a sect, but also our home. How can you ask us to do it, to abandon this family? Even mortals know how to protect their homes, fight for their homes, and die for their homes. How can we leave our homes? To abandon this place that raised me?”","Jun Fu and Tian Yi both smiled bitterly and nodded.","!!","“Foolish!” However, this time, Jian Wushuang, who had always been respectful to the Blood Wave Master and the others, interrupted them with an unexpected scolding.","“If you save the land and lose the people, you’ll lose everything! If you save the people and lose the land, you can regain everything!”","“Supreme Blood Wave, you’re my Seniors, so it’s not appropriate for me to argue with you. However, I’m sorry, but you’ll have to listen to me.”","“You say that the Divine Life Palace is home because everyone in the Divine Life Palace exists. It is because of the existence of the disciples of the Divine Life Palace that it has been given a special meaning. Otherwise, it would just be a piece of land with some buildings.”","“I, Jian Wushuang, don’t understand any righteousness or great principles. I only know that we should give them a taste of their own medicine! The Void Universe has killed countless heroes of our Divine Power Universe. We have to stay alive and work hard to grow. Only then can we make the Void Universe pay for what it did and comfort the souls of the heroes who died in the Offworld Battlefield.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold as he spoke.","Supreme Blood Wave and the other two exchanged looks upon hearing this.","They had never thought that Jian Wushuang would talk to them in such a tone.","In their impression, Jian Wushuang had always been a modest and gentle person.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems that you have really grown up.”","Supreme Blood Wave sighed. He was not angry. On the contrary, he felt somewhat gratified.","This meant that Jian Wushuang already had his own opinion and ambition to take charge.","Supreme Tian Yi nodded and said, “Jian Wushuang, I admit that you’re right. However, I’ve already made up my mind. I’ve decided to live and die with the Divine Life Palace. You can take the other disciples and move.”","After taking a deep breath, Supreme Tian Yi continued, “Jian Wushuang, with your talent, I think you will definitely be able to lead the Divine Life Palace well. Who knows, he might be able to start a great cause again in the future. Take good care of yourself...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Supreme Tian Yi, do you think I’m discussing this with you?”","Whoosh!","The next moment, a diamond-shaped black iron token appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“Here is the Palace Master token. I, Jian Wushuang, am the second Sect Master of the Divine Life Palace!”","Bang!!","In an instant, regardless of whether it was Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Jun Fu , the stubborn Supreme Tian Yi, or even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was a little further away, their eyes lit up when they saw the token and they immediately knelt on one knee.","“I, Blood Wave, pay my respects to the Palace Master!”","“I, Tian Yi, pay my respects to the Palace Master!”","“I, Jun Fu, pay my respects to the Palace Master!”","“I, Ninth Kalpa, pay my respects to the Palace Master!”","Although they did not know where Jian Wushuang got the Palace Master’s token, the Divine Life Palace had a rule that whoever held the token of the Divine Life Palace was the Palace Master!","At the same time, they were overjoyed.","Back then, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had left with the Palace Master’s token. After the disappearance of the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, the token had never returned.","And now, the token was in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Did it mean that Jian Wushuang had met the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace?","“Blood Wave, Tian Yi, Jun Fu, hear my order!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his eyes flickered. He said in a deep voice, “I order the three of you to gather disciples for the Divine Life Palace. After that, you will leave the Divine Life Palace with me and find another place to rest and recuperate!”","“Do you all disobey?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Tian Yi, and the other two looked at each other.","“I... I wouldn’t dare.”","The three of them lowered their heads and said.","“Good. Then let’s get moving.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and a gentle force lifted the four men’s knees from the ground.","“I’m sorry for offending you just now,” Jian Wushuang said apologetically.","“This is the etiquette of meeting the Palace Master, how can you say that you’ve offended us?” Supreme Blood Wave shook his head and paused for a moment before saying, “Jian Wu– No, Palace Master, is the previous Palace Master well?”","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to reply, Blood Wave said to himself, “Forget it. We’ll talk about this later. I’ll go and gather the others first.”","After saying this, Supreme Blood Wave strode away.","Now that they had decided to move the entire Palace, they had to make all the necessary preparations.","“Palace Master, I’ll go too!”","“Farewell!”","Supreme Jun Fu, Supreme Tian Yi, Ninth Kalpa King, and the others left one after another.","In the blink of an eye, only Jian Wushuang and Lan Lan were left in the Supreme Temple.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and said, “Miss Lan Lan, please wait here for a moment. I’ll be back soon.”","“Alright, go ahead. You don’t need to worry about me. I’m sure your beloved wife has been waiting for you for a long time,” Lan Lan said with a smile.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned. He immediately nodded and said, “Yes, she’s been waiting for me for a long, long time.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He took a heavy step and soared into the sky, heading toward the sixth mountain range of the Divine Life Palace.","...","Whoosh.","A streak of flowing light landed in the manor in the sixth mountain range and turned into Jian Wushuang, who was wearing a black robe.","From a distance, Jian Wushuang saw a gentle woman sitting by the lakeside of the manor. She was throwing fish bait, which attracted the fish to fight for food.","Hearing the noise, Leng Rushuang turned her head slightly and was stunned.","Swish...","The bait slipped from her hand like a thread, but Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang blankly, as if she didn’t feel it.","“My Husband...”","“Husband!”","The next moment, Leng Rushuang ran toward Jian Wushuang and ran into his arms.","She stretched out her hands and hugged Jian Wushuang, as if she wanted to merge Jian Wushuang into her body.","“Shuang’er, I’ve let you suffer during this period of time.”","Jian Wushuang sighed and stroked Leng Rushuang’s hair with his right hand to comfort her.","The pretty girl in her arms was already teary-eyed and choked with tears.","They had not seen each other for 10,000 years. Even when Jian Wushuang had returned from the Void Universe to the Southern Ocean Immortal Island, he had not entered her house and had not taken a look at her.","Jian Wushuang had long felt guilty toward her."]},{"number":4575,"title":"Chapter 4575 The Preparations Are Ready","paragraphs":["4575 The Preparations Are Ready","“Husband, you’re finally back!”","Leng Rushuang held Jian Wushuang so tightly that her nails dug into his back. She seemed to be afraid that Jian Wushuang would leave again if she let go.","“Alright, Shuang’er, let your Husband come and check how much your cultivation has improved during this time.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and gently patted Leng Rushuang’s back, letting her go.","“Eh? Are you about to break through to the Supreme realm?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and immediately praised, “It seems that Shuang’er has been working hard during this time. You’re about to catch up to Husband.”","!!","Leng Rushuang forced a smile on her face, but her eyes were dim.","She could feel that she was of less help to Jian Wushuang.","Even though she had tried her best to improve her cultivation, the gap between her and Jian Wushuang was still getting bigger.","She was afraid that if this continued, one day, the two of them would become people from two different worlds.","“Husband, are you leaving again after coming back this time?” Leng Rushuang asked.","“I am.” Jian Wushuang nodded and noticed that Leng Rushuang’s expression had dimmed. He could not help but smile and say, “But this time, we’ll be going together.”","“Really?” In an instant, Leng Rushuang’s eyes glowed with joy and she looked at Jian Wushuang with anticipation.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded and told Leng Rushuang what had happened on the Offworld Battlefield.","Suddenly, Leng Rushuang was dazed.","The two of them chatted for a while.","At this time, Ninth Kalpa King, who also lived in the sixth mountain range, flew over and said, “Jian– Palace Master, all the disciples have been gathered and are waiting for your instructions.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he took Leng Rushuang with him to the mountain gate.","When they arrived at the mountain gate, over 10,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace had already gathered.","After 10,000 years of recuperation, the Divine Life Palace had been completely restored, and its strength was even slightly higher than before. It was showing signs of prosperity.","If they continued to grow, they might become the number one power in the Divine Power Universe.","“We pay our respects to Palace Master Wushuang!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang coming on a cloud, the disciples knelt and shouted in unison.","Their voices reverberated through the clouds!","Their faces were filled with solemness.","“Good.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Behind him stood the four top Supreme Masters, Ninth Kalpa, Xue Bo, Jun Fu, and Tian Yi.","“Everyone, I think you already know that the Divine Power Universe has been defeated. Now, we have only one way out, which is to find another place and concentrate on developing. Do you have any objections?”","“We will follow Palace Master Wushuang’s orders!”","All the disciples of the Divine Life Palace responded.","“Good.” Jian Wushuang nodded and turned to Ninth Kalpa King, “Supreme Ninth Kalpa, please release all the Cosmic Boats in the storage of my Divine Life Palace and arrange for the disciples to board it.”","“Yes.” Ninth Kalpa King nodded and turned around to prepare.","“Supreme Tian Yi,” Jian Wushuang looked at Supreme Tian Yi, “you are in charge of storing all the books, divine medicines, divine materials, weapons, and Universe Origin Stones in the Library Pavilion into your Interspatial Ring!”","“Yes, Palace Master!” Tian Yi nodded his head and transformed into a streak of light as well, heading straight for the Library Pavilion.","“Supreme Jun Fu.”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze turned to Jun Fu again and he sent out orders one after another.","Immediately, the entire Divine Life Palace began to move quickly.","Then, Jian Wushuang stepped forward and arrived at the River of Enlightenment.","“River Spirit!” Jian Wushuang stood on the River of Enlightenment with his hands behind his back and shouted.","In an instant, a short old man with a small mustache, who was no more than three feet tall, walked out of the River of Enlightenment.","“Goddamned Jian Wu...”","He saw Jian Wushuang and exclaimed. Before he could finish his sentence, Jian Wushuang glared at him and he stopped talking. He smiled embarrassedly and said, “Supreme Wushuang.”","“Mmm.” Jian Wushuang nodded. River Spirit should be the only person in the Divine Life Palace who did not know his identity and the news that the Divine Power Universe had been defeated.","“Pack your things and leave the Divine Life Palace with me.”","“Leave the Divine Life Palace?”","River Spirit, who had been grinning, suddenly stared at Jian Wushuang with wide eyes. Then, like a cat whose tail had been stepped on, he cried out, “Jian Wushuang, you ungrateful thing, abusing your power for personal revenge! Do you think you’re powerful now and want to take revenge on me?”","“I’m telling you, even if I, Lord River Spirit, die here and the Divine Life Palace is destroyed, I won’t leave! I want to live and die with the Divine Life Palace!”","These words were said with a strong sense of righteousness and justice.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was so angry that he laughed. He flicked his sleeves and said, “Then prepare to die here.”","Then, Jian Wushuang was ready to leave.","The River Spirit glanced at Jian Wushuang and snorted.","Whoosh!","At this moment, a disciple of the Divine Life Palace who had packed his bags flew over. He stopped when he saw the spirit of the river of enlightenment. He landed and said in surprise, “Lord River Spirit, you’re still not ready to leave, are you?”","“Leave? Why should I leave?” River Spirit said disdainfully as it picked its nose and flicked a booger onto the ground.","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace was even more surprised when he heard this, and he replied, “Lord River Spirit, don’t you know? The Divine Power Universe has already been defeated. The great beings of the Void Universe will come here soon.”","After saying that, the disciple did not say anything more. He took a step forward and immediately walked toward the square at the mountain gate. His Senior Brothers had already boarded the Cosmic Boat, so he could not delay any longer.","“What? The Divine Power Universe was defeated? The people from the Void Universe are about to attack?”","River Spirit stopped picking his nose stopped, and he was stunned.","Immediately, his entire body shivered and he cried out, “Mommy!”","Plop!","The next moment, the River Spirit plunged into the River of Enlightenment.","A few breaths later, the dwarf-like Lord River Spirit rushed out with a bag that looked like a pair of flower underpants on his back.","“Hey, the little guy in front, wait for me!!” he shouted, panting.","To hell with righteousness!","...","Two hours later, all the preparation work was completed.","More than 10,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace had already boarded the Cosmic Boat.","Jian Wushuang could not help but let out a sigh of relief.","In that case, there was only one last problem left.","“Palace Master, what should we do about Supreme Yan Shan?” Xue Bo stood behind Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice.","Supreme Yan Shan’s body had long since transformed into a mountain, taking root in the land of the Divine Life Palace and becoming one with it."]},{"number":4576,"title":"Chapter 4576 Moving Away","paragraphs":["4576 Moving Away","“Supreme Yan Shan...”","Jian Wushuang looked at the mountain in front of the Divine Life Palace and frowned.","Supreme Yan Shan’s body had long since been connected to the entire Divine Life Palace. He was like a huge tree that was deeply rooted in the ground. The ground beneath his feet was Supreme Yan Shan’s chest, and the flowing river was his bloodline.","He and the Divine Life Palace had long been inseparable.","“Palace Master, there’s no need to consider my fate.”","!!","On the huge mountain, Supreme Yan Shan’s face appeared. He looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled, “I’ve been unable to move during these years, but I’ve long since mastered a divine ability that can conceal my aura. As long as I don’t reveal my aura, even an Invincible Supreme won’t be able to see through my true form. They’ll only think that I’m an ordinary mountain.”","“All of you, just leave.”","Jian Wushuang was silent for a moment and then nodded.","Regardless of whether what Supreme Yan Shan said was true or false, he could only treat it as the truth to comfort him.","Now, he was no longer the pampered disciple. He had to carry the entire Divine Life Palace and be responsible for the tens of thousands of lives in the Divine Life Palace.","He could not afford to be indecisive.","A moment later.","All the disciples boarded the Cosmic Boat, leaving only Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and the other three lead Supreme masters.","Whirrrr...","At this moment, a muffled sound came from the direction of the Divine Life Palace’s Weapon-Hiding Pavilion, and the whole earth trembled.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and turned his head to look. He saw Supreme Tian Yi pushing a huge dragon-head cannon out of the armament repository.","This dragon-head cannon was a thousand feet tall, and just the muzzle was the size of a pond. It reached into the clouds, and the black body of the cannon was covered with golden divine patterns.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his face revealed a touch of surprise.","He could actually feel a sense of danger from the dragon-head cannon.","It had to be known that with his current strength, even some ordinary Invincible Supremes would not be able to make him feel such a sense of danger.","“Palace Master, this is the Divine Life Palace’s trump card, the Dragon God Cannon. It was refined from the skull of the Ancestral Dragon after its death. Although it can only launch one attack, it can kill an Invincible Supreme.”","Supreme Tian Yi said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and replied, “Why didn’t we use this when the Six Forces invaded the Divine Life Palace?”","With a bitter smile, Supreme Xue Bo continued, “Secondly, we couldn’t use the dragon-head cannon at that time. We had to use a special key to start it.”","“Key?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“That’s right.” Xue Bo nodded and pointed at the black iron token hanging on Jian Wushuang’s waist, which represented his status as the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.","He said, “Palace Master, the key is the Palace Master’s Token of the Divine Life Palace. When the previous Palace Master left and never returned, the Palace Master’s Token disappeared as well. This great killing weapon has been left in the Weapon-Hiding Pavilion since then.”","“I see.” After that, Jian Wushuang used the Palace Master’s Token to unlock the dragon-head cannon and put it into his Interspatial Ring.","At this point, the plan to relocate the Divine Life Palace had been completed.","Rumble!","With a series of engines rumbling, dozens of Cosmic Boats floated in the starry sky. They let out an angry roar and suddenly shot out, heading toward the extreme north of the universe.","On the deck of the first Cosmic Boat, the wind was howling.","Jian Wushuang stood silently with his hands behind his back. He turned around and looked in the direction of the Divine Life Palace.","As the Cosmic Boat sped along, the Divine Life Palace became smaller and smaller until it was just a black dot.","“I’ll definitely be back, definitely!”","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He turned around and no longer looked at the Divine Life Palace. Instead, his eyes flickered as he looked into the distance.","...","Three months passed by in a flash.","In these three months, a large group of people from the Void Universe had finally killed their way into the depths of the Divine Power Universe.","As they passed, they killed. The entire Divine Power Universe was engulfed in flames of War and smoke of war.","The starry sky that used to be bright and beautiful was now dyed blood-red.","The cries for mercy, the screams, the roars, and the roars of madness that would not stop until one died became the melody of the universe.","In a short three months, more than a hundred sects of all sizes had fallen.","There were tens of thousands of races in the universe, but all of them were exterminated by the Void Universe. They were completely exterminated and removed from the universe.","Some top forces had been enslaved by the Void Universe and turned into puppets without self-consciousness, which could be controlled at will.","At the same time, countless fierce battles broke out in the universe.","In one of the Divine Kingdoms, from the ant-like mortals to the Divine Masters and the Supreme realm experts, none of them surrendered. They fought to the last moment of their lives. Even at the last moment of their deaths, the billions of living beings in the kingdom remained silent and did not beg for mercy.","They only had one thing to say.","To live was to live while standing tall!","He would die standing!","There was also a top force, the Lord of a Holy Land, who only kept a trace of fire. After sending out the most talented disciples in his sect, he led more than 8,000 disciples of his sect to die brazenly. All of them self-destructed.","The Divine Power Universe never lacked blood.","In the Divine Power Universe, in the cold and lonely boundless starry sky, they had written one soul-stirring epic after another.","The fleet of the Divine Life Palace was already getting closer and closer to the extreme north of the universe, in the direction of the Nine Forbidden Zones.","In the cabin of the first Cosmic Boat, which was responsible for clearing the way, Jian Wushuang, Supreme Jun Fu, Supreme Xue Bo, and the others were gathered together and discussing the issue of settling down.","The four of them were gathered around a round table. On the table, a map was being formed using divine power.","There was nothing else on the map, only the Nine Forbidden Zones.","Five of the Nine Forbidden Zones had been crossed by Jian Wushuang and the other three.","“Palace Master, the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans each occupy a large forbidden area, while the Dark Demon and the Overlord Patriarch occupy other large forbidden zones. I’m afraid they won’t let us in rashly during such an emergency.","“Therefore, we can only choose from these four Forbidden Zones.”","Supreme Xue Bo’s eyes flickered as he spoke in a deep voice.","“The Ancient Cavern!”","“The Tomb of the Gods!”","“The Land of Sorrows!”","“The Imperial Ancestor Ruins!”","“No one has ever stepped into or come out of these four places. No one unknown what the situation is like. I’m afraid the danger level is extremely high.”"]},{"number":4577,"title":"Chapter 4577 Choosing the Forbidden Zone, the Refugees Come To Surrender","paragraphs":["4577 Choosing the Forbidden Zone, the Refugees Come To Surrender","The Ancient Cavern!","The Tomb of the Gods!","The Land of Sorrow!","The Imperial Ancestor Ruins!","These four places were the four Forbidden Lands that no one had ever set foot in!","!!","Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the map that was formed by divine power. He did not speak but started to think quickly.","He already had a basic understanding of these four places.","First, it was the Ancient Cavern.","It was said that the formation of the Ancient Cavern was at the beginning of the universe when the primordial Qi split into two. The clear Qi rose and formed a dome-like sky, while the turbid Qi sank and formed a thick earth.","However, the foul air was not exhausted.","The remaining impure energy gathered together and entered the northernmost area, forming the Ancient Cavern.","It was rumored that there was a large amount of foul air reverberating day and night in the Ancient Cavern. It let out a huge rumbling sound that was enough to scrape off one’s bones and flesh and annihilate one’s soul.","Even an Invincible Supreme would not be able to last for the time it takes an incense stick to burn.","It was because of this that no one lived in the Ancient Cavern. It had always been the most spacious Forbidden Zone in the entire universe.","Secondly, there was the Tomb of the Gods.","There were many dead souls buried in the Tomb of the Gods.","Most of these dead souls came from the Great Tribulation of the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans at the beginning of the universe, as well as the war with the Void Universe that broke out after that. They were almighty dead souls who had died in the Great Tribulation.","Therefore, the Tombs of the Gods were filled with the shocking fighting spirit of these powerful people before their death, as well as all kinds of emotions such as unwillingness, anger, and sadness.","With these emotions present, even an Invincible Supreme would be affected mentally if they stayed inside for too long, turning them into complete lunatics.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang erased the two Forbidden Zones.","The Divine Life Palace did not have an Invincible Supreme to keep watch over it, and it was far too dangerous to go to these two Forbidden Zones.","It could be said that as long as Jian Wushuang dared to take the Divine Life Palace into these two Forbidden Zones, all the disciples of the Divine Life Palace would be annihilated in less than ten breaths.","As for Jian Wushuang, he would only be able to hold on for a few breaths.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts were almost the same as theirs.","“Palace Master, then the only Forbidden Zones we can choose are the desolate goose land and the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.”","Supreme Xue Bo said in a deep voice.","“Yes, I know.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at the last two Forbidden Zones on the map.","The Land of Sorrows and the Imperial Ancestor Ruins were publicly acknowledged as the two most mysterious Forbidden Zones in the Divine Power Universe!","In the past, there had been two Invincible Supreme experts who had tried to kill each other and had escaped into the Imperial Ancestor Ruins. In the end, the two of them had never come out again.","If it could be said that everyone still knew a thing or two about the Tomb of the Gods and the Ancient Cavern.","Then, when it came to the Land of Sorrows and the Imperial Ancestor Ruins, they would be in the dark.","The only information he knew was that these two Forbidden Lands had been formed before the universe’s chaos.","Even before the universe’s chaos...","How long ago was that?","“Palace Master, which Forbidden Zone should we choose?” Xue Bo asked.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and shook his head, “For us, the situation in these two Forbidden Zones is similar. We’ll take one step at a time when we reach the extreme north of the universe.","“I guess that’s the only way.” When Supreme Xue Bo and the others saw this, they could not help but look at each other and smile bitterly.","The Divine Life Palace was one of the top forces in the Divine Power Universe, but they had no power to fight back when the disaster struck. It was difficult for them to even find a place to hide.","Just as everyone was discussing.","Thud, thud, thud.","On the deck, there was a sudden rush of footsteps.","Then, a disciple of the Divine Life Palace walked into the cabin in a hurry and said, “Palace Master, Supremes Masters, there are refugees outside the boat. They want to ask for help.”","“Eh? Refugees?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","The Xue Bo Supreme explained, “Palace Master, you don’t know this. When the Void Universe attacked, many disciples and elders from great powers lost their homes and drifted around the universe. They wanted to seek refuge and help. They were the refugees.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and did not order him to take in the refugees. Instead, he said, “Let’s go and see what’s the situation.”","Then, Jian Wushuang stood up and walked out of the cabin with Leng Rushuang.","Xue Bo, Jun Fu, Tian Yi, and Ninth Kalpa King, the four lead Supremes, were slightly behind Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang walked to the deck of the Cosmic Boat and looked up. He saw a large crowd of people standing in front of the Cosmic Boat.","These people were dressed in tattered clothes and their hair was disheveled. They were in a sorry state.","The leader of the group was an old man with a head full of white hair hanging down, covering half of his face, and blood spots all over his body.","One could tell at a glance that these people had probably gone through a brutal slaughter before escaping.","“Sir, I was an Elder of the Sky Yuan Sect in the past. Please take me in!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang walk out, the leading old man immediately knelt down and kowtowed to Jian Wushuang.","Behind him, the refugees from all over the world knelt one after another, pleading for him to take them in.","“Husband, they’re so pitiful. Please take them in.”","Leng Rushuang’s heart softened when she saw this.","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he stared at the man who claimed to be an Elder of the Sky Yuan Sect. After ten breaths, he turned around and looked at the refugees behind him.","“I’m sorry, our cabin is full and can’t take in so many people,” Jian Wushuang said expressionlessly.","After he finished speaking, he turned around and wanted to return to the cabin.","Leng Rushuang was stunned. She clearly remembered that there were still many seats in the cabin.","However, she had always trusted Jian Wushuang, so she did not say anything more. Instead, she looked at the refugees carefully.","With this look, she was shocked and saw something strange.","The old man, who was the leader of the refugees, squinted his eyes when he saw Jian Wushuang turning to leave.","Immediately after, he cried out, “My Lord, please save us! We don’t have a Cosmic Boat, so the people from the Void Universe will come and kill us. We’ll all die!”","“I beg you, My Lord. Please show mercy and save us!”","After he finished shouting, the refugees behind the old man also began to cry.","Jian Wushuang stopped.","He turned his head again and looked at the group of refugees. His expressionless face gradually became cold.","“Run them over!”","Jian Wushuang looked at the refugees coldly and spat out three words.","The old man’s expression changed instantly.","The next moment, the grief on his face disappeared and was replaced by a sinister look."]},{"number":4578,"title":"Chapter 4578 Noisy","paragraphs":["4578 Noisy","“Run them over?”","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace behind Jian Wushuang were all shocked.","“P-Palace Master, at most, we can just stop them from boarding the ship. It’s not very good to just run them over, right?” a disciple of the Divine Life Palace stuttered.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and stared at the old man, who was the leader of the refugees, with a cold expression.","“Hehe.” The mournful-looking old man suddenly laughed.","!!","“Little Kid, tell me, how did you see through it?”","The old man slowly stood up. The grief on his face had disappeared. Instead, he stuck out his tongue and licked the corner of his mouth. His eyes revealed a touch of greed.","As the old man laid his cards on the table, the refugees behind him also stood up, their faces filled with ferocity.","“Chief, don’t waste your breath on this little kid. Just kill them all and take their Cosmic Boats!”","One of the refugees stood behind the old man and laughed sinisterly.","Jian Wushuang looked at the old man with contempt and said, “If I’m not wrong, you just robbed someone, right? The divine blood in his body belongs to someone else, so it’s hard not to be seen through.”","“Is that so?” The old man narrowed his eyes and looked down at the blood on his body. He seemed to have thought of something and said, “Just now, there was a couple who didn’t know what was good for them. All they needed to do was join us. I had no choice but to kill the man’s cultivation partner in front of him, and then I crushed the man’s divine body inch by inch. In the end, the man couldn’t bear it and self-destructed.”","The old man raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang, who was next to him. With a lecherous look, he said, “Little Kid, you must be a smart person. You won’t be so insensible, right?”","Before Jian Wushuang could do anything, Leng Rushuang flew into a rage. The long whip in her hand appeared out of thin air and cracked the void. It extended for thousands of miles and struck at the Elder.","“Hahaha, you little girl, you’re quite feisty.” The old man laughed and rose into the sky, revealing his cultivation.","The aura of a Half Invincible Supreme being spread out.","He flicked his finger and Leng Rushuang’s long whip was knocked away.","“A Half Invincible Supreme!”","The hearts of the Xue Bo and the others sank.","After all, with the death of Supreme Gai Fu, the person with the highest cultivation in the entire Divine Life Palace was Supreme Xue Bo, who had just broken through not long ago.","However, Supreme Xue Bo had only just stepped into the Half Invincible Supreme realm not long ago, while this old man’s aura was as deep as the abyss. Clearly, he was already an experienced Half Invincible Supreme.","Xue Bo took a deep breath with a grave expression.","“There’s no need.” Jian Wushuang shook his head, squinted at the old man, and said indifferently, “He’s just an animal.”","Then, Jian Wushuang took a step forward, turned into a sword light, and rushed toward the Elder.","The clouds within 10,000 miles were all cut open!","There was only a thin line left between heaven and earth!","“Oh?”","Feeling the bone-piercing Sword Qi, the old man was first shocked, but then he said in disdain, “You’re just an Intermediate Supreme martial artist. How dare you be so presumptuous in front of me?”","“Be careful, Palace Master!”","Supreme Xue Bo was also shocked when he saw Jian Wushuang rush over.","Jian Wushuang had been away from the Divine Power Universe for more than 10,000 years, but Xue Bo’s impression of Jian Wushuang was that he was still a Primary Supreme, and his strength was at most at the Top Supreme level.","Although Jian Wushuang had broken through to Intermediate Supreme, he was still a ways off to fight against a Half Invincible Supreme expert.","Even Leng Rushuang’s heart clenched.","Jian Wushuang had left the Divine Power Universe for far too long.","It had been so long that many people had already forgotten his combat strength.","In the entire scene, only Ninth Kalpa King had an indifferent expression. He was not worried about Jian Wushuang at all.","He knew about Jian Wushuang’s battle strength. Jian Wushuang might not be able to match an Invincible Supreme, because he had never tried it before. However, in the world, there was no existence below the Invincible Supreme that could withstand ten moves from Jian Wushuang.","Even Hell King, the most powerful Five Scar Void Master in the Void Universe, had been killed by Jian Wushuang within ten moves.","What was this old man?","“Hahaha, Junior, since you don’t know what’s good for you, don’t blame this old man for...”","The old man laughed wildly, but before he could finish his sentence, his laughter stopped abruptly.","A head was instantly separated from his neck and flew high into the air.","Then, his body shattered like a mirror that had been smashed to the ground.","“You... how did you...”","The old man’s face was filled with extreme shock as he looked at Jian Wushuang in horror.","“My Lord, I failed to recognize your might... I didn’t know that you’re extraordinary. Please be magnanimous and forgive me...”","He frantically begged for mercy.","“You’re noisy.”","Jian Wushuang stood proudly in the void and flicked his finger. Instantly, a sword light shot out from his fingertip and pierced through the man.","Swish!","In the next moment, the old man’s head exploded like a watermelon. He could not be more dead.","Supreme Xue Bo, who had been about to charge out, suddenly stopped in his tracks, and a look of shock appeared in his eyes.","“A... a Half Invincible Supreme was killed by Jian Wushuang in one move?”","As for the refugees who followed the old man, when they saw the situation, they were deathly silent.","Immediately.","“Mother of God!”","The refugees shrieked in fear and fled.","Jian Wushuang patted his waist with his right hand and the Tarot Divine Sword was instantly unsheathed. Like a white dragon, it rushed forward and killed them one by one.","A moment later, the Tarot Divine Sword returned to its scabbard.","In a flash, Jian Wushuang returned to the deck of the Cosmic Boat from the boundless void.","Supreme Xue Bo finally came to his senses. He grabbed Jian Wushuang’s arm and asked, “Palace Master, is your current battle prowess comparable to an Invincible Supreme’s?”","“I don’t know, but I think I can put up a fight.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","This was not because he was arrogant, but because he was confident.","Jian Wushuang had not only broken through to the Intermediate Supreme realm and improved his cultivation greatly, but he had also obtained all the cultivation comprehensions given by Supreme Dao Yan, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.","He refined this comprehension every day, and his strength seemed to double with each day, like a boat rising with the tide.","The only reason he was not sure was that he had not had the chance to truly fight an Invincible Supreme yet.","For the time being, Jian Wushuang was far inferior to the Supreme experts like the Overlord Patriarch and Supreme Gai Fu. However, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could fight against the weaker Invincible Supremes like the Temple Master of Cosmos Temple, Supreme Hei Yu.","“Alright, let’s go.”","After a while, Jian Wushuang returned to the cabin.","The entire fleet of the Divine Life Palace continued to sail and left this place in a flash.","In the boundless starry sky, they were getting closer and closer to the extreme north where the Nine Forbidden Zones were located."]},{"number":4579,"title":"Chapter 4579 Arriving at the Nine Forbidden Zones","paragraphs":["4579 Arriving at the Nine Forbidden Zones","Three months later.","The fleet of the Divine Life Palace gradually left the bustling area and came to the extreme north of the universe.","The temperature dropped rapidly, and the deck of the entire Cosmic Boat was covered in a thick layer of frost.","In front of him was a cold and lonely starry sky. Nine millstone-shaped galaxies were quietly hovering in front of him, emitting a biting cold.","Of the Nine Forbidden Zones, the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans had already taken up three of them. With the Overlords and the Dark Demons taking up two of them, there were only four Forbidden Zones left.","As for the Ancient Cavern and the Tomb of the Gods, Jian Wushuang had already eliminated them from his expectations.","Thus, only the Imperial Ancestor Ruins and the Land of Sorrows were left.","Jian Wushuang looked at the two Forbidden Zones and his eyes flickered. He began to think carefully.","These two Forbidden Zones were formed before the universe was created, so no one knew what was inside.","Therefore, the level of danger was no different to Jian Wushuang.","“Palace Master, I think we should go to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.” Supreme Xue Bo said.","“Oh? Why?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked.","Supreme Xue Bo chuckled and shook his head. “I don’t know either. It’s just a gut feeling. I feel that there’s a great fortune in the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.”","“Alright, let’s go to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins,” Jian Wushuang was stunned and then said.","The Cosmic Boat let out a loud roar and sailed toward the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.","Just as the Cosmic Boat was about to arrive at the galaxy entrance leading to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins, in the Cosmic Boat, an ordinary disciple suddenly knelt on the ground with a bang. His stomach turned, and he vomited.","Blargh!","Pfft!","In an instant, countless pieces of flesh and blood were spat out from the disciple’s mouth. Among them was a black corpse puppet the size of a finger.","“Junior Brother Mu Ye, what’s wrong?”","“What is this?”","Instantly, the other disciples around him were shocked and looked at him in confusion.","Now that they were about to enter the Imperial Ancestor Ruins, all the disciples were tense and held their breath. They were extremely nervous.","“Eh? What’s wrong?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked back.","The corpse puppet jumped on the deck and turned into a black light, piercing toward the galaxy where the Imperial Ancestor Ruins were.","The Nine Forbidden Zones were all independent small worlds, and the entrance to the passage was in the center of the galaxy.","At this moment, in the center of the galaxy of the Imperial Ancestor Ruins, a black-clothed figure stood with his hands behind his back, stepping on a meteorite. His clothes fluttered in the wind, and his entire person was filled with a cold aura.","Whoosh.","The corpse puppet automatically landed on the black-clothed figure’s shoulder and then slid into his body through the gap in his collar.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene and gradually frowned.","This back view gave him a familiar feeling.","The next moment.","The black-clothed man turned around slowly and looked at Jian Wushuang. He said two words expressionlessly, “Wushuang!”","As he finished speaking, the face of the man in black appeared from the shadows.","This person was the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master, Void Master Ba Huang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank and his pupils shrank.","Why would this person appear here?","Void Master Ba Huang looked at Jian Wushuang coldly and said, “Wushuang, you didn’t expect me to appear here, did you? When you disguised yourself as the Sect Master of Crimson Whale Gang and sneaked into the 87th void rift, I had a faint suspicion. Only after the battle had gone on did I finally confirm that it was you.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer.","Now, he could already guess the reason for the appearance of Void Master Ba Huang. During the battle, Void Master Ba Huang had secretly placed a corpse puppet to track his movements.","“What’s going on?”","“Who is this person?”","The scene behind Jian Wushuang was in chaos.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and gestured for the disciples of the Divine Life Palace to be quiet. Then he raised his head and looked at Void Master Ba Huang. He said calmly, “Ba Huang, what do you want to do now?”","“What do I want?”","Void Master Ba Huang snorted and said angrily, “Wushuang, I have always treated you well. You killed Elder Shen Lian and his son, but I did not pursue it. I even personally gave you the position of the God Refining Sect Master and placed you at the peak. Do you still remember Elder Mi Feng? How did he treat you in the past? Back then, he protected you at all costs in front of me!”","“Has anyone in my God Refining Sect ever mistreated you?”","“But what about you? You disregarded the entire God Refining Sect and betrayed the Void Universe. Let me ask you, do you feel any guilt?”","At the end, Void Master Ba Huang’s voice was like thunder, rumbling and deafening.","Jian Wushuang fell silent again. After a long while, he took a deep breath and replied, “I’m sorry.”","The Sect Master snorted coldly. His eyes flickered and he replied, “Wushuang, now that the Divine Power Universe has been defeated, there is no chance of turning the tables. I will give you one last chance. As long as you abandon the dark side and join the light, and kill all the people from the sect behind you, I will forgive your previous actions. You will still be the new Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. How about it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the God Refining Sect Master stared at Jian Wushuang. It was as if he would attack if Jian Wushuang dared to say ‘I refuse’.","Jian Wushuang remained expressionless and slowly held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Ba Huang, there’s no point in talking. Let’s fight.”","Jian Wushuang’s answer was clear.","“You’re so stubborn and stupid!” Void Master Ba Huang snorted and a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“Wushuang, you’ll be buried with the Divine Power Universe!”","Bang!!!","In an instant, the Void Master Ba Huang took a step forward and the meteorite under his feet shattered.","His entire body had already turned into a flowing light and was shooting toward Jian Wushuang!","The aura of a Six Scar Void Master was released completely, like a raging sea and raging waves.","“Supreme Xue Bo, I’ll stop him. You take the disciples of the Divine Life Palace and enter the Land of Sorrows.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and unsheathed his sword as well.","After saying that, Jian Wushuang turned into a sword light that pierced through the sky and earth and charged at Void Master Ba Huang!","Ba Hang, a Six Scar Void Master, was an Invincible Supreme expert in the Divine Power Universe!","This was Jian Wushuang’s first time fighting against an Invincible Supreme!","“My Husband!”","Seeing this, Leng Rushuang’s expression changed. She stood up and wanted to rush out.","Whoosh!","A big hand grabbed Leng Rushuang’s sleeve.","Supreme Xue Bo’s expression turned grave as he shook his head. “Palace Mistress, we can’t interfere in this battle. We will only drag Palace Mistress down if we stay here. Listen to Palace Mistress, let’s head to the desolate wildlands first.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Xue Bo steered the Cosmic Boat and turned the bow around. With a loud boom, the Cosmic Boat shot toward the Land of Sorrows, which was next to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins."]},{"number":4580,"title":"Chapter 4580 Battling Ba Huang","paragraphs":["4580 Battling Ba Huang","Bang!","Like two burning meteorites, Jian Wushuang and Void Master Ba Huang crashed into each other!","A violent explosion was heard. Then, a figure was sent flying backward, drawing a long straight line in the void and leaving a long gully.","The person who was sent flying was Jian Wushuang.","“Is this the power of an Invincible Supreme?”","Golden divine blood flowed out of the corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth. His purlicue trembled violently and his blood and Qi were in turmoil.","It had to be said that the power of an Invincible Supreme was far beyond that of an ordinary Supreme. Even a casual strike from him was not something that an ordinary Supreme could compare to.","Jian Wushuang could be said to be an expert below the Invincible Supreme level, but he was no match for a casual attack from Void Master Ba Huang.","“You want to escape?”","Void Master Ba Huang snorted and looked at the fleet of the Divine Life Palace that was flying toward the Ancient Cavern. A cold light flashed in his eyes.","Although he did not know what was inside the Land of Sorrows, his Six Scar Void Master’s sharp intuition told him that if he allowed this group of people to escape to the Land of Sorrows, he was afraid that he would no longer be able to kill them and would only be in trouble.","“Go.”","He waved his right hand, and a massive divine corpse with a withered face and eyes like rotten grapes walked out from the void behind him.","This divine corpse was also a Six Scar divine corpse!","In an instant, the divine corpse took a step forward, leaving an afterimage in the void as he charged toward the fleet of the Divine Life Palace that was less than a thousand feet away from the entrance of the Land of Sorrows.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and used Sundering Stars to stop the divine corpse.","Then, in the void behind Jian Wushuang, the Tarot divine corpse also took a step forward. With a flash of his body, he had already crashed into the Six Scar level divine corpse!","The aura of a High Supreme was exuding from the corpse!","During this period of time, Jian Wushuang not only digested the cultivation comprehension given to him by the Supreme Dao Yan and improved his strength, but he also did not neglect the cultivation of the Tarot divine corpse.","The corpse of Supreme Tarot had the initial cultivation base of a Top Supreme realm, and there were no obstacles in his recovery. He had unknowingly reached the High Supreme realm!","The divine corpse of the Tarot turned into a sword and flew forward on it. Wind and thunder rolled, and he crashed into the Six Scar level divine corpse, leaving a sword mark as thick as a fingernail on the surface of its body.","When Supreme Tarot was still alive, he was able to kill an Invincible Supreme with his Top Supreme realm cultivation. Although he was only a divine corpse now, his combat instincts were enough to resist the divine corpse of Void Master Ba Huang!","To Jian Wushuang, this was enough!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang finally heaved a sigh of relief.","The current him could finally fight without holding back!","“Bastard!” When Void Master Ba Huang saw this, his face turned green.","How could he not recognize that the divine corpse that Jian Wushuang had just sent out was the one that Jian Wushuang had obtained in the God Refining Sect’s Coffin Mountain!","“Wushuang, you deserve to die!”","A cold light flashed in the eyes of Void Master Ba Huang. He clapped his hands and a large amount of void power gathered in his hands, turning into two dark light balls, which he slapped toward Jian Wushuang.","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang waved his sleeve. There was no fear in his eyes. Instead, his battle intent surged to the extreme.","Between his brows, a purple ‘Chuan’ character appeared faintly like blood. His eyes turned into a pale golden color, and the Qi and blood in his body rolled, making a muffled sound like a war hammer.","This was the phenomenon produced when the Chaos Overlord Body was stimulated to the extreme!","“Fight!” Jian Wushuang spat out the word. The next moment, his entire body turned into a sword light that broke the twilight sky. He cut the sky and the earth into a line and instantly slashed toward Void Master Ba Huang.","“Petty tricks.” Void Master Ba Huang snorted coldly and flew up to fight with Jian Wushuang.","Bang! Bang!","Bang! Bang!","One after another, rumbling sounds came from where the two of them were fighting. It was as if two giant beasts were fighting.","“Open Sky!”","“Sundering Stars!”","“Eternal Night!”","“Daybreak!”","One after another, the divine power sword moves that had allowed Jian Wushuang to kill countless enemies were all performed by Jian Wushuang.","However, it was useless. Everything was useless!","Void Master Ba Huang’s void power surged in his hands and crushed them as if he was holding two bolts of lightning.","In the blink of an eye, the two of them had exchanged more than a hundred moves.","“Is this the power of an Invincible Supreme?” Jian Wushuang, who had been pushed back a thousand feet and had cracks on his divine body, exclaimed in surprise.","A hair’s breadth!","He was still a hair’s breadth away from becoming an Invincible Supreme!","Although this difference did not seem like much, it was like a huge chasm that he could not cross in a short period of time.","However, Jian Wushuang was amazed. He did not know how great a storm was surging in the heart of Void Master Ba Huang!","According to the conversion of realms in the Void Universe, Jian Wushuang’s current cultivation realm was only at the level of a Two Scar Void Master, while he was a Six Scar Void Master, an existence that stood at the peak of the entire universe!","Although Void Master Ba Huang had not used any earth-shattering killing moves in the previous exchange, the power of his attack was enough to kill all Void Masters below the Six Scar level!","As for Jian Wushuang, although he was being suppressed, he was not in any life-threatening situation.","A monster!","If he was not killed, he would become a great threat to the Void Universe in the future.","At the thought of this, a hint of killing intent appeared in the eyes of Void Master Ba Huang. He no longer intended to hold back and wanted to kill Jian Wushuang directly!","“Wushuang, prepare to die. I’ve already given you a chance to choose a new camp, but you didn’t cherish it. Don’t blame me for being merciless,” Void Master Ba Huang said coldly.","A small Whirlpool appeared in his hands and endless void power started to gather.","A destructive aura spread out and crushed the ancient void.","Before that, Jian Wushuang had already used his most powerful killing move!","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth form, Tarot!”","Swish!","In an instant, a shocking Sword Intent soared into the sky, shaking the world and breaking through the clouds.","The green-robed sword God’s figure appeared behind Jian Wushuang. As Jian Wushuang waved his sword, he cut off a vast sword light that was hundreds of thousands of feet wide!","This sword had never failed, and it had killed all its enemies in the world!","This sword move had once destroyed everything like rotten wood and had not been defeated once!","After slashing with the sword, Jian Wushuang did not even look at the result. Divine power burst out from his legs and he rushed toward the entrance of the Land of Sorrows!","He had never imagined that this sword could kill Void Master Ba Huang, as it was not something he could do at the moment.","He only needed to distract Void Master Ba Huang with this sword attack, which would be enough to make him step into the Land of Sorrows!"]},{"number":4581,"title":"Chapter 4581 Entering the Land of Sorrows","paragraphs":["4581 Entering the Land of Sorrows","“Wushuang!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang shooting toward the entrance of the Land of Sorrows, Ba Huang’s face was filled with shock and anger.","Just as he was about to get up and give chase, he saw the Tarot sword light, which Jian Wushuang had used all his strength to slash out, coming toward him!","Even he did not dare to underestimate the sharp Sword Intent.","“Damn it!”","Void Master Ba Huang’s face darkened. He had no choice but to stop and channel all his void power to block the sword strike!","“Void Technique, Great Ghost Dark Hand!” Void Master Ba Huang shouted coldly. His hands turned pitch-black and his nails grew sharply, giving off a strong corpse Qi.","“Disperse!” Void Master Ba Huang shouted coldly and pushed his hands forward to grab the Tarot sword radiance!","Bang!","Countless sparks flew out from the point where Void Master Ba Huang and the sword met.","It was like a man wearing a pair of steel gloves and grabbing a high-speed steel gear. The figure of Void Master Ba Huang was forced back by the sword, and his legs left a long mark in the void.","“This sword strike!!!”","Void Master Ba Huang was extremely shocked and furious. The last move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Tarot, was performed by Jian Wushuang. Although it did not pose a fatal threat to him, it gave him a feeling of being stabbed by needles.","This was simply impossible for an Intermediate Supreme to fight an Invincible Supreme.","“I said, disperse!!!”","After being pushed back a thousand feet by the sword, Void Master Ba Huang’s eyes widened and he roared angrily. The black light between his hands suddenly became brighter!","The next moment!","The sword strike was torn apart by Void Master Ba Huang.","After tearing the sword strike apart, Void Master Ba Huang panted slightly, and beads of sweat appeared on his forehead.","Then, he lowered his head and looked at his palms. There was a wound so deep that his bones could be seen, and blood was dripping.","“Wushuang!” Void Master Ba Huang’s eyes turned cold as he rushed to the entrance of the Land of Sorrows.","Snorting coldly, the Void Master Ba Huang released his void consciousness and spread it toward the Land of Sorrows.","In just three breaths...","Pfff!","As if he had been hit by a heavy hammer, Void Master Ba Huang bent over and spat out a mouthful of divine blood. His face instantly turned sallow.","“A land of great calamity!”","He raised his head to look at the Land of Sorrows, his eyes flashing with deep fear and dread.","When he had used his void consciousness to probe this Land of Sorrows, it was as if he had touched an unspeakable existence. In just an instant, his void consciousness had been completely shattered.","If he had not reacted quickly enough and cut off his consciousness in time, the indescribable power would have spread to his body through the void consciousness and destroyed him.","“Wushuang, you’re seeking your death by entering this land of great calamity.”","He shook his head and looked at the Land of Sorrows with mixed emotions. Then, he took a step forward and turned into a beam of light, leaving the place quickly.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang and the people from the Divine Life Palace would definitely die after entering the Land of Sorrows.","There was no need to continue wasting time here.","...","In the Land of Sorrows.","Jian Wushuang took back the Tarot divine corpse, took a step forward, and immediately rushed forward.","It was a long and dark passage.","Even though Jian Wushuang was an Intermediate Supreme Master, he could only see darkness and no more than ten meters ahead.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to release his divine sense, but kept flying forward.","He could feel that on both sides of this long and dark passage, there were cold walls. Something seemed to be carved on the uneven walls.","Out of careful consideration, Jian Wushuang did not touch it casually. Instead, he kept flying forward.","After about the time for five incense sticks to burn, Jian Wushuang saw some sparks not far away.","It was the flame of the engine when the Cosmic Boat was traveling.","Bang! Bang!","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang quickened his pace and caught up with the Cosmic Boat in one step. Then, he took a few steps and landed on the deck of the first Cosmic Boat.","“Palace Master?” Upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s return, Supreme Xue Bo, Leng Rushuang, and the others were delighted.","“Husband, are you alright?” Leng Rushuang held Jian Wushuang’s hand and asked with concern.","“I’m fine. What about you guys? Did you encounter any danger along the way?” Jian Wushuang smiled and rubbed Leng Rushuang’s nose.","Hearing Jian Wushuang say that he was fine, everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","Void Master Ba Huang was an Invincible Supreme expert according to the realm of the Divine Power Universe.","“Nothing happened to us. We’ve been moving forward in this tunnel. But it’s strange. According to our speed, we should have passed through at least three or four Star Fields, but we’re still in this tunnel.”","Leng Rushuang nodded.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything but frowned.","Indeed, this passageway was a little strange.","“Palace Master, we’re not in the Divine Power Universe right now. Each Forbidden Zone is a small world on its own, so we can’t calculate the distance with regular time,” Supreme Xue Bo said with a smile.","Although he was slightly weaker than Jian Wushuang in terms of battle strength and cultivation, his years of experience made him more knowledgeable than Jian Wushuang.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and immediately nodded. He stopped thinking and said, “Then let’s continue forward.”","“Yes!”","The fleet of the Divine Life Palace once again sailed forward steadily.","However, this journey continued for three days and three nights.","With the Cosmic Boat’s speed, they could have crossed over 100 Star Fields, but they were still in the dark tunnel.","This time, even Supreme Xue Bo frowned as he sensed that something was wrong.","However, no one dared to act rashly in this Land of Sorrows. They could only suppress their emotions and wait quietly for them to arrive.","Time continued to drag on.","On the deck.","Leng Rushuang leaned against Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, letting the dark wind in the tunnel blow on their faces.","“Husband, the entire universe will fall sooner or later. What do you think about Qing’er and the others? What about the Taichu Divine World?” Leng Rushuang said absentmindedly.","As they advanced through the passage, they were in a rare state of peace.","And calmness would often cause one to have many thoughts.","This made Leng Rushuang think of many things, such as their children and their old friends who stayed in the Taichu Divine World.","“It’ll be fine. The Taichu Divine World is far away. The war won’t reach there for now. The first step of the Void Universe will only be to conquer the top powers,” Jian Wushuang touched Leng Rushuang’s hair and said.","“Besides, I’ve already told them about the situation of the Divine Power Universe through the clone I left in the Taichu Divine World. I’m sure they’ll have a plan.”","“Yes.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","Just as the two of them were chatting, a strange and sinister chuckle suddenly came from the dark and narrow passage.","This low chuckle was like someone approaching from the dark and chuckling in your ear.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and his hair stood on end. He turned around and looked!"]},{"number":4582,"title":"Chapter 4582 A Strange Game. It Seems to Be Crying and Laughing at the Same Time","paragraphs":["4582 A Strange Game. It Seems to Be Crying and Laughing at the Same Time","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang suddenly turned his head and looked behind him.","Behind him was a pitch-black deck that was empty.","“Husband, what’s wrong?”","Leng Rushuang held Jian Wushuang’s hand and asked in confusion.","Jian Wushuang did not reply, but frowned.","Just now, he heard a strange low laugh behind his ear.","But when he turned around, he saw nothing.","“Shuang’er, did you hear the laughter just now?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and asked Leng Rushuang.","“Ah? Laughter?” Leng Rushuang was stunned. She shook her head and said, “I didn’t. Husband, have you been too tense recently?”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang frowned and immediately looked around, but he did not find anything unusual.","Could it be that he had heard wrongly?","“It’s possible.”","Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly and sighed.","He had been under too much pressure recently.","“Alright, let’s go into the cabin. I’m afraid this passage is a bit strange.” Jian Wushuang suggested after some thought.","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","Giggle! Giggle giggle.","Jian Wushuang held Leng Rushuang’s hand and was about to turn around and walk to the cabin.","The eerie and strange laughter rang in Jian Wushuang’s ears again, like the murmurs of the demon ghost!","This time, Jian Wushuang heard it clearly!","“Stop messing with me!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. With his current super perception, he might have misheard once because he was too tense, but it was impossible for him to mishear a second time!","The next moment!","Countless Blood Qi surged and gathered in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","In an instant, the divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes brightened by three inches and a purple ‘Chuan’ character appeared between his eyebrows, which was like a dancing flame.","He was expressionless as he swept his gaze across the room.","However, the result disappointed him.","He still did not see anything.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s face gradually became serious. He held Leng Rushuang’s hand with his left hand and quietly held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword with his right.","Feeling the warmth from the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang felt slightly relieved.","He was staring straight ahead and did not notice.","In the darkness behind him, a pair of wrinkled and shriveled hands reached out silently and patted his shoulders with trembling hands.","“Hiss!”","Instantly, Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and he turned around.","Behind him, the pale-faced ‘Leng Rushuang’ was looking at him with a strange smile.","“Shuang er?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Wasn’t Leng Rushuang beside him?","“Something’s wrong!”","Jian Wushuang turned his head and saw that Leng Rushuang was looking at ‘Leng Rushuang’, who had appeared behind them, in horror.","Two Leng Rushuang!","“You... are you looking for me?”","‘Leng Rushuang’ looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange smile, and the corners of her mouth slowly opened bigger... and bigger... she opened her mouth so wide that the edges reached her ears, revealing a large bloody mouth!","She stretched out her hand and grabbed Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“You’re looking for death!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. The Tarot Divine Sword, which had been holding the hilt in his right hand, was instantly unsheathed. It turned into a stunning white rainbow and slashed forward fiercely!","Before the sword could land, Leng Rushuang’s eyes, nose, and mouth began to melt like a candle. In just a few seconds, she had turned into a pool of sticky white liquid on the ground.","Giggle, giggle, giggle.","The strange voice that seemed to be both laughing and crying gradually faded away.","A moment later, the deck of the Cosmic Boat fell into dead silence again.","Jian Wushuang withdrew the Tarot Divine Sword and frowned.","They had yet to truly enter the Land of Sorrows, and strange things had already appeared?","“Husband, what’s that?”","Leng Rushuang asked, still in shock.","“I don’t know. I guess it’s a manifestation of the vengeful spirits of this Land of Sorrows.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Thud, thud, thud.","At this moment, the cabin’s door opened and Supreme Xue Bo walked in hurriedly.","“Palace Master, something has happened,” Xue Bo said with a heavy expression.","“What happened?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched.","“Palace Master, you’ll know when you come.”","Then, he led Jian Wushuang to the cabin where the disciples of the Divine Life Palace were resting.","After a while, Jian Wushuang arrived at the cabin.","A disciple of the Divine Life Palace was lying on a bed. Supreme Jun Fu, Supreme Tian Yi, Ninth Kalpa King, and the others were standing next to him, all of them looking extremely ugly.","“Palace Master.”","“Palace Master.”","Jun Fu and the others turned around and said when they saw Jian Wushuang walking over.","Jian Wushuang nodded at them as a response. Without saying anything, he walked toward the disciple.","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace was at the Fifth-Stage Ruler realm, and he was currently being bound to the bed by the Supreme Xue Bo’s Blood-Binding Technique.","The disciple’s pupils dilated and his face was ashen. His expression was indescribably strange.","Giggle, giggle, giggle!","He did not open his mouth, but a voice that sounded like he was crying and laughing came from his throat.","He seemed to be in a daze and did not notice it at all. He only opened his eyes listlessly.","“It’s that laughter again.”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned ugly and he had a bad feeling. “Let me see.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and strode forward.","“Absorb.”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and touched the disciple’s forehead.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to release his divine power to check his body.","Bang!","The disciple, who had been like a walking corpse and looked like a fool, suddenly reached out and grabbed Jian Wushuang’s wrist.","“You’re here...”","“Hurry up and come...”","“I’ve been waiting for you for a long time...”","“Hehe... hehehehe...”","A strange sound that seemed to be both crying and laughing came from the disciple’s throat.","Then, the scene that Jian Wushuang had seen on the deck reappeared.","The disciple’s body was like a candle that was burning rapidly. Starting from his hair, it melted bit by bit, turning into a pool of sticky white foam.","“Damn it!”","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely gloomy.","Strange!","It was too strange!","He had thought that the Land of Sorrows would be very dangerous, and he had even prepared himself for a battle, even if he had to die in battle.","However, he had never thought that the Land of Sorrows would be so strange.","No matter how strong the danger was, it was not scary.","There would always be a way to deal with it.","However, the strange phenomenon that appeared in the Land of Sorrows was invisible and untraceable. There was no trace of it at all.","The unknown would always be the most difficult to deal with.","“Where are the other disciples? Are there any abnormalities?”","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at Xue Bo and the others with an unsightly expression.","Supreme Xue Bo Supreme and the others also had unsightly expressions on their faces. A disciple of the Divine Life Palace had just died in front of their eyes, and they could not even find a trace of the cause, let alone do anything."]},{"number":4583,"title":"Chapter 4583 The God Is Dead, the Devil Is Destroyed","paragraphs":["4583 The God Is Dead, the Devil Is Destroyed","Within the quiet passageway of the Land of Sorrows.","Dozens of Cosmic Boats were cruising forward quietly.","In this boundless absolute darkness, even the rumbling sound of the engine was swallowed up.","“Palace Master, the other disciples have not found anything unusual.”","The Xue Bo Supreme cupped his hands and replied.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Just as he was about to ask Xue Bo to pay more attention...","“Ah-!!!”","A shrill scream suddenly exploded from the space fleet behind them!","In this dark and silent tunnel, this scream was extremely abrupt.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed instantly. With a flash of his body, he plunged toward the Cosmic Boat behind him.","Supreme Xue Bo and the others exchanged a glance, and their expressions turned extremely ugly. They hurriedly followed after him.","A moment later, in the cabin of the ninth Cosmic Boat, Jian Wushuang saw the female disciple who had screamed.","The female disciple’s body was shaking, her shoulders were shaking, and her face was pale. She pointed at the glass window on the universe cabin and said in a frightened tone, “P-Palace Master, there are people outside!”","“Someone’s there?”","Jian Wushuang focused his gaze, but it was dark outside the glass.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“Tell me about the situation just now.” Jian Wushuang said expressionlessly.","“Okay.” A look of reminiscence flashed across the female disciple’s face as she began to narrate.","The matter was simple.","Not long ago, this female disciple whose name was Su Yang was sitting cross-legged in the cabin cultivating.","When she was cultivating, she encountered a bottleneck, so she wanted to ask the disciples whose cultivation levels were higher than hers and give them some guidance.","In the end, she saw a scene that she would never forget for the rest of her life!","On the glass window, a livid face was stuck to the window, and its eyes, which were like rotten grapes, were staring straight at her!","Because his face was too close, his entire facial features were distorted and terrifying!","It was also this face that suddenly appeared that made her so scared that she fell on her butt and screamed.","After the female disciple finished speaking, her face still had an expression of shock.","“I got it.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was not good.","Ghosts playing pranks?","They were not ordinary mortals. They were Supreme realm experts who stood at the peak of this universe!","In their eyes, demons and ghosts were simply insignificant ants.","“Palace Master Wushuang, please come over for a moment. I have something to tell you.”","At this moment, Lan Lan, who had been silent the entire time, suddenly spoke.","“What?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and followed Lan Lan out of the cabin.","The two of them walked to the deck. Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and said, “Miss Lan Lan, if you have anything to say, just say it.”","Lan Lan nodded and did not continue speaking. Instead, she looked into the distance as if she was reminiscing about something. After a long while, her expression gradually became serious. “Jian Wushuang, do you know what our universe was like before it was created?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned. He really did not know anything about the things that happened before the universe was created.","“I’ve heard the details.”","Jian Wushuang extended his hand and made a gesture of invitation.","“My Master once guessed that our universe is just a reincarnation cycle.”","“Reincarnation?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“That’s right.” Lan Lan let out a deep breath and said, “It’s reincarnation. According to my Master’s conjecture, before our civilization was born, there might have been other civilizations in this universe.”","“However, for some unknown reason, this civilization was completely destroyed, and the universe returned to chaos.”","“After another long time, the universe would restart, giving birth to new life and a new civilization.”","“This is our current civilization.”","Jian Wushuang frowned. What Lan Lan said was not impossible.","He believed that the conjectures of Cosmos God were not baseless.","“My Master used to come here to explore the two Forbidden Zones. Unfortunately, he didn’t tell us anything about this experience. He would only mention it sometimes.”","“According to my Master, there seems to be a body of a Supreme being buried in the Imperial Ancestor Ruins Forbidden Zone. Even he can’t see through it. This body is even older than our universe.”","“And this Land of Sorrows, according to what Master mentioned, seems to be the place where the last universe era fell.”","“Jian Wushuang, if the Land of Sorrowss is really the place where the last universe era fell as my Master said, then there must be countless figures from the last universe era who were buried here...”","Lan Lan had not finished her words.","Suddenly, a strange singing voice came from the quiet passage.","“The God is dead... the devil is destroyed... everything shall return to nothingness.”","“The heavens crumbled, weeping alone outside the world...”","This song sounded like the cries of countless gods and demons. It was faint and ethereal.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang looked up.","However, before Jian Wushuang could use his divine power to see what was going on, he suddenly felt a sense of sorrow. A sense of profound sadness surged in his heart.","It was the sorrow of the vicissitudes of life, the despair of all hope, the sorrow of being alone and helpless.","It was just a song, but under this sorrowful stubbornness, Jian Wushuang could not help but feel a lump in his throat.","Drip.","It was the sound of water dripping on the deck.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and saw Lan Lan looking up at the starry sky in a daze. He did not know when she had started crying.","“Miss Lan Lan?”","Jian Wushuang suppressed the sorrow that wanted to destroy him and tried to call Lan Lan.","However, Lan Lan seemed to be in a daze and did not notice at all.","Jian Wushuang felt that his face was wet. He reached out to wipe it and found that his face was also covered with tears.","He could feel that this sorrow seemed to have transformed into a pair of large hands that clutched his neck tightly, trying to drag him into a place of eternal damnation.","“Stop messing with me!”","Jian Wushuang bit the tip of his tongue tightly. In an instant, the slight pain from the tip of his tongue made him slightly more awake.","Enduring the discomfort, Jian Wushuang stepped into the cabin.","Everyone in the cabin, including Supreme Xue Bo, Supreme Jun Fu, Ninth Kalpa King, the ordinary disciples, and even Leng Rushuang, stood in the cabin in a daze.","“Damn it!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists. Then, he could no longer resist the sadness. His vision turned black as if he had fallen into a boundless abyss.","The long and quiet passage in the Land of Sorrows returned to a dead silence. Only the singing that sounded like the weeping of gods and demons and the low chuckling of a voice could be heard. It sounded strange and eerie."]},{"number":4584,"title":"Chapter 4584 Before the Destruction","paragraphs":["4584 Before the Destruction","The mist mixed with black and gray threads scattered on Jian Wushuang’s face along with the wind.","That invisible yet tangible feeling made him realize his current situation.","The Cosmic Boat, which had been traveling across the starry sky, had disappeared. Even all the disciples in the Divine Life Palace had disappeared.","The strong uneasiness in his heart prompted Jian Wushuang to open his eyes, and what he saw was the extreme darkness of the long wind.","It was as if the darkness that had existed since ancient times had covered everything. Even when Jian Wushuang used his divine powers, he could only see a few feet away.","“What is this place? Could it be that I’ve already arrived at the Land of Sorrows?” Jian Wushuang murmured. However, he remembered clearly that he had been in the Cosmic Boat a moment ago, but now he was in this strange and mysterious world.","After thinking for a moment, he picked up a handful of sand from the ground. Through the golden light in his eyes, he saw that the sand was not black, but a rough white material shrouded in a layer of golden halo.","Swish-swish...","The long sound of the morning bell and evening drum seemed to pass through the time of ten thousand worlds and came from the distant past.","In such a strange environment, Jian Wushuang was shocked. He quickly lowered his body and looked into the distance.","In the next moment, the chaotic darkness slowly drifted up like clear air. At the same time, as the darkness receded, nearly 100 suns rose at the same time!","Even Jian Wushuang, who had created a Holy Kingdom with a wave of his hand, was shocked by the scene.","There was no other reason, it was because the scene was too shocking.","At this moment, these slowly rising suns were nearly a hundred times larger than the suns in any part of the universe. At the same time, these suns were no longer pure red, but gave off a purple-red light.","The sky and earth were dyed a terrifying purple-red color by the 100 suns.","As the extreme darkness retreated, the long sounds of the morning bell and evening drum became more frequent, like the sound of war drums.","The sorrow was even more heart-wrenching in this desolate Star Field.","Jian Wushuang did not act rashly due to the strange and strange phenomenon in front of him. He had already guessed that this was the Land of Sorrows.","He was waiting quietly. His subconscious intuition told him that everything here was only the beginning.","Time had long lost its value here.","As the 100 grand suns rose into the sky, the desolate Land of Sorrows suddenly began to shine with countless rays of divine power.","Primordial divine power instantly filled the earth, followed by extremely pure and rich golden and red divine blood that rained down.","Jian Wushuang, who was fully focused, did not expect such a thing. He was immediately hit by countless drops of divine blood.","Along with the divine blood, there were countless giant broken limbs, surrounded by ancient divine rhythmical aura.","The broken armors engraved with ancient ciphertexts were covered in divine blood, and the broken divine weapons were uncountable.","The more Jian Wushuang looked at it, the more shocked he became. At the same time, he could roughly guess the true meaning of the desolate Land of Sorrows.","When the vast land was filled with broken divine weapons and corpses, the entire Land of Sorrows became a God Burial Ground.","The cries of the Gods and devils resounded, as if the heavens and earth were singing a sad song.","Jian Wushuang’s state of mind seemed to have resonated with everything in the God Burial Ground and he started to throb uncontrollably.","“Why did all the Supreme Gods, who had the power to intimidate the primordial era, die here? I don’t understand...” Jian Wushuang shook his head hard and he began to realize that his divine sense was affected.","However, an even more unbelievable scene appeared.","The divine corpse on the ground disappeared in the blink of an eye like clouds and smoke. In its place was a vast amount of divine power that came from Wu Yan’s distance.","Before the divine power could solidify, the sky was the first to collapse and crack.","The suns that were hanging high in the sky suddenly grew purple feathers and turned into three-legged purple crows that could cover the sky.","Countless divine powers transformed into unparalleled terrifying existences that either rode the wind and clouds, or three to five chariots that rushed toward the vast battlefield.","The sky was torn into pieces by their divine power.","This ancient battlefield could not withstand the existence of such an unimaginable giant!","Just the majestic divine power that they exuded had constructed the most extreme collision that belonged to that era!","Heaven and earth were shaking, and the sound seemed to have been fixed.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. Existences at the level of Cosmos Gods were the most ordinary in the Land of Sorrows.","He could not imagine why a God who had reached that level would risk the shattering of his divine aura to start this ultimate battle.","In the chaotic sky, hundreds of three-legged purple crows swayed their black-purple tail feathers and shot down destructive purple-red flames.","Each flame could easily tear apart the nomological Great Dao, leaving behind a brutal aura.","There were no sounds of killing. The ultimate battle had begun.","The unimaginable divine power, even a trace of it, was enough to severely injure Snake God in the Void Universe. Even Invincible Supremes would not be able to survive for a second in this place.","The divine weapons clashed, and the ancient peak existences used the purest form of their bodies to control the divine weapons to kill their opponents.","The dazzling divine light filled every corner.","An unparalleled existence shot down the three-legged purple crow in the sky with a longbow and threw the corpse of the Purple Crow God at the enemy, causing the purest explosion.","There was an unbeatable existence wielding the formless divine sword that fought to the last moment and perished together.","Another unparalleled existence was dying and laughing before the Great Dao disappeared.","On the battlefield, a chaotic collision was going on.","The mournful song that sounded like a sea demon’s song exploded in Jian Wushuang’s divine sense. He was not affected by it, but he felt as if he was in it.","He wanted to close his eyes, but his pupils were enlarging bit by bit.","“Lunatics, lunatics, they’re all lunatics!”","“What’s wrong with all these reincarnations? Even the top cultivators can’t escape from the Heavenly Dao?!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets as divine blood gushed out from every pore of his body.","“Then, do the Daos in the world belong to the path of longevity or the path of killing?!”","“I don’t understand!”","The extremely painful thoughts could not help but spread.","The Great Dao of faith that he had been building in his heart started to collapse uncontrollably.","“Are we all puppets?”","“If that’s the case, what’s the point of everything? Can we change the final result? It’s just a change of way to die...”","His golden eyes which had never been tired or destroyed started to turn slightly dull.","“I want to sleep for a while...”","As the ultimate battle in the sky began to come to an end, all the Supreme existences were annihilated.","Jian Wushuang also lowered his eyes slowly.","The heavens cried, the rules were broken, and the Great Dao returned to its original state.","“What is the meaning of pursuing the Dao for a thousand years, proving the Dao for ten thousand years, and comprehending the Dao for a million years?”","...","It was like the sound of a clear spring, and all things were reborn.","A voice entered his ears.","“Little Guy, wake up...”"]},{"number":4585,"title":"Chapter 4585 The Old Man Shi Ting","paragraphs":["4585 The Old Man Shi Ting","The elegy in his ears gradually dissipated and was replaced by a slightly friendly call.","The call seemed to have some magical power that pulled Jian Wushuang, who was on the verge of death, back from his fallen divine consciousness.","He unwillingly opened his eyes and saw a thin face.","He sobered up in an instant and his subconscious reaction made him move back a few feet. He looked at the old man in plain white with vigilance.","The thin old man did not blame Jian Wushuang for his rudeness. He stood up with a smile and introduced himself, “Hello, Little Guy, my name is Shi Ting.”","Without any carelessness, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and said, “Greetings, Old Sir.”","To be able to appear here and not be from the Divine Life Palace, these two factors alone were enough to make Jian Wushuang raise his vigilance to the highest level.","At the same time, he began to suspect whether the ultimate battle that had just occurred was the doing of the old man in front of him.","The old man who called himself Shi Ting smiled and waved his hand. “It’s fate that we’ve met here. There’s no need to be so formal.”","Jian Wushuang was unmoved. After seeing the surrounding scene, he was dazed for a moment.","Countless broken bones were either buried or exposed on the ground. The broken divine weapons and blood-stained armor were mostly buried by the sand and stones.","Even though the Great Daos had been gone for hundreds of millions of years, the unparalleled pure divine power still protected their Masters, just like before.","The scene in front of him was exactly the same as what he had seen before.","However, all the almighty existences had fallen.","“Is this the true Land of Sorrows?” Jian Wushuang asked himself, not knowing how to express his inner thoughts.","Shi Ting smiled and in his not-so-clear eyes, the scene of the earth was reflected, “You call it the Land of Sorrows, but in my heart, it is the God Burial Ground.”","“They’ve all left...”","Shi Ting’s words were relaxed, but at the end, he revealed a sense of melancholy and loneliness.","Jian Wushuang was stunned and he looked at Shi Ting with a strange expression. From his words, it was not difficult to tell that Shi Ting, who looked like an old man, seemed to have gone through that era and lived until now...","However, ever since he had seen that scene, Jian Wushuang could not believe that there was an unparalleled existence that could survive the ultimate battle.","As if he could sense what Jian Wushuang was thinking, Shi Ting came back to his senses and said, “I am willing to wait here to find the fated person, who was meant to come here.”","Shi Ting did not wait for him to speak and asked again, “Little Guy, why did you come to this place?”","Jian Wushuang felt a little embarrassed. The Divine Power Universe had fallen. As the new Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, after careful calculation, he was ready to come to the Land of Sorrows to recuperate. However, he did not know how to say these words.","Shi Ting did not seem to have any ill intentions, but if he did not want them to stay, he would probably be able to suppress them or drive them out easily.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to take the risk of speaking rashly.","In this short stalemate, Jian Wushuang suddenly realized that the three Cosmic Boats that carried the entire Divine Life Palace did not seem to have followed him to this Land of Sorrows.","His heart trembled. The tens of thousands of disciples of the Divine Life Palace were the last hope of the Divine Power Universe. If they were to suffer any losses, it would be a disaster for the Divine Power Universe.","“N-no, that won’t happen...” Jian Wushuang immediately turned around to look for the whereabouts of the Cosmic Boat.","Shi Ting stopped him, “Little Guy, are these the things you are looking for?”","As he finished his sentence, Shi Ting waved his hand and the dark sky rippled like water.","Immediately after, the space opened up, and the Cosmic Boats, which could hold its own against a star, slowly sailed out of the crack. However, the dead silence on the deck had indeed made Jian Wushuang nervous.","He was well aware of how fearsome the dark passageway leading to the Land of Sorrows was. Even Supreme Xue Bo and the others had been bewitched. Those with weaker spiritual senses might have died on the spot.","Jian Wushuang did not have time to greet Shi Ting and jumped onto the deck. He was relieved to see what was happening.","Supreme Xue Bo and the others were leaning against the boat, unconscious. From their long breaths, they were not in any life-threatening danger.","“Their cultivation realms are too weak. If they enter this God Burial Ground, their realms will be affected at the very least. If they get lost, they will become the nourishment of this God Burial Ground. As a last resort, I made them fall into a deep sleep to avoid many restrictions.”","A straight and thin figure was standing behind Jian Wushuang.","After hearing the explanation, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He turned around, cupped his hands, and said solemnly, “Thank you for your help, Old Sir. I am grateful.”","Shi Ting laughed and waved his hand, “Don’t thank me yet. Although I helped to protect you, those with low-level consciousness might not be able to escape.”","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. He hurriedly activated his divine skill to wake everyone up. However, he thought that it would be difficult to wake them up with his own divine skill, so he immediately activated the Origin Blood in his body to test them.","As expected, with the Origin Blood, people st rated to wake up. Xue Bo, Jun Fu, Lan Lan, and Leng Rushuang were the first to wake up.","“Greetings, Palace Master Wushuang!” When Supreme Xue Bo and the others saw Jian Wushuang, they immediately knelt down and paid their respects.","“Everyone, there’s no need to use those overly elaborate formalities.” Jian Wushuang withdrew his hand and motioned for them to stand up.","Supreme Xue Bo shook his head, and two streams of tears suddenly gushed out of his eyes. “I thought that we could only die in that dark passage. I didn’t expect that we would arrive at this Land of Sorrows safely. It seems that the Heavenly Dao doesn’t stop at the Divine Power Universe and my Divine Life Palace.”","“My Husband.” Leng Rushuang could not help but throw herself into Jian Wushuang’s arms and sob. “I thought I would never see you again.”","Jian Wushuang caressed the beautiful hair of the fairy in his arms and said in a low voice, “I promise you that even if I die, I will see you again.”","Most of the Divine Palace’s disciples in the first Cosmic Boat had woken up, and they all revealed the joy of surviving a disaster.","Only Lan Lan, who was standing beside Supreme Xue Bo, turned to look at the straight and thin figure behind Jian Wushuang after calming down.","“Now is not the time to console. I need to count all the disciples and deal with what’s going to happen next.” Jian Wushuang said.","Leng Rushuang nodded and left his arms.","After exchanging a glance with Xue Bo and the others, Jian Wushuang leaped and glided toward the other two Cosmic Boats.","A moment later, Jian Wushuang used his Origin Blood to wake up the disciples in the other two Cosmic Boats.","There were a total of 14,600 disciples who had headed to the Land of Sorrows this time. In the end, close to 3,000 of them would remain in the dark passageway forever.","The rest of the disciples who were at a lower cultivation realm were also more or less affected."]},{"number":4586,"title":"Chapter 4586 Shattering Ten Thousand Daos","paragraphs":["4586 Shattering Ten Thousand Daos","These were the last remnants of the Next Generation, who were preserved by the Divine Power Universe, but so many of them had died just by entering the Land of Sorrows. This made their heart sink.","He did not know if it was because he was depressed or because he had lost too much Origin Blood Essence, but when he fell from the Cosmic Boat, Jian Wushuang fell straight to the ground.","“Palace Master Wushuang!” Supreme Xue Bo and the others hurriedly lifted Jian Wushuang up.","Then, Supreme Xue Bo activated his divine ability and enveloped him with divine power, slowly soothing his meridians.","“I’m, fine...” Jian Wushuang’s expression recovered. He waved his hand and stood up straight.","He then looked at Shi Ting and walked over slowly.","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands solemnly and said in a deep voice, “I, Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, would like to plead with you to let us live in this desolate place.”","“The universe is so big that there’s no other place for us to stay...” After saying this, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled slightly as if all his strength had been drained.","Cosmos God used his body to seal Void Gods, and Supreme Gai Fu exterminated his divine soul, turning his body into a sky-soaring attack to block the Void Universe outside. Fengtian Patriarch burned his life source to form a wall, seeking a way out for the people of the Divine Power Universe.","Everything these ancient Elders had done was to preserve the Last Flame of the Divine Power Universe.","The current scene and the past all came to his mind, making Jian Wushuang even more sorrowful.","“Of course.” Shi Ting’s face slowly revealed a smile, “I have been in this God Burial Ground for God knows how many years. With someone to accompany me, I will not feel bored.”","As if the clouds had parted and the moon had brightened, Jian Wushuang felt that the sorrow in his heart had been reduced. He cupped his hands in excitement and said, “Thank you, Old Sir. We are very grateful.”","Supreme Xue Bo and the others were also extremely excited. They looked at each other, and the pressure on them lessened significantly.","No one dared to approach this sorrowful place, and in the end, the last of the universe’s Next Generation entered it, and the Heavenly Dao was not destroyed.","In the Land of Sorrows, which was full of bones and corpses of the Gods, the vast divine power was still as agile as its Master when he was alive.","Each divine corpse was an independent existence.","From time to time, there would be divine power that would transform into all things and rise up, releasing its last breath without tiring.","The divine power that had existed since the primordial era was so vast that even the Supremes experts like Xue Bo, Tian Yi, and Jun Fu found it difficult to walk, let alone the nearly 10,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were far weaker than Supremes.","With every step they took, just the ownerless divine power that was derived was enough to cause the meridians of every disciple to burst.","When they took their 100th step, nearly 3,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace fell to the ground at the same time.","“Why can’t I move anymore?”","The 3,000 disciples who had fallen to the ground began to exchange questions.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang was the first to notice the strange situation behind him.","He was stunned at first, then he seemed to realize something and said with great joy, “The disciples who are kneeling on the ground, listen up. From now on, you will immediately comprehend on the spot and absorb any divine power that enters the body. You must not disobey the order. From now on, no matter for 1,000 years or 10,000 years, you must guard your mind and concentrate on cultivating!”","“By the Palace Master’s orders!” the 3,000 disciples shouted in unison and immediately stood still on the spot, each cultivating on their own. Brilliant light shot into the sky, and there was some momentum.","“The Heavens have not destroyed my Divine Power Universe!” Supreme Xue Bo’s eyes were slightly red as he sighed.","“Little Fellow, your comprehension is really not bad.” Shi Ting smiled and moved forward.","Jian Wushuang could not suppress the joy on his face. He realized that this Land of Sorrows would be the last opportunity for the entire Divine Power Universe to fight against the Void Universe again!","After that, every 100 steps, 2,000 disciples could no longer hold on and sat down.","The further they went, the purer and more abundant the ownerless divine power that was derived.","The huge divine corpses stacked up and each of them had their divine power soaring into the sky and splitting the space apart.","At the same time, there were mottled cracks that looked like mysterious runes that occasionally lingered on one of the divine corpses.","Jian Wushuang could vaguely recognize that it was the aura of Dao Vindication, but it had long been broken.","Even so, even someone as powerful as Supreme Xue Bo was extremely envious.","One must know that this was the Dao Vindication of an even more terrifying unparalleled existence. Even if he could only comprehend a part of it, it would definitely be more effective than wasting hundreds of thousands of eras.","As time stopped, more and more disciples of the Divine Life Palace sat down to comprehend the Dao.","When Jian Wushuang heard Lan Lan’s voice and looked back, only Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, and less than a hundred people were left behind. His wife, Leng Rushuang, was also sitting down to comprehend the Dao.","“Palace Master Wushuang.” Lan Lan was standing not far behind her, sweat dripping from her cheeks. The pressure of divine power had stopped her in her tracks.","“I’ll be meditating here for now, so I’ll bid you farewell.” Lan Lan cupped her hands and smiled. Then, she slowly sat down. “I hope that after we part today, we will be able to see each other in the future.”","“Take care!”","“Take care!”","The two of them solemnly said goodbye. Lan Lan’s hesitant look lingered in Jian Wushuang’s mind for a moment. Then, Jian Wushuang continued to lead Xue Bo and the others forward.","A majestic divine power shot into the sky, and it seemed to be mixed with auspicious cries and flowing treasure light.","Undamaged divine weapons began to appear, and divine blood that had been condensed for hundreds of millions of years flowed like crystals. At the same time, the pressure of more and more vast divine power became stronger.","After Ninth Kalpa King walked nearly a hundred steps, he stopped to comprehend the Dao.","Next was Supreme Tian Yi, followed by Supreme Jun Fu.","Only Jian Wushuang walked among them like a dragon swimming in the sea. Not only did he not feel the terrifying pressure, but the more he walked, the more he felt like he was walking on flat ground.","“Palace Master Wushuang, this old man will also stop here.” Supreme Xue Bo stopped in his tracks, and his eyes seemed to be burning with flames. “Palace Master Wushuang is the Divine Messenger, and the Heavenly Dao is looking down on you. Even this old man can’t compare to you. At this point, I can no longer accompany you, Palace Master. I hope that Palace Master can forgive me.”","Jian Wushuang did not say much. He held Supreme Xue Bo’s arms and said sincerely, “I’ll wait here for you, Supreme Xue Bo. No matter if it takes 10,000 years or 100,000 years, I’ll remember my duty and try my best to break through!”","“In addition, Supreme Xue Bo, you can also try to break through. You should know that there’s no end to the realms. Only those above the Supreme level can Vindicate your Dao.”","These few words seemed to have broken through Supreme Xue Bo’s shackles, causing him to tremble.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He smiled and followed Shi Ting.","The Twilight Bell between heaven and earth rang, and countless broken Great Daos flowed through the ancient times, shining on each other. With only a corner of it, one could see the glory and magnificence of their Masters.","It was unknown whether the heavens and earth had reincarnated or not, but from the Supremes to the peddlers, they had all worked hard to prove themselves in the same galaxy, lake, and sea."]},{"number":4587,"title":"Chapter 4587 Seeking the Dao","paragraphs":["4587 Seeking the Dao","At this moment, there were only two figures walking slowly in the vast divine power of heaven and earth.","One of them was a young man with a straight body, like a sharp sword waiting to be unsheathed. The edge of the sword was already sharp enough.","The other old man in white was also thin and straight, like a blunt sword that had lost its edge and hidden its light.","There was a broken Great Dao circulating around him, a divine weapon hidden in the earth waiting to be found, and the vast divine power of the Overlord filling every inch of space.","However, Jian Wushuang was not envious at all. He followed Shi Ting calmly and firmly.","From time to time, there were undamaged and powerful Great Dao fragments that wanted to get close to Jian Wushuang, but they were flicked away by Shi Ting.","“Where are they going?” Jian Wushuang said to himself and started to look around.","Time had no value here, and everything seemed to have stopped at the moment when it died hundreds of millions of years ago.","“Why did you all come here?” Shi Ting, who was one step ahead of Jian Wushuang, turned around and asked.","Jian Wushuang was silent. After a while, he talked about the battle of catastrophe that happened between the two universes.","When Jian Wushuang mentioned that the Divine Power Universe had already fallen, he lost the mood to continue.","After listening to his story, Shi Ting did not say much but only let out a small sigh.","Jian Wushuang did not feel too sad anymore. He had long understood that he could only protect everything he wanted to protect by breaking through to the peak endlessly.","Right now, it was a great fortune!","Jian Wushuang did not dare to relax as it concerned everything about the Divine Power Universe.","“Before I die, I want to have a clear conscience for everything I’ve done.”","Jian Wushuang swore in his heart and his eyes became even more passionate.","In the following journey, even Jian Wushuang, who had a strong mental state, began to feel anxious.","To be able to comprehend for a day in such a vast divine power was something that the previous him dared not imagine. However, Shi Ting showed no signs of stopping and this made Jian Wushuang’s state of mind waver.","As if he could read his mind, Shi Ting’s voice sounded in his ears, “Are you getting impatient?”","Jian Wushuang was embarrassed and said awkwardly, “I’m ashamed.”","Everything changed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The ownerless divine power rose up with the wind, sweeping up the thousands of divine weapons on the ground and shooting into the sky. There were billions of divine rays connected between them.","The extremely bright and vast divine power directly destroyed the entire chaotic cloud layer. Countless divine weapons from all directions seemed to have reopened their divine senses and were running freely in the sky.","In the next moment, like a dragon, the divine soldiers fell to the ground like fallen stars.","Clang! Clang!","The unparalleled divine power bloomed like a lotus flower and swept toward the ground.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. If he was hit by the sweeping divine power, even a Top Supreme martial artist would not be able to hold on for one breath, let alone him!","However, the scene that he had expected did not happen. Shi Ting stood there like a heavy sword. With a gentle wave of one hand, it was as if a curtain was lifted. The vast divine power that swept across the ground suddenly rose and rushed into the sky like a huge sea.","Rumble! Rumble!","When the Supreme divine power collided with the sky, it was like the most beautiful picture scroll. The divine power dissipated on its own and turned into stars that slowly fell under the heaven and earth.","The auras of holiness, antiquity, and chaos were all revealed at this moment.","It was a divine rhythm that was mixed with the aura of the peak of the ancient era. Jian Wushuang stood at the same place and held back the shock in his heart as he reached out to catch the falling brilliance.","When the light entered the water, it only touched the skin and naturally integrated into the meridians.","This is the aura of the Great Dao?!","Jian Wushuang was completely shocked. In the raindrop-like brilliance, every trace of it carried a different aura of the Great Dao!","“Follow me.” Shi Ting smiled and stepped into the path that was formed by divine weapons.","Jian Wushuang suppressed the fire in his heart and stepped onto the Creation Dao.","It was only the first step, but his foot was pierced by a powerful divine spear.","The divine blood dripped down the tip of the spear. However, Jian Wushuang’s body only trembled slightly and he continued to move forward firmly.","With every step he took, the sharp divine weapon easily tore through every inch of his skin.","Bright divine blood gushed out from his feet and calves.","However, Jian Wushuang did not seem to feel it. He continued to move forward without stopping. He was like the most devout and determined worshipper, moving forward step by step.","Behind him, a layer of glistening divine blood was left on the Great Dao formed by divine power.","Jian Wushuang was holding on.","The divine weapon that could even cut his soul had left deep marks on his feet and calves. The pain on his body was far less than one-ten-thousandth of the pain of his soul being cut.","The flesh on the soles of his feet was cut, and the deepest part of his bones was exposed.","Jian Wushuang’s firm state of mind began to waver. Shi Ting was right in front of him, but he felt that it was so far away.","“I can’t help but persist... for those seniors who had already died, I can live... they sacrificed for it. Even if I die, I will die on the battlefield.”","Jian Wushuang felt that his mind was clear and the pain of his divine soul being cut seemed to have reduced.","“I told Supreme Xue Bo that I would risk my life to make a breakthrough. That was an oath I made to others, as well as myself.” He seemed to be in extreme pain, and his pale face actually squeezed out a smile.","An even more unbelievable scene appeared. Jian Wushuang began to let go of his legs and from moving, he started to run!","On the Great Dao that was blooming with divine power like a lotus flower, a thin but firm figure was running forward.","After an unknown period of time, the light in the sky dissipated and the sky returned to chaos.","There was only one bright and vast Great Dao that remained in this Land of Sorrows.","All kinds of terrifying divine power were like huge pillars that supported this unknown Land of Sorrows. The derived divine power seemed to be attracted by some kind of power and was no longer rejected. Instead, it was divided into thousands of threads and poured into places that needed them.","When a pair of feet that no longer had any skin and flesh stuck to them stepped on the end of the undying Great Dao, even Shi Ting, who had been waiting for a long time, could not help but look sideways.","The lower hem of his robe was completely torn, and his divine blood seemed to have been completely drained. The foot at the end of the robe was already white bone.","Only his eyes, which were like the eternal stars, moved Shi Ting.","Shi Ting said, “I can feel that there is a stronger power in your body. Why don’t you release it to help you move forward?”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything but shook his head slowly. Then, he could not hold on any longer and fell to the ground."]},{"number":4588,"title":"Chapter 4588 Comprehending the Sword","paragraphs":["4588 Comprehending the Sword","He did not know if it was a dream or an illusion.","The Great Dao Comprehension that the Cosmos God had left in Jian Wushuang’s divine consciousness was opened by him.","However, at the moment it was opened, he suddenly woke up.","“You’re awake, little guy.” Shi Ting stood on the Taoist sanctum that was made of divine power and looked at Jian Wushuang with relief.","Jian Wushuang propped himself up with one hand and stood up instantly.","“What is this place?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the huge square that was completely made of vast divine power and he had not reacted yet.","“This is the place you should be comprehending.” Shi Ting laughed.","Jian Wushuang did not lack comprehension. With just a hint, he instantly realized that the Daoist Rite Temple was built by the divine weapons of left by the unparalleled warriors.","“Thank you, Old Sir.” Jian Wushuang cupped his fists and looked at Shi Ting with even more admiration.","Shi Ting clapped his hands and said, “This is the place that is most suitable for you. However, your final cultivation will depend on your own fate.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang agreed and was about to sit cross-legged to cultivate when he was stopped by Shi Ting.","“Little guy, this kind of cultivation method will have little effect on you,” Shi Ting said as he raised his right hand.","Suddenly, the Tarot Divine Sword that was hanging behind Jian Wushuang’s back soared into the sky and hovered above his head as if it had a mind of its own.","“The path of cultivation is to constantly search for the Dao and the process of Dao vindication. You’ve already vaguely touched that level, so I’ll give you a trace of Enlightenment.”","Shi Ting’s words were clear but they were like hammers that smashed into Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Before chaos was formed, when heaven and earth were still one, chaos was the Dao. The chaos turns into clear and turbid Qis, and these two Qis are two streaks.”","“When the great era begins, the number of Daos will increase.”","“Dao appears to have no limits, but it has limits. Some people can pry into the profoundness within and prove themselves, while some people can’t touch that layer of meaning in their entire lives.”","“Little guy, although you already have a complete Dao, it’s not yours. But with your current realm, it’s rare for you to understand the meaning.”","“All I can do now is to let you guard the Dao in your heart and stabilize your state of mind.”","Shi Ting did not care about Jian Wushuang’s arrogance. He said slowly, “Unparalleled existence.”","Boom!","It was as if a thunderbolt had exploded in his divine sense. Jian Wushuang could no longer remain calm.","He directly stretched out his hand and the Tarot Divine Sword appeared in his hand. divine power surged out uncontrollably.","Holding the Tarot Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang was like an unsheathed sharp sword, revealing its sharp edge!","“Not bad, the divine power is sharp. It seems that you have some understanding of the sword.” Shi Ting seemed to be satisfied.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then said firmly, “Sir, I think I have roughly understood the concept in my heart. I am determined to enter the Dao with the sword!”","Shi Ting nodded and signaled Jian Wushuang to make his move.","In this vast and majestic divine power dojo, the divine power that he had used up could be replenished almost instantly.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang no longer held back and directly activated Chaos Overlord Body. The purple color of the ‘Chuan’ character between his eyebrows exuded.","“Eternal Night!”","Jian Wushuang directly performed the first move of the Tarot Sword Manual. Blazing black gas gushed out from the sword and transformed into a black ball that swept toward Shi Ting.","With the support of the vast divine power, the momentum and power of the first move of the sword code were several times stronger than the previous ones.","Just as the black ball was about to hit Shi Ting, the space around it paused. Then, the black ball split into two from the center and dissipated into black smoke.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised by the situation and directly used the third move of the sword code, Dusk.","At that moment, with Shi Ting as the center, the pit that should have collapsed did not appear. Instead, a huge repulsive force hit Jian Wushuang and sent him flying.","After retreating for dozens of feet, Jian Wushuang stabbed his sword into the ground to stop his retreating figure. His Qi and blood were boiling violently.","He swallowed the blood in his throat and slowly got up.","The Sword Manual’s Dusk did not affect Shi Ting at all. Instead, the damage that was rejected was reflected back to Jian Wushuang, which made him extremely depressed.","And Shi Ting stood at the same spot from start to finish, not even moving a step.","Looking at his calm appearance, he probably did not even use much strength.","Jian Wushuang adjusted his state of mind, took a deep breath, and quietly induced the fourth move.","“Four Seasons.”","A silent cold light emerged from Jian Wushuang’s feet. With the support of the vast divine power of the dojo, it swept through the entire dojo almost instantly.","Under this move, even the divine power that supported the operation of the Daoist sanctum paused for a moment.","Now’s the time!","Jian Wushuang suddenly jumped and poured all his divine power into the Tarot Divine Sword. He slashed down from the sky and attacked Shi Ting.","The slash that could easily tear the universe apart only left a faint white mark in the air of the Land of Sorrows. When the sword mark reached Shi Ting, it was only an inch long.","Shi Ting stretched out his index and middle fingers and pinched the sword mark, causing it to be destroyed!","After the attack stopped, Jian Wushuang did not stop. He stepped on the ground and ran toward Shi Ting.","In an instant, a carefree Tarot divine corpse appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","All the previous moves were in service of this moment. The huge figure was like a mountain, and it pressed down with Jian Wushuang’s sword!","Whizz...","A slight collision sound was heard, and time seemed to have stopped.","The shadow of Supreme Tarot had yet to retreat, and Jian Wushuang was still suspended in the air. The long sword in his hand was only one palm away from Shi Ting, but it could not move an inch further.","Shi Ting was still standing at the same place. He raised his right palm above his head as if he was holding a sword to block Jian Wushuang’s most powerful attack.","“The person who created this set of sword techniques was quite experienced. If he were to improve one more step, it would be considered to be truly perfect,” Shi Ting said softly as if he was feeling sorry and pushed his right hand up slightly.","In an instant, like a receding tide, Jian Wushuang was sent flying.","Shi Ting’s attack seemed to be as light as the wind, but when it actually landed on his body, it almost made him lose the ability to resist.","After landing on the ground, Jian Wushuang directly spat out a large mouthful of divine blood. The Tarot Divine Sword, which had never left his hand, was also nailed to the side.","An unprecedented sense of powerlessness overwhelmed him. The last time he felt this powerlessness was when he was Void God, who had broken through the universe to kill him.","Shi Ting walked slowly toward Jian Wushuang with his hands behind his back.","“Who wrote the sword techniques you are using?”","Jian Wushuang stood up slowly with the help of the Tarot Divine Sword. “He’s a genius Senior from my Divine Power Universe.”","“To be able to comprehend this sword technique, he must be a Heaven’s Favorite. But why doesn’t he improve this sword technique?”","“That’s because the Senior who created the sword code has already died,” Jian Wushuang said dejectedly."]},{"number":4589,"title":"Chapter 4589 Unparalleled Sword Dao, Boundless Sword Strike","paragraphs":["4589 Unparalleled Sword Dao, Boundless Sword Strike","Shi Ting nodded. “I see. But it’s a blessing that this sword manual was passed down.”","Before Jian Wushuang could speak, Shi Ting continued, “The chaos was separated and the universe was born. Although there are thousands of sword principles, is there really a sword principle that is connected to your mind?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. Apparently, he was also thinking about the same question.","He originally wanted to blurt out the Tarot Sword Manual, but in the end, he didn’t.","“That’s right, the Tarot Sword Manual could easily split the universe, but was it really in line with his heart?”","Even if the inheritance was not destroyed in his hands, even if he could display the power of the Tarot Sword Manual, it was still the Sword Dao of Supreme Tarot.","Shi Ting said, “You have to be clear about every word I said. Your understanding of the Sword Dao is far beyond your imagination. But even if you can understand every Sword Dao and integrate them, they will still not be yours. Each Sword Dao will only belong to their creator.”","“From the moment you started cultivating the Tarot Sword Manual, a tiny sword mark was left in your heart. This sword mark is the barrier.”","“What you need to do now is to find your own Sword Dao.”","At the same time, he waved his right hand in the air. The invisible but tangible fluctuations made Jian Wushuang cast a sidelong glance.","Although Shi Ting’s hand was empty, the sharp and invisible aura made Jian Wushuang understand.","It was an invisible sword, a Sword Dao that belonged to Shi Ting.","Jian Wushuang was overwhelmed with emotions. He immediately placed the Tarot Divine Sword to one side and started to comprehend the concept that was gradually taking shape in his heart as time stopped.","There was no brilliant sword essence, only the purest form and move.","“I’ve always been searching for my own Sword Dao, but it’s always fleeting. I’m also afraid that the Sword Dao I’ve comprehended will be incomplete, so I’ve put it aside until now.”","“Now, I will no longer run away. Even if the sword manual becomes incomplete because of this, I will not regret it!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes and a golden light radiated from his eyes.","Divine patterns started to gather around his palm that had been rising with the wind.","Frame by frame, his extremely slow movements seemed to be analyzing the Sword Intent in his mind.","Complicated and extremely mysterious divine patterns started to appear around Jian Wushuang.","Shi Ting had already left Jian Wushuang and was looking at him from afar.","“Integrate with all things in the world, and stay outside...”","“Using the sword to enter the Dao!”","With the shapeless body of the sword, divine power as the hilt, the long wind as the blade, and divine glyphs as the center, an extremely strange but reckless long sword appeared.","This was the manifestation of Jian Wushuang’s sword principle. A boundless Sword Intent that was different but stronger than before soared into the sky.","Even though he had once held the Tarot Divine Sword and released the power to split the sky, he had never released such endless pressure as he was now.","His long hair was untied and danced wildly behind his back. His pale golden eyes emitted a crystal-like brilliance, as if a God had descended and emitted endless divine might!","For the first time, the divine power floating around the training hall became restless.","The ownerless divine power that was derived seemed to have sensed the sword essence that was in the process of being nurtured. It attacked crazily from all directions, trying to merge with it.","Shi Ting waved his hand to create a barrier outside the dojo, blocking the worship of the ownerless divine power.","The long sword with golden patterns was raised above his head. At that moment, Jian Wushuang seemed to have turned into a sword and a hazy treasure image occupied half of the Daoist sanctum.","“I have a sword move...”","“Today, I’d like to invite Old Sir to take a look!”","A deep roar came from his chest, and the manifestation sword intent in his hand slashed down.","The phantom form also fell.","The sacred and ritualistic stroke was a sword principle that only belonged to him!","The endless golden runes expanded and bloomed along with the power of the sword!","Swish!","In the next moment, the Daoist sanctum built with divine power trembled, and the sword will that took form slashed down.","The almost indestructible training hall was instantly torn into a long mark like a natural chasm, and the remaining training halls quickly fell apart.","Shi Ting stood at the center of the Sword Intent, and the divine power barrier he created was almost immediately swallowed.","When the entire training hall was torn in half by the heavenly chasm, the divine gold pattern that had already disappeared suddenly transformed into a pillar of light that shot up into the sky from the bottom of the training hall, eventually devouring the entire training hall.","The most magnificent and sacred explosion lasted for a full ten breaths before it finally ended with the fall of a figure.","The light of the divine power spread and the Daoist sanctum that had been destroyed by such an unparalleled attack slowly appeared.","Countless divine power turned into threads that lifted Jian Wushuang up. The destroyed dojo was scattered everywhere like stars.","The thousands of divine weapons below the Daoist sanctum trembled at the same time, as if they could no longer suppress their divine might.","Lying on the divine power, Jian Wushuang gasped for breath. Although the divine power that had been depleted was instantly replenished, the pain that went straight to the divine soul still dazzled Jian Wushuang.","Just the power of this move had almost sucked him dry. If he used it in the universe where his divine power could not be replenished quickly, it would be a moment of life and death.","Shi Ting’s figure reappeared and he stood on a fragment as he drove toward Jian Wushuang.","“Is this your Sword Dao?” Shi Ting asked.","Jian Wushuang was stunned, then he said proudly, “This is my Dao!”","Shi Ting’s face started to reveal a smile and he said. “Astounding.”","“Thank you for your guidance, Old Sir!” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said with joy.","Shi Ting laughed, “My advice is not of much use. Everything is based on your own thoughts and understanding.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “It’s precisely because of your teachings that I dared to take that step. Otherwise, I’m afraid I’ll never be able to move forward.”","Shi Ting nodded. Jian Wushuang’s brilliant stroke was a brilliant stroke that he had fully comprehended his own Sword Dao. From now on, he would definitely be more and more integrated with his own Great Dao.","“Do you know what the extreme realm of the Sword Dao is?” Shi Ting sent the last question.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and then said with some uncertainty, “Man and sword as one? Turn invisible? A hidden weapon?”","Shi Ting laughed. He did not refute or agree with Jian Wushuang.","Countless divine powers spread from the feet of Shi Ting, turning into divine butterflies or chasing birds.","He slowly stretched out his palm. A chasing bird stopped at his fingertips, flapping its wings and flying up and down.","“When the bird is willing to stay at the tip of your sword, everything will be done.”","After saying that, Shi Ting’s body turned into a cloud of smoke and disappeared.","Along with him, a vast amount of divine power also dissipated.","“Old Sir?!” Jian Wushuang forced himself to stand up and looked at the place where Shi Ting had disappeared."]},{"number":4590,"title":"Chapter 4590 Waves and Clouds","paragraphs":["4590 Waves and Clouds","If it was not for the fact that the broken Dao field was slowly being built, Jian Wushuang would have treated everything that was happening as a dream.","After shouting several times, Jian Wushuang finally came back to his senses and felt lost.","This old man, who was both a teacher and a friend, had been deeply imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s heart after they had spent some time together.","What Shi Ting had done was equivalent to saving the Last Flame of the entire universe.","Jian Wushuang took a deep bow in the direction where Shi Ting disappeared.","After obtaining his own Sword Dao, Jian Wushuang felt that the powerlessness he had when facing the future was rapidly weakening. The future that belonged to him was rapidly opening up!","When Jian Wushuang checked his realm subconsciously, he could not help but exclaim.","As it turned out, the shackles of the Intermediate Supreme realm had disappeared without him knowing. It was as if the water had flowed smoothly, and he had advanced to the peak of the High Supreme realm!","The shackles that would take thousands of years to break through had actually been broken without him knowing it.","He clenched his fist and felt strong power surging again. Jian Wushuang swept away his previous fatigue and quickly sat down to stabilize his realm.","He had never broken through a whole realm directly before. He had to be careful.","After the peak of the High Supreme realm, it was the Top Supreme realm!","When he meditated, the endless divine power once again approached him and floated around him like a surge of water.","It was as if such a blessed cultivation environment was tailor-made for Jian Wushuang. While he could easily stabilize his realm, he could also concentrate on the Sword Dao he had just comprehended.","Jian Wushuang, who had been extremely sensitive to Sword Intent since he was a child, had long known how terrifying the first move of his Sword Dao was.","The power of the first move of his Sword Dao was similar to Tarot, the last move of the Tarot Sword Manual.","The two were comparable, or even more so than the Tarot Sword Manual. Jian Wushuang did not dare to imagine the upper limit of his own Sword Dao.","“This is my own Sword Dao, so it should naturally be called Wushuang. But how should I name the Sword Intent?” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and got the answer.","“Let’s call it the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning as he decided on the name of the unparalleled sword manual that would shock the world in the future.","After performing the Sword Dao several times, Jian Wushuang fell asleep with satisfaction.","The High Supreme realm was not his goal. Even before he had entered the Land of Sorrows, he had set the minimum requirement for himself to be a Top Supreme realm!","Top Supreme realm was his original goal, and now he set this goal on the realm that he had never dared to imagine.","Only by risking his life to break through could he have a chance of winning!","What the Void Universe had done today would be returned a thousand times or ten thousand times in the future!","The broken Great Dao circulated around Jian Wushuang, who was in a deep sleep, along with his vast divine power. From time to time, there were some runes hidden under his clothes.","In this sorrowful land that was enveloped by endless divine power, a humble but tenacious aura was growing continuously.","Every disciple of the Divine Life Palace had fallen into a deep sleep for a long time, but it was clear from their frowning brows that none of them had relaxed!","The humiliation of being like a stray dog made everyone try their best to break through.","One could hear sighs coming from one of the Cosmic Boats from time to time.","The short River Spirit sat on the railing and looked at the vast land of sorrow. His eyes were lost in thought. No one knew what he was thinking about.","...","The extreme north of the universe, the lonely starry sky.","The starry sky, which had not been seen for hundreds of millions of years, was now filled with nearly a hundred traces of Supreme divine power.","In front of these powerful Supremes, the nine-headed Snake God opened its vertical pupils in unison and stared at the ruins wrapped in the power of chaos.","“This is the Forbidden Land that the ants from the Divine Power Universe escaped to?” A sinister and strange voice came out of the Snake God’s mouth.","The master of the God Refining Sect, Void Master Ba Huang, nodded and said with an ugly expression, “I was careless that day and let them escape.”","“Since those ants can enter, why can’t you?” Snake God looked at Ba Huang and said gloomily, “Did you really not get in, or did you collude with the enemy to let them go?”","Void Warrior Ba Huang’s face turned even uglier and he released his void power. “What do you mean?”","Snake God was enraged, and an even more terrifying void power crushed down. It was as if a heavenly chasm was about to behead him.","Just as the Void Warrior Ba Huang was about to explode, a figure with thick black smoke appeared and suppressed Snake God and Ba Huang’s powers.","“You again, Devour One!” Snake God was furious, and all nine heads roared in unison. “Do you really want to go against me?!”","The black smoke dissipated, and Devour One looked at Snake God and sneered. “Stupid! You’re still not worthy of me opposing you. The two universes are currently at war, and you’re about to kill one of my Sect Masters without permission. Do you really think that you have the final say in the entire Void Universe?”","“You?” The Snake God was speechless. He had been given a high hat out of nowhere, which made it difficult for him to speak. After a cold snort, he simply stopped talking.","“One day, I’ll blast your head into pieces!” Snake God was secretly resentful.","Devour One did not say anything more, and his eyes shifted from the Land of Sorrows to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins on the other side.","“I want to nip all the possibilities in the bud. All of them will die by my hands!” Devour One’s eyes were cold. Then, Devour two, Devour Three, and the others appeared behind him.","“If you want a great fortune, follow me to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins!” After saying that, Devour One led his group to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.","Void Warrior Ba Huang’s expression was still ugly. He did not even look at Snake God and followed the Devourers with his sect members.","The remaining Void Warriors were eager to move, but they did not dare to because of Snake God.","Finally, a Two Scar Void Master mustered his courage and stepped forward. However, before he could say anything, he was crushed into a bloody pulp by Snake God.","“One day, I will slaughter your entire God Refining Sect!” Snake God said fiercely, then ordered the remaining Void Warriors to go straight to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.","The Great Catastrophe War between the two universes did not show any signs of stopping even though both Cosmos God and Void God had disappeared. The resentment that had accumulated since ancient times seemed to have finally found an outlet and were out of control.","...","5,000 years passed by.","The Land of Sorrows remained unchanged. The endless divine power was still vast, and even the ownerless divine power derived from it was more abundant.","Three thousand figures stood still like statues under the divine power that surrounded the desolate Land of Sorrows.","Each of them looked the same as they did 5,000 years ago. In fact, due to the advancement in their cultivation, they looked much younger.","These disciples’ breathing was completely closed, and they even only exhaled a mouthful of foul air every ten years. This cycle continued to repeat, and they underwent a complete transformation.","The petite figure that was lying on the railing and seemed to have fallen asleep suddenly jumped up."]},{"number":4591,"title":"Chapter 4591 Supreme! Supreme!","paragraphs":["4591 Supreme! Supreme!","In terms of the aura of all living things, it was likely that no one could compare to this small and even slightly wretched figure.","Lord River Spirit, who had been silent for nearly 5,000 years, leaped up high and landed on the ground like a fish in water.","In front of him was the first batch of disciples of the Divine Life Palace who had been meditating since all those years ago!","River Spirit’s small eyes were wide open.","The Enlightenment of the disciples closest to him seemed to be about to be integrated!","As if to confirm River Spirit’s guess, a long breath spiraled around a disciple, and nearly a thousand long breaths were awakened at the same time.","River Spirit’s mustache trembled. Ultimate Ruler realm!","This was the aura of an Ultimate Ruler.","If it was just the aura of an Ultimate Ruler, it would naturally not be able to catch River Spirit’s attention. But now, there were 3,000 of them!","What kind of concept was that? The 3,000 disciples who had remained in the outermost layer only comprehended it for 5,000 years, but they had already reached the Ultimate Ruler realm.","These were only the outer disciples. What about the disciples who were one step ahead?","River Spirit recovered from his shock and could not help but feel excited.","He knew that the entire Divine Power Universe and the Divine Life Palace could be saved!","With this in mind, River Spirit could no longer fall into a deep sleep. Like a child, he excitedly rushed into the depths. He wanted to take a good look at what kind of surprise that unparalleled genius, who was constantly growing, would give him.","However, just as he was about to set off, River Spirit realized that Enlightenment was ethereal. It was fickle, blending with heaven and earth. If he rashly disturbed him, the consequences would be unimaginable.","After thinking for a while, River Spirit gave up and said, “Forget it. Let’s not disturb that kid for now. It’s not too late to talk about it after he has broken through.”","After making up his mind, River Spirit jumped into the Cosmic Boat and observed the disciples who were about to wake up with his small eyes.","As the Ultimate Rulers’ aura grew more and more pure, the 3,000 disciples at the very edge of the formation all woke up.","“Heavens, this... I actually reached the realm of an Ultimate Ruler?!”","“I... I actually reached that level too!”","“I’ve only cultivated for a few years, yet I have actually reached such a realm. It’s really too terrifying...”","The 3,000 disciples went from disbelief to ecstasy, and then they wanted to continue moving forward.","However, at that moment, coughing sounds came from the Cosmic Boat, attracting the attention of all 3,000 disciples.","“Are my eyes playing tricks on me? Lord River Spirit is still alive??”","Hearing the noise, River Spirit was so angry that he almost jumped off the deck.","“Enough! Who said that your Lord River Spirit is dead? I’m telling you, even if you stuff me in the Void Universe right now, I can still live a good life!” the wretched old man placed his hands on his hips and said with his eyes wide open.","Then, he said earnestly, “Alright, all of you shut up for Lord River Spirit. For now, don’t move forward and stay here. Don’t disturb the cultivation of the remaining disciples. You’ve just become an Ultimate Ruler, so you must stabilize your cultivation. Don’t forget that the realm above you is the real deal!”","River Spirit’s words made the hearts of the 3,000 disciples burn with passion. How could they not understand that all those below the Supreme realm were just illusions?","In other words, in the war between the two universes, they were at best cannon fodder that were sent to their deaths and could not play any role. Only after becoming a Supreme martial artist could they drag one or two enemies down with them before they died.","Now that he was in such a land of great fortune, he would not allow himself to waste even a second.","Some of the disciples who had a clear mind immediately sat down again and began a new round of Enlightenment. The rest of the disciples also entered the realm again after checking their own conditions.","As the Last Flame, the expectation and mission that they had to shoulder would force them to grow.","After all the disciples were seated, River Spirit returned to its previous posture and looked at the chaotic sky.","“When will everything that has happened return to the right track that originally belonged to them?”","Another thousand years passed, and the second batch of disciples began to recover. They had also reached the Ultimate Ruler realm, and some of them had even begun to touch the barrier to the Supreme realm.","River Spirit strode forward, and after another round of preaching, he allowed them to continue their comprehension.","“Ah, it seems like they can’t live without me.” The River Spirit heaved a long sigh and put his hands behind his back, ready to make another round of patrol.","Swish!","As River Spirit turned around, a powerful divine power light pillar rose. Although it was not obvious in the vast divine power, it made River Spirit tremble.","The shock that symbolized the achievement of the Supreme realm was caused by the third batch of disciples who sat down to comprehend.","Then, the second wave of Supreme divine power rose.","The third...","The fourth...","The seventh!","A total of seven Supreme divine powers shot up into the sky, but they quickly returned to silence.","It did not trigger any Supreme Lightning Tribulation, nor did the heavens and earth shake. There was only a symbol of Supreme divine power.","The seven disciples who had obtained the Supreme Great Dao were the first to stand up. They looked at the Supreme divine power that appeared in their bodies in disbelief.","“I’ve become a Supreme martial artist...” One of the older middle-aged disciples murmured softly. When he saw the true Supreme power rising with the wind, his eyes instantly turned red.","“It seems like the Divine Power Universe can be saved,” River Spirit said with a sigh. A gratified look that was completely different from his style of doing things appeared in his small eyes.","The Land of Sorrows did not know the passage of time, but the extremely bored River Spirit counted the days and forcibly counted to the 8,000th year.","And it was during these 8,000 years that Supreme Tianyi awakened.","A vast amount of divine power shot up into the sky, and the divine power of a Top Supreme realm became even more profound. In the end, it stopped at the level of the Half Invincible Supreme realm.","8,000 years, he had broken through the true chasm of heaven and earth.","It would only be a matter of time before he became truly invincible.","Supreme Jun Fu also woke up after Tian Yi.","He had also taken that step, reaching the Half Invincible Supreme realm.","The two of them encouraged each other, gave River Spirit some instructions, and went on with the second round of comprehension.","During this time, Jian Wushuang’s wife, Leng Rushuang, had already woken up and successfully broken through the realm barrier, staying in the Primary Supreme realm.","At this point, only three people had yet to awaken from their Enlightenment.","Supreme Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, and Jian Wushuang.","The ownerless divine power, which seemed to have gained sentience, no longer wandered aimlessly. It either rushed toward Supreme Blood, or rushed toward Ninth Kalpa King like a tide.","However, even more ownerless divine power gushed toward the center of the entire Land of Sorrows along with the divine power left behind by the ancient existences!"]},{"number":4592,"title":"Chapter 4592 Breakthrough to the Half Invincible Supreme Realm!","paragraphs":["4592 Breakthrough to the Half Invincible Supreme Realm!","It was a dojo that belonged to Jian Wushuang.","The dome was constructed by all kinds of Supreme divine power, and the divine rhythm filled the entire Dao Field from top to bottom. It was brilliant gold and brilliant.","Under the Dao Field were thousands of divine weapons that acted as the foundation and infused the divine aura into the Dao Field.","In the center of the huge Daoist sanctum, an extremely thin figure sat there. The loose black robe on his upper body had been torn apart by the vast divine power, revealing his strong body with divine patterns.","!!","His long hair, which seemed to have been dyed golden by his divine aura, was scattered on the ground like a waterfall of stars.","The Tarot Divine Sword was slanted to one side, the blade ringing in its sheath.","Jian Wushuang had maintained this posture for 8,000 years. The vast divine power flowed into his body through every pore and nourished every inch of his meridians.","Every hundred years, Jian Wushuang would spit out a mouthful of turbid breath and the cycle continued.","He had practiced the Wushuang Sword Dao that he had just comprehended for 2,000 years.","For the past 2,000 years, he had been using his divine sense to draw and withdraw his sword at all times, tempering the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent until it was perfect.","It was not until the 3,000th year that Jian Wushuang managed to construct the framework of the entire Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent. The first move he used to fight Shi Ting only had the simplest Star Character.","The meaning of each character was simple, but when they were finally put together, it was enough to cover the endless universe.","This was Jian Wushuang’s Sword Dao and his ambition.","When he had finished polishing the entire sword principle, Jian Wushuang, who was in the chaotic divine consciousness, wanted to open the gift that the former Palace Master, Dao Yan, had given him.","However, he did not know if it was because of the breathing technique or because his hands were trembling with apprehension, but when he opened Dao Yan’s cultivation comprehension, the comprehension of Cosmos God was also opened at the same time.","The two majestic and majestic cultivation comprehensions made him faint...","...","Another 2,000 years passed.","“Haha, great, great!”","“Hahahahaha!” A loud laugh that shook the heavens resounded. A thick and restrained divine power surged like a flood dragon that emerged from the water and completely scattered in the sky.","Supreme Jun Fu, who had just undergone a second comprehension, had awakened once again! This time, he had awakened to an unbelievable level of Invincible Supreme!","What would have originally taken hundreds of chaos cycles to cultivate had now only taken 2,000 years. This was probably something that had never happened since the primordial chaos began.","Supreme Jun Fu, who had entered the Invincible Supreme godly state, had swept away his previous fatigue. His eyes were like a bright Star Field, emitting a bright light from the inside out, and he looked solemn.","Soon after, Supreme Tian Yi woke up and also entered the Invincible Supreme divine realm.","The two old friends who had accompanied each other for countless chaos cycles smiled at each other, their eyes brimming with tears.","The Divine Life Palace had been humiliated again and again because they were not strong enough. The Divine Power Universe had fallen, and countless Supreme talents had been killed.","Only by constantly risking their lives to break through could they protect what they wanted to protect.","“Tian Yi,” Supreme Jun Fu laughed arrogantly. “You and I have both entered the Invincible Supreme divine realm. Why don’t we spar today to temper ourselves?”","“That’s what I was thinking!” Tian Yi laughed, and a divine bow that could destroy the world appeared in his hand.","Supreme Jun Fu immediately retreated a few thousand feet, while countless ownerless divine powers began to construct a Daoist Rite Temple.","In the small training hall, the two figures instantly erupted with the might of Invincible Supremes.","The boundless divine power was no longer as abundant as it had been before he had become a Half Invincible Supreme. Instead, it seemed to possess a mind of its own, and it was rather restrained.","The two Invincible Supreme Martial Artists began their most satisfying battle!","Tian Yi’s grip tightened on his divine bow and used his own divine power as an arrow. In an instant, the arrow shot out like a phoenix’s tail feather, sweeping toward Supreme Jun Fu.","Jun Fu expanded in the wind, and the two collided heavily. The resulting explosion directly tore apart the newly built dojo.","Countless crystalline lights were drawn to the divine bow. Tian Yi laughed and released the shot toward Jun Fu.","Supreme Jun Fu leaned his axe against his back. As his figure changed, he met the attack with a sky-splitting force.","The crimson divine power clashed with the crystal blue light. The might of an Invincible Supreme once again tore apart the training ground and completely dissipated into the world.","Since the entire dLand of Sorrows was constructed from an even more ancient and vast divine power, Jun Fu and Tian Yi’s magical abilities were greatly restricted.","Perhaps it was because the soaring battle intent stirred up the dormant divine power.","Some of the disciples who had gained Enlightenment for the second time started to wake up.","The awakened disciples were at least at the level of an Ultimate Ruler, and at the same time, new Supreme divine powers began to appear!","From the original seven Supreme divine realm experts, it started to increase to two digits and there were still signs of it increasing.","Perhaps she had sensed some kind of aura, Leng Rushuang woke up from her Enlightenment. A new power rose from her meridians.","A magnificent dark blue divine power shot into the sky and then dissipated.","Leng Rushuang had entered the Supreme divine realm!","“It’s really a little noisy...” A slightly lazy voice was heard, and the white-haired Ninth Kalpa King woke up from his comprehension.","There were no fluctuations of a breakthrough, and he did not even reveal any divine power. It was as if he had a good sleep.","However, the more this was the case with Ninth Kalpa King, the more terrifying he was. He was like a divine sword that hid its edge, but it revealed its sharpness in its calmness.","A profound light surged in his eyes, and a faint smile hung on the corner of his mouth.","“Can the power of a Top Supreme martial artist reach such a level? If I were to advance even a little more...”","Only Ninth Kalpa King himself knew that it only took him 8,000 years to completely cross a major realm and touch the more mysterious realm.","He was confident that he would definitely become an Invincible Supreme within a chaos cycle!","“And that guy, what kind of miracles would he pull of this time?” Ninth Kalpa King’s deep and pure eyes looked at the Daoist Rite Temple in the distant chaos.","Lan Lan had awoken. She had attained the Dao under the command of Cosmos God, so she had long been indifferent to the matters of cultivation realms. It was also because of her state of mind that she had leaped to the peak of the High Supreme realm.","She did not pay much attention to the progress of her cultivation realm. The moment she woke up, she looked at Jian Wushuang’s dojo with worry.","Unless one’s divine power had reached the level of Cosmos God, any individual power that could not be measured on the battlefield would appear extremely weak in front of the decision-makers who could save the situation.","As for Lan Lan, she had long regarded Jian Wushuang as the decision-maker who could turn the tide.","Although the Divine Power Universe had already fallen, the Last Flame was still growing under the pressure of the Void Universe. The Next Generation showed immense promise.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the bright dojo.","They were all waiting for that tenacious young man who had never slacked in his training to create a miracle."]},{"number":4593,"title":"Chapter 4593 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (1)","paragraphs":["4593 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (1)","After destroying countless Daoist Fields of divine power, the two Invincible Supremes finally stopped, and the divine power that suppressed the universe was completely retracted into their bodies.","“Great, it’s really great!” Supreme Tian Yi kept his divine bow and laughed heartily.","Supreme Jun Fu nodded his head and said arrogantly, “Now, I have the power to fight even a Six Scar Void Master!”","After putting away their divine arts, the two of them landed on the ground.","“Congratulations to the two of you for entering the invincible realm.” Lan Lan stepped forward and cupped her hands.","!!","Supreme Jun Fu nodded and said, “Thank you, Miss Lan Lan. The fact that the two of us were able to advance to the Invincible Supreme realm is a sign of the Heavenly Dao’s pity for our Divine Power Universe.”","In less than 10,000 years, Jun Fu Supreme and Supreme Tian Yi had both become Invincible Supremes. Apart from the pity of the Heavenly Dao, they did not seem to have any other fortuitous encounters in this land of great creation...","Supreme Tian Yi chuckled in response. “I think that we’ll have another Invincible Supreme soon.”","“Oh?”","They immediately turned to look at Supreme Xue Bo.","The divine force field that surrounded Xue Bo was like a huge golden cocoon, completely wrapping his body within it. Outsiders could only vaguely see his figure.","Jun Fu Supreme frowned and muttered to himself, “Xue Bo is a Half Invincible Supreme, and he has been on the brink of the Invincible realm for a long time. Logically speaking, he should have had a much easier time than the two of us. Why is there no sign of a breakthrough even now?”","“Don’t worry. After Xue Bo successfully advances to the Invincible Supreme realm, I’m afraid his strength will be much stronger than the two of us,” Supreme Tian Yi replied. After spending nearly endless years together, he had never doubted the strength of his old friend.","“I hope so,” Jun Fu said, nodding.","Only Lan Lan’s gaze changed slightly when she looked at the Daoist Rite Temple that Supreme Xue Bo had comprehended.","The white-haired Ninth Kalpa King, who looked a little lonely, had been looking at Jian Wushuang’s dojo from the beginning to the end.","He was eager to see how this Heaven’s Favorite would appear and how far he would be left behind.","He probably did not even know when he had used Jian Wushuang as a flag and made him the target he was chasing after.","“Supreme Jun Fu,” Ninth Kalpa King suddenly said with a sincere look, “forgive me for being abrupt. Can I ask Supreme Jun Fu to come and examine my state of mind?”","When Jun Fu Supreme heard this, he did not show any displeasure. Instead, he looked at Ninth Kalpa King with even more admiration. “Of course. I can also see what kind of surprise this other peerless genius will bring me.”","Ninth Kalpa King agreed and rose to the sky with Jun Fu.","These vast divine powers that had been preserved from ancient times to this day seemed to be very sensitive to fighting intent, and they were also like spectators who did not mind watching a show. They fought to have good seats and views of the Daoist Temple...","“Supreme Ninth Kalpa, I won’t hold back later.” Supreme Jun Fu smiled as a divine axe appeared in his hand.","Jun Fu Supreme stood still and waved his hand, causing the terrifying might of an Invincible Supreme to burst out. It was as if the gates of heaven had opened and a huge sea was crashing down.","In just one move, Ninth Kalpa King’s power that belonged to a Top Supreme realm was instantly suppressed.","He only felt like a lonely boat in a huge sea, which could be destroyed at any time. Even the flow of his Supreme divine power slowed down a lot.","Supreme Jun Fu stomped his feet on the ground, and the divine axe in his hand expanded in the wind. Countless divine patterns rose from the handle of the axe, completely enveloping it.","With a gentle wave, an axe light that could tear apart the dome of any Star Field burst out from the tip of the blade and slashed at Ninth Kalpa King in a three-edged manner.","Even in the suppressed realm of an Invincible Supreme, Ninth Kalpa King’s performance was still remarkable.","His fist, which was completely wrapped with the might of a Top Supreme divine power, slammed directly into the training hall on the ground. He used the force to quickly rise into the air and paused for a moment. Then, nearly a hundred rays of cold divine power swept out from his palm and stabbed at Supreme Jun Fu.","Each ray of cold light contained the power of a Top Supreme martial artist, covering the sky and earth.","Supreme Jun Fu did not have time to dodge, and could only raise his axe to block.","The cold light only left a faint white spot on the axe.","Descending from the sky, Ninth Kalpa King emitted a unique white light, and an illusory phantom image condensed behind him. Then, he brazenly collided with the Jun Fu Supreme.","Rumble!","The majestic divine power shattered into mottled stars that fell like the Star River. A deep sound like a bell rang from the axe.","The stars scattered. Under this blow, Ninth Kalpa King himself suffered a backlash, causing him to fly backward. A wisp of divine blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth.","As for Supreme Jun Fu, he was finally forced to take a few steps back.","Ninth Kalpa King wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth with his sleeve and slowly got up.","“To be able to shake an Invincible Supreme realm expert with just a Top Supreme realm cultivation, you’re indeed a Heaven’s Favorite!” Supreme Jun Fu waved his hand and prepared his long axe on his back. “Are you willing to try this move of mine, which I obtained after entering the Invincible Supreme realm?”","Ninth Kalpa King was stunned. He immediately said solemnly, “I’m willing to try!”","Supreme Jun Fu did not say anything else. His gray-white hair suddenly broke free from the ribbon and danced wildly in the air. The silver-white axe in his hand began to shine with a golden light under the blessing of divine power.","The majestic divine power began to be restrained, as if it was all poured into the divine axe.","Nearly ten shadows that looked very similar to Supreme Jun Fu quietly appeared. They were bare-chested and carried their axes on their backs, like ancient giants who had awakened at the same time!","“This is the divine ability I gained after entering the invincible state,” The eleven figures said in unison.","“Divine power — Sky Splitter!”","In an instant, a brilliant light bloomed. Eleven figures raised the big axes in their hands high, as if they were really splitting the sky, and chopped at Ninth Kalpa King.","The 11 axe lights combined to form an illusion of mighty axe and fell heavily.","Looking at the axe shadow falling from the sky, Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes seemed to be enlightened.","It was as if he had returned to the day he listened to Dao in Ling Xiao Palace, crossing tens of thousands of Lotus Peaks, with auspicious lights circulating and long green smoke curling up.","“What is the Dao you understand?”","...","“What is the Dao that I understand?”","“The Dao I understand is to press forward with indomitable will. Although I have died nine times, I still do not regret it. It is the Dao of welcoming death and living...”","“This is my Dao!”","When the sky-splitting giant axe fell, Ninth Kalpa King opened his eyes, and countless cold glints rose to the sky without fear!","What followed was a light so bright that it seemed that the entire arena was bathed in white. The light lasted a very long time.","As the light slowly faded, Supreme Jun Fu stepped on the wind and landed, and Ninth Kalpa King fell asleep in his arms.","“Ninth Kalpa Supreme had an Enlightennebt. He has already understood the path ahead,” Jun Fu Supreme said with a smile.","“You bastard,” Supreme Tian Yi shook his head with a bitter smile. “You’re so rough even when it comes to imparting your Dao. Even I almost thought that was your full-powered strike.”","Supreme Jun Fu smiled and waved his hand to form a small Daoist Rite Temple, placing Ninth Kalpa King inside.","Then, everyone’s eyes looked into the depths again.","“Palace Master Wushuang, it’s time to wake up.”"]},{"number":4594,"title":"Chapter 4594 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (2)","paragraphs":["4594 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (2)","Time flew by, and under Lord River Spirit’s diligent recording, 12,000 years passed by in the blink of an eye.","All the disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were in deep sleep were awakened.","In this great fortune, other than the disciples who died in the passage first, the remaining 11,000 disciples all reached the Ultimate Ruler realm!","In addition, there were nearly 300 disciples who had successfully transcended and advanced to the Supreme realm!","There were more than 300 Supreme martial artists in total! Even the Dragon clan, which had been passed down to this day, did not have such skill, such foundation!","!!","This was a scene that no one could imagine!","When Supreme Tian Yi and Supreme Jun Fu saw this scene, tears streamed down their faces. They immediately knelt three times at the place where Shi Ting had disappeared.","All the disciples of the Divine Life Palace had become the ultimate trump cards of the entire Divine Power Universe.","Although these 300 Supremes were only at the Primary stage, as long as they broke through the Supreme stages, which was, then the Intermediate and High Supreme realms would be easy to achieve.","Ever since all the disciples had awakened, Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi had been working hard to speed up the cultivation of all the disciples and help them stabilize their cultivation.","Since the battle between Ninth Kalpa King and Supreme Jun Fu, Ninth Kalpa sat down and meditated again. When he woke up 2,000 years later, his originally sharp divine power began to tend to be restrained, with a great momentum of hiding it.","The light in his eyes was even more intense than before, and the most difficult shackles to break through also began to show signs of fading.","Everything was developing toward a flourishing direction.","Only two people showed no signs of waking up.","One of them was Jian Wushuang, while the other was Supreme Xue Bo.","For this reason, Supreme Jun Fu had specially assigned 12 disciples to be in charge of observing and patrolling the area. Once there was any movement, they would immediately send a message.","“Third brother, how long do you think it will take for our Palace Master to wake up? It has already been 12,000 years. I’m afraid...”","Before the young disciple could finish his sentence, he was hit on the head.","“Shut up! It’s only been 10,000 years, and you’re already giving up? What are you going to do when you become a Supreme and have to sit there for hundreds of chaos cycles?” the middle-aged disciple who was addressed as ‘Third Brother’ said sternly.","The young disciple rubbed his head and pouted, not daring to say anything.","In the patrol team of 12, only the middle-aged man was a Primary Supreme. The rest of the people were at the Ultimate Ruler realm. Naturally, he was in charge of observing Jian Wushuang’s dojo.","As he stepped forward, an ownerless divine power naturally lifted the middle-aged disciple and swept toward the vast Daoist Sanctum in the center.","The huge Daoist Sanctum that covered Jian Wushuang was now covered with a thick layer of golden light and it was harder to see what was inside.","He stepped on the ownerless divine power and was about to land when the sky suddenly shook!","Then, the ownerless divine power under his feet suddenly went crazy and shot back uncontrollably.","Due to the suddenness of the incident, the middle-aged disciple fell from a high altitude without any warning and landed heavily on the ground.","“Third Brother!” The other 11 disciples rushed over and helped the middle-aged disciple up.","it seems that this divine power is not easy to control! He shook his head helplessly and smiled bitterly. He subconsciously looked up and suddenly trembled.","The huge dojo that had been hovering in the air for 10,000 years began to seep with thick golden water!","“H-how did this happen?”","In the next moment, countless wisps of golden water suddenly surged like the galaxy in the sky.","“Hurry, hurry up and leave this place!” The middle-aged disciple was the first to react. He immediately released his Supreme divine power to push the 11 people away.","The golden water gushed forth as if the gates of heaven had opened, pouring down on the ground.","At this moment, the huge Daoist Sanctum that had been covered in dust for tens of thousands of years suddenly shattered!","The stars scattered, and the light of treasures circulated.","The thousands of silent divine weapons also shrieked in unison, as if they were waiting for their former master.","The golden water and silver river gushed out, but the moment they touched the ground, they condensed into a Great Dao of divine power.","The huge Dao Field shattered, and the brilliant power shook the universe.","Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi, who were guiding the tens of thousands of disciples in their meditation, looked at the place where the golden might was shining and immediately transformed into two streams of divine power that shot out.","Lan Lan’s body trembled as she looked in that direction in disbelief.","Ninth Kalpa King slowly opened his eyes, which were full of smiles. The next moment, he soared into the sky and rushed to the Daoist Sanctum.","River Spirit, who was sleeping soundly on the deck, jumped up when he heard this. ‘The sky has changed, the sky has changed...’","When the tens of thousands of disciples saw this, they looked at each other and rushed forward.","The great path of divine power was constructed by the thick and majestic golden water. It was full of brilliant might, and there were thousands of forms of divine power on it. It was magnificent and sacred.","The shattered Dao Field of divine power slowly fell like thousands of stars.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the most dazzling star in the sky!","A muscular upper body was covered in countless golden divine patterns. A brilliant might flowed out from his eyes and every pore.","This figure was only left with a tattered black robe and pants at his waist, but even so, it could not hide his divine might. It was as if he had returned to his most original existence.","A pure golden light and an exuberant purple light blended together and appeared around his body in the form of lightning.","He was Jian Wushuang.","When his feet touched the ground, all the stars in the sky were destroyed, and a brilliant golden pattern was reflected on his body.","The big and small lotus buds bloomed together, and the magnificent lotus bloomed in the Great Dao.","As the purple light receded from his eyes, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had woken up from a chaotic dream that was so long ago that it was the beginning of the world. He walked on the road in a daze.","With every step he took, his spiritual sense became a little clearer.","His long hair was shining with golden light, and each step he took had divine patterns flowing on it.","Everyone held their breath. Even Jun Fu and Tian Yi, who were already Invincible Supremes, felt an indescribable pressure.","This kind of pressure was the purest form of suppression. It had nothing to do with one’s cultivation realm. It was a more profound level of life.","There was no disbelief or jealousy in Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes. There was only joy from the bottom of his heart, as well as a touch of the most sincere passion. This was the pride that belonged only to Ninth Kalpa King, and it could not be tainted by any distracting thoughts.","‘How could I, Ninth Kalpa King, not reach Jian Wushuang’s cultivation realm?’","Supreme Jun Fu was the first to react. Facing the Great Dao and Jian Wushuang, he knelt down on one knee without hesitation and said in a bell-like voice, “Welcome, Palace Master Wushuang!”","Tens of thousands of disciples knelt down and shouted in unison, “All disciples of the Divine Life Palace welcome Palace Master Wushuang!”","Their voices reverberated through the entire desolate Land of Sorrows and Jian Wushuang became completely clear-headed.","His purple eyes looked at the tens of thousands of disciples, and a long-lost smile appeared on his face.","Ten thousand years of loneliness would only be exchanged for a more vigorous new life."]},{"number":4595,"title":"Chapter 4595 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (3)","paragraphs":["4595 One Move to Break the Invincible Supreme (3)","Countless rays of golden light scattered in the wind and swept toward the crowd with the breeze.","“There’s no need to be so formal. Everyone, please stand up.” Jian Wushuang laughed lightly.","The tens of thousands of disciples only felt warmth on their knees. A gentle force lifted everyone up.","“Thank you, Palace Master Wushuang!” all the disciples said in unison.","The divine radiance flowing around his body was completely retracted as he flew in front of Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi.","Looking at the god-like figure in front of him, Supreme Jun Fu’s eyes were slightly moist. He only called out to Palace Master Wushuang and secretly shed tears.","Upon seeing this, Supreme Tian Yi nudged him with his elbow and said in a low voice, “I say, old friend, Palace Master Wushuang has come out of seclusion. You should be happy. Why are you crying again?”","“Why do you care? This old man can cry however I want, no one can control me,” Supreme Jun Fu retorted like a child.","Supreme Tian Yi shook his head helplessly.","Jian Wushuang naturally understood Supreme Jun Fu’s frustration.","Then, he placed his palm on Supreme Jun Fu’s shoulder and said solemnly, “Don’t worry, Supreme Jun Fu. I’ll make them go back to where they came from. They’ll pay for their debt with blood!”","Supreme Jun Fu hurriedly wiped his tears with his sleeves and cupped his hands. “I, Supreme Jun Fu, am a subordinate of the Divine Life Palace. I am willing to follow Palace Master Wushuang’s orders!”","“Supreme Tian Yi of the Divine Life Palace is willing to follow Palace Master Wushuang’s orders!” Supreme Tian Yi replied.","Ninth Kalpa King smiled, cupped his hands, and said, “I, Supreme Ninth Kalpa of the Divine Life Palace, am willing to be at Palace Master Wushuang’s disposal!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at the tens of thousands of disciples of the Divine Life Palace. His fighting spirit soared to the sky.","“Palace Master Wushuang, out of the 11,000 disciples, 300 of them have reached the Supreme realm, while the rest have reached the Ultimate Ruler realm. They can already fight in the Great Catastrophe battlefield.”","Supreme Jun Fu analyzed the general situation as he advanced through the Land of Sorrows. “However, the battle between the Invincible Supreme and the Six Scar Void Masters...”","Supreme Jun Fu did not continue. When the Great Catastrophe War had just started, the 40-odd Six Scar Void Masters from the Void Universe had almost dominated the entire battlefield.","If the high-end combat forces could not be balanced, the direction of this war would still lean toward the Void Universe.","Moreover, the Void Universe still had Snake God, a terrifying existence that had surpassed the Invincible Supreme realm.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything at first. “Leave Snake God to me. As for the number of the Invincible Supremes, I’ll gather a few more after we leave the Land of Sorrows.”","Ninth Kalpa King also stopped in his tracks, and a hint of bitterness appeared in his eyes.","In just 10,000 years, Jian Wushuang had grown to such a level?","He had thought that with his Top Supreme cultivation, he would be able to fight Jian Wushuang. However, everything had changed.","Jian Wushuang’s target was Snake God in the Void Universe!","“I’m already a Half Invincible Supreme. I think it won’t be a problem for me to face Snake God in the Void Universe,” Jian Wushuang added.","Jun Fu and Tian Yi were shocked. Back then, Jian Wushuang could kill a Supreme divine realm expert when he was only at the ultimate ruler realm. He had always killed those at a higher realm and created miracles. Now that he was already at the Half Invincible Supreme realm, could he really cross the heavenly chasm?","“However,” Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment, looked at Supreme Jun Fu, and said, “I’ll have to trouble you later.”","Supreme Jun Fu understood, and he immediately agreed.","“Supreme Xue Bo, he...” Jian Wushuang watched from afar. Supreme Xue Bo was still sitting in the middle of the vast divine power.","Supreme Tian Yi shook his head. “He hasn’t awakened from his meditative state. There must be a great opportunity waiting for him.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Xue Bo had already been a Half Invincible Supreme before he had reached Enlightenment, so it was not difficult for him to break through to the Invincible Supreme realm. The fact that he had been able to reach this stage meant that he was probably already progressing toward an even more mysterious realm.","A moment later, all the disciples of the Divine Life Palace gathered around Jian Wushuang and came to a relatively empty place. He waved his hand and built a huge Daoist Rite Temple under the firmament, then jumped onto it with Supreme Jun Fu.","“Who do you guys think will win?”","“I-I’m guessing that Supreme Jun Fu will win. He’s an Invincible Supreme, after all, someone who can easily suppress ordinary Supremes with a wave of his hand.”","“I guess Palace Master Wushuang will win. Don’t forget that Palace Master Wushuang was able to kill a Supreme realm expert when he was only at the Ultimate Ruler realm. Now, Palace Master Wushuang is only at the Half Invincible realm. Isn’t it easy for him to fight an Invincible Supreme?”","“That seems to be the case...”","The tens of thousands of disciples were in a clamor as they discussed animatedly. Supreme Tian Yi snorted, and all the disciples immediately fell silent.","Only the strong wind in the sky was blowing.","Jian Wushuang, who was like a god, stood on the spot. The vast and vigorous divine power made the ends of his hair emit a golden light.","As soon as Supreme Jun Fu stepped onto the stage, he immediately summoned his divine axe and waited.","He would never treat Jian Wushuang as an ordinary Half Invincible Supreme expert.","Thus, he was able to immediately raise his divine power to the level of an Invincible Supreme.","“Palace Master Wushuang, I won’t hold back, so please don’t be offended,” Supreme Jun Fu said in a deep voice. The divine axe in his hand was already trembling.","Jian Wushuang nodded and his own divine power emerged from the ground.","Supreme Jun Fu brandished his Jun Fu, sending a scorching astral wind that could destroy a star slashing forward!","However, when the ten astral winds touched Jian Wushuang’s divine power, they were destroyed like snow melting!","Supreme Jun Fu’s eyes narrowed. He knew that ordinary moves were no longer effective against Jian Wushuang.","Taking a deep breath, he held the divine axe vertically in front of him and began to restrain all of the divine power that had been dispersed.","As his divine power shrank, Supreme Jun Fu’s figure began to transform into 10 figures.","20...","30!","There were a total of 30 Supreme Jun Fus, and every single one of them possessed his complete divine power.","“This is the divine power I comprehended after I entered the Invincible Supreme realm. In a one-on-one battle, no one in the same realm as me can stop me!”","Supreme Jun Fu had an unyielding nature, and his Dao was also indomitable. His strike was so powerful that no one dared to compete with him.","“Divine power – Sky Splitter!”","The endless divine power was combined into one, and the 30 phantom images turned into a line. The sky in the Daoist Sanctum turned into chaos, leaving only the illusion of a huge divine axe that tore the chaos apart.","Like a mighty figure from the beginning, all gods, ghosts, demons, and evil had to obey his orders. The foul air sank while the clear air rose.","The chaotic sky was torn apart easily and the heaven-splitting axe went straight for Jian Wushuang!","Everyone held their breath in shock. Even some of the disciples who were determined to win turned to look at Supreme Jun Fu.","In the next moment, thousands of purple-gold divine light beams rose from the chaos like the Milky Way. At the same time, a magnificent Heavenly Gate appeared above the chaos!"]},{"number":4596,"title":"Chapter 4596 Ancestral Technique, Transcendence Heavenly Gate","paragraphs":["4596 Ancestral Technique, Transcendence Heavenly Gate","A brilliant might sprinkled toward the chaos, and the vast Heavenly Gate suddenly opened!","Jian Wushuang was suspended in the air with a majestic aura. His eyes seemed to pierce through the chaos and locked onto Supreme Jun Fu.","A giant finger that seemed to carry the power of the ancient gods reached out from the Heavenly Gate.","The mighty divine power descended with a finger!","The divine axe that seemed to be able to split open the chaos of the universe collided with the giant finger.","However, in just a breath, thousands of cracks appeared on the surface of the divine axe, and the surging divine power poured out!","The heaven-splitting divine axe did not even last for a second when it collided with the Heavenly Gate’s giant finger. It was shattered immediately.","His precious form was destroyed, and even his chaotic aura was severely damaged. Supreme Jun Fu was sent flying far away, and his aura instantly became extremely weak.","However, the giant finger merely paused for a moment before continuing its advance toward Supreme Jun Fu.","Supreme Tian Yi’s expression changed drastically, and he immediately rushed into the training hall.","He opened his palm and the divine bow appeared in his hand. Tian Yi shot out thousands of beams of godly light in order to intimidate the terrifying finger.","The divine power of heaven’s might gushed out from the Heavenly Gate, nourishing the giant finger.","The 1,000 streaks of divine light unleashed by the Invincible Supreme expert were only able to leave a faint mark on the massive finger. In fact, they were unable to stop it for even a single moment.","The heaven-reaching giant finger continued to press down, and the pressure that gushed out of the Heavenly Gate completely suppressed the figures of Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi. The two of them were unable to move an inch!","Ninth Kalpa King also saw that something was wrong. He pressed his feet and his figure rose to the dojo without hesitation.","Pitch-black divine patterns emerged around his body, and the vast divine power of a Top Supreme and Half Invincible realm was emitted.","An illusionary figure with a bare upper body and impressive divine patterns appeared behind Ninth Kalpa King. Then, he and the illusionary figure behind him appeared to be holding up the sky and heavily collided with the finger!","Boom, boom, boom!","The Daoist Field instantly shattered, and the shadow behind Ninth Kalpa King instantly dimmed. Divine blood gushed out from the corner of his mouth.","“Wake up, Jian Wushuang!!” Ninth Kalpa King’s gums were stained with blood as he roared.","Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi exchanged a glance before summoning their respective forms and sending them crashing toward the giant finger.","However, an unbelievable scene appeared.","The two Invincible Supreme phantoms and one Top Supreme phantom form only managed to block the attack for a few breaths of time before they were completely shattered!","“Not good!” Lan Lan’s heart trembled. She flew up to the shattered Dao Field and released her divine power to block it!","Then, Leng Rushuang also flew up.","300 Primary Supreme martial artists and more than 10,000 Ultimate Rulers also rose into the sky at this moment. Facing the giant finger that reached the sky, they twisted into a rope and released their own power.","Jian Wushuang was in great pain!","He had long been lost in his own desolate and empty divine sense!","The Heavenly Gate was created by Jian Wushuang after he comprehended a profound Ancestral Skill left in his memory by Cosmos God.","This was an Ancestral Skill that transcended the Supreme divine realm and would grow as the user’s cultivation realm grew!","Jian Wushuang had used an Ancestral Skill that should not have belonged to his Half Invincible Supreme cultivation realm. Getting lost was the best outcome.","His consciousness was in a state where no one was taking over.","“Ancestral Skill — Transcendence Heavenly Gate!”","Jian Wushuang hovered in the sky and the golden divine patterns around him were brilliant. He looked like an ancient unparalleled existence!","As soon as he finished speaking, the giant finger easily crushed the divine power barrier formed by ten thousand people.","The terror of being caught in the middle of life and death by Void God’s palm attack instantly surged into their minds.","Tens of thousands of disciples turned pale. They had nowhere to run!","Ninth Kalpa King looked bitter as he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was hanging in the sky with his eyes closed. He slowly closed his eyes and suddenly said, “You must live well!”","In an instant, it was as if the mountain wind had blown over the sea and the spring water had melted.","The finger that was pressing down suddenly stopped above everyone’s heads.","“Hurry, hurry up and leave...” Jian Wushuang’s voice resounded.","Looking over, they saw Jian Wushuang hanging between heaven and earth. His eyes were clear, and his arms were bulging as he blocked the attack from landing.","Ninth Kalpa King immediately reacted, and his vigorous divine power burst out, pushing tens of thousands of disciples with all his might.","After everyone was out of danger, the giant finger pressed down heavily...","Heaven and earth slightly changed color.","Rumble, rumble, rumble...","After an unknown period of time, Ninth Kalpa King’s slightly complaining voice sounded. “You released such a ridiculous attack. Are you trying to kill us?”","Sitting in front of a huge pit, Jian Wushuang rubbed his nose awkwardly, “I...I wanted to try this attack at that time. I didn’t expect that the power would be so terrifying that even I fell into it...”","Ninth Kalpa King shook his head helplessly. “I’ll remember this. In the future, you’ll have to carry Snake God’s head to make up for this.”","“That attack just now was truly terrifying,” said Supreme Jun Fu, still feeling a lingering fear in his heart. “If it were on the battlefield, I’m afraid that no Invincible Supreme would be able to withstand that attack.”","Jian Wushuang replied, “I can’t master that move now. If it weren’t for Ninth Kalpa waking me up, the consequences would be unimaginable. So, I won’t use it again unless I’m on the battlefield.”","Supreme Tian Yi nodded and said, “Palace Master Wushuang, are we going to continue comprehending in the Land of Sorrows, or are we going to the Divine Power Universe and fight with the Void Universe?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then said, “You guys continue to cultivate in the Land of Sorrows. I will go to the Void Universe alone to pick up those who should have returned but can’t.”","“Pick up those who should return... but can’t?” Supreme Jun Fu muttered, his body shaking.","“Could it be that Palace Master Dao Yan is still alive?” Tian Yi’s body trembled.","Jian Wushuang did not deny nor confirm it. “When I was in the Void Universe, I met Palace Master Dao Yan in the Land of Gods. Palace Master Dao Yan personally gave me the Palace Master’s Token at that time.”","“Furthermore, he passed all of his comprehensions of creation to me. Then, his soul dissipated.”","“At that time, due to Supreme Bing Ye’s death battle with me, I didn’t have time to investigate the traces of life that Palace Master Dao Yan left behind. Now that I think about it, Palace Master Dao Yan must still be in deep sleep there.”","Jian Wushuang said sincerely, “Regardless of whether Palace Master Dao Yan is dead or not, I will make a trip there because he belongs to the Divine Power Universe. Even if he dies and his Dao vanishes, I will still bring him back.”","Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi knelt in front of Jian Wushuang immediately, tears streaming down their faces.","“Thank you, Palace Master Wushuang. Jun Fu and Tian Yi will obey the Palace Master’s orders until death!”","“No need to be so polite. I’ll get back what the Void Universe owes us, bit by bit.” Jian Wushuang lifted the two of them up with a serious look.","Ninth Kalpa came to Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice, “This trip is dangerous. I’ll go to the Void Universe with you so that we can look out for each other.”"]},{"number":4597,"title":"Chapter 4597 Entering Danger Alone","paragraphs":["4597 Entering Danger Alone","Jian Wushuang pondered for a while and shook his head. “No, the two of us are too big a target. We may be discovered at any time. Besides, I have a secret technique that can completely disguise myself as a Void Master of the Void Universe. I think it won’t be a big problem.”","Ninth Kalpa King did not insist. After telling him to be careful on the road, he did not speak again.","Jian Wushuang nodded and left the Land of Sorrows after giving Jun Fu and Tian Yi some instructions.","“Husband, I can’t help you, so please be careful.” Leng Rushuang’s eyes were bitter.","“You being by my side is the greatest help to me. The years without you are the true desolation.” Looking at the woman who had no regrets and had been with him until now, Jian Wushuang hugged her gently. Then, his body turned into a long rainbow and he headed to the exit of the Land of Sorrows.","“With such a pure and kind heart, I can’t see through Palace Master Wushuang’s future,” Supreme Jun Fu murmured as he looked at the sky where Jian Wushuang had disappeared.","Stepping into the dark and lonely passage again, all kinds of heart-palpitating and painful wails disappeared. Even the resentment that had existed since ancient times had disappeared without a trace.","Jian Wushuang started to feel that the God Burial Ground seemed to be dissipating slowly in some form.","The originally long and endless passage had reached its end with a single thought from Jian Wushuang.","As soon as he stepped out of the silent passage, the cold and withered star area appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The starry sky 10,000 years later was no different from the starry sky 10,000 years ago.","The only difference might be the traces of void energy that were about to completely dissipate left in the Star Field.","“Did people from the Void Universe come here again?” Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the Imperial Ancestor Ruins.","The ruins that exuded the dark fog and separated the universe and the starry sky did not change at all.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and summoned a Cosmic Boat. Then, he set off into the distance.","A few months later, a handsome young Ranger in a loose black robe stopped in front of the 23rd crack that led to the Void Universe.","Since the two universes were still in the midst of the Great Catastrophe War, various Void Masters would come out of the cracks from time to time and rush to the Divine Power Universe, which had already opened its door.","At the same time, they also strengthened the patrolling Void Masters around these void cracks that led to the Divine Power Universe.","Currently, there were 15 Four Scar Void Masters stationed in the 23rd void crack. At the same time, a terrifying aura belonging to a Six Scar Void Master was surging out from the dark.","The young man, dressed like a young Ranger, was naturally Jian Wushuang.","His eyes were like a deep spring as he arrived in front of the crack in one step.","“Who’s there?” A black mist emerged and a patrol team of three Void Masters with Four Scars blocked Jian Wushuang’s way, their eyes alert.","“My Lords, my allies.” Jian Wushuang laughed lightly and raised his hand to reveal a wisp of void power.","Jian Wushuang was calm and composed. “I come from the Liyang Star Field, from the Annihilating Fire Sect. In response to the call of Void God, I have gone the Divine Power Universe 13,000 years ago.”","“Then why did you return alone? Shouldn’t you be serving the Void God on the battlefield?” the Four Scar Void Master asked.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He took out three obsidian boxes from his Interspatial Ring and handed them to the leader.","A strange medicinal fragrance wafted out of the box. Seeing this, the furious Four Scar Void Master immediately put the box away with a wave of his sleeve.","After a few fake coughs, the Four Scar Void Master said loudly, “So you miss your hometown. Forget it, go home quickly and don’t let your family worry about you.”","Jian Wushuang agreed and was about to step into the crack.","The next moment, a powerful and suppressed voice rang out from the darkness.","“Hold on!”","Suddenly, a faint sense of danger welled up in his heart.","“Or have I been discovered?” Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks. Then, a boundless void power surged out from the deep crack in front of him.","Along with the appearance of the void energy, a middle-aged man dressed in purple and gold robes also appeared.","The few people who had been secretly rejoicing immediately knelt on the ground when they saw who it was. “G-greetings, Jiuzhi Emperor!”","The middle-aged man in a purple-gold robe fixed his eyes on Jian Wushuang and shouted in a deep voice, “You’re not from my Void Universe. Are you trying to enter?”","“A Six Scar Void Master?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his black robe fluttered.","The successor of the patrol team also noticed that something was wrong and immediately surrounded them.","Jiuzhi Emperor sneered. “It seems that you’re not from the Void Universe. Are you willing to offer your head, or do you want me to twist it off?”","“The head is here, if you can take it, then come and take it!” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“You’ve got guts! Die!” Jiuzhi Emperor roared, and an extreme void power crushed over.","Jian Wushuang moved his feet slightly and pushed forward with his palm.","The seemingly ordinary palm strike actually directly shattered the void power astral wind that rushed over.","Jiuzhi Emperor’s eyes narrowed. This guy, who looked like he had at most the cultivation of Two Scar, could shatter his void power with a wave of his hand?","With that in mind, Jiuzhi Emperor no longer acted arrogantly. An Emperor’s Sword that contained immense void power appeared in his hand and he slashed down with all his might!","Containing the full power of a Six Scar Void Warrior, the sword light split the starry sky!","“Small tricks!” Jian Wushuang sneered disdainfully and immediately pressed forward with his finger.","The unparalleled energy directly hit the sword light, and the unstoppable sword light turned dim and dissipated in an instant.","The force from Jian Wushuang’s finger did not slow down. It passed through the protection of the void power and directly pressed on the right shoulder where Jiuzhi Emperor held the sword.","An invisible force shot out of his body and tore off his entire right arm!","His right arm, which was holding the Emperor’s Sword, fell into the boundless starry sky and was torn apart by the astral wind.","With just one strike, he had easily destroyed one of the arms of a Six Scar Void Master. This made the Three and Four Scar Void Masters, who had been preparing to launch a sneak attack, retreat from the battle without a trace.","Jiuzhi Emperor, who had lost an arm, looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","How could an ant destroy a giant elephant?","With important matters at hand, Jian Wushuang ended the battle quickly. He raised his palm high and slammed it down heavily like God’s judgment.","Suddenly, unparalleled divine power turned into a huge palm print and slammed down on Jiuzhi Emperor’s head.","The horror of life and death struck fear into Jiuzhi Emperor’s heart. He did not even have time to turn around before he was crushed into meat paste by the giant palm!","A great Emperor of a Holy Kingdom had died by the hands of Jian Wushuang.","Killing a Six Scar Void Master with a single move as a Half Invincible Supreme was beyond the knowledge of all the Supremes in the two universes.","With a thud, the Three and Four Scar Void Masters knelt down in front of Jian Wushuang.","Scoffing, Jian Wushuang strode into the Void Universe after killing him!"]},{"number":4598,"title":"Chapter 4598 Land of Gods","paragraphs":["4598 Land of Gods","There were a total of 17 Void Masters patrolling the 23rd crack. Apart from the most powerful Jiuzhi Emperor, there were seven Void Masters with Five Scars hiding in the depths.","In order to prevent the news of him entering the Void Universe from spreading too quickly, Jian Wushuang simply sealed the entire area with his super power and killed the remaining Void Masters one by one.","After doing all this quickly, Jian Wushuang’s body turned into a flowing light and swept toward the path in his memory.","There were billions of Star Fields in the Void Universe, and the larger Star Fields and Holy Lands were already in a state of war. Every once in a while, they would send Scar-level Void Masters to the Divine Power Universe.","The Void Universe had already exhausted all its resources during the Great Catastrophe War.","“Just for the sake of fate energy for the Void Universe, my entire Divine Power Universe has fallen...” Jian Wushuang’s star-like eyes reflected a large Star Field. “I’ll make you pay back double for what you’ve eaten!”","In a desolate Star Field, Jian Wushuang, dressed as a young Ranger, stopped.","In just 10,000 years, the Land of Gods where Palace Master Dao Yan was sealed had become dilapidated and desolate until it was destroyed.","The 99 divine power restrictions had long since ceased to exist, and any Four Scar Void Master could break them with force.","The more it was so, the more Jian Wushuang panicked. He did not want to believe that the Supreme Dao Yan would die just like that, so he immediately urged his divine power to enter the Land of Gods.","The 99 divine power restrictions disappeared automatically and opened up a path for Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was stunned when he stepped into the Land of Gods.","The dilapidated walls that were originally as large as hills and ravines had disappeared. In their place was a green lotus that grew to the sky.","Every inch of the land was filled with green lotuses, swaying with the wind.","Apart from the green lotuses, there was nothing else.","“Senior Brother Dao Yan... Senior Brother Dao Yan.” Jian Wushuang walked forward and his voice reverberated through the entire world.","The green lotus contained a divine rhythm, which was transformed from the body of the Supreme Dao Yan.","Jian Wushuang did not know if the Supreme Dao Yan had died, so he could only follow his aura to find his whereabouts.","For 15 days, he searched the hills and ravines tirelessly, but there was no trace of him.","“Could it be that Senior Brother Dao Yan has really died?” A trace of sadness flashed through his eyes.","“Junior Brother Wushuang, how have you been?”","Like the spring breeze and summer cicadas, an indescribably pleasant and warm voice sounded.","Jian Wushuang quivered and hurriedly looked behind him.","“Senior brother Dao Yan!” Jian Wushuang jumped up and ran to Dao Yan excitedly.","Dao Yan had recovered a little since the last time they met. His dry face had begun to recover and looked a little more refreshed.","“Wushuang, why did you risk your life to come here?” Dao Yan said, “I can sense that the aura left behind by that existence is extremely weak. Has our universe won?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes dimmed and he told Dao Yan everything that had happened.","“Even now, it is still unknown how powerful Cosmos God is.” Jian Wushuang found it difficult to continue.","Supreme Dao Yan’s body swayed as he looked at the sky that was forever dark. He shed tears and said, “The Heavenly Dao! How can the Heavenly Dao be like this!?”","“As long as I’m still alive, I’ll definitely slaughter all the enemies!” Jian Wushuang said hatefully, “I’ll use my life to change the heavens!”","“I, Dao Yan, swear to protect the Divine Power Universe with my life!” Dao Yan’s tears fell. “But now, my Dao realm has returned to its original state. I can’t turn the situation around.”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said, “Senior Brother, it’s okay. Now, leave this place with me. I’ll take you to a Land of Great Creation. After comprehending for more than 10,000 years, you’ll definitely be able to return to your peak.”","Dao Yan’s eyes were filled with hope, but then they dimmed again. “Silly Junior Brother, I can’t leave now. Once I leave, the aura left by Void God will definitely fight back crazily. I’m afraid you won’t be able to leave then.”","Jian Wushuang said firmly, “Senior Brother, I’m not the same person as before. As long as he doesn’t come in person, I can protect you even if he’s a Half Ancestor realm expert!”","Then, without waiting for Dao Yan to speak, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and used divine power to pick the Natal Green Lotus under Dao Yan.","In an instant, the entire Land of Gods collapsed. Countless green lotuses withered like rivers and seas falling. The dispersed spiritual power returned to the origin of the green lotus.","At the same time, a majestic voice that seemed to have traveled through the primeval times resounded.","“Dao Yan, why do you want to step out of the restriction? Aren’t you afraid of your soul being destroyed?”","The sky caved in, and endless void power descended. Black flames so dense that they were almost tangible covered the entire sky, and a giant face of chaos looked down at the earth.","His eyes, which were like the sun and stars, shone on the ground.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly. The huge face was the True Shadow of Void God in the Void Universe!","Dao Yan snorted and did not look at him. Instead, he sent a message to Jian Wushuang, “Junior Brother Wushuang, I will fight him with my divine soul later. You should take the time to escape and save the Last Flame for my Divine Power Universe.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head gently and said, “Senior Brother Dao Yan, I’m telling you now that I’m not the same as before. Even if his True Shadow comes, I’m not afraid at all!”","At the end of his words, a vast divine power suddenly surged up like a huge wind that hit the sky.","The two completely different forces clashed together, creating the most magnificent light.","The divine power that belonged to Jian Wushuang, under the pressure of the void power, was actually able to be equal to it and there was a faint trend of rising!","“What?” In the sky, the giant face asked doubtfully, “Such an ant can actually emit such an aura. No wonder you dare to step out of the thunder pool, Dao Yan!”","“Since that’s the case, then all of you shall stay here today!”","As the sound of a bell rang out, the endless void power suddenly condensed into a huge palm that covered the sky and pressed down heavily.","Jian Wushuang was not afraid. He snorted coldly and his palms emitted a brilliant scarlet-gold divine light.","“Ancestral Skill — Transcendence Heavenly Gate!”","The majestic Heavenly Gate broke through the dark void power and landed in the sky, emitting an endless majesty.","Treasure light circulated and the giant sun shone. A giant finger that reached the heavens appeared from the Heaven’s Gate. With a brilliant divine might, it met the giant palm that covered the sky.","Boom!!","The two collided, and an extremely dark void power and brilliant divine might erupted in the most intense explosion.","The seven-colored shockwaves destroyed the sky, and a chasm appeared on the ground. The foul air of the abyss gushed out.","At the moment of collision, blood gushed out of Jian Wushuang’s ears and nose. The black robe on his body was torn and the divine patterns around him dimmed.","The giant palm and the giant finger of the Heavenly Gate were in a stalemate. The divine power and void power completely tore the Land of Gods apart.","The giant face in the sky was no longer expressionless. Under the Heaven’s Gate’s finger, it also quickly dimmed.","Although the face was Void God’s True Shadow, this was Jian Wushuang’s home field!"]},{"number":4599,"title":"Chapter 4599 Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate","paragraphs":["4599 Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate","The giant face was shocked and furious. “How dare you?”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything, but his eyes were shining with golden light.","In the past, I risked my life and used all my abilities just to escape your palm strike.","Now that I can resist you with only one move, what can you do to me?","A brilliant divine might gushed out from the heavenly gate, dispelling the endless dark void power.","“Even if I’m just a True Shadow, I can annihilate all of you!”","The sky collapsed, and the giant face opened its mouth to swallow the finger of Heavenly Gate, then crushed it to the ground.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate instantly dimmed.","“How can an ant’s power fight against the power of the heavens and earth?”","Divine blood seeped out of Jian Wushuang’s mouth, and the divine patterns around him started to dissipate.","A gentle divine power wrapped around Jian Wushuang’s waist and pulled him in front of Supreme Dao Yan.","“Junior Brother Wushuang, I am very grateful that you came to save me. Let me end all this karma.” Dao Yan smiled and then pushed Jian Wushuang far away with pure divine power.","Then, Supreme Dao Yan turned his body into a green lotus, and a vast green charm rushed into the sky.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes almost popped out. “Senior Brother Dao Yan!”","Countless tragedies were ultimately caused by the lack of strength.","Now, this tragedy was about to repeat itself.","The originally dim golden pattern suddenly shattered and turned into a shocking Dragon that soared into the sky. With Jian Wushuang as the center, the brilliant divine power pierced through the sky and directly entered the Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","The incomparably bright red light was like 100 suns shining together.","It was only a blurry outline of the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate, but Jian Wushuang used it without caring about the cost.","The might that could pierce through all things had long surpassed the pressure of the giant finger.","The illusions of almost a thousand divine weapons appeared and linked with each other, giving off an overwhelming aura!","Void God’s giant face which was almost falling to the ground suddenly stopped and could not move an inch further.","The images of the divine weapons intertwined with each other, as if divine punishment had fallen.","The two star-like pupils looked at Jian Wushuang and shattered after he said the last sentence:","“We will meet again.”","Everything returned to earth, and Void God’s True Shadow shattered!","The Heavenly Gate above the broken sky slowly disappeared. Jian Wushuang was like a dying fish, kneeling on the ground and gasping for breath.","With his green aura restrained, Dao Yan, who was dressed in a green robe, helped Jian Wushuang up.","“Junior Brother Wushuang, I thank you,” Supreme Dao Yan cupped his hands and said.","The gentle divine power nourished Jian Wushuang’s dried meridians and helped him recover quickly.","“Senior Brother Dao Yan,” Jian Wushuang stood up straight and said seriously, “don’t thank me. This is what I should and must do. Even if I die, I will save you.”","Dao Yan stopped talking and nodded with red eyes.","The battle with Void God’s True Shadow had completely destroyed the Land of Gods, and the entire Star Field had crumbled and collapsed. It would take hundreds of chaos cycles to repair it.","As the commotion was too big, there were already Scar-level Void Warriors who had begun to rush over.","After Jian Wushuang set up a Ward with a wave of his hand, he left with Dao Yan in the Cosmic Boat.","His next destination was the God Refining Sect.","Supreme Pan Shan, who had been dormant for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, was also Ban Shan, the Daoist from the Divine Power Universe.","After traveling through the various Star Fields for several months, they finally stopped at a very familiar Star Field.","That was the God Refining Sect’s territory.","Jian Wushuang and Dao Yan transformed their bodies again and went straight to the God Refining Sect!","Although Jian Wushuang was currently a Half Invincible Supreme, he could easily kill an Invincible Supreme with his super power. Thus, it was a piece of cake for him to hide his aura.","Although Dao Yan could not turn divine power into void power, his aura had reached its peak, so it was not difficult for ordinary Void Masters to not notice him.","A gust of wind blew into the God Refining Sect, waking up the two disciples guarding the gate. After muttering a few words to each other, they fell asleep again.","In a brightly lit hall different from the gloomy God Refining Sect, Elder Ban Shan had been sitting in the middle of his sleeping quarters for tens of thousands of years.","Since Jian Wushuang had left, he had been in deep comprehension.","Green smoke rose from the incense burner, and Elder Ban Shan, who had been silent for tens of thousands of years, slowly opened his eyes.","In the bottom of his heart, an inexplicable feeling rose.","The palace door, which had not been opened for a long time, was gently pushed open.","A figure dressed in a Ranger’s attire appeared in his eyes.","Behind the Ranger, an elegant green robe appeared.","The young Ranger slowly pulled down his hood and said with a smile, “Elder Ban Shan, you can go home now.”","As if struck by lightning, all the sounds faded into Elder Ban Shan’s ears.","At this moment, the only thing in his eyes was that figure he had not seen for countless chaos cycles.","“Long time no see, little guy.”","An experienced smile appeared on Dao Yan’s face, his eyes slightly red.","“Palace Master... Palace Master!”","Elder Ban Shan stood up and ran in front of Dao Yan. Then, he knelt down heavily and cried sorrowfully.","The past was turbulent, and the old people reappeared. From the peddlers to the Heavenly gods, it was likely that even they would find it difficult to resist the suffering and extraordinary past.","No one would have thought that these two old friends would meet again in this lifetime.","When they first met, the two had black hair and were the unparalleled experts, and the pride of the Divine Power Universe.","When they met again after all the suffering, they were already in their senior age.","Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion and left the hall to let the two catch up.","“Palace Master Dao Yan, you’ve suffered.” Elder Ban Shan wiped his tears and sobbed.","Dao Yan wiped his tears. “It’s been hundreds of millions of years. I didn’t expect that we would meet again. I only hope that we won’t be separated again this time.”","“Apart from death, in this life, I will not leave you, Palace Master,” Ban Shan Daoist said with tears in his eyes.","Dao Yan did not say anything more, but clenched Ban Shan Daoist’s hand tightly.","These two old friends did not need to say anything more to each other.","As the sun moved and the stars slanted, the palace door was slowly pushed open. Ban Shan knelt on one knee and said solemnly, “Greetings, Palace Master Wushuang. From now on, I’ll follow Palace Master Wushuang’s orders, even if it costs me ten thousand lives!”","Jian Wushuang quickly helped Daoist Ban Shan up. “Let’s leave this place first. We’ll make plans after we return to the Divine Power Universe.”","Dao Yan and Ban Shan agreed and left the God Refining Sect with Jian Wushuang.","Almost endless years had passed in this Void Universe. The cage of time had finally been broken. Even dying on the Offworld Battlefield was the best ending.","Jian Wushuang sat on the railing of the universe boat and looked out. Supreme Dao Yan and Ban Shan stood on the deck and finally took in the entire Star Field of the Void Universe.","In at most a year, the Cosmic Boat would be able to leave the Void Universe. At that time, Jian Wushuang would take advantage of the time when Void God was sealed to launch a full-scale counterattack.","“The Devourers... What kind of people are they?” Jian Wushuang was lost in thought."]},{"number":4600,"title":"Chapter 4600 An Old Friend (1)","paragraphs":["4600 An Old Friend (1)","Void God had been sealed for more than 10,000 years, and there was no sign of his return at all.","With Supreme Dao Yan, who had experienced the last Great Catastrophe, in addition to the Starry Sky Sword Sect and the Invincible Supremes from the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans, they should be able to barely match the number of Six Scar Void Masters in the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang was confident that although he could not kill Snake God, he could at least stall him.","In this way, they were at least even in the high-end battlefield, and the battle of the ordinary battlefields were the home base of the Divine Power Universe. They could drag the ordinary Void Masters of the Void Universe to death.","As long as they could kill as many living forces in the Void Universe as possible, even if Void God returned, it would take an extremely long time to start the next Great Catastrophe.","In Jian Wushuang’s calculation, only the Devourers, the mysterious organization, was a great variable.","He had personally experienced how terrifying the Devourers was. If it had not been for Supreme Gai Fu, he would have probably died at the hands of Devour One.","‘What kind of organization are they? What’s their goal? Are their demands the same as the Void Universe?’ The more Jian Wushuang thought about it, the more he felt a headache.","“Palace Master Wushuang, what’s bothering you? Can you tell me?” asked Supreme Dao Yan.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and then jumped onto the deck. He asked, “Elder Dao Yan, do you know that there’s an organization called the Devourers in the Void Universe?”","Supreme Dao Yan’s eyes narrowed. “Did the Devourers take part in this Great Catastrophe?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “They’ve already made their moves. From the looks of it, their strength is probably not weaker than Half Ancestor realm.”","“Half Ancestor level. Have they already grown to such a level?” Dao Yan’s eyes were bitter. “I knew about the Devourers before the last Great Catastrophe War.”","“Actually, the Devourers was the first organization to appear in our Divine Power Universe. I had a Dao discussion with Devouring Emperor.”","Dao Yan said slowly as he recalled his distant memories, “However, that Dao discussion ended on bad terms. From then on, they left the Divine Power Universe and became a nightmare that can’t be wiped away.”","“Then, does Elder Dao Yan know what they really need? Is it really the fate energy of our Divine Power Universe?” Jian Wushuang asked urgently.","Supreme Dao Yan shook his head and said, “He and his Devour team seem to be in a very contradictory situation. During the Dao discussion, Devouring Emperor promised to help our Divine Power Universe repel the enemy, but he didn’t ask for any conditions that were beneficial to him. He only asked for one thing, which was to kill the Void Universe completely and leave no living being alive!”","“I didn’t agree to his request. Even if we invaded the Void Universe first, I knew I couldn’t kill every living being. So, he left the Divine Power Universe and joined the Void Universe.”","“If you’re asking why he and the Devourers helped the Void Universe, it’s probably because Void God agreed to his request.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shuddered. The Devouring Emperor of the Devourers was like a special existence independent of two universes. Their purpose had never been to fight for the fate energy.","Instead, the universe that was defeated would be completely reduced to a dead zone, leaving no living beings behind.","The two universes seemed to have become toys in his hands, and they would not stop until it is done.","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang suddenly said, “Elder Dao Yan, if it really comes to that, I should make a deal with them for the sake of the Divine Power Universe.”","“Palace Master Wushuang, are all living beings just pawns in the ancient universe?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. After a while, he said, “One day, I’ll find Master and ask him.”","In the cold and dry ancient Star Field, the Cosmic Boat was the only thing moving","Half a year later, they were in the void country in the Haohua Star Field, he could no longer travel freely in the Cosmic Boat.","Jian Wushuang, Dao Yan, and Ban Shan were dressed like Rangers to avoid unnecessary trouble.","Even so, the journey was extremely dangerous. Jian Wushuang had killed more than 20 Void Masters.","“In three months at most, we will be able to leave this place and reach the Divine Power Universe,” Jian Wushuang said after he finished replenishing his supplies in the void country.","Although Supreme Dao Yan and Daoist Ban Shan looked calm, the excitement in their eyes still revealed their inner feelings.","They had been away from home for too long, so long that most of the Divine Kingdom had turned to dust, not to mention these old men, who still had ties with with the old generation.","In order to avoid too many unnecessary troubles, the three Rangers tried their best to travel in a roundabout way from the lonely Star Field.","Perhaps the opening of the door to the 23rd crack had alerted the Void Universe, for the rarely seen Void Masters had also appeared in various Star Fields.","In the countdown before he left the Void Universe, Jian Wushuang sensed a weak but extremely familiar aura in the sky above the void country in the Haohua Star Field.","That aura was the divine power of the Divine Power Universe.","Supreme Dao Yan and Ban Shan also sensed the divine power and looked at Jian Wushuang.","As the two universes were still in a heated battle, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and decided to let the two of them hide in the void country while he went to investigate the situation alone.","After telling each other to be careful, Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and he stood on the starry sky.","In the endless starry sky, four or five Cosmic Boats of the Void Universe were traveling through the sky. The weak divine power had come from the first boat.","With a quick thought, Jian Wushuang’s body moved like a rainbow and he boarded the deck of the first Cosmic Boat.","“Who’s there?!” With a low shout, a Four Scar Void Master walked out from the bottom of the cabin and looked at Jian Wushuang vigilantly.","“I’ve come a long way. I’d like to ask for a bowl of water from Your Excellency,” Jian Wushuang said. As he stepped forward, he grabbed at the air.","Suddenly, the Void Warrior with Four Scars kneeled on the ground, unable to speak, his face full of pain.","“Tell me, did you capture someone from the Divine Power Universe?” Jian Wushuang said angrily.","The fear of life and death made this Void Master speak without hiding anything.","“Yes, we did catch one, but she was just a little girl with little strength. My Lord saw that she was born with red lips and white teeth, and was ready to take her in as a slave...”","Before he could finish his words, Jian Wushuang crushed him into meat paste and destroyed his spirit.","Then, he took a few steps back and looked down at the deck with cold eyes.","An even purer and more tyrannical power than that of an Invincible Supreme burst forth.","“What kind of small fry dares to act so brazenly here?”","A domineering and powerful void energy tore the entire deck apart, triggering bursts of purple-blue divine lightning."]}]);
